text:AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice.NoSuccessFindingScanner	{'body': "I'm investigating this ship on behalf\\nof CAPT. STERN.\\pHe also asked me to find a SCANNER,\\nbut I haven't had any success…$"}
text:AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice.OhCanYouDeliverScanner	{'body': "Oh! That's a SCANNER!\\pListen, can I get you to deliver that\\nto CAPT. STERN?\\pI want to investigate this ship a\\nlittle more.$"}
text:AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice.ThisIsSSCactus	{'body': 'This ship is called S.S. CACTUS.\\nIt seems to be from an earlier era.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_1F.CharlieIntro	{'body': "What's so funny about having my inner\\ntube aboard the ship?$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_1F.CharlieDefeat	{'body': 'Whoa, you overwhelmed me!$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_1F.CharliePostBattle	{'body': "It's not easy throwing POKé BALLS\\nwhile hanging on to an inner tube!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_1F.IsntItFunHere	{'body': "Isn't it fun here?\\nI get excited just being here!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_B1F.DuncanIntro	{'body': 'When we go out to sea, we SAILORS\\nalways bring our POKéMON.\\lHow about a quick battle?$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_B1F.DuncanDefeat	{'body': "Whoops, I'm sunk!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_B1F.DuncanPostBattle	{'body': "The ship's bottom has sunk into the\\ndepths.\\pIf a POKéMON knew how to go underwater,\\nwe might make some progress…$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_B1F.YayItsAShip	{'body': "Yay!\\nIt's a ship!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_B1F.DoorIsLocked	{'body': 'The door is locked.\\p“STORAGE” is painted on the door.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Corridors_B1F.InsertedStorageKey	{'body': '{PLAYER} inserted and turned the\\nSTORAGE KEY.\\pThe inserted KEY stuck fast,\\nbut the door opened.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_TheDoorIsOpen	{'body': 'The door is open.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_HiddenFloorCorridors.Rm1DoorIsLocked	{'body': 'The door is locked.\\p“RM. 1” is painted on the door.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_HiddenFloorCorridors.Rm2DoorIsLocked	{'body': 'The door is locked.\\p“RM. 2” is painted on the door.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_HiddenFloorCorridors.Rm4DoorIsLocked	{'body': 'The door is locked.\\p“RM. 4” is painted on the door.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_HiddenFloorCorridors.Rm6DoorIsLocked	{'body': 'The door is locked.\\p“RM. 6” is painted on the door.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_HiddenFloorCorridors.InsertedKey	{'body': '{PLAYER} inserted and turned the\\nKEY.\\pThe inserted KEY stuck fast,\\nbut the door opened.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_HiddenFloorRooms.BrightShinyTrash	{'body': "It's bright and shiny!\\nBut it's just trash…$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Room_B1F.PutKeystoneInTrash	{'body': 'The ODD KEYSTONE fits the cracked\\nsocket in this old bin.\\pA whisper rises from the hull. Set\\nthe stone in place?$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Room_B1F.KeystoneMissing	{'body': 'Cold air seeps from the old bin.\\pA cracked socket in its base looks\\nmade for an ODD KEYSTONE.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.DanIntro	{'body': 'DAN: While searching for treasures,\\nwe discovered a TRAINER!$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.DanDefeat	{'body': "DAN: We couldn't win even though\\nwe worked together…$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.DanPostBattle	{'body': "DAN: We can't find any treasures…\\nI wonder if someone got them already?$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.DanNotEnoughMons	{'body': "DAN: You don't even have two POKéMON.\\nYou can't expect to beat us like that.$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraIntro	{'body': 'KIRA: Oh?\\nWe were searching for treasures.\\lBut we discovered a TRAINER instead!$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraDefeat	{'body': 'KIRA: Ooh, so strong!$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraPostBattle	{'body': "KIRA: Where could the treasures be?\\pI've already decided what I'm buying\\nwhen we find the treasures!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraNotEnoughMons	{'body': "KIRA: Oh, you don't have two POKéMON?\\nWe'll have to battle some other time!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraRegister	{'body': "KIRA: Oh, you make me so angry!\\nI'm going to register you for that!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.DanRematchIntro	{'body': "DAN: We've been searching for\\ntreasures all this time.\\pOur POKéMON have grown stronger, too.\\nLet us show you, okay?$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.DanRematchDefeat	{'body': "DAN: You're strong, as usual!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.DanPostRematch	{'body': "DAN: We can't find any treasures,\\nwe lose at POKéMON…\\pI want to go home… But if I say that,\\nshe gets all angry with me…$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.DanRematchNotEnoughMons	{'body': "DAN: You don't even have two POKéMON.\\nYou can't expect to beat us like that.$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraRematchIntro	{'body': "KIRA: Oh? We meet again!\\pJust like us, you still haven't given up\\nsearching for treasures, have you?\\pWant to make it so the loser has\\nto give up searching?$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraRematchDefeat	{'body': 'KIRA: Oh, we lost again…$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraPostRematch	{'body': "KIRA: We're not leaving until we raise\\nour POKéMON some more and we find\\lthe treasures here!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.KiraRematchNotEnoughMons	{'body': "KIRA: Oh, you don't have two POKéMON?\\nWe'll have to battle some other time!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.JaniIntro	{'body': "I'm not good at swimming,\\nbut I am good at battles!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.JaniDefeat	{'body': "Oops.\\nThat didn't go very well.$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.JaniPostBattle	{'body': 'Walking around barefoot in this ship\\nis kind of gross.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.GarrisonIntro	{'body': "Strength and compassion…\\nThose are a TRAINER's treasures!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.GarrisonDefeat	{'body': 'Ah, there is something about you\\nthat sparkles.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F.GarrisonPostBattle	{'body': 'In a cabin somewhere on board,\\nI saw something sparkle.$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms2_B1F.PerfectPlaceToGoExploring	{'body': "This is a perfect place to go exploring!\\nIt's exciting here!\\pI bet there're amazing treasures on\\nboard.$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.TakingALookAround	{'body': "Ships of this sort are rare, so I'm\\ntaking a look around.\\pHmhm…\\nThere appear to be other cabins…$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.ThaliaIntro	{'body': 'What on earth would compel you to\\ncome here? You must be curious!$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.ThaliaDefeat	{'body': 'Not just curious, but also strong…$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.ThaliaPostBattle	{'body': "The man next door…\\pHe says he's just sightseeing,\\nbut I don't know about that.$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.ThaliaRegister	{'body': "You're such a tough TRAINER!\\nLet me register you as a memento!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.ThaliaRematchIntro	{'body': 'What on earth would compel you to\\ncome back? You must really be curious!$'}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.ThaliaRematchDefeat	{'body': "Aren't you too strong?$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.ThaliaPostRematch	{'body': "I'm sure that man's up to something!\\nHe just acts so suspiciously!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.DemetriusIntro	{'body': "Waaah!\\nI've been found! …Huh?$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.DemetriusDefeat	{'body': "Oh, you're not my mom.$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F.DemetriusPostBattle	{'body': "I'm in trouble with my mom, so I ran.\\nKeep it a secret where I am!$"}
text:AbandonedShip_Rooms_B1F.GettingQueasy	{'body': "Urrrrppp…\\pI'm getting queasy just being aboard\\nthis ship…\\pIt's not even moving, but…$"}
text:AlteringCave_1F.Researcher	{'body': 'This cavern feels like a doorway.\\nThe deeper I go, the stranger it\\lbecomes.\\pHOOPA lives among the wild\\nPOKéMON here. Each encounter\\lhas a 3% chance of being HOOPA.\\pMEWTWO waits on B1F. It accepts\\nchallengers with the MIND BADGE.$'}
text:AlteringCave_B1F.LeafIntro	{'body': "LEAF: I followed reports of\\nstrange POKéMON here from KANTO.\\pThere's something powerful in this\\ncavern. Before you go farther,\\llet's see how your team handles\\lmine!$"}
text:AlteringCave_B1F.LeafDefeat	{'body': "You've earned my respect!$"}
text:AlteringCave_B1F.LeafAfter	{'body': 'LEAF: Take this MEWTWONITE X. It\\ncan help MEWTWO Mega Evolve.\\pIf you meet it here, I hope the\\ntwo of you can learn to trust each\\lother.$'}
text:AlteringCave_B1F.LeafBagFull	{'directives': ('.set EC_SIGN_MEWTWO_ID, 61',), 'body': 'Make room for the MEWTWONITE X.\\nYour reward will wait here.$'}
text:AlteringCave_B1F.MewtwoDormant	{'body': 'MEWTWO is watching you. Return\\nwith the MIND BADGE to challenge\\lit.$'}
text:AlteringCave_B1F.MewtwoNeedsPartner	{'body': 'MEWTWO accepts challengers with\\nthe MIND BADGE. No partner\\lspecies is required.$'}
text:AlteringCave_B1F.MewtwoAwakens	{'body': 'MEWTWO steps forward to challenge\\nyou!$'}
text:AquaHideout_1F.OurBossIsSnatchingSomething	{'body': "What? What? What do you want with \\nTEAM AQUA?\\pOur BOSS isn't here! He's gone off to\\nsnatch something important!\\p… …\\nWhere did he go?\\pWahaha! Do you really think I'd tell\\nyou something that crucial?$"}
text:AquaHideout_1F.WhereMightMagmaHideoutBe	{'body': 'What? What?\\nAre you a TEAM MAGMA grunt?\\pI hear that TEAM MAGMA is trying to\\nawaken an awesome POKéMON at their\\lHIDEOUT.\\pBut where might their HIDEOUT be?$'}
text:AquaHideout_1F.BossWentToJackASubmarine	{'body': "What? What? What do you want with \\nTEAM AQUA?\\pOur BOSS isn't here!\\nHe's gone off to jack a submarine!\\p… …\\nWhere did he go?\\pWahaha! Do you really think I'd tell\\nyou something that crucial?$"}
text:AquaHideout_1F.BossIsOnRoute122	{'body': "What? What? What do you want with \\nTEAM AQUA?\\pOur BOSS isn't here! He's on his way to\\nMT. PYRE on ROUTE 122!\\p… …\\nWhy did he go?\\pWahaha! Do you really think I'd tell\\nyou something that crucial?$"}
text:AquaHideout_1F.TeamMagmaAtMtChimney	{'body': 'What? What?\\nAre you a TEAM MAGMA grunt?\\pI hear that TEAM MAGMA is after\\nan awesome POKéMON at MT. CHIMNEY.\\pBut what is that POKéMON like?$'}
text:AquaHideout_1F.BossIsInSlateportCity	{'body': "What? What? What do you want with\\nTEAM AQUA?\\pOur BOSS isn't here!\\nHe's on his way to SLATEPORT CITY!\\p… …\\nWhy did he go?\\pWahaha! Do you really think I'd tell\\nyou something that crucial?$"}
text:AquaHideout_1F.Grunt1Intro	{'body': 'Ayiyiyi! Suspicious character!\\pRight, right, procedure. TENTACRUEL,\\nDHELMISE, hold the gate!$'}
text:AquaHideout_1F.Grunt1Defeat	{'body': 'Grrrr… I lost it! I lost the gate!$'}
text:AquaHideout_1F.Grunt1PostBattle	{'body': "I did my part. The rest of the crew is\\ndeeper in, and they're better than me.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt2Intro	{'body': "Want the HIDEOUT's secret? Then you go\\nthrough me and my SHARPEDO first!$"}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt2Defeat	{'body': "I can't win at all lately…$"}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt2PostBattle	{'body': 'The secret? Our submarine dock is at\\nthe far end. All these warp panels\\lshould keep you guessing. Kekeke.$'}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt3Intro	{'body': "Fuel loaded A-OK! Snacks loaded A-OK!\\pOnly thing left on my checklist is\\nKO one meddler. That's you.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt3Defeat	{'body': "That's… not how the checklist went.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt3PostBattle	{'body': 'Humph! My real job was to slow you\\ndown. Every minute you spend here\\lis another minute for the BOSS.$'}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt5Intro	{'body': "Yawn… Guard duty in a cave with no sea\\nview. I'll take you on just to wake up.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt5Defeat	{'body': 'Yawn… oh. I lost. Figures.$'}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt5PostBattle	{'body': "Careful running around in here. The\\nothers aren't as sleepy as me.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt7Intro	{'body': "Hey! Honest question. Whose uniform is\\ncooler, ours or MAGMA's?\\p…Right answer. Now battle me anyway.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt7Defeat	{'body': 'I lost in a cool way, at least…$'}
text:AquaHideout_B1F.Grunt7PostBattle	{'body': "Good uniform, you look fine even when\\nyou lose. That's my whole philosophy.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.MattIntro	{'body': "MATT: You made it through the\\nwhole hideout? Ha! You've got\\lguts.\\pARCHIE's nearly ready to sail. I\\njust need to keep you busy a\\llittle longer!$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.MattDefeat	{'body': "Ha… You don't give up, do you?$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.OurBossGotThroughHisPreparations	{'body': "MATT: You beat me, but you're too\\nlate! ARCHIE's ready to dive!$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.MattPostBattle	{'body': "MATT: ARCHIE's headed for a cavern\\nbeneath ROUTE 128.\\pGo on, chase him! You'll need DIVE\\nto follow a submarine down there.\\pYou'll need MOSSDEEP's BADGE and\\nDIVE. Ask STEVEN for help, if you\\lcan find him! ARCHIE will be miles\\lahead.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt4Intro	{'body': "I've been waiting here so long my\\nfeet have gone numb.\\pAt last! An intruder! I knew this\\npost mattered!$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt4Defeat	{'body': 'All that waiting, and I still\\nlost…$'}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt4PostBattle	{'body': "Even a little delay helps ARCHIE\\nget the submarine ready.\\pThat's what I'm putting in my\\nreport, anyway.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt6Intro	{'body': "Warp panels! The pride of our\\nhideout!\\pI know exactly where you came\\nfrom. Let's see if you can get\\lpast me!$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt6Defeat	{'body': "What's wrong with you?\\nYou're not tired at all!$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt6PostBattle	{'body': "That reminds me… I can't remember\\nwhere I put the MASTER BALL.\\pIf I fail to guard it, our BOSS will\\nchew me out…$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt8Intro	{'body': "First thing they taught me here was how\\nthe warp panels connect.\\pSecond thing was doubles. I'm better\\nat the panels.$"}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt8Defeat	{'body': 'Too busy thinking about panels…$'}
text:AquaHideout_B2F.Grunt8PostBattle	{'body': "I'll learn to battle properly. Someday.\\nThe panels are just more fun.$"}
text:AshenWoods.VialBlobKeepsRunning	{'body': 'Blob disappeared deeper into the ash.\\nThe chase is not over yet.$'}
text:AshenWoods.VialBlobCornered	{'body': 'Blob reached the far edge of the woods.\\nThere is nowhere else to run.$'}
text:AshenWoods.VialBlobNowhereToRun	{'body': 'Blob watches the HEAL BALL.\\nThis is your chance to bring it home.$'}
text:AshenWoods.VialApproachFromEast	{'body': 'Blob keeps looking for an escape.\\nTry approaching from the east.$'}
text:AshenWoods.VialApproachFromNorth	{'body': 'Blob is still too restless to catch.\\nTry the narrow trail to the north.$'}
text:AshenWoods.VialNoHealBall	{'body': "You need one of the nurse's HEAL BALLS.\\nReturn to her on ROUTE 111 for another.$"}
text:AshenWoods.VialCatchBlob	{'body': '{PLAYER} threw the HEAL BALL at Blob!$'}
text:AshenWoods.VialBlobCaught	{'body': 'Click! Blob was caught!\\pThe nurse is waiting on ROUTE 111.$'}
text:AshenWoods.AlannahIntro	{'body': 'The ash feeds roots tougher than\\nstone. Can your team outlast\\lmine?$'}
text:AshenWoods.AlannahDefeat	{'body': 'Your answer grew through the ash.$'}
text:AshenWoods.AlannahAfter	{'body': 'The forest rewards adaptation, not one\\nperfect type chart.$'}
text:AshenWoods.MartinIntro	{'body': 'A firebird circles whenever the sun\\nbreaks through. Face the whole blaze!$'}
text:AshenWoods.MartinDefeat	{'body': 'You extinguished the wildfire cleanly.$'}
text:AshenWoods.MartinAfter	{'body': 'MOLTRES roosts in EMBER PATH.\\nFollow the trail and keep your eyes\\lup. Those feathers catch the light!$'}
text:AshenWoods.RomanIntro	{'body': 'The rocks hiss when rain hits them.\\nA little water, all that heat...\\lNow watch what my POKéMON can do!$'}
text:AshenWoods.RomanDefeat	{'body': "Whew! You've left us steaming!$"}
text:AshenWoods.RomanAfter	{'body': 'I could listen to the forest hiss\\nafter rain all day. Even the mountain\\lneeds to cool off sometimes.$'}
text:AshenWoods.ElmerIntro	{'body': 'Look closely at the ash. Tiny tracks\\neverywhere! My bugs are tougher\\lthan they look. Care to see?$'}
text:AshenWoods.ElmerDefeat	{'body': 'You changed pace with every swarm.$'}
text:AshenWoods.ElmerAfter	{'body': 'Some insects burrow when the ash\\nfalls. Others just shake it off.\\lI always find something new here.$'}
text:AshenWoods.Caretaker	{'body': 'Heat scorched these woods, but the\\nroots survived. See the new leaves?\\pWith the weather changing so much,\\nPOKéMON we seldom saw are appearing\\lamong the ash.\\pThe old wardens say RAYQUAZA keeps\\nland and sea in balance. I hope\\lthey are right.$'}
text:AshenWoods.MoltresCaught	{'body': 'MOLTRES found a partner in you!\\pEMBER PATH still glows at sunset.\\nI always look up, out of habit.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.PlayerStepForward	{'body': 'REFEREE: TRAINER {PLAYER}!\\nStep forward, please!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.OpponentStepForward	{'body': 'REFEREE: TRAINER {STR_VAR_1}!\\nStep forward, please!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.SetKOTourneyBegin	{'body': 'REFEREE: Set KO Tourney!\\nBegin!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.WinnerIsPlayer	{'body': 'REFEREE: The winner is {PLAYER}!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.WinnerIsOpponent	{'body': 'REFEREE: The winner is {STR_VAR_1}!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.MonsWillBeRestored	{'body': 'Your POKéMON will be restored to\\nfull health.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.ReadyFor2ndOpponent	{'body': 'Next up, your second opponent!\\nAre you ready to move on?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.ReadyFor3rdOpponent	{'body': 'Next up, your third opponent!\\nAre you ready to move on?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.ReadyFor4thOpponent	{'body': 'Next up, your fourth opponent!\\nAre you ready to move on?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.ReadyFor5thOpponent	{'body': 'Next up, your fifth opponent!\\nAre you ready to move on?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.ReadyFor6thOpponent	{'body': 'Next up, your sixth opponent!\\nAre you ready to move on?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.ReadyFor7thOpponent	{'body': 'Next up, your seventh opponent!\\nAre you ready to move on?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.SaveAndShutDown	{'body': 'Would you like to save the game and\\nshut down now?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.RetireFromChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to retire from your\\nSet KO Tourney challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.SavingPleaseWait	{'body': 'I am saving your game data.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.RecordLastBattle	{'body': 'Would you like to record your last\\nbattle on your FRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.NowFaceTycoon	{'body': 'My dear challenger!\\pYour skill level is truly astounding!\\pWe now would like you to face our\\nleader, the ARENA TYCOON!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.PreparedForTycoon	{'body': 'A battle with the ARENA TYCOON!\\nAre you prepared?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.MakeWayForGreta	{'body': 'REFEREE: The ARENA TYCOON!\\nMake way for GRETA!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.GretaYoureChallenger	{'body': 'GRETA: Hey!\\nHowdy!\\p…Wait, are you the challenger?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.IsThatRight	{'body': 'Is that right? Hmm…\\nHmhm…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.YouLookWeakTakeThingsEasy	{'body': "I don't know how to say it, but…\\nTo put it bluntly, you look pretty weak.\\lAre you sure you're up for me?\\pHmm…\\pWell, all right!\\nWe'll take things easy to start with!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.IgniteMyPassionForBattle	{'body': "Okay! Let's see you ignite my passion\\nfor battle!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.GretaYoureToughAfterAll	{'body': "GRETA: Ow, wait a second!\\nYou are tough after all!\\pI like you!\\nLet's see your FRONTIER PASS.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.ReceivedGutsSymbol	{'body': 'The Guts Symbol was embossed on\\nthe FRONTIER PASS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.GoingToBeFunNextTime	{'body': "Hmm…\\pIt's going to be fun the next time!\\nI'm looking forward to it!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.GretaLookingForwardToSeeingAgain	{'body': 'GRETA: Hey! Howdy!\\nYou finally won your way up to me!\\pI was getting worried waiting for you!\\nI was really looking forward to seeing\\lyou again!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.SoAreYouReady	{'body': '… … …\\nSo, are you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.WontAllowHalfheartedEffort	{'body': "I won't allow a halfhearted effort!\\nBe ready for a thrashing!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.LetsGetThisStarted	{'body': "Come on, REFEREE!\\nLet's get this started!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.GretaBlownAway	{'body': "GRETA: Gaaah! Blown away!\\nLet's see your FRONTIER PASS!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.GutsSymbolTookGoldenShine	{'body': 'The Guts Symbol took on\\na golden shine!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom.IfWeBattleAgainWontLose	{'body': "Arrrgh!\\nThis is so infuriating!\\pIf we ever battle again, I won't lose!\\nDon't you forget it! Bye-bye!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaCorridor.PleaseStepIn	{'body': 'Your battles shall be waged in\\nthe next room. Please step in!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.WelcomeToBattleArena	{'body': 'Where the battling spirit of TRAINERS\\nis put to the test!\\pI welcome you to the BATTLE ARENA!\\pI am your guide to the Set KO Tourney!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.WishToTakeChallenge	{'body': 'Now, do you wish to take\\nthe BATTLE ARENA challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.AwaitAnotherChallenge	{'body': 'We await your challenge on\\nanother occasion!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.ExplainChallenge	{'body': "In the BATTLE ARENA, we undertake\\nthe Set KO Tourney.\\pAll participants enter with a team of\\nthree POKéMON.\\pThe three POKéMON must be lined up in\\nthe order in which they are to appear.\\pDuring battle, the POKéMON will appear\\none at a time in the preset order.\\pOnce a POKéMON enters battle, it must\\nremain out until the match is decided.\\pIf a match remains undecided in\\nthree turns, it goes to judging.\\pIf you wish to interrupt your challenge,\\nplease save the game.\\pIf you don't save, you will not be able\\nto continue with your challenge.\\pIf you pull off the feat of beating\\nseven TRAINERS in succession,\\lwe will present you with Battle Points.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.OkayToSave	{'body': 'Before showing you to the BATTLE\\nARENA, you must save. Is that okay?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.WhichLevelMode	{'body': 'The BATTLE ARENA offers two levels\\nof challenge, Level 50 and Open Level.\\lWhich is your choice?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.SelectThreeMons	{'body': 'Very well, now select your\\nthree POKéMON, please.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen	{'body': 'My dear challenger!\\pYou do not have the three POKéMON\\nrequired for entry.\\pTo qualify, you must bring three\\ndifferent kinds of POKéMON.\\pThey also must not hold the same\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsEnd	{'body': 'When you have made your preparations,\\nplease do return.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50	{'body': 'My dear challenger!\\pYou do not have the three POKéMON\\nrequired for entry.\\pTo qualify, you must bring three\\ndifferent kinds of POKéMON.\\pThe three different POKéMON\\nmust all be Level 50 or lower.\\pThey also must not hold the same\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.GuideYouToArena	{'body': 'I shall now guide you to\\nthe BATTLE ARENA.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.DidntSaveBeforeShuttingDown	{'body': 'My dear challenger!\\pYou did not save the game before\\nshutting down, did you?\\pIt is unfortunate, but that has\\nresulted in your disqualification\\lfrom your challenge.\\pYou may, of course, start with a fresh\\nchallenge.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.CongratsOnSevenWins	{'body': 'We congratulate you for your splendid\\nstring of wins over seven TRAINERS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.RecordAchievement	{'body': 'Your achievement will be recorded.\\nPlease wait while I save the game.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.PresentYouWithPrize	{'body': 'In commemoration of your 7-win streak,\\nwe present you with this prize.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.ReceivedPrize	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the prize\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.BagFullReturnForPrize	{'body': 'Oh?\\nYour BAG seems to be full.\\pI urge you to clear space and\\nreturn for your prize.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.ThankYouWaitWhileSave	{'body': 'Thank you so much for participating!\\pPlease wait while I save the game.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.AwaitAnotherChallenge2	{'body': 'We await your challenge on\\nanother occasion!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.LookingForwardToArrivalSaveGame	{'body': 'We have been looking forward to\\nyour arrival.\\pBefore I show you to the BATTLE\\nARENA, I must save the game.\\lPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.RecordLastMatch	{'body': 'Shall I record your last BATTLE ARENA\\nmatch on your FRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.BadIdeaToNotAttack	{'body': 'I protected every turn and never\\nbuilt a winning position.\\pNext time, my defensive choices\\nneed to create an opportunity.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.LandingHitsWorked	{'body': 'I kept finding safe chances to\\nland my attacks.\\pThat won my last Circuit match!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.MatchWasDeclaredDraw	{'body': 'The old ARENA judged a match after\\nthree turns.\\pThe CIRCUIT lets a longer plan\\nplay out. You still have to\\lsurvive those first turns.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.OrderOfMonsImportant	{'body': 'Your first two Pokémon begin the\\nCircuit battle together.\\pMake the opening pair support one\\nanother, and keep useful answers\\lin reserve.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.RulesAreListed	{'body': "The Set KO Tourney's rules are listed.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.ExplainBattleRules	{'body': "The Set KO Tourney has special rules,\\nunlike standard battles.\\pFirst, one battle lasts only\\nthree turns.\\pIf the outcome is not decided after\\nthree turns, it goes to judging.\\pThe REFEREE will choose the winner\\nbased on how the POKéMON battled.\\pAlso, a POKéMON cannot be switched out\\nuntil its battle's outcome is decided.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.ExplainMindRules	{'body': 'The first judging factor is “Mind.”\\nThis factor evaluates how aggressive\\lthe battlers were.\\pThe judging is based on how often\\nthe TRAINERS ordered the use of\\loffensive moves.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.ExplainSkillRules	{'body': 'The second judging factor is “Skill.”\\nThis factor evaluates how effectively\\lPOKéMON moves were used.\\pIf a move worked successfully,\\nthe Skill rating goes up.\\pIf a move failed, the Skill rating\\nis lowered.\\pIf it was an offensive move, the Skill\\nrating goes up if the move was “super\\leffective” and goes down if it was\\l“not very effective.”\\pThe Skill rating will not go up for\\nmoves such as PROTECT and DETECT.\\pIf the opponent used PROTECT or\\nDETECT, and your POKéMON failed to\\lhit with a move, its Skill rating will not\\lgo down.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.ExplainBodyRules	{'body': 'The third judging factor is “Body.”\\nThis factor is based on how much HP\\lremained at the end of a battle.\\pThe rating takes into account how much\\nHP a POKéMON had at the start of\\lbattle, and what remained at the end.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.CongratsOnDefeatingTycoon	{'body': 'A victory snatched from the ARENA\\nTYCOON, and a seven-TRAINER sweep!\\pWe congratulate you on your most\\nsplendid challenge!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby.PleaseAcceptBattlePoints	{'body': 'My dear challenger, in recognition of\\nyour indefatigable spirit, please\\laccept these Battle Point(s).$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.PlayerHasEnteredDome	{'body': '{PLAYER} has entered the BATTLE DOME!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.PlayerVersusTrainer	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1}\\nmatch!\\p{PLAYER} versus {STR_VAR_2}!\\pLet the battle begin!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.PlayerIsWinner	{'body': '{PLAYER} is the winner!\\nCongratulations!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.TrainerIsWinner	{'body': '{STR_VAR_2} is the winner!\\nCongratulations!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.PlayerIsLv50Champ	{'body': '{PLAYER} is the Level 50\\nBattle Tournament Champion!\\pCongratulations!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.PlayerIsLvOpenChamp	{'body': '{PLAYER} is the Open Level\\nBattle Tournament Champion!\\pCongratulations!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.RefereeDecisionPleaseWait	{'body': "What an unbelievable finish!\\nWe have a double knockout!\\pIn this event, the Battle Tournament\\nrules call for a REFEREE'S decision.\\pPlease wait while the judging\\nis under way.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.RefereesDecidedWinnerTrainer	{'body': 'The REFEREES have reached\\na decision!\\pThe winner is…\\nOh, my goodness!\\lThe winner is {STR_VAR_1}!\\lCongratulations!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.RefereesDecidedWinnerPlayer	{'body': 'The REFEREES have reached\\na decision!\\pThe winner is…\\nOh, my goodness!\\lThe winner is {PLAYER}!\\lCongratulations!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.BrightNewHope	{'body': 'The bright new hope!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.RisingStar	{'body': 'The rising star!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.WillTheyRaceToChampionship	{'body': 'Will this TRAINER race to\\nthe championship?\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.CanAchieveChampionFirstTry	{'body': 'Can the feat of a championship\\non the first try be achieved?\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.CanLossBeAvenged	{'body': 'Can the loss of the last match\\nbe avenged?\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.OnFireForChampionship	{'body': 'The TRAINER is on fire for\\nthe first championship try!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.WinHereAdvancesToFinal	{'body': 'A win here means this TRAINER\\nadvances to the final!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.WillLongHeldDreamComeTrue	{'body': 'Will the long-held dream of\\na championship finally come true?\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.TheInvincibleChampion	{'body': 'The invincible champion!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.CanAnyoneHopeToBeatTrainer	{'body': 'Can anyone hope to beat this\\nTRAINER?\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.DoBattlesExistSolelyForTrainer	{'body': 'Do battles exist solely for\\nthis TRAINER?\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.CurrentChampAimingToRetainTitle	{'body': 'The current champion aiming to\\nretain the title!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.FormerChampHasReturned	{'body': 'The former champion has returned!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.FormerToughnessReturned	{'body': 'The former toughness has returned!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.WillDoExpectedAdvanceToFinals	{'body': 'Will this TRAINER do as expected\\nand advance to the finals?\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.WillFormerChampRegainGlory	{'body': 'Will the former champ regain\\nlost glory?\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.FeelGlowOfTrueMaster	{'body': 'Feel the glow of a true master!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.MakeWayForDomeAceTucker	{'body': "And now… The TRAINER standing in\\n{PLAYER}'s record-setting path…\\pYes! The one and only!\\nThe BATTLE DOME COMMISSIONER!\\lOur very own DOME ACE!\\lMake way for TUCKER!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.SpectatorTuckerChant	{'body': 'Spectators: TUCKER! TUCKER!\\nTUCKER! TUCKER! TUCKER!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.TuckerSilverIntro	{'body': "TUCKER: Ahahah!\\pDo you hear it? This crowd!\\nThey're all itching to see our match!\\pAhahah!\\pI bet you're twitching all over from\\nthe tension of getting to battle me!\\pBut don't you worry about a thing!\\pI'm the no. 1 star of the BATTLE DOME!\\nI, TUCKER the DOME ACE, will bathe you\\lin my brilliant glow!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.LetsSeeYourStrategy	{'body': "Your strategy!\\nLet's see it!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.IncredibleVictorIsPlayer	{'body': "Unbelievable! It's incredible!\\nThe victor is {PLAYER}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.WinnerIsTucker	{'body': 'The winner is TUCKER!\\nThe DOME ACE has prevailed!\\pCongratulations, TUCKER!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.SeeYourFrontierPass	{'body': 'TUCKER: Rules are rules!\\nLet me see your FRONTIER PASS.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.ReceivedTacticsSymbol	{'body': 'The Tactics Symbol was embossed on\\nthe FRONTIER PASS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.WontUnderestimateYouNextTime	{'body': "… … … … … …\\pI sorely underestimated you. I won't\\nmake the same mistake next time…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.CanWinStreakBeStretched	{'body': 'Can the win streak be stretched?\\nThe confidence is there!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.LegendHasReturnedDomeAceTucker	{'body': "Ladies and gentlemen!\\nBoys, girls, and POKéMON!\\pFinally!\\nFinally, the legend has returned!\\pYes, the name of that legend!\\nOur very own DOME ACE!\\lIt's none other than TUCKER!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.TuckerGoldIntro	{'body': 'TUCKER: Ah…\\nThe pummeling roar of the crowd…\\lTheir furnace-like heat of excitement…\\lThis is a wonderful place…\\pTo the crowd, I am the DOME ACE…\\nI represent their hopes and dreams…\\lI must never fade from their sight…\\pI must burn!\\nBrighter and more brilliant!\\lI must light all that gather here!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.UnleashAllPowerIPossess	{'body': 'I will unleash all the power that\\nI possess! Right here and now!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.NeverLostWhenPowerUnleashed	{'body': "TUCKER: You're genuinely fantastic!\\pNever before! I haven't ever lost in the\\ntimes I've had to unleash my power.\\pYes, quite fantastic!\\nYour FRONTIER PASS, please?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.TacticsSymbolTookGoldenShine	{'body': 'The Tactics Symbol took on\\na golden shine!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.LookForwardToNextEncounter	{'body': "You're strong, but above all,\\nyou have a unique charm!\\pIn you, I see a definite potential for\\na superstar like me.\\pI will very much look forward to\\nour next encounter!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.PlayerIsLv50Champ2	{'body': '{PLAYER} is the Level 50\\nBattle Tournament Champion!\\pCongratulations!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.PlayerIsLvOpenChamp2	{'body': '{PLAYER} is the Open Level\\nBattle Tournament Champion!\\pCongratulations!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.PlayerVersusTucker	{'body': 'The final match!\\p{PLAYER} versus the DOME ACE, TUCKER!\\pLet the battle begin!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom.RefereesDecidedWinnerTucker	{'body': "The REFEREES have reached\\na decision!\\pThe winner is…\\nOh, my goodness!\\lThe winner is our very own DOME ACE!\\lIt's TUCKER!\\pCongratulations! And thank you!\\nLet's hear it for the DOME ACE, TUCKER!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.WelcomeSingleBattle	{'body': 'Where the strategies of TRAINERS\\nare put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE DOME!\\pI am your guide to the SINGLE BATTLE\\nTournament.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.TakeSinglesChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to challenge\\nthe SINGLE BATTLE Tournament?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.HopeToSeeYouAgain	{'body': 'We hope to see you again.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ExplainSinglesChallenge	{'body': "The SINGLE BATTLE Tournament\\nis exactly as the name suggests--\\la tournament of SINGLE BATTLES.\\pAll participating TRAINERS must\\nenter three POKéMON each.\\pIn each battle, one of the three\\nPOKéMON must be held in reserve.\\pThe other two POKéMON can battle\\none at a time.\\pChoose the two battling POKéMON after\\nexamining the opponent's trio.\\pYou win the tournament by defeating\\nfour TRAINERS.\\pBattle Points are awarded to\\nthe tournament winner.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\ntournament, please save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.OkayToSaveBeforeChallenge	{'body': 'Before I show you to the BATTLE DOME,\\nI must save the data. Is that okay?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.WhichLevelMode	{'body': 'The tournament offers two levels\\nof challenge, Level 50 and Open Level.\\lWhich is your choice?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.SelectThreeMons	{'body': 'Now select the three POKéMON that\\nyou wish to enter, please.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou don't have three eligible POKéMON.\\pAlso, the POKéMON must be holding\\ndifferent kinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsEnd	{'body': 'Please come see me when you are ready.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou don't have three eligible POKéMON.\\pYou must have three different POKéMON\\nof Level 50 or less to enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ShowYouToBattleDome	{'body': 'I will now show you to\\nthe BATTLE DOME.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.DidntSaveBeforeQuitting	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou didn't save before you quit your\\nchallenge last time.\\pBecause of that, your challenge so far\\nhas been disqualified. Sorry!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.CongratsForWinningTourney	{'body': 'Congratulations for winning\\nyour Battle Tournament!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.HereIsYourPrize	{'body': 'Here is your prize for your Battle\\nTournament victory.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ReceivedPrize	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the prize\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.BagFullMakeRoom	{'body': 'Oh, your BAG appears to be full.\\pPlease make room in your BAG, then come\\nsee me.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ThankYouForPlaying	{'body': 'Thank you for playing!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.RecordWillBeSaved	{'body': 'Your record will be saved.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.WeveBeenWaitingForYou	{'body': "We've been waiting for you!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.OkayToSaveBeforeChallenge2	{'body': 'Before I show you to the BATTLE DOME,\\nI must save the data. Is that okay?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.WelcomeDoubleBattle	{'body': 'Where the strategies of TRAINERS\\nare put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE DOME!\\pI am your guide to the DOUBLE BATTLE\\nTournament.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.TakeDoublesChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to challenge\\nthe DOUBLE BATTLE Tournament?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ExplainDoublesChallenge	{'body': "The DOUBLE BATTLE Tournament\\nis exactly as the name suggests--\\la tournament of DOUBLE BATTLES.\\pAll participating TRAINERS must\\nenter three POKéMON each.\\pIn each battle, one of the three\\nPOKéMON must be held in reserve.\\pThe remaining two POKéMON must take\\npart in a DOUBLE BATTLE.\\pChoose the two battling POKéMON after\\nexamining the opponent's trio.\\pYou win the tournament by defeating\\nfour TRAINERS.\\pBattle Points are awarded to\\nthe tournament winner.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\ntournament, please save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.PrevTourneyResultsSinglesLv50	{'body': "They're the results of the last\\nLevel 50 SINGLE BATTLE Tournament.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.PrevTourneyResultsDoublesLv50	{'body': "They're the results of the last\\nLevel 50 DOUBLE BATTLE Tournament.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.PrevTourneyResultsSinglesLvOpen	{'body': "They're the results of the last\\nOpen Level SINGLE BATTLE Tournament.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.PrevTourneyResultsDoublesLvOpen	{'body': "They're the results of the last\\nOpen Level DOUBLE BATTLE Tournament.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.LastWinnerWasTough	{'body': "These monitors used to show the\\nDOME's tournament results.\\pNow they show your CIRCUIT\\nrecords. A different challenge,\\lthe same ambition!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_LongDreamedAboutBattleFrontier	{'body': "The BATTLE FRONTIER…\\nI've long dreamed about a place like it.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_BattleDomeSign2	{'body': 'The BATTLE DOME\\nBecome the Unbeatable Superstar!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_QuestionMarkUnderConstruction	{'body': 'The ??????\\nUnder Construction!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.WinnersGainReputation	{'body': 'The DOME built its reputation on\\ngreat tournament battles.\\pNow its desk enters the CIRCUIT.\\nKeep winning, and people remember\\lyour team!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.TrashedInFirstRound	{'body': 'My very first Circuit opponent\\nbroke through my opening.\\pI need a stronger answer from the\\nfirst turn.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.NeedToCheckOpponentCarefully	{'body': 'I committed my best answer too\\nearly and lost it.\\pA reserve is valuable only if you\\npreserve the chance to use it.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.CongratsDefeatedTucker	{'body': 'Congratulations!\\pYou defeated the DOME ACE and won\\nthe Battle Tournament!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.AwardTheseBattlePoints	{'body': 'In recognition of your strategy--\\na thing of beauty it was, too--\\lwe award you these Battle Point(s)!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.RecordLastMatch	{'body': 'Would you like to record your\\nlast BATTLE DOME match on your\\lFRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.RulesAreListed	{'body': 'The Battle Tournament rules\\nare listed.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ExplainMatchupRules	{'body': 'The tournament matchups are drawn up\\nbased on the toughness of POKéMON\\lheld by TRAINERS.\\pThe matchups avoid having tough\\nTRAINERS face each other right away.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ExplainTourneyTree	{'body': "The tournament chart, or as we call it,\\nthe “Tree,” is available for viewing\\lin the Waiting Room from any guide.\\pThe Tournament Tree will provide\\nseveral kinds of data.\\pThe data on view includes the previous\\ntournament's results, the POKéMON held\\lby TRAINERS, and the battle styles of\\lTRAINERS.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomeLobby.ExplainDoubleKORules	{'body': 'If battling POKéMON faint at the same\\ntime--a double KO--in a tournament\\lmatch, the REFEREES will review\\lthe match and declare the winner.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ReadyForRound1	{'body': 'Your 1st-round match is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ReadyForRound2	{'body': 'Your 2nd-round match is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ReadyForSemifinals	{'body': 'Your semifinal match is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ReadyForFinals	{'body': 'Your final match is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ChooseTwoMons	{'body': 'Please choose the two POKéMON\\nthat are to appear in battle.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.RightThisWay	{'body': 'Right this way, please.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.RestoreMonsToFullHealth	{'body': "Thank you for competing!\\pI'll restore your POKéMON to\\nfull health.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.Round1Complete	{'body': 'All 1st-round matches have been\\ncompleted.\\pThese are the teams that advanced!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.Round2Complete	{'body': 'All 2nd-round matches have been\\ncompleted.\\pThese are the teams that advanced!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.SemifinalsComplete	{'body': 'All semifinal matches have been\\ncompleted.\\pThese are the teams that advanced!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.CongratsReadyForRound2	{'body': 'Congratulations for getting through\\nthe 1st round.\\pThe 2nd round is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.CongratsReadyForSemifinals	{'body': 'Congratulations for advancing\\nto the semifinals.\\pThe best four teams meet in this round.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.CongratsReadyForFinals	{'body': "Congratulations for advancing\\nto the final match.\\pYou're one win from the championship.\\nAre you ready?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.PlayersNextOpponentIsTrainer	{'body': "{PLAYER}'s next opponent\\nis this TRAINER.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.TourneyInRound1	{'body': 'The tournament is in the 1st round.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.TourneyInRound2	{'body': 'The tournament is in the 2nd round.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.TourneyInSemifinals	{'body': 'The tournament is in the semifinals.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.TourneyInFinals	{'body': 'The tournament is up to the final.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.SaveAndQuitGame	{'body': 'Would you like to save and\\nquit the game?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.RetireYourChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to retire from your\\nBattle Tournament challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.SavingDataPleaseWait	{'body': 'I am saving your data.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.RecordLastMatch	{'body': 'Should I record your last match\\non your FRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ReadyForTuckerSilver	{'body': 'Congratulations for advancing\\nto the final match.\\pFor the final match, you will challenge\\nthe DOME ACE TUCKER.\\pAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ReadyForTuckerGold	{'body': 'Congratulations for advancing\\nto the final match.\\pFor the final match, you will challenge\\nthe DOME ACE TUCKER.\\pAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ReadyForTuckerSilverShort	{'body': 'Your final battle against TUCKER is\\nnext. Are you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleDomePreBattleRoom.ReadyForTuckerGoldShort	{'body': 'Your final battle against TUCKER is\\nnext. Are you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.GetAMoveOn	{'body': 'Hey, hey!\\nGet a move on!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.NolandImFactoryHead	{'body': "Hey, my name's NOLAND!\\nI'm basically in charge of this place,\\lwhich is why I'm the FACTORY HEAD!\\pI had a look at your Battle Swap data.\\pYou seem to have the right idea,\\nbut you're still square in your head!\\pListen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only\\nabout reading books or doing desk work.\\pJust doing that sort of thing…\\nIt may as well be useless!\\pYou have to experience things with\\nyour heart and your body, understand?\\pI'll take you on under the same\\nconditions as you.\\pI'll be using rental POKéMON, too!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.ShakeOutKnowledgeBringItOn	{'body': 'Shake out every last bit of your\\nknowledge and bring it on!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.NolandLetsSeeFrontierPass	{'body': "NOLAND: Smart going!\\nLet's see your FRONTIER PASS.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.ReceivedKnowledgeSymbol	{'body': 'The Knowledge Symbol was embossed\\non the FRONTIER PASS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.NextTimeNoHoldsBarred	{'body': "Heh…\\nYou're a pretty bright spark…\\pNext time, I'll come after you hard.\\nNo holds barred, understand?\\pYou keep up your studies!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.HarderLookThanLastTime	{'body': "NOLAND: Hey, hey! How's it going?\\nYou keeping up with your studies?\\p…Oh?\\pYou've taken on a harder look than\\nthe last time I saw you.\\pNow, this should be fun!\\nI'm getting excited, hey!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.AllRightBringItOn	{'body': 'All right!\\nBring it on!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.OutOfMyLeagueLetsSeePass	{'body': "NOLAND: What the…\\nYou're getting out of my league!\\pSheesh!\\nLet's see that FRONTIER PASS!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.KnowledgeSymbolTookGoldenShine	{'body': 'The Knowledge Symbol took on\\na golden shine!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom.LastTimeILoseToYou	{'body': "Pfft, man!\\pThat's absolutely the last time\\nI lose to you!\\pWe have to do this again, hey?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.WelcomeForSingleBattle	{'body': 'Where the intelligence of TRAINERS\\nis put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE FACTORY!\\pI am your guide to the Battle Swap\\nSingle Tournament.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.TakeSinglesChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to take the Battle\\nSwap Single challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ExplainSinglesChallenge	{'body': "The Battle Swap Single Tournament\\nis a SINGLE BATTLE competition using\\lonly rental POKéMON.\\pFirst, you will be loaned three\\nPOKéMON specifically for this event.\\pUsing the supplied rental POKéMON,\\nyou must conduct a SINGLE BATTLE.\\pIf you win, you are permitted to trade\\none of your rental POKéMON.\\pRepeat this cycle of battling and\\ntrading--if you win seven times in\\la row, you will earn Battle Points.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, please save the game.\\pIf you don't save, you will be\\ndisqualified from your challenge.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.LookForwardToNextVisit	{'body': 'We look forward to your next visit.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.WhichLevelMode	{'body': 'Which level do you wish to challenge?\\nLevel 50 or Open Level?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.OkayToSaveBeforeChallenge	{'body': 'Before you begin your challenge,\\nI need to save the game. Is that okay?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.WillHoldMonsForSafekeeping	{'body': 'Okay, I will hold your POKéMON for\\nsafekeeping while you compete.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.StepThisWay	{'body': 'Please step this way.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ReturnMonsSaveResults	{'body': 'Thank you for participating!\\pI will return your POKéMON in exchange\\nfor our rental POKéMON.\\pI must also save the event results.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ReturnMons	{'body': 'I will return your POKéMON in exchange\\nfor our rental POKéMON.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.CongratsSevenWins	{'body': "Congratulations! You've won seven\\nstraight Battle Swap matches!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.AwardBattlePointsForStreak	{'body': 'In recognition of your 7-win streak,\\nwe award you these Battle Point(s).$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.MaxBattlePoints	{'body': 'Oh, oh, oh!\\pYour Battle Points are maxed.\\pPlease come back after using\\nsome Battle Points.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.WaitingForYouToResume	{'body': "We've been waiting for you!\\pBefore we resume your challenge,\\nI must save the game.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.DidntSaveBeforeQuitting	{'body': "I'm sorry to say this, but you didn't\\nsave before you quit playing last time.\\pAs a result, you have been disqualified\\nfrom your challenge.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.WellReturnMons	{'body': "We'll return your personal POKéMON.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ReceivedPrizeItem	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the prize\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.WelcomeForDoubleBattle	{'body': 'Where the intelligence of TRAINERS\\nis put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE FACTORY!\\pI am your guide to the Battle Swap\\nDouble Tournament.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.TakeDoublesChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to take the Battle\\nSwap Double challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ExplainDoublesChallenge	{'body': "The Battle Swap Double Tournament\\nis a DOUBLE BATTLE competition using\\lonly rental POKéMON.\\pFirst, you will be loaned three\\nPOKéMON specifically for this event.\\pUsing the supplied rental POKéMON,\\nyou must conduct a DOUBLE BATTLE.\\pIf you win, you are permitted to trade\\none of your rental POKéMON.\\pRepeat this cycle of battling and\\ntrading--if you win seven times in\\la row, you will earn Battle Points.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, please save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.CongratsForDefeatingHead	{'body': 'Congratulations for defeating\\nthe FACTORY HEAD and winning\\lseven matches in a row!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.AwardBattlePoints	{'body': 'In recognition of your wealth of\\nknowledge and keen intelligence,\\lwe award you these Battle Point(s).$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ExchangeMonsAndSave	{'body': 'Let me exchange your POKéMON\\nfor our rental POKéMON.\\pI need to save the battle data,\\nso please wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.RecordLastMatch	{'body': 'Would you like to record your last\\nBATTLE FACTORY match on your\\lFRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.NeedKnowledgeOfMonsMoves	{'body': "Don't judge an opposing Pokémon by\\nits reputation alone.\\pLook at the board and what its\\npartner makes possible. That's how\\lthe CIRCUIT keeps surprising me.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.SwappedForWeakMon	{'body': "I changed one member of my team\\nand lost the support another\\lpartner depended on.\\pThe new Pokémon wasn't weak. My\\ncombination was incomplete.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.NeedToCheckOpponentsMons	{'body': "Things haven't been going my way\\nat all.\\pYou need to check your opponent's\\nPOKéMON during battle to see if\\lthey're any good.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.CantFigureOutStaffHints	{'body': "A name tells you which Pokémon\\nyou're facing. It doesn't tell you\\levery choice it can make.\\pI keep that in mind when the\\nCIRCUIT introduces an opponent.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.RentalMonsAreVaried	{'body': "Like, I'm really tough, but I get bored\\nreally easily, so I just kept swapping\\land battling over and over.\\pSo anyway, when I kept entering\\nBattle Swap events, I noticed they\\lvaried the rental POKéMON.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.RulesAreListed	{'body': 'The Battle Swap rules are listed.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ExplainBasicRules	{'body': 'In a Battle Swap event, you may use\\nonly three POKéMON.\\pWhether you are renting or swapping,\\nyour team may not have two or more\\lof the same POKéMON.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ExplainSwapPartnerRules	{'body': 'You may swap POKéMON only with\\nthe TRAINER you have just defeated.\\pYou may swap for only those POKéMON\\nused by the beaten TRAINER.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ExplainSwapNumberRules	{'body': "After every battle you win, you may\\nswap for one of your defeated\\lopponent's POKéMON.\\pYou will not be able to swap POKéMON\\nwith the seventh TRAINER in the event.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ExplainSwapNotesRules	{'body': "There are two key points to be aware\\nof when swapping POKéMON.\\pFirst, when swapping, you can't check\\nthe stats of the POKéMON you are\\labout to receive.\\pSecond, the POKéMON on your team\\nare lined up in sequence, depending on\\lthe order in which you rented them.\\pThis sequence remains unchanged\\neven when swaps are made.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryLobby.ExplainOpenLvRules	{'body': "In the Open Level, the rental POKéMON\\nand the opposing TRAINERS' POKéMON\\lare all Level 100.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.HoldMonsChooseFromSelection	{'body': 'First, we will hold your POKéMON for\\nsafekeeping.\\pYou may then choose from our\\nselection of POKéMON.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.LetUsRestoreMons	{'body': 'Thank you for competing!\\nLet us restore your POKéMON!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.ReadyFor2ndOpponent	{'body': 'The 2nd match is next!\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.ReadyFor3rdOpponent	{'body': 'The 3rd match is next!\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.ReadyFor4thOpponent	{'body': 'The 4th match is next!\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.ReadyFor5thOpponent	{'body': 'The 5th match is next!\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.ReadyFor6thOpponent	{'body': 'The 6th match is next!\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.ReadyFor7thOpponent	{'body': 'Finally, the 7th match is next!\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.SaveAndQuitGame	{'body': 'Would you like to save and quit\\nthe game?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.RetireFromChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to retire from your\\nBattle Swap challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.InvestigatedUpcomingOpponent	{'body': "I've conducted a little investigation\\nabout your upcoming opponent.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInNormalType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the NORMAL type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInFireType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the FIRE type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInWaterType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the WATER type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInElectricType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the ELECTRIC type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInGrassType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the GRASS type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInIceType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the ICE type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInFightingType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the FIGHTING type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInPoisonType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the POISON type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInGroundType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the GROUND type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInFlyingType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the FLYING type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInPsychicType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the PSYCHIC type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInBugType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the BUG type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInRockType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the ROCK type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInGhostType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the GHOST type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInDragonType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the DRAGON type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInDarkType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the DARK type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInFairyType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the FAIRY type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerSkilledInSteelType	{'body': 'The TRAINER is apparently skilled\\nin the handling of the STEEL type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.TrainerHasNoClearFavorite	{'body': 'The TRAINER appears to have no clear\\nfavorites when it comes to type.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleSlowAndSteady	{'body': 'The favorite battle style appears to\\nbe slow and steady.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleEndurance	{'body': 'The favorite battle style appears to\\nbe one of endurance.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleHighRisk	{'body': 'The favorite battle style appears to\\nbe high risk, high return.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleDependsOnFlow	{'body': "The favorite battle style appears to\\ndepend on the battle's flow.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleTotalPreparation	{'body': 'The favorite battle style appears to\\nbe one based on total preparation.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleWeakenFoe	{'body': 'The favorite battle style appears\\nto be weakening the foe to start.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleFlexible	{'body': 'The favorite battle style appears to\\nbe flexibly adaptable to the situation.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleImpossibleToPredict	{'body': 'The favorite battle style appears to\\nbe impossible to predict.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.StyleUnrestrained	{'body': 'The favorite battle style appears to\\nbe free-spirited and unrestrained.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.LikeToSwapMon	{'body': 'Before starting the battle, would you\\nlike to swap a POKéMON?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.YourSwapIsComplete	{'body': 'Thank you!\\nYour POKéMON swap is complete.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.RightThisWay	{'body': 'Right this way, please!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.SavingDataPleaseWait	{'body': 'I am saving your data.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.RecordLatestBattle	{'body': 'Would you like to record your latest\\nbattle on your FRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.WaitFewMoments	{'body': 'Excuse me! Excuse me, please!\\nMay I get you to wait a few moments?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.UnderstoodSirWillDo	{'body': '…Uh-huh? What?! …Whoa!\\nUnderstood, sir! Will do!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.MessageFromHeadComeRightNow	{'body': "Oh, my…\\nSorry to keep you waiting!\\pI have a message from this facility's\\nboss, the FACTORY HEAD.\\pHe says, “We're going to do it!\\nCome here right now!”$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.PreparedToFaceHead	{'body': 'The FACTORY HEAD is demanding you.\\nAre you prepared to face him?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryPreBattleRoom.CantTellAnythingAboutHead	{'body': "I'm terribly sorry, but I can't tell you\\nanything about the FACTORY HEAD.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.LetMeRestoreYourMons	{'body': 'Excellent…\\nLet me restore your POKéMON.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.PreparedFor2ndOpponent	{'body': 'The 2nd opponent is next.\\nAre you prepared?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.PreparedFor3rdOpponent	{'body': 'The 3rd opponent is next.\\nAre you prepared?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.PreparedFor4thOpponent	{'body': 'The 4th opponent is next.\\nAre you prepared?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.PreparedFor5thOpponent	{'body': 'The 5th opponent is next.\\nAre you prepared?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.PreparedFor6thOpponent	{'body': 'The 6th opponent is next.\\nAre you prepared?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.PreparedFor7thOpponent	{'body': 'The 7th opponent is next.\\nAre you prepared?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SaveAndQuitGame	{'body': 'Would you like to save and quit\\nthe game?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.WishToQuitChallenge	{'body': 'Do you wish to quit your challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SavingData	{'body': 'Saving the data.\\nHave patience…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.RecordLastMatch	{'body': 'Do you wish to record your latest\\nmatch on your FRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.ChallengingPalaceMaven	{'body': 'And now…\\pBy winning consistently, you have\\nearned the privilege of challenging\\lour master, the PALACE MAVEN…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.ReadyForPalaceMaven	{'body': 'I shall send for the PALACE MAVEN.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.AnnounceArrivalOfSpenser	{'body': 'Let great fanfare announce the arrival\\nof the PALACE MAVEN, SPENSER!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SpenserFirstIntro	{'body': 'SPENSER: My physical being is with\\nPOKéMON always!\\pMy heart beats as one with\\nPOKéMON always!\\pYoung one of a TRAINER!\\nDo you believe in your POKéMON?\\pCan you believe them through\\nand through?\\pIf your bonds of trust are frail,\\nyou will never beat my brethren!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.ProveYourBondWithMons	{'body': 'The bond you share with your POKéMON!\\nProve it to me here!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SpenserPostSilverBattle	{'body': 'SPENSER: Gwahahah!\\pHah, you never fell for my bluster!\\nSorry for trying that stunt!\\pHere!\\nBring me the thing!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.LetsSeeFrontierPass	{'body': "My, my, if only you could maintain that\\nfacade of distinguished authority…\\pHere!\\nLet's see your FRONTIER PASS!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.ReceivedSpiritsSymbol	{'body': 'The Spirits Symbol was embossed on\\nthe FRONTIER PASS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SpenserAwaitNextTime	{'body': "SPENSER: Your POKéMON's eyes are \\ntruly clear and unclouded.\\pI will eagerly await the next\\nopportunity to see you.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SpenserThisTimeWontHoldBack	{'body': "SPENSER: Gwahahah!\\nYou've battled your way up again?\\pYou must have developed a truly\\nformidable bond with your POKéMON.\\pSo be it!\\pThis time, I won't bluster or hold back.\\nThis time, there's no fooling around.\\pReady now?\\nPrepare to lose!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.Kaaah	{'body': '… … …Kaaah!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SpenserYourTeamIsAdmirable	{'body': 'SPENSER: Well, that was some display!\\nEven fully unleashed, my brethren\\lcould not overpower you.\\pYour team spirit is truly admirable!\\pHere!\\nBring me that thing, will you?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.HurryWithFrontierPass	{'body': 'My, my, if only you could maintain\\na certain level of decorum…\\pGaaah, here!\\nHurry with that FRONTIER PASS, you!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SpiritsSymbolTookGoldenShine	{'body': 'The Spirits Symbol took on\\na golden shine!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom.SpenserComeSeeMeAgain	{'body': 'SPENSER: Gwahahah!\\pCome see me time and again!\\nMy brethren and I will be waiting!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor.PeopleAndMonAreSame	{'body': 'People and POKéMON, they are but\\nthe same…\\pTheir individual nature makes them\\ngood at certain things, and not good\\lat others.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor.LetMonDoWhatItLikes	{'body': "Rather than trying to make a POKéMON\\ndo what it dislikes, try to let it do\\lwhat it likes and is good at doing.\\pPut yourself in the POKéMON's position\\nand consider what moves it would like.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor.MonDifferentWhenCornered	{'body': "A POKéMON's nature is a remarkable\\nthing…\\pSome POKéMON behave in a completely\\ndifferent way when they are cornered.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor.BeginningToUnderstandNature	{'body': "Are you beginning to understand how\\na POKéMON's nature makes it behave?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor.HeartfeltBondBetweenYouAndMons	{'body': 'Ah… I see a strong, heartfelt bond\\nbetween you and your POKéMON…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.WelcomeForSingleBattle	{'body': 'Where the hearts of TRAINERS\\nare put to the test.\\pI welcome you to the BATTLE PALACE.\\pI accept challenges to the SINGLE\\nBATTLE HALLS.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.TakeSingleBattleChallenge	{'body': 'Do you wish to take\\nthe SINGLE BATTLE HALL challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ExplainSingleBattleChallenge	{'body': "In the BATTLE PALACE, there are\\nseveral auditoriums for SINGLE BATTLES\\lthat are named SINGLE BATTLE HALLS.\\pThe SINGLE BATTLES are conducted in\\nthe usual way, except with one crucial\\lrule that must be obeyed.\\pTRAINERS are permitted only to switch\\ntheir POKéMON in and out.\\pTRAINERS are otherwise forbidden to\\ncommand their POKéMON.\\pThe POKéMON are to behave according\\nto their nature and battle on their own.\\pYou must put your trust in your\\nPOKéMON and watch over them.\\pIf you achieve the honor of beating\\nseven TRAINERS in succession,\\lwe will present you with Battle Points.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, you must save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ReturnWhenFortified	{'body': 'When you have fortified your heart\\nand POKéMON, you must return.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.WhichChallenge	{'body': 'There are two BATTLE HALLS,\\nLevel 50 and Open Level.\\lWhich is your choice of a challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50	{'body': 'Sigh…\\pYou do not have the three POKéMON\\nrequired for the challenge.\\pTo enter, you must provide three\\ndifferent kinds of POKéMON.\\pThese POKéMON must all be of\\nLevel 50 or lower.\\pThey also must not be holding\\nthe same kinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsEnd	{'body': 'Come back when you have made\\nyour preparations.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen	{'body': 'Sigh…\\pYou do not have the three POKéMON\\nrequired for the challenge.\\pTo enter, you must provide three\\ndifferent kinds of POKéMON.\\pThey also must not be holding\\nthe same kinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.NowSelectThreeMons	{'body': 'Good. Now, you must select your\\nthree POKéMON.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.MustSaveBeforeChallenge2	{'body': 'I must save before I show you to\\nthe BATTLE HALL. Is that okay?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.FollowMe	{'body': 'Good.\\nNow, follow me.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ResultsWillBeRecorded	{'body': "I feel privileged for having seen\\nyour POKéMON's exploits.\\pThe results will be recorded.\\nI must ask you to briefly wait.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.FirmTrueBondsFor7WinStreak	{'body': 'To achieve a 7-win streak…\\pThe bonds that bind your heart with\\nyour POKéMON seem firm and true.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.FeatWillBeRecorded	{'body': 'Your feat will be recorded.\\nI must ask you to briefly wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.BattlePointsFor7WinStreak	{'body': 'For the feat of your 7-win streak,\\nwe present you with Battle Point(s).$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.NoSpaceForPrize	{'body': 'You seem to have no space for\\nour prize.\\pYou should return when you have\\norganized your BAG.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.WeHaveBeenWaiting	{'body': 'We have been waiting for you…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.MustSaveBeforeChallenge	{'body': 'I must save before I show you to\\nthe BATTLE HALL. Is that okay?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.FailedToSaveBeforeEndingChallenge	{'body': 'Sigh…\\pYou failed to save before you ended\\nyour challenge the last time.\\pAs a result, your challenge has been\\ndisqualified. It is most unfortunate.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ReceivedPrize	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the prize\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.LadyCanTellWhatMonsThink	{'body': "For a hardy fellow like me,\\nhardy POKéMON are the best.\\pOffense is the best defense!\\nA relentless attack is the ultimate!\\pBut that's not what I wanted to chat\\nabout.\\pEvery so often a really cute lady\\nswings by here.\\pShe says that she can tell what\\nPOKéMON are thinking.\\pI don't know about that part,\\nbut she is really cute.\\pHuh?\\nWhy are you looking at me like that?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.NatureAndMovesKeyHere	{'body': 'The old Palace tested how Pokémon\\nacted on their own.\\pIn the CIRCUIT, you command every\\nmove. Natures change stats, not\\lobedience.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.MonDocileButTransforms	{'body': "My POKéMON is usually very docile.\\pBut when it's in a BATTLE HALL,\\nit sometimes seems to become\\ltransformed into something wicked!\\pIt becomes totally intimidating.\\nIt's shocking, even.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.WhatNatureFavorsChippingAway	{'body': 'A careful Nature and EV\\nspread can help a partner survive\\lthe turn that matters.\\pThen I choose what it does with\\nthat extra turn!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.WelcomeForDoubleBattle	{'body': 'Where the hearts of TRAINERS\\nare put to the test.\\pI welcome you to the BATTLE PALACE.\\pI accept challenges to the DOUBLE\\nBATTLE HALLS.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.TakeDoubleBattleChallenge	{'body': 'Do you wish to take\\nthe DOUBLE BATTLE HALL challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ExplainDoubleBattleChallenge	{'body': "In the BATTLE PALACE, there are\\nseveral auditoriums for DOUBLE BATTLES\\lthat are named DOUBLE BATTLE HALLS.\\pThe DOUBLE BATTLES are conducted in\\nthe usual way, except with one crucial\\lrule that must be obeyed.\\pTRAINERS are permitted only to switch\\ntheir POKéMON in and out.\\pTRAINERS are otherwise forbidden to\\ncommand their POKéMON.\\pThe POKéMON are to behave according\\nto their nature and battle on their own.\\pYou must put your trust in your\\nPOKéMON and watch over them.\\pIf you achieve the honor of beating\\nseven TRAINERS in succession,\\lwe will present you with Battle Points.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, please save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ToDefeatMavenAnd7Trainers	{'body': 'To defeat the PALACE MAVEN\\nand seven TRAINERS in a row…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.PresentYouWithBattlePoints	{'body': 'In honor of the bond you share with\\nyour POKéMON, we present you with\\lthese Battle Point(s).$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.LikeToRecordMatch	{'body': 'Would you like to record your latest\\nBATTLE PALACE match on your\\lFRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.RulesAreListed	{'body': 'The BATTLE HALL rules are listed.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ExplainRulesBasics	{'body': 'Here, POKéMON are required to think\\nand battle by themselves.\\pUnlike in the wild, POKéMON that live\\nwith people behave differently\\ldepending on their nature.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ExplainRulesNature	{'body': 'Depending on its nature, a POKéMON\\nmay prefer to attack no matter what.\\pAnother POKéMON may prefer to protect\\nitself from any harm.\\pYet another may enjoy vexing or\\nconfounding its foes.\\pDue to its nature, a POKéMON\\nwill have favorite moves that it is good\\lat using.\\pIt may also dislike certain moves that\\nit has trouble using.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ExplainRulesMoves	{'body': 'There are offensive moves that inflict\\ndirect damage on the foe.\\pThere are defensive moves that are\\nused to prepare for enemy attacks or\\lused to heal HP and so on.\\pThere are also other somewhat-odd\\nmoves that may enfeeble the foes with\\lstat problems including poison and \\lparalysis.\\pPOKéMON will consider using moves in\\nthese three categories.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ExplainRulesUnderpowered	{'body': 'When not under command by its TRAINER,\\na POKéMON may be unable to effectively\\luse certain moves.\\pA POKéMON is not good at using any\\nmove that it dislikes.\\pIf a POKéMON only knows moves that\\ndo not match its nature, it will often\\lbe unable to live up to its potential.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby.ExplainRulesWhenInDanger	{'body': "Depending on its nature, a POKéMON may\\nstart using moves that don't match its\\lnature when it is in trouble.\\pIf a POKéMON begins behaving oddly\\nin a pinch, watch it carefully.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeCorridor.YourChallengeHasBegun	{'body': 'Your Battle Choice challenge\\nhas now begun…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.WelcomeToBattlePike	{'body': 'Where the luck of TRAINERS\\nis put to the test…\\pWelcome to the BATTLE PIKE…\\pI am your guide to the BATTLE PIKE…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.TakeChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to take the Battle\\nChoice challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ExplainBattlePike	{'body': "Here we conduct an event we call\\nthe Battle Choice.\\pThe Battle Choice rules are very\\nsimple…\\pChoose one of three paths and make\\nyour way to the goal room at the end\\lof the BATTLE PIKE. It's that simple.\\pHowever, what happens on the chosen\\npath depends entirely on the luck\\lof the challenger…\\pIf you reach the goal, you will be\\nrewarded with Battle Points.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, please have a word with\\lour staff in the big rooms on the way.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.LookForwardToSeeingYou	{'body': 'We look forward to seeing you\\non another occasion…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.WhichChallengeMode	{'body': 'You have the choice of two courses,\\nLevel 50 and Open Level.\\lWhich will you challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50	{'body': 'I beg your pardon, but…\\pYou do not have three eligible\\nPOKéMON for the Battle Choice event.\\pYou must have three different POKéMON\\nof Level 50 or less to enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsEnd	{'body': 'Please come see me when\\nyou are ready…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen	{'body': 'I beg your pardon, but…\\pYou do not have three eligible\\nPOKéMON for the Battle Choice event.\\pYou must have three different\\nPOKéMON to enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.PleaseChooseThreeMons	{'body': 'Please choose the three POKéMON\\nyou wish to enter in the challenge…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.SaveBeforeChallenge	{'body': 'Before starting your Battle Choice\\nchallenge, I must save the game.\\lIs that acceptable?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.StepThisWay	{'body': 'Please step this way…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ChallengeEndedRecordResults	{'body': 'Your challenge has ended…\\pI shall record your results.\\nPlease wait…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.PossessLuckInAbundance	{'body': 'You have completed the challenge…\\pI must say… You seem to possess luck\\nin abundance…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ShallRecordResults	{'body': 'I shall record your results.\\nPlease wait…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.AwardYouTheseBattlePoints2	{'body': 'To commemorate your completion of\\nthe Battle Choice challenge, we award\\lyou these Battle Point(s)…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ReachedBattlePointLimit	{'body': 'You appear to have reached the limit\\nfor Battle Points…\\pPlease exchange some Battle Points\\nfor prizes, then return…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.FailedToSaveBeforeQuitting	{'body': 'I beg your pardon, but…\\pYou failed to save before you quit\\nyour challenge the last time.\\pBecause of that, your challenge so far\\nhas been disqualified. I am sorry…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.SnatchedVictoryFromQueen	{'body': 'Congratulations…\\pYou have snatched victory from the\\nPIKE QUEEN and cleared the event…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.AwardYouTheseBattlePoints	{'body': 'In recognition of your amazing luck,\\nwe award you these Battle Point(s)…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.OneRoomAwayFromGoal	{'body': 'One more victory would have beaten\\nmy Circuit record.\\pA status move stopped me. I left\\nthat answer out of my team.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.NeverHadToBattleTrainer	{'body': 'I used to get lucky in the PIKE.\\pThe CIRCUIT makes you face a\\ncomplete opposing team every\\lmatch. I like that.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ThinkAbilitiesUsefulHere	{'body': "Listen! Listen!\\pDon't you think that the special\\nabilities of POKéMON will be useful\\lhere?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.TrainersWhicheverPathIChoose	{'body': 'I went to a different desk hoping\\nfor an easier challenge.\\pThey all enter the same CIRCUIT!\\nNow the receptionist recognizes\\lme…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.RulesAreListed	{'body': "The Battle Choice's rules are listed.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ExplainPokenavBagRules	{'body': 'The BAG and POKéNAV may not be used\\nduring a Battle Choice challenge.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ExplainHeldItemRules	{'body': 'During a Battle Choice challenge,\\nany BERRY or HERB held by POKéMON\\lwill be effective only once.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby.ExplainMonOrderRules	{'body': 'During a Battle Choice challenge,\\nthe sequence of POKéMON cannot be\\lchanged.\\pThe sequence must be set before\\nstarting your challenge.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomFinal.CongratsThisWayPlease	{'body': 'Congratulations…\\nNow, this way, please…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.WillRestoreToFullHealth	{'body': 'Welcome…\\nYou must be commended for your luck…\\pYour POKéMON shall be restored\\nto full health…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.EnjoyRestOfChallenge	{'body': 'I urge you to enjoy the rest of your\\nBattle Choice challenge…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.WillRestoreOneMon	{'body': "Ah, you're a lucky one.\\nI'm in somewhat-good spirits now.\\pI will restore one of your POKéMON\\nto full health.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.BestOfLuckFarewell	{'body': 'The best of luck to you.\\nFarewell.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.CareForBattleWillRestoreMons	{'body': "Excuse me…\\pWould you care for a battle?\\nI'll restore your POKéMON if you win.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.NowShallWe	{'body': 'Very well…\\nNow, shall we?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.HowUnsportingOfYou	{'body': 'I see…\\nHow unsporting of you…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.WillRestoreMonsAsPromised	{'body': 'Magnificent…\\pAs promised, I shall restore your\\nPOKéMON to full health.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.BestOfLuckFarewell2	{'body': 'The best of luck to you.\\nFarewell.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.WatchOut	{'body': 'Oh, my!\\pWatch out!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.KirliaStop	{'body': 'Now, now!\\nKIRLIA, stop that!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.DusclopsStop	{'body': 'Now, now!\\nDUSCLOPS, stop that!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.KirliaUsedToxic	{'body': 'KIRLIA used TOXIC!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.KirliaUsedHypnosis	{'body': 'KIRLIA used HYPNOSIS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.KirliaUsedThunderWave	{'body': 'KIRLIA used THUNDER WAVE!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.KirliaUsedWillOWisp	{'body': 'KIRLIA used WILL-O-WISP!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.DusclopsUsedWillOWisp	{'body': 'DUSCLOPS used WILL-O-WISP!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.DusclopsUsedIceBeam	{'body': 'DUSCLOPS used ICE BEAM!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ThatsEnough	{'body': "Look here!\\nThat's quite enough!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ApologizeForKirlia	{'body': 'I must apologize to you…\\pMy KIRLIA has a TIMID nature…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ApologizeForDusclops	{'body': 'I must apologize to you…\\pMy DUSCLOPS has a TIMID nature…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.AttacksWhenStartled	{'body': 'It attacks without warning if it is\\nstartled by another person…\\pAre you and your POKéMON all right?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ApologizeHopeMonsAreFine	{'body': 'I do apologize for what happened…\\nI do hope your POKéMON are fine.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.Silence	{'body': '… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.BattleSomewhatToughTrainer	{'body': 'Welcome…\\pHere, we will have you battle\\na somewhat-tough TRAINER…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.RestoreToFullHealth	{'body': 'How wonderful…\\pTo honor your victory, your POKéMON\\nshall be restored to full health…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.EnjoyRestOfChallenge2	{'body': 'I urge you to enjoy the rest of your\\nBattle Choice challenge…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ImThePikeQueen	{'body': "I am LUCY…\\nI am the law here…\\lFor I am the PIKE QUEEN…\\pYou already know it, but to advance,\\nyou must defeat me…\\p…I'm not one for idle chatter.\\nHurry. Come on…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.HopeYouDidntUseUpLuck	{'body': "Your luck…\\nI hope you didn't use it all up here…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.LucyShowMeFrontierPass	{'body': 'LUCY: … … … … … …\\nShow me your FRONTIER PASS…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ReceivedLuckSymbol	{'body': 'The Luck Symbol was embossed on\\nthe FRONTIER PASS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.AllThereIsDisappear	{'body': "…That's all there is…\\nDisappear already…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.LucyYouAgain	{'body': "LUCY: …You again…\\p… … … … … …\\p…I've trampled flowers and braved\\nstorms to get to where I am…\\pI don't feel any compulsion to keep\\nlosing to the same opponent…\\p… … … … … …\\nFine… I'll do it…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.NowComeOn	{'body': 'Now!\\nCome on!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.LucyFrontierPass	{'body': 'LUCY: … … … … … …\\p…FRONTIER PASS…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.LuckSymbolTookGoldenShine	{'body': 'The Luck Symbol took on\\na golden shine!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.IWontForget	{'body': "…You, I won't forget…\\n…Ever…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ChoseRoomNoHeal	{'body': "I welcome you…\\pGiggle…\\nYou seem to be bereft of luck…\\pIf only you hadn't chosen this room,\\nyour POKéMON could have been healed…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ChoseRoomHealOne	{'body': 'I welcome you…\\pSince you have chosen this room, I will\\nrestore one POKéMON to full health…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ChoseRoomHealTwo	{'body': 'I welcome you…\\pSince you have chosen this room, I will\\nrestore two POKéMON to full health…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.WillRestoreAllMons	{'body': 'I welcome you…\\pGiggle…\\nYou should thank your lucky stars…\\pSince you have chosen this room,\\nall your POKéMON will be restored…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.ShallFetchOurMaster	{'body': 'I shall go fetch our master…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeRoomNormal.WillRestoreTwoMons	{'body': "Ah, you're a lucky one!\\nI'm in good spirits now.\\pI will restore two of your POKéMON\\nto full health!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.CurrentlyInRoom1	{'body': 'You are currently in\\nthe 1st room…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.CurrentlyInRoom3	{'body': 'You are currently in\\nthe 3rd room…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.CurrentlyInRoom5	{'body': 'You are currently in\\nthe 5th room…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.CurrentlyInRoom7	{'body': 'You are currently in\\nthe 7th room…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.CurrentlyInRoom9	{'body': 'You are currently in\\nthe 9th room…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.CurrentlyInRoom11	{'body': 'You are currently in\\nthe 11th room…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.CurrentlyInRoom13	{'body': 'You are currently in\\nthe 13th room…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.ContinueWithChallenge	{'body': 'Will you continue with\\nyour challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.SaveChallengeAndQuit	{'body': 'Would you like to save your challenge\\nand quit the game for now?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.RetireFromChallenge	{'body': 'Do you wish to retire from your\\nBattle Choice challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.AwaitingReturnSaveBeforeResume	{'body': "We've been awaiting your return…\\pBefore resuming your Battle Choice\\nchallenge, let me save the game…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.PleaseEnjoyChallenge	{'body': 'Please do enjoy your Battle Choice\\nchallenge…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.SavingYourData	{'body': 'I am saving your data…\\nA little time, please…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePike_PathBlockedNoTurningBack	{'body': 'The path is blocked!\\nAnd there is no turning back…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.FindingItDifficultToChoose	{'body': 'I beg your pardon, but…\\pAre you perhaps finding it difficult\\nto choose your path?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.ApologizeForImpertinence	{'body': 'I see…\\nI apologize for my impertinence…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.SomethingAboutRightPath	{'body': 'Ah, let me see… There is something\\nabout the path on the right…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.SomethingAboutCenterPath	{'body': 'Ah, let me see… There is something\\nabout the path in the center…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.SomethingAboutLeftPath	{'body': 'Ah, let me see… There is something\\nabout the path on the left…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.AromaOfPokemon	{'body': 'It seems to have the distinct aroma\\nof POKéMON wafting around it…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.PresenceOfPeople	{'body': 'Is it… A TRAINER?\\nI sense the presence of people…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.HeardWhispering	{'body': 'I seem to have heard something…\\nIt may have been whispering…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.WaveOfNostaliga	{'body': 'For some odd reason, I felt a wave\\nof nostalgia coming from it…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.TerrifyingEvent	{'body': 'I am sorry to say…\\pA terrifying event, yes, a horrible one,\\nis about to befall you…\\pI urge you to pay the utmost care\\nand prepare for the worst…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom.DreadfulPresence	{'body': 'From every path I sense a dreadful\\npresence…$'}
text:BattleFacility_TrainerBattle_PlaceholderText	{'body': 'This is a sample message.$'}
text:gBattlePyramidConfirmRest	{'body': 'Your BATTLE PYRAMID quest will be\\nsaved so that you may quit for now.\\lIs that okay?$'}
text:gBattlePyramidConfirmRetire	{'body': 'Are you sure you want to quit your\\nPYRAMID quest?$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintUp1	{'body': "This floor's exit is in\\nthat direction: {UP_ARROW}$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintLeft1	{'body': "This floor's exit is in\\nthat direction: {LEFT_ARROW}$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintRight1	{'body': "This floor's exit is in\\nthat direction: {RIGHT_ARROW}$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintDown1	{'body': "This floor's exit is in\\nthat direction: {DOWN_ARROW}$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintUp2	{'body': 'The exit on this floor is in\\nthe {UP_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintLeft2	{'body': 'The exit on this floor is in\\nthe {LEFT_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintRight2	{'body': 'The exit on this floor is in\\nthe {RIGHT_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintDown2	{'body': 'The exit on this floor is in\\nthe {DOWN_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintUp3	{'body': 'The exit is over\\nthat {UP_ARROW} way.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintLeft3	{'body': 'The exit is over\\nthat {LEFT_ARROW} way.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintRight3	{'body': 'The exit is over\\nthat {RIGHT_ARROW} way.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintDown3	{'body': 'The exit is over\\nthat {DOWN_ARROW} way.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintUp4	{'body': 'On this floor, the exit is somewhere\\nin the {UP_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintLeft4	{'body': 'On this floor, the exit is somewhere\\nin the {LEFT_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintRight4	{'body': 'On this floor, the exit is somewhere\\nin the {RIGHT_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintDown4	{'body': 'On this floor, the exit is somewhere\\nin the {DOWN_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintUp5	{'body': "The exit?\\nIt's that {UP_ARROW} way.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintLeft5	{'body': "The exit?\\nIt's that {LEFT_ARROW} way.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintRight5	{'body': "The exit?\\nIt's that {RIGHT_ARROW} way.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintDown5	{'body': "The exit?\\nIt's that {DOWN_ARROW} way.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintUp6	{'body': 'The exit happens to be in\\nthe {UP_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintLeft6	{'body': 'The exit happens to be in\\nthe {LEFT_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintRight6	{'body': 'The exit happens to be in\\nthe {RIGHT_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ExitHintDown6	{'body': 'The exit happens to be in\\nthe {DOWN_ARROW} direction.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_EightItemsRemaining1	{'body': 'Are you looking for items?\\pThere are eight items left to\\nbe found.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenItemsRemaining1	{'body': 'Are you looking for items?\\pThere are seven items left to\\nbe found.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SixItemsRemaining1	{'body': 'Are you looking for items?\\pThere are six items left to\\nbe found.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveItemsRemaining1	{'body': 'Are you looking for items?\\pThere are five items left to\\nbe found.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FourItemsRemaining1	{'body': 'Are you looking for items?\\pThere are four items left to\\nbe found.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeItemsRemaining1	{'body': 'Are you looking for items?\\pThere are three items left to\\nbe found.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoItemsRemaining1	{'body': 'Are you looking for items?\\pThere are two items left to\\nbe found.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_OneItemRemaining1	{'body': 'Are you looking for items?\\pThere is one item left to\\nbe found.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroItemsRemaining1	{'body': "Are you looking for items?\\pThere isn't anything left to\\nbe found!$"}
text:BattlePyramid_EightItemsRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere are eight items\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenItemsRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere are seven items left\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SixItemsRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere are six items left\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveItemsRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere are five items left\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_FourItemsRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere are four items left\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeItemsRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere are three items left\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoItemsRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere are two items left\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_OneItemRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere is just one item\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroItemsRemaining2	{'body': "Because you won, I'll tell you\\na little secret!\\pThere isn't anything left\\nlying around here.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_EightItemsRemaining3	{'body': "How's your stock of items holding up?\\pI reckon there are eight items left\\nwaiting to be found on this floor.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenItemsRemaining3	{'body': "How's your stock of items holding up?\\pI reckon there are seven items left\\nwaiting to be found on this floor.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SixItemsRemaining3	{'body': "How's your stock of items holding up?\\pI reckon there are six items left\\nwaiting to be found on this floor.$"}
