text:BattlePyramid_FourItemsRemaining3	{'body': "How's your stock of items holding up?\\pI reckon there are four items left\\nwaiting to be found on this floor.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeItemsRemaining3	{'body': "How's your stock of items holding up?\\pI reckon there are three items left\\nwaiting to be found on this floor.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoItemsRemaining3	{'body': "How's your stock of items holding up?\\pI reckon there are two items left\\nwaiting to be found on this floor.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_OneItemRemaining3	{'body': "How's your stock of items holding up?\\pI reckon there's but one item left\\nwaiting to be found on this floor.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroItemsRemaining3	{'body': "How's your stock of items holding up?\\pI reckon there are no more items\\nwaiting to be found on this floor.\\lYou take care now!$"}
text:BattlePyramid_EightItemsRemaining4	{'body': "You're strong, so you've earned\\na hint!\\pThere appear to be eight more\\nitems on the ground.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenItemsRemaining4	{'body': "You're strong, so you've earned\\na hint!\\pThere appear to be seven more\\nitems on the ground.$"}
