text:BattlePyramid_FiveItemsRemaining4	{'body': "You're strong, so you've earned\\na hint!\\pThere appear to be five more\\nitems on the ground.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_FourItemsRemaining4	{'body': "You're strong, so you've earned\\na hint!\\pThere appear to be four more\\nitems on the ground.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeItemsRemaining4	{'body': "You're strong, so you've earned\\na hint!\\pThere appear to be three more\\nitems on the ground.$"}
