text:BattlePyramid_ZeroItemsRemaining4	{'body': "You're strong, so you've earned\\na hint!\\pThere appear to be no more\\nitems on the ground.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_EightItemsRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there are eight items…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenItemsRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there are seven items…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SixItemsRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there are six items…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveItemsRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there are five items…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FourItemsRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there are four items…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeItemsRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there are three items…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoItemsRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there are two items…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_OneItemRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there is one item…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroItemsRemaining5	{'body': 'On this floor of the PYRAMID,\\nI hear there are no items…$'}
text:BattlePyramid_EightItemsRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there are eight more\\nitems on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenItemsRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there are seven more\\nitems on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SixItemsRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there are six more\\nitems on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveItemsRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there are five more\\nitems on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FourItemsRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there are four more\\nitems on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeItemsRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there are three more\\nitems on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoItemsRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there are two more\\nitems on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_OneItemRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there is one more\\nitem on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroItemsRemaining6	{'body': 'Have you collected any items?\\pI believe there are no more\\nitems on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenTrainersRemaining1	{'body': 'You were really awesome!\\pBut there are still seven tough\\nTRAINERS other than me!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SixTrainersRemaining1	{'body': 'You were really awesome!\\pBut there are still six tough\\nTRAINERS other than me!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveTrainersRemaining1	{'body': 'You were really awesome!\\pBut there are still five tough\\nTRAINERS other than me!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FourTrainersRemaining1	{'body': 'You were really awesome!\\pBut there are still four tough\\nTRAINERS other than me!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeTrainersRemaining1	{'body': 'You were really awesome!\\pBut there are still three tough\\nTRAINERS other than me!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoTrainersRemaining1	{'body': 'You were really awesome!\\pBut there are still two tough\\nTRAINERS other than me!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_OneTrainersRemaining1	{'body': "You were really awesome!\\pBut there's still one tough\\nTRAINER other than me!$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroTrainersRemaining1	{'body': "You were really awesome!\\pThere's no one left that\\ncan beat you!$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenTrainersRemaining2	{'body': 'This is so upsetting!\\pBut there are seven TRAINERS left!\\nSomeone will humble you!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SixTrainersRemaining2	{'body': 'This is so upsetting!\\pBut there are six TRAINERS left!\\nSomeone will humble you!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveTrainersRemaining2	{'body': 'This is so upsetting!\\pBut there are five TRAINERS left!\\nSomeone will humble you!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FourTrainersRemaining2	{'body': 'This is so upsetting!\\pBut there are four TRAINERS left!\\nSomeone will humble you!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeTrainersRemaining2	{'body': 'This is so upsetting!\\pBut there are three TRAINERS left!\\nSomeone will humble you!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoTrainersRemaining2	{'body': 'This is so upsetting!\\pBut there are two TRAINERS left!\\nSomeone will humble you!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_OneTrainersRemaining2	{'body': "This is so upsetting!\\pBut there's one TRAINER left!\\nI'm sure you will be humbled!$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroTrainersRemaining2	{'body': 'This is so upsetting!\\pBut there are no more TRAINERS\\nwho can engage you!$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenTrainersRemaining3	{'body': "That's pretty impressive!\\pBut there are seven more TRAINERS\\non this floor. Can you beat them all?$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SixTrainersRemaining3	{'body': "That's pretty impressive!\\pBut there are six more TRAINERS\\non this floor. Can you beat them all?$"}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveTrainersRemaining3	{'body': "That's pretty impressive!\\pBut there are five more TRAINERS\\non this floor. Can you beat them all?$"}
text:BattlePyramid_FourTrainersRemaining3	{'body': "That's pretty impressive!\\pBut there are four more TRAINERS\\non this floor. Can you beat them all?$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeTrainersRemaining3	{'body': "That's pretty impressive!\\pBut there are three more TRAINERS\\non this floor. Can you beat them all?$"}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoTrainersRemaining3	{'body': "That's pretty impressive!\\pBut there are two more TRAINERS\\non this floor. Can you beat them both?$"}
text:BattlePyramid_OneTrainersRemaining3	{'body': "That's pretty impressive!\\pBut there's still one more TRAINER\\non this floor. Can you prevail?$"}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroTrainersRemaining3	{'body': "That's pretty impressive!\\pYou've gone through all the TRAINERS\\non this floor.$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenTrainersRemaining4	{'body': 'Maybe you could sweep through\\nthe seven TRAINERS left on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SixTrainersRemaining4	{'body': 'Maybe you could sweep through\\nthe six TRAINERS left on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveTrainersRemaining4	{'body': 'Maybe you could sweep through\\nthe five TRAINERS left on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FourTrainersRemaining4	{'body': 'Maybe you could sweep through\\nthe four TRAINERS left on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeTrainersRemaining4	{'body': 'Maybe you could sweep through\\nthe three TRAINERS left on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoTrainersRemaining4	{'body': 'Maybe you could sweep through\\nthe two TRAINERS left on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_OneTrainersRemaining4	{'body': 'Maybe you could complete your sweep\\nwith the one TRAINER left on this floor.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroTrainersRemaining4	{'body': "There isn't a single person left who\\ncan defeat you now…$"}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenTrainersRemaining5	{'body': 'You may have what it takes to beat\\nthe seven expert TRAINERS who remain.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SixTrainersRemaining5	{'body': 'You may have what it takes to beat\\nthe six expert TRAINERS who remain.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveTrainersRemaining5	{'body': 'You may have what it takes to beat\\nthe five expert TRAINERS who remain.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FourTrainersRemaining5	{'body': 'You may have what it takes to beat\\nthe four expert TRAINERS who remain.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeTrainersRemaining5	{'body': 'You may have what it takes to beat\\nthe three expert TRAINERS who remain.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoTrainersRemaining5	{'body': 'You may have what it takes to beat\\nthe two expert TRAINERS who remain.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_OneTrainersRemaining5	{'body': 'You may have what it takes to beat\\nthe one expert TRAINER who remains.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroTrainersRemaining5	{'body': 'Your skills are beyond reproach.\\pThere are no more TRAINERS here\\nwho have any chance of beating you.$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SevenTrainersRemaining6	{'body': 'Can you keep winning against\\nthe seven remaining TRAINERS?$'}
text:BattlePyramid_SixTrainersRemaining6	{'body': 'Can you keep winning against\\nthe six remaining TRAINERS?$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FiveTrainersRemaining6	{'body': 'Can you keep winning against\\nthe five remaining TRAINERS?$'}
text:BattlePyramid_FourTrainersRemaining6	{'body': 'Can you keep winning against\\nthe four remaining TRAINERS?$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ThreeTrainersRemaining6	{'body': 'Can you keep winning against\\nthe three remaining TRAINERS?$'}
text:BattlePyramid_TwoTrainersRemaining6	{'body': 'Can you keep winning against\\nthe two remaining TRAINERS?$'}
text:BattlePyramid_OneTrainersRemaining6	{'body': 'Can you keep winning against\\nthe last remaining TRAINER?$'}
text:BattlePyramid_ZeroTrainersRemaining6	{'body': "There aren't any TRAINERS left that\\ncan take you on now…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.WelcomeToBattlePyramid	{'body': 'Where the courage of TRAINERS\\nis put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE PYRAMID!\\pI am your guide to\\nthe Battle Quest.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.EmbarkOnChallenge	{'body': 'Have you the courage to embark on\\nthe Battle Quest challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.AwaitFutureChallenge	{'body': 'We await your challenge in the future!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ExplainBattlePyramid	{'body': "The Battle Quest is a battling\\nevent in which you must explore\\lthe PYRAMID and try to reach the top.\\pIn the PYRAMID are seven floors of\\nmazes, all of them filled with not only\\lskilled TRAINERS but also wild POKéMON.\\pYou must enter with three POKéMON,\\nnone of them holding an item.\\pOn your ascent, you will be provided\\nwith a BATTLE BAG for items.\\pIf you fail in your challenge, any item\\nplaced in the BATTLE BAG disappears.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, you must select “REST”\\land save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.WhichLevelMode	{'body': 'The PYRAMID offers two courses,\\nLevel 50 and Open Level.\\lWhich will you enter?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.SelectThreeMons	{'body': 'Very good. Now, please select the three\\nPOKéMON you wish to accompany you.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen	{'body': 'A slight problem, adventurer!\\pYou seem to not have the three\\nPOKéMON qualified for the challenge.\\pPlease also remember to take all\\nitems from your POKéMON.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50	{'body': 'A slight problem, adventurer!\\pYou seem to not have the three\\nPOKéMON qualified for the challenge.\\pThe three POKéMON must be different\\nand each no higher than Level 50.\\pPlease also remember to take all\\nitems from your POKéMON.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsEnd	{'body': 'When you are ready, please have\\na word with me.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.OkayToSaveBeforeChallenge	{'body': 'Before you enter the BATTLE PYRAMID,\\nthe game must be saved. Is that okay?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ShowYouIntoPyramid	{'body': 'Very good. I will now show you into\\nthe BATTLE PYRAMID.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.WeWillHoldBagForSafekeeping	{'body': 'We will hold your BAG for safekeeping,\\n{PLAYER}, while you are exploring.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.PleaseTakePreviousBattleBag	{'body': 'In exchange, please take this BATTLE\\nBAG, the one you used previously.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.PleaseTakeThisBattleBag	{'body': 'In exchange, please take this\\nBATTLE BAG.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ExchangedBagForBattleBag	{'body': '{PLAYER} exchanged the BAG for\\nthe BATTLE BAG.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.StepOnFloorPanel	{'body': 'When you step on this floor panel,\\nyou will be transported to a higher\\lfloor in the PYRAMID.\\pI hope for your sake that your\\nquest goes safely!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.DidntSaveBeforeQuittingTakeBag	{'body': "A major problem, explorer!\\pYou did not save before ending\\nyour challenge the last time.\\pConsequently, your challenge has\\nbeen disqualified, I'm sorry to say.\\pHere is the BAG we've been holding\\nfor you.\\p{PLAYER} got the BAG back.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.YouveConqueredPyramid	{'body': "Excellent to see you back!\\pYou've conquered the PYRAMID!\\nHow splendid!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.MonHoldingItemCannotTake	{'body': "Ah, a slight problem.\\pAt least one POKéMON is holding\\nan item.\\pI'm sorry to say, items obtained in\\nthe PYRAMID cannot be taken away.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HeldItemsMovedToBag	{'body': 'All items held by your POKéMON will be\\nmoved to your BATTLE BAG, {PLAYER}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.BagCannotHoldPickItemsToKeep	{'body': "The BATTLE BAG cannot hold all your\\nitems, I'm sorry to say.\\pPlease pick the items you'll keep in the\\nBATTLE BAG, and with your POKéMON.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.LeastOneMonHoldingItem	{'body': 'At least one POKéMON is still\\nholding an item.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.PickItemsToKeep	{'body': "Please pick the items you'll keep in the\\nBATTLE BAG, and with your POKéMON.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ReturnedEverythingMonsHeld	{'body': '{PLAYER} returned everything that\\nthe POKéMON held.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.UsedBattleBagWillBeKept	{'body': "The BATTLE BAG you used will be kept\\nin readiness for your next challenge.\\p{PLAYER} turned the BATTLE BAG over\\nfor the BAG's return.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.RecordResultsWait	{'body': 'I must record your results.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ForConqueringPyramidTakeThis	{'body': 'As a memento for conquering\\nthe BATTLE PYRAMID, please take this.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ReceivedPrizeItem	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the prize\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.BagIsFull	{'body': "…Ah…\\nYour BAG appears to be filled.\\pPlease return after you've organized\\nyour BAG's contents.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.DisappointingHereIsBag	{'body': "How disappointing for you…\\pHere is the BAG we've been holding\\nfor you.\\p{PLAYER} got the BAG back.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.LookForwardToNextChallenge	{'body': 'We look forward to your\\nnext challenge!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HereIsPrize	{'body': 'We have been looking forward to\\nyour arrival!\\pHere is your prize for conquering\\nthe PYRAMID.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.TellYouWhatMisfortunesAwait	{'body': 'Welcome…\\pI shall be pleased to tell you what\\nmisfortunes await in the PYRAMID…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.Aah	{'body': '… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\p… … … … … …\\nAah!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintParalysis	{'body': 'I see a shower of sparks…\\p…And in it, I see your POKéMON\\nstruggling with paralysis…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintPoison	{'body': 'I see poison…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom the effects of poison…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintBurn	{'body': 'I see bright red flames…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom burns…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintPPWaste	{'body': 'I sense the tremendous pressure of\\nunrequited anger…\\pIt is a curse…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON drained of\\nPower Points and having no recourse\\lbut to use STRUGGLE…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintLevitate	{'body': 'I see POKéMON loftily airborne…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON frustrated\\nby powerless GROUND-type moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintTrapAbility	{'body': "I sense terrific energy rising from\\nthe ground below…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON unable to\\nescape the power's clutches…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintIce	{'body': 'I see ICE-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON fighting\\nthe freezing effects of ice…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintExplosion	{'body': 'I see a flurry of moves that imperil\\nthe user…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON falling\\nto them…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintPsychic	{'body': 'I see PSYCHIC-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON in torment\\nfrom PSYCHIC moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintRock	{'body': 'I see ROCK-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom ROCK moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintFighting	{'body': 'I see FIGHTING-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON pummeled\\nby FIGHTING moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintWeather	{'body': 'RAIN DANCE… SUNNY DAY…\\nSANDSTORM… HAIL…\\pI see POKéMON that become stronger\\nwith the weather…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON confounded\\nby different types of moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintBug	{'body': 'I see BUG-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom different kinds of attacks…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintDark	{'body': 'I see DARK-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom DARK-type moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintWater	{'body': 'I see WATER-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom WATER-type moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintGhost	{'body': 'I see GHOST-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom GHOST-type moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintSteel	{'body': 'I see STEEL-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom enormously powerful moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintFlyingDragon	{'body': 'I see flying POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom enormously powerful moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintStoneEvolve	{'body': 'I see those that have evolved from\\nthe power of stones…\\pI also sense fire, water,\\nand electricity…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom those three powers…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.HintNormal	{'body': 'I see NORMAL-type POKéMON…\\p…And, I see your POKéMON suffering\\nfrom enormously powerful moves…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.BelieveMyFortunesOrNot	{'body': 'Whether you believe my fortunes\\nor not, the choice is yours…\\pThe future can be changed anytime…\\nI wish you safe passage…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.TrainersNoticeRunning	{'body': 'The old PYRAMID was a maze. Now I\\nstudy the CIRCUIT here.\\pIts opponents can punish a\\ncareless switch just as quickly as\\la careless attack.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.LostLotOfItems	{'body': 'I used to worry about losing items\\nin the old PYRAMID.\\pThe CIRCUIT restores my team and\\nheld items after each match. I can\\lfocus on the battle.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.YouveDefeatedPyramidKing	{'body': "Welcome back!\\nYou've done the unthinkable!\\pYou've defeated the PYRAMID KING\\nand conquered the BATTLE PYRAMID!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.GiveYouTheseBattlePoints	{'body': 'Young explorer!\\nIn commendation of your courage,\\lwe give you these Battle Point(s)!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.RulesAreListed	{'body': 'The Battle Quest rules are listed.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ExplainMonRules	{'body': 'When the PYRAMID is conquered,\\nthe wild POKéMON that appear in it\\lare replaced by different kinds.\\pExplore, observe, and learn what kinds\\nof wild POKéMON you may encounter.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ExplainTrainerRules	{'body': 'TRAINERS are lying in wait for you\\ninside the PYRAMID.\\pOn each floor, there are up to\\neight TRAINERS.\\pWhen you defeat a TRAINER, you will\\nget a helpful hint for your adventure.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ExplainMazeRules	{'body': 'The mazes in the PYRAMID rearrange\\nthemselves every time you enter it.\\pThe mazes are poorly lit.\\nYou must advance with caution.\\pThe light grows brighter whenever you\\ndefeat a wild POKéMON or a TRAINER.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.ExplainBagRules	{'body': 'The BATTLE BAG serves as your BAG\\nwhile in the PYRAMID.\\pThere are two separate BATTLE BAGS--\\none each for the Level 50 and\\lOpen Level adventures.\\pThey each can hold up to 99 pieces\\nof ten kinds of items.\\pThe contents of the BATTLE BAG are\\nlost if you fail in your quest.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby.CircuitObserver	{'body': "I once read the PYRAMID's omens.\\pThe CIRCUIT asks a different\\nquestion: how will your team\\lanswer the board before it?\\pA prediction helps. A sound\\nfallback helps even more.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.ReachedSummitUpYouGo	{'body': "It is a delight to see you here!\\nYou have reached the summit of\\lthe BATTLE PYRAMID!\\pAbove here is the PYRAMID's\\nlookout point.\\pIt is a place open only to those\\nwho have conquered the PYRAMID.\\pNow, please!\\nUp you go!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.PlayerConqueredPyramid	{'body': "The PYRAMID's new conqueror!\\nLet the name {PLAYER} be known!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.ChiefBeatYouHere	{'body': 'It is a delight to see you here!\\pUnfortunately, you were second by\\na mere fraction of time!\\pOur chief has already conquered\\nthe PYRAMID ahead of you.\\pHowever, my young explorer…\\nYou are a TRAINER!\\pAssert your power and take the glory\\nof the pinnacle from our chief!\\pNow, please! When you are ready,\\ntake one more step of courage!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.ExplorationsAreGrandestAdventure	{'body': "Young adventurer…\\pWouldn't you agree that explorations\\nare the grandest of adventures?\\pYour own wits!\\pYour own strength!\\pYour own POKéMON!\\pAnd, above all, only your own courage\\nto lead you through unknown worlds…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.ImPyramidKingBrandon	{'body': "Aah, yes, indeed this life is grand!\\nGrand, it is! Eh?\\pI'm BRANDON!\\pI'm the PYRAMID KING, which means\\nI'm in charge here.\\pMost people call me the chief!\\pYou coming here means you have\\nthat much confidence in yourself,\\lam I right?\\pHahahah!\\nThis should be exciting!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.BringCourageToOurBattle	{'body': 'Now, then!\\nBring your courage to our battle!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.BrandonFrontierPassPlease	{'body': "BRANDON: Hahahah! Grand it was!\\nGrand, yes, indeed!\\pWell done! You've earned recognition!\\nYour FRONTIER PASS, please!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.ReceivedBraveSymbol	{'body': 'The Brave Symbol was embossed on\\nthe FRONTIER PASS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.LookForwardToNextMeeting	{'body': 'Young explorer!\\nI look forward to our next meeting!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.BrandonYouveReturned	{'body': "BRANDON: …You've finally returned,\\nyoung explorer…\\pYour love of adventure seems to come\\ndeep from within your heart…\\pYes… You are exactly as I was in\\nmy own youth…\\p… … …Ah…\\pThe passionate!\\pThe dangerous!\\pThe desperate!\\pThose days of death-defying,\\nlife-affirming adventures are back…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.MyCourageIsOffMeter	{'body': 'Now, then!\\pI sense my own courage is off\\nthe meter!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.EverythingYouHave	{'body': "Everything you have!\\nI'm braced for it all!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.BrandonRemarkableHaveThis	{'body': "BRANDON: Hahahah!\\nRemarkable!\\lYes, it's grand, indeed!\\pYoung explorer!\\pYou've bested me through and through!\\nHere! I want you to have this!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.BraveSymbolTookGoldenShine	{'body': 'The Brave Symbol took on\\na golden shine!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.FarewellForNow	{'body': 'Ah, yes! It just goes to show that\\nI have much to learn still!\\pMay our paths cross again!\\nFarewell for now, young explorer!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidTop.StepForwardWhenReady	{'body': 'Now, when you are ready, take courage\\nand step forward.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.CircuitRoomWelcome	{'body': 'The CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT is ready.\\nEach victory brings a new opponent.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.RestoreMonsToFullHealth	{'body': 'We will restore your POKéMON to\\nfull health.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReadyForOpponent	{'body': 'You will face opponent\\nno. {STR_VAR_1}.\\pAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReadyFor2ndOpponent	{'body': 'You will be facing opponent no. 2.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReadyFor3rdOpponent	{'body': 'You will be facing opponent no. 3.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReadyFor4thOpponent	{'body': 'You will be facing opponent no. 4.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReadyFor5thOpponent	{'body': 'You will be facing opponent no. 5.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReadyFor6thOpponent	{'body': 'You will be facing opponent no. 6.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReadyFor7thOpponent	{'body': 'You will be facing opponent no. 7.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.RecordYourBattle	{'body': 'Record your battle on your\\nFRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_BattleRecordedOnPass	{'body': "{PLAYER}'s battle was recorded\\non the FRONTIER PASS.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.SaveAndQuitGame	{'body': 'Would you like to save and\\nquit the game?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.SavingPleaseWait	{'body': 'Saving your battle data.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.CancelYourChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to cancel your BATTLE\\nROOM challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.RecordCouldntBeSaved	{'body': 'There was an error of some sort.\\nYour record could not be saved.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.SalonMaidenOnHerWay	{'body': 'Excuse me, but…\\pOur leader, the SALON MAIDEN, is on\\nher way here in hopes of battling you.\\pShe should be arriving very shortly.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReadyForSalonMaiden	{'body': 'You will be facing the SALON MAIDEN.\\nAre you prepared?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.GreetingsImAnabel	{'body': "Greetings…\\nMy name is ANABEL.\\pI am the SALON MAIDEN, and I am in\\ncharge of running the BATTLE TOWER…\\pI have heard several rumors\\nabout you…\\pIn all honesty, what I have heard does\\nnot seem attractive in any way…\\pThe reason I've come to see you…\\nWell, there is but one reason…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.LetMeSeeYourTalent	{'body': 'Let me see your talent in\\nits entirety…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.AnabelTalentShallBeRecognized	{'body': 'ANABEL: Fufufu, nicely done…\\pYour FRONTIER PASS, please…\\nYour talent shall be recognized.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.ReceivedAbilitySymbol	{'body': 'The Ability Symbol was embossed on\\nthe FRONTIER PASS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.UntilNextTime	{'body': "… … … … … …\\pYou have confidence in your POKéMON\\nbattling talent, don't you?\\pI urge you to keep battling and\\nkeep on winning.\\pI will be waiting for you.\\nUntil the next time we meet…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.AnabelYouCameBack	{'body': "ANABEL: You really did come back to\\nsee me…\\p… … … … … …\\pYou've won straight matches to see me…\\nI won't have to hold back against you…\\pIt's been too long now…\\pToo long since I've been able to battle\\nwithout thinking about anything…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.LetsBeginShallWe	{'body': "Let's begin, shall we?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.AnabelCongratsYourPassPlease	{'body': 'ANABEL: Fufu, congratulations…\\nYour FRONTIER PASS, please…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.AbilitySymbolTookGoldenShine	{'body': 'The Ability Symbol took on\\na golden shine!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.WishICouldBattleYouAgain	{'body': 'That was fun…\\pI have never had a POKéMON battle\\nso enjoyable before…\\pI wish I could battle with you again…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom.CircuitBattlePoints	{'body': 'You earned {STR_VAR_3} Battle Points!\\pSpend them at the Exchange Service\\nCorner whenever you like.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitWelcome	{'body': 'Welcome to the CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT!\\pEvery match is a full-team Double\\nBattle with a competitive\\lopponent.\\pYour team battles at Lv. 100.\\nOpponents grow stronger as your\\lrun continues, up to Lv. 255.\\pEvery Frontier desk registers you\\nfor the central Tower arena.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitWelcomeBack	{'body': 'Welcome back to the CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT.\\nAre your six Pokémon ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitEnter	{'body': 'Your team battles at Lv. 100. Held items\\nand HP return after every match.\\pYour difficulty sets the starting\\nopponent levels. Begin a new run?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitOpponent	{'body': 'Match {STR_VAR_2}: your opponent has\\nprepared {STR_VAR_1}.\\pTheir lead is Lv. {STR_VAR_3}.\\nThe next battle begins now!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitWon	{'body': 'Victory! Your team has been fully\\nrestored. Continue the run?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitRewardParty	{'body': 'Circuit milestone reached!\\p{STR_VAR_1} joined your party.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitRewardPC	{'body': 'Circuit milestone reached!\\p{STR_VAR_1} was sent to the PC.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitRewardNoRoom	{'body': 'A Circuit reward is waiting, but\\nboth your party and PC are full.\\pMake room, then speak to this\\ndesk again.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitLocked	{'body': "The CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT welcomes\\nchallengers with the FEATHER\\lBADGE.\\pReturn when you've earned it!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitNeedsParty	{'body': 'The Circuit requires six healthy\\nPokémon and no Eggs.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitCancel	{'body': 'Prepare any six you like. The Circuit\\nwill be waiting.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitLost	{'body': 'Your streak ends at {STR_VAR_2} wins.\\pYour original\\nteam and levels have been restored.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitRetire	{'body': 'Your streak ends at {STR_VAR_2} wins.\\pYour original team and levels have\\nbeen restored.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitGenerationFailed	{'body': 'The next opponent could not be\\nprepared. Your team was restored.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.DirectYouToBattleRoom	{'body': "I'll direct you to your BATTLE ROOM now.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.DidntSaveBeforeQuitting	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou didn't save before you quit your\\nchallenge last time.\\pBecause of that, your challenge so far\\nhas been disqualified. Sorry!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CongratsBeatenSeven	{'body': "Congratulations!\\nYou've beaten all seven TRAINERS!\\p$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.EarnedFabulousPrize	{'body': 'For beating seven TRAINERS in a row,\\nyou have earned this fabulous prize!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ReceivedPrize	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the prize\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.BagFullMakeRoom	{'body': 'Oh, your BAG appears to be full.\\pPlease make room in your BAG, then come\\nsee me.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ThankYouForPlaying	{'body': 'Thank you for playing!\\p$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.RecordWillBeSaved	{'body': 'Your record will be saved.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.WeveBeenWaitingForYou	{'body': "We've been waiting for you!\\p$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ProgressWillBeSaved	{'body': 'Before entering a BATTLE ROOM, your\\nprogress will be saved. Please wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.AboutToFace50thTrainer	{'body': "You're finally about to face the\\n50th TRAINER.\\pFrom here on, every time you beat seven\\nTRAINERS in a row, your POKéMON will\\lreceive a commemorative RIBBON.\\pGood luck!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.HereAreSomeRibbons	{'body': 'Here are some RIBBONS for beating\\nseven tough TRAINERS in a row.\\p{PLAYER} received some RIBBONS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.PutRibbonOnMons	{'body': '{PLAYER} put the RIBBONS on\\nthe challenger POKéMON.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.DescribeFeelingsAboutBattleTower	{'body': "Excuse me, do you have a moment?\\pCan you describe your feelings when\\nyou're about to begin a BATTLE TOWER\\lmatch, or when you've either won or\\llost a match?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.FeelWhatWhenYouBegin	{'body': "Okay, what are your feelings when\\nyou're about to begin a match?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.FeelWhatWhenYouveWon	{'body': "What do you feel when you've won\\na match?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.FeelWhatWhenYouveLost	{'body': 'Can I hear about your feelings when\\nyou have lost a match?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.DontThinkMuchAboutIt	{'body': "Oh, so you don't think much about it?\\nYou're one cool customer.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ChangedYourMind	{'body': "Hunh? You changed your mind?\\nI guess you're fickle.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ThatsHowYouFeel	{'body': "Okay, so that's how you feel?\\nThat's quite original.\\pThanks!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.WinsInRowRecorded	{'body': "The number of matches you win in a row\\nis recorded.\\pI'd better not get beaten in\\nan embarrassing way!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CanLeaveUntilLossOrSevenWins	{'body': 'The CIRCUIT restores your team\\nafter each match.\\pYou may continue or leave then. A\\nstrong run deserves another\\lwell-prepared decision.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.DoubleBattleRoomConstruction	{'body': 'Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER\\nDOUBLE BATTLE CORNER!\\pUnfortunately, the BATTLE ROOMS\\nare still under construction.\\pPlease come back when the work\\nis completed.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.MultiBattleRoomConstruction	{'body': 'Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER\\nMULTI BATTLE CORNER!\\pUnfortunately, the BATTLE ROOMS\\nare still under construction.\\pPlease come back when the work\\nis completed.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.LookForwardToAnotherChallenge	{'body': 'We look forward to seeing you on\\nanother challenge!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.WhichLevelMode	{'body': 'The BATTLE ROOM offers two levels\\nof challenge, Level 50 and Open Level.\\lWhich is your choice?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.PleaseSelectMons	{'body': 'Please select the POKéMON you wish\\nto enter.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.OkayToSaveBeforeEntering	{'body': 'Before entering a BATTLE ROOM, your\\nprogress must be saved. Is that okay?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ShowYouToBattleRoom	{'body': 'I will now show you to the\\n{STR_VAR_1} BATTLE ROOM.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.RecordLastMatch	{'body': 'Shall I record your last BATTLE TOWER\\nmatch on your FRONTIER PASS?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50	{'body': 'Excuse me!\\pYou need {STR_VAR_2} eligible\\nPOKéMON.\\pBring {STR_VAR_2} different POKéMON\\nof Level 50 or less.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsEnd	{'body': 'Please come see me when you are ready.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen	{'body': 'Excuse me!\\pYou need {STR_VAR_2} eligible\\nPOKéMON.\\pBring {STR_VAR_2} different POKéMON\\nto enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50Singles	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou don't have three eligible POKéMON.\\pYou must have three different POKéMON\\nof Level 50 or less to enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpenSingles	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou don't have three eligible POKéMON.\\pYou must have three different POKéMON\\nto enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50Doubles	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou don't have four eligible POKéMON.\\pYou must have four different POKéMON\\nof Level 50 or less to enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpenDoubles	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou don't have four eligible POKéMON.\\pYou must have four different POKéMON\\nto enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLv50Multis	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou don't have two eligible POKéMON.\\pYou must have two different POKéMON\\nof Level 50 or less to enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpenMultis	{'body': "Excuse me!\\pYou don't have two eligible POKéMON.\\pYou must have two different POKéMON\\nto enter.\\pThey also must be holding different\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.WelcomSingleBattle	{'body': 'Where the talents of TRAINERS\\nare put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\\pI am your guide to the SINGLE\\nBATTLE ROOMS.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.TakeSinglesChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to take the SINGLE\\nBATTLE ROOM challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ExplainSinglesChallenge	{'body': "The BATTLE TOWER's SINGLE BATTLE\\nROOMS are facilities for conducting\\lSINGLE BATTLES with three POKéMON.\\pThere are many SINGLE BATTLE ROOMS\\nin the BATTLE TOWER for team battles.\\pIn each of the SINGLE BATTLE ROOMS,\\nseven TRAINERS await your challenge.\\pIf you manage to defeat all seven,\\nyou will earn Battle Points.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, please save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.SelectThreeMons	{'body': 'Now please select the three POKéMON\\nthat are to be entered.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.WelcomeDoubleBattle	{'body': 'Where the talents of TRAINERS\\nare put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\\pI am your guide to the DOUBLE\\nBATTLE ROOMS.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.TakeDoublesChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to take the DOUBLE\\nBATTLE ROOM challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ExplainDoublesChallenge	{'body': "The BATTLE TOWER's DOUBLE BATTLE\\nROOMS are facilities for conducting\\lDOUBLE BATTLES with four POKéMON.\\pThere are many DOUBLE BATTLE ROOMS\\nin the BATTLE TOWER for team battles.\\pIn each of the DOUBLE BATTLE ROOMS,\\nseven TRAINERS await your challenge.\\pIf you manage to defeat all seven,\\nyou will earn Battle Points.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, please save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.PleaseSelectFourMons	{'body': 'Now please select the four POKéMON\\nthat are to be entered.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.WelcomeMultiBattle	{'body': 'Where the talents of TRAINERS\\nare put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\\pI am your guide to the MULTI\\nBATTLE ROOMS.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.TakeMultisChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to take the MULTI\\nBATTLE ROOM challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ExplainMultisChallenge	{'body': "The BATTLE TOWER's MULTI BATTLE\\nROOMS are facilities for conducting\\lMULTI BATTLES.\\pFor MULTI BATTLES, you must partner\\nwith a TRAINER in the TOWER and enter\\lwith two POKéMON each.\\pInside the TOWER is a room named\\nthe BATTLE SALON where you may meet\\lother TRAINERS.\\pThere, you must find a TRAINER to act\\nas your partner in MULTI BATTLES.\\pOnce you have partnered up, you will\\nbe shown to a MULTI BATTLE ROOM.\\pIn the MULTI BATTLE ROOM, seven\\ntag teams await your challenge.\\pIf you manage to defeat all seven\\nteams, you will earn Battle Points.\\pIf you want to interrupt your\\nchallenge, please save the game.\\pIf you don't save before interrupting,\\nyou will be disqualified.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.PleaseSelectTwoMons	{'body': 'Now please select the two POKéMON\\nthat are to be entered.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.WelcomeLinkMultiBattle	{'body': 'Where the talents of TRAINERS\\nare put to the test!\\pWelcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\\pI am your guide to the LINK MULTI\\nBATTLE ROOMS.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.TakeLinkMultisChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to take the LINK MULTI\\nBATTLE ROOM challenge?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ExplainLinkMultisChallenge	{'body': "The BATTLE TOWER's MULTI BATTLE\\nROOMS are facilities for conducting\\lMULTI BATTLES with a friend.\\pYou must link with your friend using\\nWireless Adapters or a Game Boy\\lAdvance Game Link cable.\\pYou must partner with your friend and\\nenter two different kinds of POKéMON.\\pThere are many MULTI BATTLE ROOMS\\nin the BATTLE TOWER for team battles.\\pIn a MULTI BATTLE ROOM, seven\\ntag teams await you and your friend\\lto make a tag-team challenge.\\pIf you manage to defeat all seven\\nteams, you will earn Battle Points.\\pPlease beware that unlike other ROOMS,\\nyou may not interrupt your challenge.\\pOnce you start, you must battle seven\\nMULTI BATTLES in a row nonstop.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.PleaseSelectTwoMons2	{'body': 'Now please select the two POKéMON\\nthat are to be entered.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ChoseSameMonAsFriend	{'body': "You have chosen the same kind of\\nPOKéMON as your friend.\\pPlease choose two POKéMON different\\nfrom your friend's, match the level\\lyou wish to enter, and register again.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.LinkMultiOnlyForTwoPlayers	{'body': 'The LINK MULTI BATTLE ROOM challenge\\nis only for two linked players.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.FriendAlsoSelectedMon	{'body': 'Your friend has also selected\\nthe POKéMON {STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.FriendAlsoSelectedMons	{'body': 'Your friend has also selected the\\nPOKéMON {STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.FriendChoseDifferentLvlMode	{'body': 'Your friend has chosen a different\\nbattle level.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.FriendChoseDifferentLvlModeSameMon	{'body': 'Your friend has chosen a different\\nbattle level.\\pYour friend has also selected\\nthe POKéMON {STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.FriendChoseDifferentLvlModeSameMons	{'body': 'Your friend has chosen a different\\nbattle level.\\pYour friend has also selected the\\nPOKéMON {STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ChooseDifferentMonsMatchLvlMode	{'body': "Please choose two POKéMON different\\nfrom your friend's, match the level\\lyou wish to enter, and register again.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.SaveGameBeforeShowingIn	{'body': 'I will save the game before\\nshowing you in. Please wait.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CongratsDefeatedMaiden	{'body': 'Congratulations!\\nYou have defeated the SALON MAIDEN\\land swept seven TRAINERS!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.AwardYouTheseBattlePoints	{'body': 'In recognition of your infinite talent,\\nwe award you these Battle Point(s).$'}
text:BattleFrontier_ObtainedXBattlePoints	{'body': '{PLAYER} obtained\\n{STR_VAR_1} Battle Point(s).$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.RulesAreListed	{'body': 'The BATTLE TOWER rules are listed.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ExplainTowerRules	{'body': 'The BATTLE TOWER is a facility where\\nfour types of battles are waged--\\lSINGLE BATTLE, DOUBLE BATTLE, MULTI\\lBATTLE, and LINK MULTI BATTLE.\\pFor each of these types, there are\\nseparate BATTLE ROOMS.\\pPlease speak with a guide offering\\nthe type of battle you wish to enter.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ExplainMonRules	{'body': 'Depending on the BATTLE ROOM you are\\nentering, you will be required to take\\la certain number of POKéMON.\\pThe SINGLE BATTLE mode requires\\nthree POKéMON.\\pThe DOUBLE BATTLE mode requires four,\\nand the MULTI modes both require two.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ExplainSalonRules	{'body': "The BATTLE SALON is where you must\\nfind a partner to form a tag team for\\lthe MULTI BATTLE ROOM challenge.\\pChoose the best partner for you by\\nexamining other TRAINERS'\\lPOKéMON and their moves.\\pYou may choose a new tag partner\\nafter winning seven straight matches.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.ExplainMultiLinkRules	{'body': 'The LINK MULTI BATTLE Mode is for two\\nfriends to mount a challenge together.\\pYou and your friend must be linked with\\nWireless Adapters or a GBA Game Link\\lcable.\\pYou must choose two POKéMON at\\nthe registration counter.\\pThese POKéMON must be different\\nfrom those of your friend.\\pYou may not interrupt this challenge\\nin the middle, unlike other modes.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CircuitRewardPending	{'body': "Your reward remains recorded.\\pReview this Pokémon's legendary lead\\nfor any remaining conditions.\\pYour wins will not be lost.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CurrentCircuitRules	{'body': 'CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT\\pBring six healthy Pokémon and no\\nEggs. Every match is doubles; you\\lcontrol your own team.\\pYour team battles at Lv. 100.\\nOpponent levels begin from your\\ldifficulty and rise with wins.\\pAfter each battle, your party and\\nheld items are restored. You can\\lleave between matches.\\pEvery Frontier desk registers you\\nfor the central Tower arena.\\lMilestone rewards remain recorded.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby.CurrentCircuitRecord	{'body': 'CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT\\pCurrent run: {STR_VAR_1}\\pBest recorded: {STR_VAR_2}\\pTotal wins: {STR_VAR_3}$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.ReadyFor2ndOpponentSet	{'body': 'The 2nd set of opponents is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.ReadyFor3rdOpponentSet	{'body': 'The 3rd set of opponents is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.ReadyFor4thOpponentSet	{'body': 'The 4th set of opponents is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.ReadyFor5thOpponentSet	{'body': 'The 5th set of opponents is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.ReadyFor6thOpponentSet	{'body': 'The 6th set of opponents is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.ReadyFor7thOpponentSet	{'body': 'The 7th set of opponents is next.\\nAre you ready?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.2ndOpponentSetNext	{'body': 'The 2nd set of opponents is next.\\nDo your best!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.3rdOpponentSetNext	{'body': 'The 3rd set of opponents is next.\\nDo your best!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.4thOpponentSetNext	{'body': 'The 4th set of opponents is next.\\nDo your best!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.5thOpponentSetNext	{'body': 'The 5th set of opponents is next.\\nDo your best!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.6thOpponentSetNext	{'body': 'The 6th set of opponents is next.\\nDo your best!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiBattleRoom.7thOpponentSetNext	{'body': 'The 7th set of opponents is next.\\nDo your best!$'}
text:gLinkStandby3	{'body': 'Link standby…$'}
text:gYourPartnerHasRetired	{'body': 'Your partner has retired.\\pYour BATTLE ROOM challenge\\nwill be canceled.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.PleaseFindPartner	{'body': 'Please find a partner from out of\\nthe TRAINERS gathered here.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.QuitLookingForPartner	{'body': '{PLAYER}, you have not found a partner\\nfor your tag team.\\pWould you like to quit looking and\\nreturn to the reception counter?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.PleaseFindPartner2	{'body': 'Then, please find a partner from\\nthe TRAINERS gathered here.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.ThankYouForChoosingPartner	{'body': 'Thank you for choosing a partner.\\pI will now show you to your\\nMULTI BATTLE ROOM.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice1Intro	{'body': "I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nno. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\\pYou can call me {STR_VAR_3}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice1Mon1	{'body': "On {STR_VAR_1}'s advice, I brought\\none {STR_VAR_3} with {STR_VAR_2} and$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice1Mon2Ask	{'body': 'one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\pPlease, let me join you as a tag team.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice1Accept	{'body': "Thank you!\\nI'll go register right now.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice1Reject	{'body': 'I really wanted to form a tag team\\nwith you, {PLAYER}…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice2Intro	{'body': "I am {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nno. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\\pMy name is {STR_VAR_3}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice2Mon1	{'body': 'I got advice from {STR_VAR_1} and chose\\none {STR_VAR_3} with {STR_VAR_2} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice2Mon2Ask	{'body': "one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\pPlease, let's form a tag team!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice2Accept	{'body': "Thank you very much!\\nI'll be done with registration quickly!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.UnusedApprentice2Reject	{'body': '{PLAYER}, I was hoping that I could\\npartner up with you…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice1Intro	{'body': "Um, my name's {STR_VAR_3}, and I'm\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\\pSnivel…\\pI'm sorry!\\nThis tension is making me cry…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice1Mon1	{'body': '{STR_VAR_3} advised me, so I have\\none {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice1Mon2Ask	{'body': 'one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\pSnivel…\\nPlease, please team up with me!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice1Accept	{'body': "Oh, really? You will?\\nAwesome! Wicked! Awoooh!\\pOh… I'm sorry…\\nI'm so happy, I'm crying…\\pI'll go register right away.\\nPlease don't go away!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice1Reject	{'body': 'Oh, b-but…\\nSob… Waaaaah!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice2Intro	{'body': "Hi, there! I'm {STR_VAR_3}!\\nI'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice2Mon1	{'body': '{STR_VAR_3} recommended my crew.\\nOne {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice2Mon2Ask	{'body': "one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1},\\nthat's what I have! Cool, huh?\\pSo come on!\\nLet's form a tag team!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice2Accept	{'body': "Yay! Great!\\nOkay, I'll go register, okay?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice2Reject	{'body': 'Aww, why?\\nI wanted to team up, {PLAYER}!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice3Intro	{'body': "I'm {STR_VAR_3}, the no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice\\nof the famous {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice3Mon1	{'body': 'I looked to {STR_VAR_3} for advice.\\nOne {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice3Mon2Ask	{'body': "and one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1},\\nthat's my pair.\\pPlease, will you join me in\\na tag team?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice3Accept	{'body': "Thank you!\\nI'll register right away!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice3Reject	{'body': '{PLAYER}, I had been hoping to join\\nyou in a tag team…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice4Intro	{'body': "Um… I'm sincerely happy that you\\nwould take the time to talk to me.\\pI'm {STR_VAR_3}.\\nI'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice4Mon1	{'body': "{STR_VAR_3} gave me advice.\\nI'm very grateful for it.\\pI have a team of one {STR_VAR_2}\\nwith {STR_VAR_1} and$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice4Mon2Ask	{'body': "one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\nI know I'm asking a lot…\\pI don't think you'll be willing to,\\nbut may I join you as a partner?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice4Accept	{'body': "Really? I can't believe it!\\nI can't believe you'll let me join you!\\lI… I won't let you down!\\pUm… If it's really okay, I'll go register\\nright this instant!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice4Reject	{'body': "Oh…\\nI didn't think I was good enough…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice5Intro	{'body': "Hi, I'm {STR_VAR_3}.\\nI'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice5Mon1	{'body': '{STR_VAR_3} told me that it would be\\ngood to make this team:\\lone {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice5Mon2Ask	{'body': 'and one {STR_VAR_2} that knows how\\nto use {STR_VAR_1}.\\pNot bad, huh?\\nWant me to team up with you?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice5Accept	{'body': "Okay, glad to join you!\\nI hope you won't mess things up for me!\\lI'll do my registration now.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice5Reject	{'body': "Huh? Why did you turn me down?\\nYou're no judge of character!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice6Intro	{'body': "I'm {STR_VAR_3} and I'm a TRIATHLETE.\\nI'm busy every day what with jogging,\\ltraining, and rapping.\\pI also happen to be {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nno. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice6Mon1	{'body': 'This is what {STR_VAR_3} recommended.\\nOne {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice6Mon2Ask	{'body': "and one {STR_VAR_1}-using\\n{STR_VAR_2}.\\pI put a lot of effort into raising\\nthem, even though I'm busy.\\pLet's form a tag team\\nand give it a go!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice6Accept	{'body': "Thanks, that's the spirit!\\nHang tight while I go register, okay?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice6Reject	{'body': 'I took time from my busy schedule\\nto be here! Give me a break!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice7Intro	{'body': "Hi!\\nHow's it going?\\pI'm {STR_VAR_3}, {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nno. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice. Glad to meet you!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice7Mon1	{'body': 'Listen, listen! You have to hear about\\nthe POKéMON {STR_VAR_3} recommended.\\lOne {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice7Mon2Ask	{'body': "one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\nOf course I raised them superbly!\\pSo, want to team up?\\nI'm sure it'll be a great combo!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice7Accept	{'body': "Yay, I think this will be fun!\\nI'll go register!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice7Reject	{'body': "Oh, you're mean!\\nI come recommended, you know.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice8Intro	{'body': "Please let me introduce myself.\\nI am {STR_VAR_3}.\\pI serve as {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nno. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice8Mon1	{'body': 'I sought the sage advice of\\n{STR_VAR_3} and raised my team\\lof one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice8Mon2Ask	{'body': 'and one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\pPlease agree to a tag team with me!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice8Accept	{'body': "Oh… I'm delighted!\\nI promise to give you my best!\\pOf course I will register us!\\nPlease wait!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice8Reject	{'body': 'I had been hoping to join you,\\n{PLAYER}…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice9Intro	{'body': "Eek! You spoke to me!\\nI… I'm overjoyed!\\pI'm {STR_VAR_3}! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nno. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice9Mon1	{'body': "On {STR_VAR_3}'s advice, I trained\\none {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice9Mon2Ask	{'body': 'and one {STR_VAR_1}-using\\n{STR_VAR_2}.\\pPlease, can you grant me my wish?\\nI want to be your tag-team partner!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice9Accept	{'body': "Eek! I… I feel giddy!\\nThank you so much!\\lI'll go register us right away!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice9Reject	{'body': "Waaah! Don't you feel any pity?\\nBut that makes you cooler…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice10Intro	{'body': "Yeehaw! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nno. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\\p{STR_VAR_3}'s my name, hello, hello!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice10Mon1	{'body': 'My mentor {STR_VAR_3} recommended\\none {STR_VAR_1}-master {STR_VAR_2}$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice10Mon2Ask	{'body': "and one {STR_VAR_1}-master\\n{STR_VAR_2}.\\pGood stuff, huh?\\nYou'll partner with me, won't you?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice10Accept	{'body': "Okay, excellent!\\nI'll get the registration done quickly!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice10Reject	{'body': "Gwaaah!\\nYou're a calculating one, {PLAYER}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice11Intro	{'body': "Hey! There's big trouble! This is\\nthe BATTLE TOWER's last day!\\p… … … … … …\\nI'm only joking!\\pPeople call me {STR_VAR_3} and I do, too!\\nI'm {STR_VAR_1}'s 1,000th apprentice!\\lActually, I'm no. {STR_VAR_2}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice11Mon1	{'body': '{STR_VAR_3} gave me some advice.\\n{STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice11Mon2Ask	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\nI've got ten of each kind!\\lActually, just one of each!\\pHow about it?\\nWant to try tag battles with me?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice11Accept	{'body': "Yippee!\\nI'll give you a POKéMON as my thanks!\\pJust joking! But I will really go do\\nthe registration, okay?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice11Reject	{'body': "Oh, that's so cold! I'll have to wreck\\nthe BATTLE TOWER for that!\\pOf course I won't!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice12Intro	{'body': "Hey, there, I'm rockin' and a-rollin'!\\nPOKéMON, I be controllin'!\\pI'm {STR_VAR_3} the rappin' SAILOR.\\nDon't be mistakin' me for no wailer!\\pI'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\\nMe, you shouldn't be quick to dismiss!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice12Mon1	{'body': 'With the advice of {STR_VAR_3} I did\\nabide, put together my team of pride!\\lOne {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice12Mon2Ask	{'body': 'and one {STR_VAR_1}-using\\n{STR_VAR_2}!\\pOur meeting we should commemorate,\\nwith a tag-team victory to celebrate!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice12Accept	{'body': 'Hey, hey, I like your style!\\nOur registration, I will go file!$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice12Reject	{'body': "Oh, hey, {PLAYER}, now that's cold!\\nIf I may be so bold!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice13Intro	{'body': "Yippee-yahoo!\\nOh, don't run! I was just having fun!\\pHowdy! I'm {STR_VAR_3}!\\nI'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice13Mon1	{'body': '{STR_VAR_3} told me what to do.\\nSo one {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice13Mon2Ask	{'body': "and one {STR_VAR_1}-using\\n{STR_VAR_2}, I did choose.\\pSo, what do you say?\\nCome on, make my day!\\pPlease, I'm begging you!\\nLet me join you, don't leave me blue!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice13Accept	{'body': "Yeahah! Luck is with me!\\nIt sure makes me happy!\\pBefore we go join the fray,\\nI'll go register right away!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice13Reject	{'body': "You're turning me down?\\n{PLAYER}, you're making me frown!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice14Intro	{'body': "Cough!\\pOh, sorry, I have a cold.\\nMy POKéMON are fine, though.\\pMy name's {STR_VAR_3}, {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nno. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice. Cough!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice14Mon1	{'body': "I took {STR_VAR_3}'s advice to heart\\nand put together my team of\\lone {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice14Mon2Ask	{'body': "one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI trained them every day,\\neven in wind and rain.\\pThat's why I have this cold,\\nI think.\\pThat's what I'm about.\\nWant to be my tag partner?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice14Accept	{'body': 'Thanks, I appreciate this!\\nCough, cough!\\lHang on while I go register.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice14Reject	{'body': "Oh, you won't?\\n{PLAYER}, I think we'd make a good pair.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice15Intro	{'body': "Oh, hello!\\nThis is nerve-racking.\\pI'm {STR_VAR_3}.\\nI'm the no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice of {STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice15Mon1	{'body': "{STR_VAR_3} said this team'll be good--\\none {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice15Mon2Ask	{'body': "one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI'm feeling self-conscious about this,\\nbut will you let me join you?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice15Accept	{'body': "Oh, gee, thank you!\\nI feel bashful, but I'll do my best!\\pI'll go get the registration done.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice15Reject	{'body': "Oh, please don't say no!\\nI feel self-conscious enough already…$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice16Intro	{'body': "I am {STR_VAR_3}, and that's no lie.\\nI am {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice16Mon1	{'body': '{STR_VAR_3} recommended my team.\\pSince the advice sounded sincere,\\nI decided to bring with me\\lmy {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice16Mon2Ask	{'body': 'my {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}.\\pIf possible, I would like you to accept\\nme as your tag-team partner.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice16Accept	{'body': "You really will accept me?\\nIt would be too terrible otherwise.\\pBut since you've agreed, this is fine.\\nI shall go register the both of us.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.Apprentice16Reject	{'body': 'Hm? Now why would you refuse?\\nIs this your idea of a joke?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LassIntro	{'body': "I'm {STR_VAR_1}, and I'm a LASS!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LassMon1	{'body': 'What I have are one {STR_VAR_2}\\nthat uses {STR_VAR_1} and one$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LassMon2Ask	{'body': '{STR_VAR_2} that uses {STR_VAR_1}.\\nThose are what I have with me.\\pWill you be my partner?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LassAccept	{'body': "Thank you!\\nI'll go do the registration!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LassReject	{'body': "You don't want to be my partner?\\nYou'll regret it later!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.YoungsterIntro	{'body': "Hello!\\pI'm YOUNGSTER {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.YoungsterMon1	{'body': 'Want to know what I have?\\nOne {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.YoungsterMon2Ask	{'body': "one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}!\\pYou'll be my tag-team partner,\\nwon't you?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.YoungsterAccept	{'body': "Yay!\\nI'll go and register, okay?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.YoungsterReject	{'body': "Aww! If you'd form a tag team with\\nmy POKéMON, we'd be unstoppable!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.HikerIntro	{'body': "Yahoo!\\nI'm HIKER {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.HikerMon1	{'body': 'Know what I have with me?\\nMy {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.HikerMon2Ask	{'body': 'my {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}!\\pSounds good, eh?\\nWant to form a tag team?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.HikerAccept	{'body': "Yahoo!\\nI'll go do the registering, then.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.HikerReject	{'body': "I would've liked to battle with you\\nat my side.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BeautyIntro	{'body': "Hello!\\nI'm {STR_VAR_1}, and I'm a BEAUTY!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BeautyMon1	{'body': "Do you know what I've been raising?\\nOne {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BeautyMon2Ask	{'body': 'one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}!\\pWhat do you think?\\nWant to make a tag team together?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BeautyAccept	{'body': "Wonderful!\\nI'll get the registration done now!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BeautyReject	{'body': "How disappointing!\\pWe two together--we would've been\\nthe best!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.FishermanIntro	{'body': "Yo!\\pYou know who I am?\\nI'm {STR_VAR_1} the FISHERMAN!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.FishermanMon1	{'body': "I've got with me a team of one\\n{STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2} and$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.FishermanMon2Ask	{'body': 'one {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}.\\pSo, how about it?\\nWill you battle at my side?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.FishermanAccept	{'body': "Good, good!\\nLeave it up to me!\\pI'll go and register us now.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.FishermanReject	{'body': 'We matched up perfectly, too…$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LadyIntro	{'body': 'Glad to make your acquaintance.\\nI am {STR_VAR_1}, a LADY.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LadyMon1	{'body': 'I am accompanied by a team of\\none {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LadyMon2Ask	{'body': 'one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI hope I meet your approval.\\nFor I wish to have you as my partner.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LadyAccept	{'body': 'I thank you sincerely.\\nI shall handle the registration.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.LadyReject	{'body': "I'm sure that you will regret not\\nhaving me as your partner.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.CyclingTriathleteFIntro	{'body': "I'm TRIATHLETE {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.CyclingTriathleteFMon1	{'body': 'What I have…\\nOne {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.CyclingTriathleteFMon2Ask	{'body': "one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}!\\nThat's my pair!\\pPlease?\\nWill you form a tag team with me?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.CyclingTriathleteFAccept	{'body': "Gee, thanks!\\nI'll go register at the counter.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.CyclingTriathleteFReject	{'body': "We two together, we would've been\\ntough for certain!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BugCatcherIntro	{'body': "Hiya!\\nI'm BUG CATCHER {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BugCatcherMon1	{'body': 'Check out what I have!\\nOne {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BugCatcherMon2Ask	{'body': 'one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}!\\pSo, listen!\\nDo you want to form a tag team?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BugCatcherAccept	{'body': "Gotcha!\\pI'll go do the registration stuff\\nat the counter.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.BugCatcherReject	{'body': "Aww, my POKéMON are awesome.\\nI hope you won't regret this!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.SchoolKidMIntro	{'body': "Good day!\\nI'm SCHOOL KID {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom.SchoolKidMMon1	{'body': "What I've been raising are one\\n{STR_VAR_2} that uses {STR_VAR_1}$"}
