text:Debug_EWRAMCounters_Text	{'body': 'Follower Steps: {STR_VAR_1}.\\nFishing Chain: {STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:Debug_FontTest_1	{'body': '{FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}Angel Adept Blind Bodice Clique\\nCoast Dunce Docile Enact Eosin\\lFurlong Focal Gnome Gondola Human\\lHoist Inlet Iodine Justin Jocose\\lKnoll Koala Linden Loads Milliner\\lModal Number Nodule Onset Oddball\\lPneumo Poncho Quanta Qophs Rhone\\lRoman Snout Sodium Tundra Tocsin\\lUncle Udder Vulcan Vocal Whale\\lWoman Xmas Xenon Yunnan Young\\lZloty Zodiac.$'}
text:Debug_FontTest_2	{'body': '{FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}Angel angel adept for the nuance loads\\nof the arena cocoa and quaalude. Blind\\lblind bodice for the submit oboe of the\\lclub snob and abbot. Clique clique\\lcoast for the pouch loco of the franc\\lassoc and accede. Dunce dunce docile\\lfor the loudness mastodon of the\\lloud statehood and huddle.$'}
text:Debug_FontTest_3	{'body': '{FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}Enact enact eosin for the quench coed\\nof the pique canoe and bleep. Furlong\\lfurlong focal for the genuflect\\lprofound of the motif aloof and offers.\\lGnome gnome gondola for the impugn\\llogos of the unplug analog and smuggle.\\lHuman human hoist for the buddhist\\lalcohol of the riyadh caliph and\\lbathhouse.$'}
text:Debug_FontTest_4	{'body': '{FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}Inlet inlet iodine for the quince\\nchampion of the ennui scampi and shiite.\\lJustin justin jocose for the djibouti\\lsojourn of the oranj raj and hajjis.\\lKnoll knoll koala for the banknote\\llookout of the dybbuk outlook and\\ltrekked. Linden linden loads for the\\lulna monolog of the consul menthol and\\lshallot.$'}
text:Debug_FontTest_5	{'body': '{FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}Milliner milliner modal for the alumna\\nsolomon of the album custom and summon.\\lNumber number nodule for the unmade\\leconomic of the shotgun bison and\\ltunnel. Onset onset oddball for the\\labandon podium of the antiquo tempo\\land moonlit. Pneumo pneumo poncho for\\lthe dauphin opossum of the holdup\\lbishop and supplies.$'}
text:Debug_FontTest_6	{'body': '{FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}Quanta quanta qophs for the inquest\\nsheqel of the cinq coq and suqqu. Rhone\\lrhone roman for the burnt porous of the\\llemur clamor and carrot. Snout snout\\lsodium for the ensnare bosom of the\\lgenus pathos and missing. Tundra\\ltundra tocsin for the nutmeg isotope\\lof the peasant ingot and ottoman.$'}
text:Debug_FontTest_7	{'body': '{FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}Uncle uncle udder for the dunes cloud\\nof the hindu thou and continuum. Vulcan\\lvulcan vocal for the alluvial ovoid of\\lthe yugoslav chekhov and revved. Whale\\lwhale woman for the meanwhile blowout\\lof the forepaw meadow and glowworm.\\lXmas xmas xenon for the bauxite\\ldoxology of the tableaux equinox and\\lexxon.$'}
text:Debug_FontTest_8	{'directives': ('Debug_EventScript_FontTest_Text_9::',), 'body': "{FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}Yunnan yunnan young for the dynamo\\ncoyote of the obloquy employ and\\lsayyid. Zloty zloty zodiac for the gizmo\\lozone of the franz laissez and buzzing.${FONT_SMALL_NARROWER}42 × 138 = 5796.\\nMr Jock, TV quiz PhD: bags 20% fewer\\llynx at a café; voilà, they're “worth”\\l♂1/♀1 = ¥1. That's 10 + 9 - 8 = 11\\lNintendo GBA can connect to a Nintendo\\lGameCube console! He claimed-though I don't\\lbelieve him-to have done so in an eyes-shut\\lstate…?$"}
