text:PokemonLeague_EliteFour_RetirePrompt	{'body': 'You need two battle-ready POKéMON.\\pEnd this LEAGUE run and return to the\\nlobby?$'}
text:PokemonLeague_EliteFour_Stay	{'body': 'Then restore another POKéMON with your\\nBAG and speak to me again.$'}
text:PokemonLeague_EliteFour_Retired	{'body': 'Your LEAGUE run ends here. Rest,\\nrebuild, and challenge us again.$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_BattleVendorWelcome	{'body': 'Competitive held items are free here.\\pTake as many as your teams need!\\pWhich kind of held item do you need?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_BattleVendorCompleteWelcome	{'body': 'Your RING opens the Form Tools archive.\\nThese form-changing tools are free!\\pEvolution specialists sell stones and\\ndevices. LILYCOVE has the full range.\\pFor Mega Stones, explore HOENN and\\nget to know the people who live here.$'}
