text:EmeraldChampions_ExplainBattleSets	{'body': "A Battle Set is a prepared build:\\nmoves, Nature, Ability, EVs,\\land a held item.\\pI'll show it before you decide.\\nApplying it replaces those parts\\lof your current build.\\pYou can edit it afterward, or\\ntry another set, all for free.\\lUse your Leveler separately.\\pTransformation items, such as\\nMega Stones, must be found\\lseparately.$"}
text:EmeraldChampions_ChooseBattleSetMon	{'body': 'Which Pokémon should I prepare?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_ChooseBattleFormat	{'body': 'Which battle format are you\\npreparing for?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_Doubles	{'body': 'Doubles$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_Singles	{'body': 'Singles$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_ChooseEvMon	{'body': 'Up to 252 EVs per stat, 510 total.\\nWhose stats should we adjust?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_ResetEvs	{'body': 'Reset all six EVs to zero?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_EvsReset	{'body': 'All EVs were reset.\\nYou can now build a new spread.$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_EvEgg	{'body': "An Egg's EVs can't be edited.$"}
text:EmeraldChampions_EvGoodbye	{'body': 'Come back whenever you want to\\ncustomize another spread.$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_ChooseDoublesBattleSetStyle	{'body': 'Which Doubles set should I build?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_ChooseSinglesBattleSetStyle	{'body': 'Which Singles set should I build?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_ConfirmBattleSet	{'body': 'Apply {STR_VAR_2} to\\n{STR_VAR_1}?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_ConfirmMegaBattleSet	{'body': 'Required item:\\n{STR_VAR_3}.\\pApply this set without it?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_BattleSetSuccess	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}'s set is ready!\\nIts full build was updated.$"}
text:EmeraldChampions_MegaBattleSetSuccess	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}'s transformation\\nset is ready!\\pNo item was supplied.\\nRequired: {STR_VAR_3}.$"}
text:EmeraldChampions_MegaBattleSetHeldSuccess	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}'s transformation\\nset is ready!\\pIt kept its {STR_VAR_3}.$"}
text:EmeraldChampions_PrepareAnotherBattleSet	{'body': 'Prepare another Pokémon?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_BattleSetEgg	{'body': "An Egg can't use a battle set.$"}
text:EmeraldChampions_BattleSetMissing	{'body': "I don't have a finished battle set\\nfor that Pokémon yet.$"}
text:EmeraldChampions_BattleSetSpecialItem	{'body': "I won't discard that special item.\\pRemove it before changing sets.$"}
text:EmeraldChampions_ForgetAnotherMove	{'body': 'Should another move be forgotten?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_RenameAnotherPokemon	{'body': 'Rename another Pokémon?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_MoveTutorGoodbye	{'body': 'Come back whenever you want to\\nchange your team.$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_NeedTwoPokemon	{'body': 'This is a Double Battle. Come back\\nwith two usable Pokémon.$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_ChooseStarterRegion	{'body': 'Dad studies how battling traditions\\ndiffer across every region.\\pWhich starter trio speaks to you?$'}
text:EmeraldChampions_StarterRegionChosen	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}! Great choice!\\pDad packed that trio in his field bag.\\nChoose two partners. I'll train\\lthe partner you leave with Dad.$"}
