text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_FishingPokemonCaughtStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER caught\\n{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON while fishing!\\p{STR_VAR_3} is a legendary fishing\\nexpert!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_EggsHatchedTitle	{'body': 'The EGG-Warming TRAINER$'}
