text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_EggsHatchedStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER hatched {STR_VAR_1} POKéMON\\nfrom EGGS!\\p{STR_VAR_3} is a legendary warmer\\nof EGGS!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_PokemonEvolvedTitle	{'body': 'The Evolver TRAINER$'}
