text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_PokemonEvolvedStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER made {STR_VAR_1} POKéMON\\nevolve!\\p{STR_VAR_3} is the ultimate evolver\\nof POKéMON!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedPokemonCenterTitle	{'body': 'The POKéMON CENTER-Loving TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedPokemonCenterAction	{'body': 'Used POKéMON CENTERS$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedPokemonCenterStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER healed POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1} times at POKéMON CENTERS!\\pThere could be no greater lover of\\nPOKéMON CENTERS than {STR_VAR_3}!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_RestedAtHomeTitle	{'body': 'The Homebody TRAINER$'}
