text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_RestedAtHomeStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER healed POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1} times at home!\\pThere could be no more of a homebody\\nthan {STR_VAR_3}!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_SafariGamesTitle	{'body': 'The SAFARI-Loving TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_SafariGamesAction	{'body': 'Entered the SAFARI ZONE$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_SafariGamesStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER went into the SAFARI ZONE\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} is a TRAINER whose wild side\\nmust come out in the SAFARI ZONE!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedCutTitle	{'body': 'The CUT-Frenzy TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedCutAction	{'body': 'Used CUT$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedCutStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER used CUT\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} is a TRAINER who just must\\nlove to CUT!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedRockSmashTitle	{'body': 'The ROCK-SMASHING TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedRockSmashAction	{'body': 'Smashed rocks$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedRockSmashStory	{'body': "This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER used ROCK SMASH\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must be a TRAINER who\\ncan't leave a stone unsmashed!$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_MovedBasesTitle	{'body': 'The Move-Loving TRAINER$'}
