text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_MovedBasesStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER moved the SECRET BASE\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} is a TRAINER who loves\\nto move houses often!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedSplashTitle	{'body': 'The SPLASH-Happy TRAINER$'}
