text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedStruggleStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER had to rely on STRUGGLE\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} is a tenacious TRAINER\\nwho never gives in to adversity!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_SlotJackpotsTitle	{'body': 'The SLOT Champ$'}
