text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_BattleTowerChallengesStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER took the BATTLE TOWER\\nchallenge {STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} is a TRAINER who aspires\\nfor excellence in the BATTLE TOWER!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_MadePokeblocksTitle	{'body': 'The Blend-Loving TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_MadePokeblocksAction	{'body': 'Made {POKEBLOCK}S$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_MadePokeblocksStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER made {POKEBLOCK}S\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\pThere is none better at using a BERRY\\nBLENDER than {STR_VAR_3}!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_EnteredContestsTitle	{'body': 'The CONTEST-Loving TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_EnteredContestsAction	{'body': 'Entered CONTESTS$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_EnteredContestsStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER entered CONTESTS\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must love showing off\\nPOKéMON to others!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WonContestsTitle	{'body': 'The CONTEST Master$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WonContestsAction	{'body': 'Won CONTESTS$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WonContestsStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER won CONTESTS\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must be an incredible\\nCONTEST master!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TimesShoppedTitle	{'body': 'The Happy Shopper$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TimesShoppedAction	{'body': 'Shopped$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TimesShoppedStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER bought items in shops\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must be one of those\\npeople who are born to shop.$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedItemFinderTitle	{'body': 'The Item-Finding TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedItemFinderAction	{'body': 'Used a DOWSING MACHINE$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedItemFinderStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER used a\\nDOWSING MACHINE {STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must enjoy scouring the\\nground for hidden items!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TimesRainedTitle	{'body': 'The Rain-Soaked TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TimesRainedAction	{'body': 'Got rained on$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TimesRainedStory	{'body': "This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER got soaked by rain\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3}'s charisma must even\\nattract rain!$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_CheckedPokedexTitle	{'body': 'The Avid POKéDEX Reader$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_CheckedPokedexAction	{'body': 'Checked a POKéDEX$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_CheckedPokedexStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER checked a POKéDEX\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must love inspecting\\nPOKéMON in a POKéDEX!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_ReceivedRibbonsTitle	{'body': 'The RIBBON Collector$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_ReceivedRibbonsAction	{'body': 'Received RIBBONS$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_ReceivedRibbonsStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER received RIBBONS\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must be a TRAINER who\\nloves to collect RIBBONS!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_LedgesJumpedTitle	{'body': 'The Ledge-Jumping TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_LedgesJumpedAction	{'body': 'Jumped down ledges$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_LedgesJumpedStory	{'body': "This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER jumped down ledges\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\pIf there's a ledge to be jumped,\\n{STR_VAR_3} can't ignore it!$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TVWatchedTitle	{'body': 'The Legendary TV Viewer$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TVWatchedAction	{'body': 'Watched TV$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TVWatchedStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER watched TV\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must love watching TV!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_CheckedClockTitle	{'body': 'The Time-Conscious TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_CheckedClockAction	{'body': 'Checked the time$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_CheckedClockStory	{'body': "This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER checked the time\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must be a punctual TRAINER\\nwho's conscious of the time.$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WonLotteryTitle	{'body': 'The POKéMON LOTTERY Wizard$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WonLotteryAction	{'body': 'Won POKéMON LOTTERIES$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WonLotteryStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER won POKéMON LOTTERIES\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must have many friends\\nto trade POKéMON with!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedDaycareTitle	{'body': 'The DAY CARE-Using Trainer$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedDaycareAction	{'body': 'Left POKéMON at the DAY CARE$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_UsedDaycareStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER left POKéMON with the\\nDAY CARE {STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must be a real go-getter\\nwho raises POKéMON aggressively!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_RodeCableCarTitle	{'body': 'The CABLE CAR-Loving TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_RodeCableCarAction	{'body': 'Rode the CABLE CAR$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_RodeCableCarStory	{'body': "This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER rode the CABLE CAR\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must be a busy TRAINER\\nwho's up and down all the time!$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_HotSpringsTitle	{'body': 'The Hot Spring-Loving TRAINER$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_HotSpringsAction	{'body': 'Bathed in hot springs$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_HotSpringsStory	{'body': 'This is a tale of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThis TRAINER bathed in hot springs\\n{STR_VAR_1} times!\\p{STR_VAR_3} must be a TRAINER with\\nbaby-smooth skin!$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_HearMyStory	{'body': "I'm GIDDY!\\nI have a scintillating story for you!\\pWould you like to hear my story?$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_GiddyFeelingTheBlues	{'body': "Oh…\\nYou've left me feeling the blues…$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_AlsoIWasThinking	{'body': 'Also, I was thinking…$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WeShouldChatAgain	{'body': "That's about it, I think…\\pWe should chat again!\\nBye-bye!$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WouldYouLikeToHearMySong	{'body': "Hi, I'm the BARD.\\nWould you like to hear my song?$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_BardFeelingTheBlues1	{'body': "Oh…\\nYou've left me feeling the blues…$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WishICouldPlaySongForOthers	{'body': 'Oh, what a moving song…\\nI wish I could play it for others…$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_WouldYouLikeToWriteSomeLyrics	{'body': "So?\\nHow do you like my song?\\pBut I'm none too happy about\\nthe lyrics.\\pHow would you like to write some\\nnew lyrics for me?$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_BardFeelingTheBlues2	{'body': "Oh…\\nYou've left me feeling the blues…$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_LetMeSingItForYou	{'body': 'Thank you kindly!\\nLet me sing it for you.$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_ThatHowYouWantedSongToGo	{'body': 'Was that how you wanted your song\\nto go?$'}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_IllSingThisSongForAWhile	{'body': "Okay! That's it, then.\\nI'll sing this song for a while.$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_TeachWhatsHipAndHappening	{'body': "Hey, yo! They call me the HIPSTER.\\nI'll teach you what's hip and happening.$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_IAlreadyTaughtYou	{'body': "But, hey, I taught you what's hip and\\nhappening already.\\pI'd like to spread the good word to\\nother folks.$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_IveGotNothingNewToTeach	{'body': "But, hey, you already know a lot about\\nwhat's hip and happening.\\pI've got nothing new to teach you!$"}
text:MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_HaveYouHeardOfWord	{'body': "Hey, have you heard about\\n“{STR_VAR_1}”?\\pWhat's it mean? Well…\\nAsk your daddy or mommy, okay?$"}
text:MoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnce	{'body': 'This move can be learned only\\nonce. Is that okay?$'}
text:IdLoveToHearYourProfile	{'body': "Hi, glad to meet you!\\p…That's unfriendly of you.\\nHow about saying hi back?\\pSo, come on, tell me about\\nyourself.\\pI'd love to hear your profile!$"}
text:TellMeWhatsYourProfile	{'body': "Tell me something good about\\nyourself. What's your profile?$"}
text:ExplainProfile	{'body': "A profile is written using four\\nwords or phrases.\\pThere're plenty of words to choose\\nfrom for your profile.\\pThe words and phrases are placed\\nin several convenient groups.\\pFirst, choose a group, then choose\\na word or phrase.\\p…It's easier than it sounds.\\nWhy don't you try it?$"}
text:WhatsYourProfile	{'body': "What's your profile?$"}
text:DontBeLikeThat	{'body': "Aww… Don't be like that.\\nYou can tell me your profile.$"}
text:DecidedNotTo	{'body': "Oh, you've decided not to?\\nYou're fickle, aren't you?$"}
text:HiWeMeetAgain	{'body': 'Hi!\\nWe meet again!$'}
text:ChangeYourProfile	{'body': 'Would you like to change your\\nprofile?$'}
text:WhatAreYouLikeNow	{'body': "What are you like now?\\nI'd really like to know.$"}
text:LikeProfileWayItIs	{'body': 'Okay, you like your profile the\\nway it is.\\pI think so, too.$'}
text:ProfileSaysSomethingAboutYou	{'body': 'Hmhm…\\pYour profile really says something\\nabout who you are.\\pNow that I know you better, it \\nmakes us better friends than ever!$'}
text:HeardThatBefore	{'body': "Oh, I've heard that before…\\pMy cousin, who lives far away,\\nalways used to say that, I think.$"}
text:TellMoreNextTime	{'body': 'Please tell me more about\\nyourself next time!$'}
text:WelcomeWantToHealPkmn_Frlg	{'body': 'Welcome to our POKéMON CENTER!\\pWould you like me to heal your\\nPOKéMON back to perfect health?$'}
text:TakeYourPkmnForFewSeconds_Frlg	{'body': "Okay, I'll take your POKéMON for a\\nfew seconds.$"}
text:WeHopeToSeeYouAgain_Frlg	{'body': 'We hope to see you again!$'}
text:RestoredPkmnToFullHealth_Frlg	{'body': "Thank you for waiting.\\nWe've restored your POKéMON to\\lfull health.$"}
text:VoiceRangOutDontRunAway	{'body': "Someone's voice rang out,\\n“Don't run away!”$"}
text:ProfileMan_CollectTrainerProfiles	{'body': "Hello there, TRAINER!\\nYou've got a wonderful smile, there.\\pI have a hobby--collecting the profiles\\nof POKéMON TRAINERS.$"}
text:ProfileMan_MayISeeYourProfile	{'body': 'So, how about it?\\nMay I see your profile?$'}
text:ProfileMan_EasyChatExplanation	{'body': "You make your own profile by putting\\ntogether four words or phrases.\\pHere, I'll show you an example of a\\nprofile using four pieces of text.\\pYou can switch those four pieces with\\nother text pieces any which way you\\llike to make your own profile.\\pThere are a lot of text pieces that\\nyou can use.\\pThey are arranged in groups like\\nPOKéMON, lifestyles, and hobbies so\\lit is easier to look them up.\\pSo, first, choose the group of text\\npieces to display a list of choices.\\pThen, pick the choice you want.\\pRepeat for the remaining text choices,\\nand you'll have your very own profile.$"}
text:ProfileMan_LetsSeeItThen	{'body': "Yes! Thank you!\\nSo, let's see it, then.$"}
text:ProfileMan_ImagineYouWouldHaveWonderfulProfile	{'body': 'Oh, no, really?\\pI imagine someone like you would have\\na wonderful profile…$'}
text:ProfileMan_NotIntoItRightNow	{'body': "Oh? You're not into it right now?\\pWell, anytime is good by me!$"}
text:ProfileMan_YouHaveWonderfulSmile	{'body': "Hello there, TRAINER!\\nYou've got a wonderful smile.$"}
text:ProfileMan_MayISeeYourNewProfile	{'body': 'May I see your new profile?$'}
text:ProfileMan_EvenBetterThanLastProfile	{'body': "Yes! Thank you!\\pI hope it's even better than the profile\\nyou showed me before.$"}
text:ProfileMan_LikeProfileWayItIs	{'body': "Oh, you like your profile the way it is.\\pI don't blame you--it's a wonderful\\nprofile the way it is now.$"}
text:ProfileMan_FantasticProfile	{'body': "F-fantastic!\\pYour profile, it's wonderful!\\nIt really says what you're about.\\pWhy, anyone hearing this profile would\\nbe captivated by you!\\pThank you!$"}
text:ProfileMan_YouKnowSecretSaying	{'body': "Oh?\\nYou know the secret saying!\\pThat means you're now a fellow member\\nof the MYSTERY EVENT CLUB!$"}
text:SprayWoreOff	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}'s effect wore off…$"}
text:SprayWoreOffAskUseAnother	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}'s effect wore off!\\nUse another?$"}
text:SprayWoreOffAskUseX	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}'s effect wore off…\\nUse a {STR_VAR_2}?$"}
text:SprayWoreOffUseX	{'body': '{PLAYER} used the\\n{STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:OnlySkilledTrainersAllowedThrough	{'body': "Only truly skilled TRAINERS are\\nallowed through.\\pYou don't have the {STR_VAR_1}\\nyet!$"}
text:CantLetYouPass	{'body': "Rules are rules.\\nI can't let you pass.$"}
text:OhThatsBadgeGoRightAhead	{'body': 'Oh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!\\nGo right ahead.$'}
text:OnlyPassWithBadgeDontHaveYet	{'body': "You can pass here only if you have\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\\pYou don't have the {STR_VAR_1}\\nyet.\\pYou have to have it to get to\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE.$"}
text:OnlyPassWithBadgeOhGoAhead	{'body': 'You can pass here only if you have\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\\pOh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_LEVEL_UP}{PAUSE 0x60}{RESUME_MUSIC}\\pOkay, then.\\nPlease, go right ahead.$'}
text:SafariZone_WouldYouLikeToExit	{'body': 'Would you like to exit the SAFARI\\nZONE right now?$'}
text:SafariZone_TimesUp	{'body': "Ding-dong! Time's up!\\nYour SAFARI Game is over.$"}
text:SafariZone_OutOfBalls	{'body': "You've run out of SAFARI BALLS.\\nYour SAFARI Game is over.$"}
text:SafariZone_PlacePokeblockOnFeeder	{'body': 'Would you like to place a {POKEBLOCK}\\non the {POKEBLOCK} FEEDER?$'}
text:SafariZone_PokeblockStillHere	{'body': 'The {STR_VAR_1} you left\\nbefore is still here.$'}
text:SafariZone_PokeblockWasPlaced	{'body': 'The {STR_VAR_1} was placed\\non the {POKEBLOCK} FEEDER.$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_WelcomeToSafariZone	{'body': "Welcome to the SAFARI ZONE!\\pHere, you may witness many kinds of\\nPOKéMON rarely seen in HOENN.\\pAnd, you'll see them in their wild,\\nuntamed state in natural habitats.\\pWhat's more, we've thrown open the\\ngates to POKéMON TRAINERS.\\pYou're encouraged to catch POKéMON\\nfor keeps!\\pCome in and enjoy the SAFARI ZONE!$"}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_WelcomeFirstTime	{'body': 'Welcome to the SAFARI ZONE!\\nIs it your first time here?$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_ComeInAndEnjoy	{'body': 'Come in and enjoy the SAFARI ZONE!$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_FirstTimeInfo	{'body': "When you enter the SAFARI ZONE, you\\nstart with 30 SAFARI BALLS for\\lcatching POKéMON.\\pThe SAFARI Game is over when you run\\nout of SAFARI BALLS, or when you've\\lwalked 500 steps.\\pCome in and enjoy the SAFARI ZONE!$"}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_WouldYouLikeToPlay	{'body': 'Welcome to the SAFARI ZONE!\\pAll you can catch for just ¥500!\\nWould you like to play a SAFARI Game?$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_PlayAnotherTime	{'body': 'Okay.\\nPlease play another time!$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_NotEnoughMoney	{'body': "You don't have enough money.\\nSorry.$"}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_ThatWillBe500Please	{'body': 'That will be ¥500, please.$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_HereAreYourSafariBalls	{'body': 'Here are your SAFARI BALLS.$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_Received30SafariBalls	{'body': '{PLAYER} received 30 SAFARI BALLS.$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_PleaseEnjoyYourself	{'body': "We'll let you know when your game\\nis over.\\pSo, until then, enjoy yourself, please!\\nOff you go on your wild excursion!$"}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_PCIsFull	{'body': 'Excuse me!\\nYour PC BOX is full.$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_YouNeedPokeblockCase	{'body': 'Excuse me!\\nYou seem to be without a {POKEBLOCK} CASE.\\pYour SAFARI Game will be much more\\nfruitful if you use {POKEBLOCK}S.\\pPlease come back with a {POKEBLOCK} CASE.\\pYou may obtain a {POKEBLOCK} CASE from\\nthe LILYCOVE CONTEST HALL.$'}
text:SafariZone_South_StillHaveTimeExit	{'body': 'You still have time left. Would you like\\nto exit the SAFARI ZONE now?$'}
text:SafariZone_South_EnjoyTheRestOfYourAdventure	{'body': 'Please enjoy the rest of your wild\\nadventure!$'}
text:SafariZone_South_ExitEarlyThankYouForPlaying	{'body': "Okay.\\pI'll take back your remaining SAFARI\\nBALLS.\\pThank you for playing.\\nWe hope to see you again.$"}
text:SafariZone_South_GoodLuck	{'body': "Good luck!\\pIf you need anything, don't hesitate\\nto tell me, please!$"}
text:SafariZone_South_Boy	{'body': 'Did you know?\\pIf you put a {POKEBLOCK} in that square box,\\nPOKéMON gather around.$'}
text:SafariZone_South_Man	{'body': 'I want to keep going deeper, but I\\nforgot to bring a BIKE.\\pSomething tells me that rare POKéMON\\nlive in the outlying areas.$'}
text:SafariZone_Southwest_Woman	{'body': 'Sometimes, when I toss a {POKEBLOCK} at \\nPOKéMON, it gets ignored.\\pDo POKéMON have likes and dislikes\\nabout what they eat?$'}
text:SafariZone_Northwest_Man	{'body': "Gasp… Gasp…\\nI…made it out here…but…\\pI'm exhausted… I don't have the\\nenergy to catch POKéMON…$"}
text:SafariZone_North_Fisherman	{'body': "I'm on a mission to find WATER POKéMON\\nyou don't see in HOENN.\\pDo you have any idea where the lake is?$"}
text:SafariZone_North_Man	{'body': "I'm going to catch a lot of rare POKéMON\\nhere and trade them with my friends!$"}
text:SafariZone_South_Youngster	{'body': 'I put a {POKEBLOCK} on the {POKEBLOCK} FEEDER.\\nBut it seems to have disappeared.\\pI guess POKéMON must have eaten it\\nwithout me noticing.$'}
text:Route121_SafariZoneEntrance_TrainerTip	{'body': 'SAFARI ZONE TRAINER TIP!\\pThrow {POKEBLOCK}S at wild POKéMON to make\\nthem less likely to flee.$'}
text:SafariZone_Southwest_RestHouseSign	{'body': '“Relieve your tired feet.”\\nREST HOUSE$'}
text:SafariZone_RestHouse_Youngster	{'body': "I don't have any {POKEBLOCK}S, but I caught\\na good number of POKéMON.\\pYou can improve your chances of making\\na catch by getting closer to them\\lbefore throwing a SAFARI BALL.$"}
text:SafariZone_RestHouse_PsychicM	{'body': "If you use {POKEBLOCK}S, wild POKéMON won't\\nbe so quick to run away.\\pIt's not much use to give {POKEBLOCK}S to\\nPOKéMON that don't flee easily.\\pLooking for Alolan forms? RAICHU lives\\nin the south. EXEGGUTOR lives in the\\lnorth and northwest; MAROWAK, north.$"}
text:SafariZone_RestHouse_FatMan	{'body': "A FEEDER draws nearby POKéMON\\nthat enjoy its {POKEBLOCK}'s flavor.\\pTry throwing the same flavor in battle.\\nA tasty treat helps keep them around!\\pTheir tastes stay the same when you\\nchange battle sets. The FEEDER's treat\\llasts for 100 steps.$"}
text:SafariZone_South_AreaOffLimits1	{'body': "This area is still under construction.\\nIt's off-limits, sorry!$"}
text:SafariZone_Southeast_ExpansionIsFinished	{'body': "The SAFARI ZONE's expansion project\\nis finished now.\\pWe hope you will enjoy the new area.$"}
text:SafariZone_South_AreaOffLimits2	{'body': "This area is still under construction.\\nIt's off-limits, sorry!$"}
text:SafariZone_Southeast_LittleGirl	{'body': "Wow! Whee! I haven't seen any of\\nthese POKéMON before!$"}
text:SafariZone_Southeast_FatMan	{'body': "The POKéMON in this area are all\\nnew to me.\\pAnd I'm allowed to catch these rare\\nPOKéMON! Too cool!$"}
text:SafariZone_Southeast_RichBoy	{'body': 'The POKéMON around here seem to be\\nfrom somewhere other than HOENN.$'}
text:SafariZone_Northeast_Boy	{'body': "I only have a couple SAFARI BALLS left.\\pI'm having a hard time trying to\\ndecide what I should catch.$"}
text:SafariZone_Northeast_Woman	{'body': 'I heard you can see PIKACHU in the\\nsouthern part of the SAFARI ZONE.\\lI may have wandered too far!$'}
text:SafariZone_Northeast_Girl	{'body': "Oh, boo!\\nI can't seem to catch anything!\\pI'll end up wasting the admission\\nprice if I don't catch something!$"}
text:AllAboardSeagallopNum	{'body': 'All right!\\nAll aboard SEAGALLOP HI-SPEED {STR_VAR_1}!$'}
text:SecretBase_TreeCanBeClimbed	{'body': 'If some vines drop down, this tree can\\nbe climbed.$'}
text:SecretBase_TreeUseSecretPower	{'body': 'If some vines drop down, this tree can\\nbe climbed.\\pUse the SECRET POWER?$'}
text:SecretBase_VineDroppedDown	{'body': 'A thick vine dropped down!$'}
text:SecretBase_ClumpOfGrass	{'body': 'If this clump of grass can be moved,\\nit might be possible to go inside.$'}
text:SecretBase_ClumpUseSecretPower	{'body': 'If this clump of grass can be moved,\\nit might be possible to go inside.\\pUse the SECRET POWER?$'}
text:SecretBase_DiscoveredSmallEntrance	{'directives': ('.include "data/text/secret_base_trainers.inc"',), 'body': 'Discovered a small entrance!$'}
text:SecretBase_AllDecorationsWillBeReturned	{'body': 'All decorations and furniture in your\\nSECRET BASE will be returned to your PC.\\pIs that okay?$'}
text:SecretBase_WantToRegisterSecretBase	{'body': "Do you want to register\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE?$"}
text:SecretBase_AlreadyRegisteredDelete	{'body': 'This data is already registered.\\nWould you like to delete it?$'}
text:SecretBase_TooManyBasesDeleteSome	{'body': 'Up to 10 locations can be registered.\\pDelete a location if you want to\\nregister another location.$'}
text:SecretBase_RegistrationCompleted	{'body': 'Registration completed.$'}
text:SecretBase_DataUnregistered	{'body': 'Data has been unregistered.$'}
text:SecretBase_BootUpPC	{'body': '{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$'}
text:SecretBase_WhatWouldYouLikeToDo	{'body': 'What would you like to do?$'}
text:SecretBase_RegistryInfo	{'body': 'Once registered, a SECRET BASE will not\\ndisappear unless the other TRAINER\\lmoves it to a different location.\\pIf a SECRET BASE is deleted from the\\nregistered list, another one may take\\lits place.\\pUp to ten SECRET BASE locations\\nmay be registered.$'}
text:SecretBase_BattleTowerShield	{'body': 'A shield of {STR_VAR_2} that marks winning\\n{STR_VAR_1} times in a row at the BATTLE TOWER.$'}
text:SecretBase_ToyTV	{'body': 'A realistic toy TV. It could be easily\\nmistaken for the real thing.$'}
text:SecretBase_SeedotTV	{'body': 'A toy TV shaped like a SEEDOT.\\nIt looks ready to roll away on its own…$'}
text:SecretBase_SkittyTV	{'body': 'A toy TV shaped like a SKITTY.\\nIt looks ready to stroll away…$'}
text:SecretBase_WouldYouLikeToMoveBases	{'body': 'You may only make one SECRET BASE.\\pWould you like to move from the SECRET\\nBASE near {STR_VAR_1}?$'}
text:SecretBase_MovingCompletedUseSecretPower	{'body': 'Moving completed.\\pWould you like to use the SECRET POWER?$'}
text:SecretBase_RetiredOwnerBattle	{'body': 'Welcome to my SECRET BASE!\\nMake yourself at home.\\pFor a DOUBLE BATTLE, visit a BATTLE\\nTENT or the CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT.$'}
text:Route111_MakingRoomUseTMToMakeYourOwn	{'body': "I'm making my own room here with\\nSECRET POWER. A partner that can\\llearn it can use it in the field.\\pWant an ULTRA BALL for the road?$"}
text:Route111_ExplainSecretPower	{'body': 'Any compatible partner can use\\nSECRET POWER in the field.\\pLook for marked trees, thick\\nbushes, and small indents in rock\\lwalls.$'}
text:Route111_DontWantThis	{'body': "Oh, you don't want this?\\nIf you change your mind, tell me, okay?$"}
text:Route111_DontHaveAnyRoom	{'body': "Oh, you don't have any room for this.\\pI'll hold on to it, so come back for it\\nanother time, okay?$"}
text:SecretBase_SmallIndentInWall	{'body': "There's a small indent in the wall.$"}
text:SecretBase_IndentUseSecretPower	{'body': "There's a small indent in the wall.\\pUse the SECRET POWER?$"}
text:SecretBase_DiscoveredSmallCavern	{'body': 'Discovered a small cavern!$'}
text:SecretBase_WantToMakeYourSecretBaseHere	{'body': 'Want to make your SECRET BASE here?$'}
text:CardKeyOpenedDoor	{'body': 'Bingo!\\nThe CARD KEY opened the door!$'}
text:ItNeedsCardKey	{'body': 'No!\\nIt needs a CARD KEY!$'}
text:TheDoorIsOpen	{'body': 'The door is open…$'}
text:ThisIsATestSignpostMsg	{'body': 'This is a test message.\\nThis is a signpost.$'}
text:TrainerHill_TeamNotReady	{'body': "The next team isn't ready.\\nPlease begin again at reception.$"}
text:Common_MissingHandoffItem	{'body': "Please bring the {STR_VAR_1}.\\nI can't accept it until you have it.$"}
text:gPokemartSign	{'body': '“Selected items for your convenience!”\\nPOKéMON MART$'}
text:gPokemonCenterSign	{'body': '“Rejuvenate your tired partners!”\\nPOKéMON CENTER$'}
text:gMomOrDadMightLikeThisProgram	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1} might like this program.\\n… … … … … … … … … … … … … … … …\\pBetter get going!$'}
text:gWhichFloorWouldYouLike	{'body': 'Welcome to LILYCOVE DEPARTMENT STORE.\\pWhich floor would you like?$'}
text:gSandstormIsVicious	{'body': "The sandstorm is vicious.\\nIt's impossible to keep going.$"}
text:gSelectWithoutRegisteredItem	{'body': 'An item in the BAG can be\\nregistered to SELECT for easy use.$'}
text:gPokemonTrainerSchoolEmail	{'body': "There's an e-mail from POKéMON TRAINER\\nSCHOOL.\\p… … … … … …\\pA POKéMON may learn up to four moves.\\pA TRAINER's expertise is tested on the\\nmove sets chosen for POKéMON.\\p… … … … … …$"}
text:gPlayerHouseBootPC	{'body': '{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$'}
text:gPokeblockLinkCanceled	{'body': 'The link was canceled.$'}
text:gUnusedNicknameReceivedPokemon	{'body': 'Want to give a nickname to\\nthe {STR_VAR_2} you received?$'}
text:gPlayerWhitedOut	{'body': '{PLAYER} is out of usable\\nPOKéMON!\\p{PLAYER} whited out!$'}
text:gFirstShouldRestoreMonsHealth	{'body': 'First, you should restore your\\nPOKéMON to full health.$'}
text:gMonsHealedShouldBuyPotions	{'body': "Your POKéMON have been healed\\nto perfect health.\\pIf your POKéMON's energy, HP,\\nis down, please come see us.\\pIf you're planning to go far in the\\nfield, you should buy some POTIONS\\lat the POKéMON MART.\\pWe hope you excel!$"}
text:gMonsHealed	{'body': 'Your POKéMON have been healed\\nto perfect health.\\pWe hope you excel!$'}
text:gHadQuiteAnExperienceTakeRest	{'body': 'MOM: {PLAYER}!\\nWelcome home.\\pIt sounds like you had quite\\nan experience.\\pMaybe you should take a quick\\nrest.$'}
text:gMomExplainHPGetPotions	{'body': "MOM: Oh, good! You and your\\nPOKéMON are looking great.\\pI just heard from {STR_VAR_1}.\\pHe said that POKéMON's energy is\\nmeasured in HP.\\pIf your POKéMON lose their HP,\\nyou can restore them at any\\lPOKéMON CENTER.\\pIf you're going to travel far away,\\nthe smart TRAINER stocks up on\\lPOTIONS at the POKéMON MART.\\pMake me proud, honey!\\pTake care!$"}
text:gRegisteredTrainerinPokeNav	{'body': 'Registered {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}\\nin the POKéNAV.$'}
text:gComeBackWithSecretPower	{'body': "Do you know the TM SECRET POWER?\\pOur group, we love the TM SECRET\\nPOWER.\\pOne of our members will give it to you.\\nCome back and show me if you get it.\\pWe'll accept you as a member and sell\\nyou good stuff in secrecy.$"}
text:gPokerusExplanation	{'body': 'Your POKéMON may be infected with\\nPOKéRUS.\\pLittle is known about the POKéRUS\\nexcept that they are microscopic life-\\lforms that attach to POKéMON.\\pWhile infected, POKéMON are said to\\ngrow exceptionally well.$'}
text:gDoorOpenedFarAway	{'body': 'It sounded as if a door opened\\nsomewhere far away.$'}
text:gBigHoleInTheWall	{'body': 'There is a big hole in the wall.$'}
text:gSorryWirelessClubAdjustments	{'body': "I'm terribly sorry.\\nThe POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB is\\lundergoing adjustments now.$"}
text:gUndergoingAdjustments	{'body': 'It appears to be undergoing\\nadjustments…$'}
text:gSorryTradeCenterInspections	{'body': "I'm terribly sorry. The TRADE CENTER\\nis undergoing inspections.$"}
text:gSorryRecordCornerPreparation	{'body': "I'm terribly sorry. The RECORD CORNER\\nis under preparation.$"}
text:gPlayerHandedOverTheItem	{'body': '{PLAYER} handed over the\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:gThankYouForAccessingMysteryGift	{'body': 'Thank you for accessing the\\nMYSTERY GIFT System.$'}
text:gPlayerFoundOneTMHM	{'body': '{PLAYER} found one {STR_VAR_1}\\n{STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:gPlayerFoundTMHMs	{'body': '{PLAYER} found {STR_VAR_3} {STR_VAR_1}\\n{STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:gSudowoodo_Attacked	{'body': "The weird tree doesn't like the\\nWAILMER PAIL!\\pThe weird tree attacked!$"}
text:gLegendaryResting	{'body': 'The legendary has retreated to rest.\\nLeave this area and return to try again.$'}
text:gLegendaryFlewAway	{'body': 'The {STR_VAR_1} has retreated.\\nLeave this area and return to try again.$'}
text:gWantWhichFloor	{'body': 'Which floor do you want?$'}
text:MonFlewAway	{'body': 'The {STR_VAR_1} is gone.\\nIt will not return.$'}
