text:gFameCheckerFlavorTextOriginObjectName_Giovanni1	{'body': 'SCIENTIST$'}
text:gFameCheckerFlavorTextOriginObjectName_Giovanni2	{'body': 'SCIENTIST$'}
text:gFameCheckerFlavorTextOriginObjectName_Giovanni3	{'body': 'GIOVANNI$'}
text:gFameCheckerFlavorTextOriginObjectName_Giovanni4	{'body': 'MAN$'}
text:gFameCheckerFlavorTextOriginObjectName_Giovanni5	{'body': 'GIDEON$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureBrock	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: PEWTER GYM\\nLEADER BROCK!\\pBROCK rarely laughs, but is said to\\nbe unable to stop if he starts.$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureMisty	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: CERULEAN GYM\\nLEADER MISTY!\\pMISTY is said to worship LORELEI\\nof the ELITE FOUR.$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureLtSurge	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: VERMILION GYM\\nLEADER LT. SURGE!\\pLT. SURGE is rumored to have been\\na pilot while home in America.\\pHe used the electricity generated\\nby POKéMON to power his plane.$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureErika	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: CELADON GYM\\nLEADER ERIKA!\\pRumor has it that if you peek into\\nCELADON GYM, you can often\\lsee ERIKA snoozing.$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureKoga	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: FUCHSIA GYM\\nLEADER KOGA!\\pKOGA is said to have a thorough\\nknowledge of medicine.\\pHe even concocts medicine to nurse\\nhis POKéMON to health.$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureSabrina	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: SAFFRON GYM\\nLEADER SABRINA!\\pPeople say that SABRINA can\\ncommunicate with her POKéMON\\lduring battle without speaking.$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureBlaine	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: CINNABAR GYM\\nLEADER BLAINE!\\pBLAINE is said to remove his dark\\nshades only when he is thinking up\\lnew quiz questions.$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureLorelei	{'body': "POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature:\\nELITE FOUR's LORELEI!\\pKnown for her logical, calculated,\\nand cool battling style, LORELEI\\lhas a surprising secret!$"}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureBruno	{'body': "POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature:\\nELITE FOUR's BRUNO!\\pBRUNO apparently joined the ELITE\\nFOUR out of his burning ambition to\\lbattle the best TRAINERS.$"}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureAgatha	{'body': "POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature:\\nELITE FOUR's AGATHA!\\pIn her youth, AGATHA and PROF.\\nOAK were rivals who vied for\\lsupremacy as TRAINERS.$"}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureLance	{'body': "POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature:\\nELITE FOUR's LANCE!\\pLANCE's grandfather is thought to\\nbe the elder of a famous clan of\\ldragon masters.$"}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureProfOak	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: PROF. OAK,\\nthe POKéMON Researcher!\\pPROF. OAK reportedly lives with his\\ngrandchildren DAISY and {RIVAL}.$'}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureDaisyOak	{'body': "This is a POKéMON JOURNAL from\\nyears ago…\\pPOKéMON JOURNAL\\nCONTEST Special!\\pThe Spring POKéMON CONTEST's\\nGrand Champion is DAISY OAK of\\lPALLET TOWN!$"}
text:PokemonJournal_SpecialFeatureMrFuji	{'body': 'POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature:\\nMR. FUJI of POKéMON HOUSE!\\pEditor: The shy MR. FUJI turned\\ndown our interview requests.\\pHe is a kindly man who is adored\\nand respected in LAVENDER TOWN.$'}
text:CeladonCity_GameCorner_TryPokemonPrinter	{'body': "It's a POKéMON PRINTER!\\pIt can put a print of your POKéMON\\non the back of your TRAINER CARD.\\pIt costs only ¥50.\\nWould you like to try it?$"}
text:CeladonCity_GameCorner_DontHaveEnoughMoney	{'body': "You don't have enough money.$"}
text:CeladonCity_GameCorner_ChoosePrintType	{'body': 'Please choose the print type.$'}
text:CeladonCity_GameCorner_BigSmileForPhoto	{'body': 'A big smile for the photo, please!\\nThree… Two… One…\\pFlash!$'}
text:CeladonCity_GameCorner_PrintIsReadyCheckTrainerCard	{'body': 'Your POKéMON print is ready!\\nCheck your TRAINER CARD.$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_WishICouldShowOffStickers	{'body': 'Giggle…\\nI collected a ton of STICKERS.\\lI wish I could show them off…$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_GiveYouStickerIfYouBrag	{'body': "Oh, excellent!\\nYou've come to the right place!\\pLook, look! See? See?\\nThese are my STICKERS!\\lLook how many I got!\\pI bet you want some.\\nI bet you do!\\pI'll give a STICKER if you can tell\\nme something awesome about\\lyourself.\\pWhat will you brag about?$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_BragAboutSomethingForMe	{'body': "Brag about something for me.\\nI'll give you a STICKER.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_BragAboutWhatToday	{'body': 'Oh, hi!\\nHere comes the braggart.\\pWhat are you going to brag about\\ntoday?$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowHoFLowest	{'body': "Oh, wow, you made it into the\\nHALL OF FAME.\\pThat's pretty good, yup!\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowHoFLow	{'body': "Oh, wow, you've entered the\\nHALL OF FAME often!\\pThat's impressive, yup!\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowHoFHigh	{'body': "Whoa! You've made it into the\\nHALL OF FAME that often?\\lThat's seriously incredible, yup!\\pYou own the POKéMON LEAGUE!\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowHoFHighest	{'body': "No way! You've gone into the\\nHALL OF FAME that many times?\\pYou're beyond incredible, yup!\\nThat's it, I have to give you this.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_HoFStickerApplied	{'body': 'The HALL OF FAME STICKER was\\napplied to the TRAINER CARD.$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_ComeBackWithBetterStoryHoF	{'body': 'Hmm…\\pCome back with a better story next\\ntime, okay?$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_LivingLegendHoF	{'body': "Oh, no, no can do.\\pYou're practically a living legend.\\nI have no SITCKERS left to give.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowEggsLowest	{'body': "Oh, wow, there are POKéMON EGGS?\\nI didn't know that!\\pThat's pretty good, yup!\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowEggsLow	{'body': "You've hatched that many EGGS?\\nYou really must like them!\\pThat's impressive, yup!\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowEggsHigh	{'body': "Whoa! You've hatched a whole\\nbunch of EGGS!\\pYou're an EGG-hatching machine!\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowEggsHighest	{'body': "Wh… You hatched that many EGGS?\\pWhat's behind your love of EGGS?\\nIt's beyond incredible, yup!\\pYou're too awesome, I tell you.\\nThat's it, I have to give you this.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_EggStickerApplied	{'body': 'The EGG STICKER was applied\\nto the TRAINER CARD.$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_ComeBackWithBetterStoryEggs	{'body': 'Hmm…\\pCome back with a better story next\\ntime, okay?$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_LivingLegendEggs	{'body': "Oh, no, no can do.\\pYou're practically a living legend.\\nI have no SITCKERS left to give.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowLinkWinsLowest	{'body': "Oh, wow, you've had success\\nlink battling?\\pYou're pretty strong, yup!\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowLinkWinsLow	{'body': "You've beaten your friends a lot\\nlink battling, huh?\\pYou're impressively strong, yup!\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowLinkWinsHigh	{'body': "Whoa! You've beaten your friends\\na frightful number of times.\\pHave you lost friends over this?\\nI'll give you one of these.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_WowLinkWinsHighest	{'body': "Wh… Wickedly whoa!\\nYou've won mind-blowingly often!\\pIt just knocks me out thinking\\nabout how tough you are.\\pYou're the stuff of nightmares!\\nThat's it, I have to give you this.$"}
text:FourIsland_House2_VictoryStickerApplied	{'body': 'The VICTORY STICKER was applied\\nto the TRAINER CARD.$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_ComeBackWithBetterStoryLinkWins	{'body': 'Hmm…\\pCome back with a better story next\\ntime, okay?$'}
text:FourIsland_House2_LivingLegendLinkWins	{'body': "Oh, no, no can do.\\pYou're practically a living legend.\\nI have no SITCKERS left to give.$"}
text:DayCare_ImDaycareManSpeakToMyWife	{'body': "I'm the DAY-CARE MAN.\\pI help take care of the precious\\nPOKéMON of TRAINERS.\\pIf you'd like me to raise your\\nPOKéMON, have a word with my wife.$"}
text:DayCare_DoYouWantEgg	{'body': "Ah, it's you!\\pWe were raising your POKéMON, and\\nmy goodness, were we surprised!\\pYour POKéMON had an EGG!\\pWe don't know how it got there,\\nbut your POKéMON had it.\\pYou do want it, yes?$"}
text:DayCare_YourMonIsDoingFine	{'body': "Ah, it's you! Good to see you.\\nYour {STR_VAR_1}'s doing fine.$"}
text:DayCare_IllKeepIt	{'body': "Well then, I'll keep it.\\nThanks!$"}
text:DayCare_YouHaveNoRoomForIt	{'body': "You have no room for it…\\nCome back when you've made room.$"}
text:DayCare_ReceivedEgg	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the EGG from\\nthe DAY-CARE MAN.$'}
text:DayCare_TakeGoodCareOfIt	{'body': 'Take good care of it.$'}
text:DayCare_SeeWifeIfYouWantToPickUpMon	{'body': 'ポケモンを\u3000ひきとりたい\u3000ときは\\nばさんに\u3000いって\u3000おくれ$'}
text:DayCare_YourMonsAreDoingFine	{'body': "Ah, it's you! Your {STR_VAR_1} and\\n{STR_VAR_2} are doing fine.$"}
text:DayCare_IWillKeepDoYouWantIt	{'body': 'I really will keep it.\\nYou do want this, yes?$'}
text:DayCare_WouldYouLikeUsToRaiseMon	{'body': "I'm the DAY-CARE LADY.\\pWe can raise POKéMON for you.\\pWould you like us to raise one?$"}
text:DayCare_WhichMonShouldWeRaise	{'body': 'Which POKéMON should we raise for\\nyou?$'}
text:DayCare_WellRaiseYourMon	{'body': "Fine, we'll raise your {STR_VAR_1}\\nfor a while.\\pCome back for it later.$"}
text:DayCare_WeCanRaiseOneMore	{'body': 'We can raise two of your POKéMON.\\pWould you like us to raise one\\nmore POKéMON for you?$'}
text:DayCare_HusbandWasLookingForYou	{'body': 'My husband was looking for you.$'}
text:DayCare_FineThenComeAgain	{'body': 'Oh, fine, then.\\nCome again.$'}
text:DayCare_NotEnoughMoney	{'body': "You don't have enough money…$"}
text:DayCare_TakeOtherOneBackToo	{'body': 'Will you take back the other one,\\ntoo?$'}
text:DayCare_ComeAgain	{'body': 'Fine.\\nCome again.$'}
text:DayCare_GoodToSeeYou	{'body': "Ah, it's you!\\nGood to see you.\\pYour POKéMON can only be doing\\ngood!$"}
text:DayCare_YourMonHasGrownXLevels	{'body': 'By level, your {STR_VAR_1} has\\ngrown by {STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:DayCare_YourPartyIsFull	{'body': 'Your POKéMON party is full.\\nMake room, then come see me.$'}
text:DayCare_TakeBackWhichMon	{'body': 'どっちの\u3000ポケモンを\u3000ひきとるかい？$'}
text:DayCare_ItWillCostX	{'body': 'If you want your {STR_VAR_1} back,\\nit will cost ¥{STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:DayCare_HeresYourMon	{'body': "Perfect!\\nHere's your POKéMON.$"}
text:DayCare_TookBackMon	{'body': '{PLAYER} took back {STR_VAR_1} from\\nthe DAY-CARE LADY.$'}
text:DayCare_YouHaveJustOneMon	{'body': 'Oh? But you have just one\\nPOKéMON.\\pCome back another time.$'}
text:DayCare_TakeYourMonBack	{'body': 'Will you take your POKéMON back?$'}
text:DayCare_WhatWillYouBattleWith	{'body': 'If you leave me that POKéMON,\\nwhat will you battle with?\\pCome back another time.$'}
text:DayCare_Huh	{'body': 'Huh?$'}
text:gOtherNewName	{'body': 'NEW NAME$'}
