text:gControlsGuide_Intro	{'body': 'The various buttons will be explained in\\nthe order of their importance.$'}
text:gControlsGuide_DPad	{'body': 'Moves the main character.\\nAlso used to choose various data\\nheadings.$'}
text:gControlsGuide_AButton	{'body': 'Used to confirm a choice, check\\nthings, chat, and scroll text.$'}
text:gControlsGuide_BButton	{'body': 'Used to exit, cancel a choice,\\nand cancel a mode.$'}
text:gControlsGuide_StartButton	{'body': 'Press this button to open the\\nMENU.$'}
text:gControlsGuide_SelectButton	{'body': 'Used to shift items and to use\\na registered item.$'}
text:gControlsGuide_LRButtons	{'body': 'If you need help playing the\\ngame, or on how to do things,\\npress the L or R Button.$'}
text:gOakSpeech_AskPlayerGender	{'body': 'Now tell me. Are you a boy?\\nOr are you a girl?$'}
text:gPikachuIntro_Page1	{'body': 'In the world which you are about to\\nenter, you will embark on a grand\\nadventure with you as the hero.\\n\\nSpeak to people and check things\\nwherever you go, be it towns, roads,\\nor caves. Gather information and\\nhints from every source.$'}
text:gPikachuIntro_Page2	{'body': 'New paths will open to you by helping\\npeople in need, overcoming challenges,\\nand solving mysteries.\\n\\nAt times, you will be challenged by\\nothers and attacked by wild creatures.\\nBe brave and keep pushing on.$'}
text:gPikachuIntro_Page3	{'body': 'Through your adventure, we hope\\nthat you will interact with all sorts\\nof people and achieve personal growth.\\nThat is our biggest objective.\\n\\nPress the A Button, and let your\\nadventure begin!$'}
text:gOakSpeech_WelcomeToTheWorld	{'body': 'Hello, there!\\nGlad to meet you!\\pWelcome to the world of POKéMON!\\pMy name is OAK.\\pPeople affectionately refer to me\\nas the POKéMON PROFESSOR.\\p$'}
text:gOakSpeech_ThisWorld	{'body': 'This world…$'}
text:gOakSpeech_IsInhabitedFarAndWide	{'body': '…is inhabited far and wide by\\ncreatures called POKéMON.\\p$'}
text:gOakSpeech_IStudyPokemon	{'body': 'For some people, POKéMON are pets.\\nOthers use them for battling.\\pAs for myself…\\pI study POKéMON as a profession.\\p$'}
text:gOakSpeech_TellMeALittleAboutYourself	{'body': 'But first, tell me a little about\\nyourself.\\p$'}
text:gOakSpeech_YourNameWhatIsIt	{'body': "Let's begin with your name.\\nWhat is it?\\p$"}
text:gOakSpeech_SoYourNameIsPlayer	{'body': 'Right…\\nSo your name is {PLAYER}.$'}
text:gOakSpeech_WhatWasHisName	{'body': "This is my grandson.\\pHe's been your rival since you both\\nwere babies.\\p…Erm, what was his name now?$"}
text:gOakSpeech_YourRivalsNameWhatWasIt	{'body': "Your rival's name, what was it now?$"}
text:gOakSpeech_ConfirmRivalName	{'body': '…Er, was it {RIVAL}?$'}
text:gOakSpeech_RememberRivalsName	{'body': "That's right! I remember now!\\nHis name is {RIVAL}!\\p$"}
text:gOakSpeech_LetsGo	{'body': "{PLAYER}!\\pYour very own POKéMON legend is\\nabout to unfold!\\pA world of dreams and adventures\\nwith POKéMON awaits! Let's go!$"}
text:Route3_ColtonRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hey!\\nI saw you in VIRIDIAN FOREST!$'}
text:Route3_BenRematchIntro	{'body': "Hi! I like shorts!\\nThey're comfy and easy to wear!\\pYou should be wearing shorts, too!$"}
text:Route3_JaniceRematchIntro	{'body': "Excuse me!\\nYou keep looking at me, don't you?$"}
text:Route3_GregRematchIntro	{'body': "You're a TRAINER, aren't you?\\nLet's get with it right away!$"}
text:Route3_SallyRematchIntro	{'body': 'That look you give me…\\nIt intrigues me so!$'}
text:Route3_CalvinRematchIntro	{'body': "Hey! What's wrong with you?\\nYou're still not wearing shorts!$"}
text:Route3_JamesRematchIntro	{'body': "I'll battle you with the POKéMON\\nI started raising.$"}
text:Route3_RobinRematchIntro	{'body': 'Eek!\\nDid you push me?$'}
text:Route4_CrissyRematchIntro	{'body': 'I always catch mushroom POKéMON\\non MT. MOON.$'}
text:Route6_RickyRematchIntro	{'body': "Oh! You're that nosy kid who\\neavesdropped on us!$"}
text:Route6_NancyRematchIntro	{'body': "Excuse me! Didn't I tell you that\\nthis is a private conversation?\\pYou shouldn't be listening in,\\nyou uncouth person!$"}
text:Route6_KeigoRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm trying to find something good\\nthat's not a BUG POKéMON, but…$"}
text:Route6_JeffRematchIntro	{'body': 'Huh?\\nYou want to go with me again?$'}
text:Route6_IsabelleRematchIntro	{'body': "Me?\\nWell, okay. I'll play this once.$"}
text:Route6_ElijahRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hey, long time!\\nHave you gotten better?$'}
text:Route8_AidanRematchIntro	{'body': 'You are good at POKéMON, but how\\nis your chemistry grade?$'}
text:Route8_StanRematchIntro	{'body': "All right!\\nLet's play another game!$"}
text:Route8_GlennRematchIntro	{'body': 'You need strategy to win at\\nbattling.\\pAre you following my advice?$'}
text:Route8_PaigeRematchIntro	{'body': "I've collected many NIDORAN.\\nI don't want them to evolve, but…$"}
text:Route8_LeslieRematchIntro	{'body': 'School is fun, but I still think\\nPOKéMON are fun, too.$'}
text:Route8_AndreaRematchIntro	{'body': 'MEOWTH and PERSIAN are so cute,\\nmeow, meow, meow!$'}
text:Route8_MeganRematchIntro	{'body': 'We may look silly standing here\\nlike this, but I can still battle.$'}
text:Route8_RichRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm a rambling, gaming dude!\\nI'm on a winning streak!$"}
text:Route8_JuliaRematchIntro	{'body': "What's a cute, round, and fluffy\\nPOKéMON?\\pYou already know, don't you?$"}
text:Route8_RicardoRematchIntro	{'body': "My bike's still acting up, man.$"}
text:Route8_JarenRematchIntro	{'body': "Okay, kid!\\nDon't expect mercy this time!$"}
text:Route8_EliRematchIntro	{'body': 'ELI: Our twin power became even\\nbetter!$'}
text:Route8_AnneRematchIntro	{'body': 'ANNE: Our twin power powered up!$'}
text:Route9_AliciaRematchIntro	{'body': "We're to battle again?\\nThis time, you're mine!$"}
text:Route9_ChrisRematchIntro	{'body': "I haven't forgotten you were with\\nthose good-looking POKéMON.$"}
text:Route9_DrewRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm taking ROCK TUNNEL to go to\\nLAVENDER…\\pBut I keep getting stopped by\\neveryone along the way…$"}
text:Route9_CaitlinRematchIntro	{'body': "Don't you dare patronize me today!\\nWe're playing for keeps!$"}
text:Route9_JeremyRematchIntro	{'body': 'Bwahaha!\\nGreat! I was bored again, eh!$'}
text:Route9_BriceRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hahaha!\\nA little toughie, as always!$'}
text:Route9_BrentRematchIntro	{'body': 'I got up early every day to train\\nmy POKéMON from cocoons!$'}
text:Route9_AlanRematchIntro	{'body': "Hahahaha!\\nI'll win this time!$"}
text:Route9_ConnerRematchIntro	{'body': 'Go win, my super BUG POKéMON!$'}
text:Route10_MarkRematchIntro	{'body': "Wow, you came here again?\\nMaybe you're a POKéMANIAC, too?\\lWant to see my collection?$"}
text:Route10_ClarkRematchIntro	{'body': "Ha-hahah-ah-ha!\\nI can't stop sneezing!$"}
text:Route10_HermanRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hi, kid!\\nDid I show you my POKéMON?$'}
text:Route10_HeidiRematchIntro	{'body': 'I went out to a POKéMON GYM again.\\p…But I lost as usual.$'}
text:Route10_TrentRematchIntro	{'body': "Ah!\\nThis mountain air is delicious!\\lIt's so good, I can't leave!$"}
text:Route10_CarolRematchIntro	{'body': "My head is starting to spin.\\nI've been hiking for too long…$"}
text:Route11_HugoRematchIntro	{'body': 'Win, lose, or draw!\\nNow for our rematch!$'}
text:Route11_JasperRematchIntro	{'body': "Competing is the ultimate thrill.\\nI still can't get enough!$"}
text:Route11_EddieRematchIntro	{'body': "You know, right?\\nLet's go, but don't cheat!$"}
text:Route11_BraxtonRematchIntro	{'body': "Hi, there!\\pBut be careful!\\nI'm still laying down some cables!$"}
text:Route11_DillonRematchIntro	{'body': 'I became a TRAINER a while ago.\\nBut, I think I can win.$'}
text:Route11_DirkRematchIntro	{'body': "Fwahaha!\\nI have never lost!\\p…And if I did, I've forgotten all\\nabout it!$"}
text:Route11_DarianRematchIntro	{'body': 'I have never won before…\\pPerhaps I am destined to remain\\nthat way…$'}
text:Route11_YasuRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm the best in my class.\\nI train every morning and night!$"}
text:Route11_BernieRematchIntro	{'body': 'Keep your eyes out for live wires!$'}
text:Route11_DaveRematchIntro	{'body': 'I raised my POKéMON carefully.\\nThey should be ready by now.\\lThis time, they should win, too.$'}
text:Route12_NedRematchIntro	{'body': 'Yeah!\\nI got a bite, here!\\lTh-this might be the real thing!$'}
text:Route12_ChipRematchIntro	{'body': "You're finally here.\\nFishing is a waiting game.$"}
text:Route12_JustinRematchIntro	{'body': "Still can't find a MOON STONE…\\nHave you found one?$"}
text:Route12_LucaRematchIntro	{'body': "Electricity has always been my\\nspecialty.\\pI don't know a thing about POKéMON\\nof the sea, though.$"}
text:Route12_HankRematchIntro	{'body': 'The FISHING FOOL vs. POKéMON KID!\\nAnother round, fight!$'}
text:Route12_ElliotRematchIntro	{'body': "I love fishing, don't get me wrong.\\nBut, I wish I had more work…\\l…It's hard to give up fishing!$"}
text:Route12_AndrewRematchIntro	{'body': "What's catching?\\pYou'll never know unless you beat\\nme!$"}
text:Route12_JesRematchIntro	{'body': "JES: I'll win here today and\\npropose to my GIA.$"}
text:Route12_GiaRematchIntro	{'body': "GIA: Hey, JES…\\nI've been waiting a long time now.\\pIf we win today, I'll marry you!$"}
text:Route13_SebastianRematchIntro	{'body': 'My bird POKéMON remember you!$'}
text:Route13_SusieRematchIntro	{'body': "I want to be the best TRAINER \\nwhile I'm a kid!$"}
text:Route13_ValerieRematchIntro	{'body': 'Wow!\\nYou got more cool BADGES!$'}
text:Route13_GwenRematchIntro	{'body': 'My cutely grown POKéMON wish to\\nbecome reacquainted with you.$'}
text:Route13_AlmaRematchIntro	{'body': 'I cleaned out my savings and\\nbought more CARBOS.$'}
text:Route13_PerryRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm not going to lose this time.\\nThe wind's blowing my way!$"}
text:Route13_LolaRematchIntro	{'body': "Oh, you're back?\\pSure, I'll play again with you,\\nsweetie.$"}
text:Route13_SheilaRematchIntro	{'body': "Can't you forget that you battled\\nwith me?$"}
text:Route13_JaredRematchIntro	{'body': "What're you starin' at?$"}
text:Route13_RobertRematchIntro	{'body': "I always go with bird POKéMON.\\nI've dedicated myself to them.$"}
text:Route14_CarterRematchIntro	{'body': 'I used TMs to teach good moves\\nto my POKéMON.$'}
text:Route14_MitchRematchIntro	{'body': 'My bird POKéMON should be ready\\nfor battle this time.$'}
text:Route14_BeckRematchIntro	{'body': 'Are you using TMs on POKéMON?\\nJust holding them is useless.$'}
text:Route14_MarlonRematchIntro	{'body': "Have you taught your bird POKéMON\\nhow to FLY?\\pYou'll be able to soar with it into\\nthe sky! Give it a try.$"}
text:Route14_DonaldRematchIntro	{'body': "The legend of the winged mirages…\\nYou've heard it, right?$"}
text:Route14_BennyRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm really not into it, but okay.\\nLet's go!$"}
text:Route14_LukasRematchIntro	{'body': "Hey!\\nI remember you!\\pC'mon, c'mon.\\nLet's go, let's go, let's go!$"}
text:Route14_IsaacRematchIntro	{'body': "You're here again, huh?\\nShut up and battle.$"}
text:Route14_GeraldRematchIntro	{'body': "We've been riding here because of\\nthe wide-open spaces.$"}
text:Route14_MalikRematchIntro	{'body': 'POKéMON battle, right?\\nCool! Rumble!$'}
text:Route14_KiriRematchIntro	{'body': 'KIRI: JAN, I hope we win today.$'}
text:Route14_JanRematchIntro	{'body': "JAN: KIRI, here we go!\\nLet's win for sure this time!$"}
text:Route15_KindraRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm going to keep battling with the\\nPOKéMON I got in trades.$"}
text:Route15_BeckyRematchIntro	{'body': "You look gentle, so I think I can\\nbeat you.\\pI'll give it one more go!$"}
text:Route15_EdwinRematchIntro	{'body': "When I whistle, bird POKéMON\\ngather around.\\pThey're amazingly cute!$"}
text:Route15_ChesterRematchIntro	{'body': "Hmm? My birds are shivering!\\nWait, aren't you that TRAINER…$"}
text:Route15_GraceRematchIntro	{'body': "Oh, you're a little cutie!\\nSo like a darling POKéMON!\\lI remember you now!$"}
text:Route15_OliviaRematchIntro	{'body': "I raise POKéMON for protection\\nbecause I live alone.\\pThat hasn't changed.$"}
text:Route15_ErnestRematchIntro	{'body': "Hey, kid! C'mon!\\nI got these off some loser!$"}
text:Route15_AlexRematchIntro	{'body': 'Fork over all your cash when you\\nlose to me, kid!$'}
text:Route15_CeliaRematchIntro	{'body': "What's cool and happening?\\nTrading POKéMON, of course.$"}
text:Route15_YazminRematchIntro	{'body': 'Want to play with my POKéMON\\nagain?$'}
text:Route15_MyaRematchIntro	{'body': "MYA: Hi, we keep meeting,\\ndon't we?\\pHelp me train my little brother\\nagain?$"}
text:Route15_RonRematchIntro	{'body': "RON: My sister's gotten more\\npowerful…$"}
text:Route16_LaoRematchIntro	{'body': 'What do you want?$'}
text:Route16_KojiRematchIntro	{'body': 'Nice BIKE!\\nHand it over quick!$'}
text:Route16_LukeRematchIntro	{'body': "Come out and play, little mouse.\\nI'll treat you right!$"}
text:Route16_HideoRematchIntro	{'body': "Hey, wait a second!\\nDon't call me and then run away!$"}
text:Route16_CamronRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm feeling hungry and mean!\\nI really need a punching bag!$"}
text:Route16_RubenRematchIntro	{'body': "Hey, there!\\nWe'll have ourselves a good time!$"}
text:Route16_JedRematchIntro	{'body': 'JED: Are you here to see our\\nlove, which knows no bounds?$'}
text:Route16_LeaRematchIntro	{'body': 'LEA: Sometimes, the intensity of\\nour love scares me.$'}
text:Route17_RaulRematchIntro	{'body': "I told you, there's no getting rich\\nquick in battling kids.$"}
text:Route17_IsaiahRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm mighty proud of my bod, kiddo.\\nCome on!$"}
text:Route17_VirgilRematchIntro	{'body': 'You out for a stroll?$'}
text:Route17_BillyRematchIntro	{'body': "We're BIKERS!\\nWe rule the roads, man!$"}
text:Route17_NikolasRematchIntro	{'body': "VOLTORB's going to seriously\\nelectrify you today!$"}
text:Route17_ZeekRematchIntro	{'body': "I leveled up my POKéMON, but it\\nabsolutely won't evolve. Why?$"}
text:Route17_JamalRematchIntro	{'body': 'Gaah! I really need to exercise\\nand seriously trim some flab!$'}
text:Route17_CoreyRematchIntro	{'body': 'Be a rebel!$'}
text:Route17_JaxonRematchIntro	{'body': "Yep, that's a nice BIKE!\\nHow's it handle?$"}
text:Route17_WilliamRematchIntro	{'body': "Get lost, kid!\\nI'm bushed!$"}
text:Route18_WiltonRematchIntro	{'body': "I've been checking every grassy\\narea for new POKéMON.\\pBut it's not always easy…$"}
text:Route18_RamiroRematchIntro	{'body': 'Koorukukukoo!\\nIs my birdcall getting better?$'}
text:Route18_JacobRematchIntro	{'body': "I warned you before, this is my\\nturf!\\pI don't want you coming around.$"}
text:Route19_RichardRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm almost warmed up to go\\nout for a swim.$"}
text:Route19_ReeceRematchIntro	{'body': 'Wait! Slow down!\\nWhat if you have a heart attack?$'}
text:Route19_MatthewRematchIntro	{'body': "I love swimming!\\nI guess you're the surfing type.$"}
text:Route19_DouglasRematchIntro	{'body': "What's beyond the horizon?\\nHave you seen?$"}
text:Route19_DavidRematchIntro	{'body': 'I tried diving for POKéMON again,\\nbut it was a no-go like before.$'}
text:Route19_TonyRematchIntro	{'body': 'I look at the sea to forget all\\nthe bad things that happened.\\p…Like losing to you the last time!$'}
text:Route19_AnyaRematchIntro	{'body': 'You always get to ride your\\nPOKéMON…\\pIt looks so relaxing.\\nCan I have it if I win?$'}
text:Route19_AliceRematchIntro	{'body': "Swimming's great!\\nSunburns aren't!$"}
text:Route19_AxleRematchIntro	{'body': "These waters are treacherous!\\nYou shouldn't come back here!$"}
text:Route19_ConnieRematchIntro	{'body': "I swam here with my friends…\\nI'm tired…\\lMust we really battle again?$"}
text:Route19_LiaRematchIntro	{'body': 'LIA: You know my brother just\\nbecame a TRAINER, right?\\pI want to make him better, so I\\nneed your help again.$'}
text:Route19_LucRematchIntro	{'body': "LUC: My big sis taught me all\\nabout POKéMON.\\pI wonder if I'm better?$"}
text:Route20_BarryRematchIntro	{'body': 'The water is shallow here.\\nThere are many people swimming.$'}
text:Route20_ShirleyRematchIntro	{'body': "Are you jealous that I'm\\nvacationing on SEAFOAM?$"}
text:Route20_TiffanyRematchIntro	{'body': 'I love floating with the fishes\\nhere among the waves.$'}
text:Route20_IreneRematchIntro	{'body': 'Were you on vacation, too?$'}
text:Route20_DeanRematchIntro	{'body': "Check out my physique!\\pIt's even more buff than ever\\nbefore!$"}
text:Route20_DarrinRematchIntro	{'body': "Why are you riding a POKéMON?\\nHaven't you learned to swim yet?$"}
text:Route20_RogerRematchIntro	{'body': 'I rode my bird POKéMON here.$'}
text:Route20_NoraRematchIntro	{'body': "My boyfriend gave me big pearls.\\nAnd, they've grown bigger!$"}
text:Route20_MissyRematchIntro	{'body': "I swam here from CINNABAR ISLAND.\\nIt wasn't easy, like I said.$"}
text:Route20_MelissaRematchIntro	{'body': 'CINNABAR, in the west, has a LAB\\nfor POKéMON.\\pMy daddy works there.$'}
text:Route21_North_RonaldRematchIntro	{'body': 'You want to know if the fish are\\nbiting?$'}
text:Route21_North_WadeRematchIntro	{'body': 'I got a big haul again!\\nWanna go for it once more?$'}
text:Route21_North_SpencerRematchIntro	{'body': 'The sea cleanses my body and soul!$'}
text:Route21_North_CueBallRematchIntro	{'body': 'きょうも\u3000およぎに\\nきちまったぜ$'}
text:Route21_South_JackRematchIntro	{'body': "I caught my POKéMON at sea.\\nAnd that's where I train them.$"}
text:Route21_South_JeromeRematchIntro	{'body': "Right now, I'm in another triathlon\\nmeet!$"}
text:Route21_South_RolandRematchIntro	{'body': 'Ahh!\\nFeel the sun and the wind!$'}
text:Route21_South_ClaudeRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hey, cut it out already.\\nYou always scare away the fish!$'}
text:Route21_South_NolanRematchIntro	{'body': 'Keep me company till I get a hit.$'}
text:Route21_North_LilRematchIntro	{'body': "LIL: Huh? A battle again?\\nIAN, can't you do it alone?$"}
text:Route21_North_IanRematchIntro	{'body': 'IAN: My sis is still a slob.\\nHelp me get her into shape!$'}
text:Route25_JoeyRematchIntro	{'body': "I won't lose while I'm here!$"}
text:Route25_DanRematchIntro	{'body': 'Dad took me to a great party on\\nthe S.S. ANNE at VERMILION CITY.$'}
text:Route25_FlintRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm a cool guy.\\nI've got a girlfriend!\\pI'll show her how cool I am for\\nsure this time!$"}
text:Route25_KelseyRematchIntro	{'body': "Hi!\\nMy boyfriend is cool!\\lMy conditioning's good today!$"}
text:Route25_ChadRematchIntro	{'body': 'I had this feeling…\\nI knew I had to battle you again!$'}
text:Route25_HaleyRematchIntro	{'body': "My friend has many cute POKéMON.\\nI'm so jealous!$"}
text:Route25_FranklinRematchIntro	{'body': "I just trained up on MT. MOON,\\nbut I've still got gas in the tank!$"}
text:Route25_NobRematchIntro	{'body': 'A POKéMANIAC lives on the cape.\\nHave you seen his collection?$'}
text:Route25_WayneRematchIntro	{'body': "You're going to see BILL again?\\nFirst, we battle!$"}
text:Route24_ShaneRematchIntro	{'body': 'I saw your feat from the grass!$'}
text:Route24_EthanRematchIntro	{'body': "Okay!\\nI'll stomp you!$"}
text:Route24_ReliRematchIntro	{'body': "You always look so busy…\\nAren't you getting tired?$"}
text:Route24_TimmyRematchIntro	{'body': 'You really must love coming to\\nNUGGET BRIDGE.$'}
text:Route24_AliRematchIntro	{'body': "The time we battled…\\pEven though I was the second in\\nline, I was the best, wasn't I?$"}
text:Route24_CaleRematchIntro	{'body': "People call this the NUGGET\\nBRIDGE!\\pYou've already beaten us, so you're\\nnot allowed to take the challenge…\\p…But, you're welcome to battle with\\nus again.$"}
text:OneIsland_TreasureBeach_AmaraRematchIntro	{'body': "Lying back, rocked by the waves…\\nI don't notice time slipping by…$"}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_MariaRematchIntro	{'body': "The weather's gorgeous!\\nI'll try not to spoil it.$"}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_AbigailRematchIntro	{'body': 'My sunburn is starting to hurt…$'}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_FinnRematchIntro	{'body': "The fire bird's mountain casts\\na huge shadow…$"}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_GarrettRematchIntro	{'body': 'I have this strong feeling that\\nI can win this time!$'}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_TommyRematchIntro	{'body': "Wait! Wait a second!\\nI'm sure I've hooked a big one!$"}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_SharonRematchIntro	{'body': "You'll help me out with my\\ntraining again?$"}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_TanyaRematchIntro	{'body': "We haven't missed a single day of\\ntraining yet!$"}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_SheaRematchIntro	{'body': 'Every morning, before breakfast,\\nI swim around this island…\\lThree times!$'}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_HughRematchIntro	{'body': 'Dress appropriately for battle!\\nLose that frivolous outfit, I said!$'}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_BryceRematchIntro	{'body': "You know, everything tastes great\\nwhen you're out in the wild.$"}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_ClaireRematchIntro	{'body': 'I ate too much again, so will you\\nbattle us for some exercise?$'}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_KiaRematchIntro	{'body': "KIA: My big brother and I make\\nan awesome combination!\\pWe won't lose this time!$"}
text:OneIsland_KindleRoad_MikRematchIntro	{'body': "MIK: Together with KIA, we're\\nafraid of nothing!\\pWe'll prove it to you this time!$"}
text:ThreeIsland_BondBridge_NikkiRematchIntro	{'body': 'Are we to battle again?$'}
text:ThreeIsland_BondBridge_VioletRematchIntro	{'body': 'From where have you come, and\\nwhere are you bound?$'}
text:ThreeIsland_BondBridge_AmiraRematchIntro	{'body': 'I want to swim without my float\\nring soon.$'}
text:ThreeIsland_BondBridge_AlexisRematchIntro	{'body': 'Yay, yay!\\nPOKéMON!$'}
text:ThreeIsland_BondBridge_TishaRematchIntro	{'body': "Oh, no, didn't I tell you already?\\nPlease, stay away from me!$"}
text:ThreeIsland_BondBridge_JoyRematchIntro	{'body': "JOY: We've gotten stronger!\\nLots and lots!$"}
text:ThreeIsland_BondBridge_MegRematchIntro	{'body': "MEG: You can't beat us today!$"}
text:FiveIsland_WaterLabyrinth_AlizeRematchIntro	{'body': 'Oh, hello!\\pAre you raising your POKéMON in a\\ngood environment?$'}
text:FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_DaisyRematchIntro	{'body': 'With these hands, I will create\\nmy victory today.$'}
text:FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_CelinaRematchIntro	{'body': "Must I repeat myself?\\nI'm trying to paint.\\lPlease keep out of my sight!$"}
text:FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_RaynaRematchIntro	{'body': "I haven't made any progress…\\nI still can't get the right angle…$"}
text:FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_JackiRematchIntro	{'body': 'Oh, you will give me another\\nopportunity to match wits with you?$'}
text:FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_GillianRematchIntro	{'body': "They're almost finished making the\\npool for my POKéMON.\\pYou must drop in for a visit.$"}
text:FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_DestinRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm a good runner.\\nI've gotten even faster!$"}
text:FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_TobyRematchIntro	{'body': 'I say, friend!\\nLet us enjoy our time together!$'}
text:FiveIsland_MemorialPillar_MiloRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm the eldest of the BIRD\\nBROTHERS. Remember me?\\pThat's right, I'm the one who loves\\nbirds for their beaks!$"}
text:FiveIsland_MemorialPillar_ChazRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm the middle kid of the BIRD\\nBROTHERS.\\pI'm the one that loves wings.\\nLet's battle again!$"}
text:FiveIsland_MemorialPillar_HaroldRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm the youngest of the BIRD\\nBROTHERS.\\pI love birds for their down.\\nI didn't think I'd see you again!$"}
text:SixIsland_OutcastIsland_TylorRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm still having no luck at all.\\nA battle'd be a change of pace!$"}
text:SixIsland_OutcastIsland_MymoRematchIntro	{'body': "Gasp… Gasp…\\pI swam here from SIX ISLAND's port\\nin one go again.$"}
text:SixIsland_OutcastIsland_NicoleRematchIntro	{'body': "You always come along while I'm\\nswimming.$"}
text:SixIsland_OutcastIsland_AvaRematchIntro	{'body': "AVA: Let's have another\\ntwo-on-two marine battle today!$"}
text:SixIsland_OutcastIsland_GebRematchIntro	{'body': 'GEB: My big sister and I are way\\ntougher than before!$'}
text:SixIsland_GreenPath_JaclynRematchIntro	{'body': '…Huh?\\pI envision my house, but TELEPORT\\nalways brings me here!$'}
text:SixIsland_WaterPath_RoseRematchIntro	{'body': 'Oh, hello.\\nA pleasant breeze is blowing again.$'}
text:SixIsland_WaterPath_EdwardRematchIntro	{'body': "Hehehe, I'm practicing in secret\\nagain.$"}
text:SixIsland_WaterPath_SamirRematchIntro	{'body': "What, you're sick of seeing\\nSWIMMERS like me?\\pAww, don't be hatin'!\\nBattle with me again.$"}
text:SixIsland_WaterPath_DeniseRematchIntro	{'body': "Sigh…\\nMy boyfriend's busy again…$"}
text:SixIsland_WaterPath_EarlRematchIntro	{'body': 'Come on, tell me, where are the\\nmountains around these parts?$'}
text:SixIsland_WaterPath_MiuRematchIntro	{'body': "MIU: Hello, POKéMON!\\nIt's time to play again!$"}
text:SixIsland_WaterPath_MiaRematchIntro	{'body': "MIA: Hello, POKéMON!\\nIt's time to battle again!$"}
text:SixIsland_RuinValley_StanlyRematchIntro	{'body': 'There appear to be many secrets\\nstill unsolved in this world.$'}
text:SixIsland_RuinValley_FosterRematchIntro	{'body': "Hi, didn't we meet before?\\nWhat compelled you to come back?$"}
text:SixIsland_RuinValley_LarryRematchIntro	{'body': "It's been said that there are\\nmysterious stones on this island.\\pHave you discovered anything since\\nwe last met?$"}
text:SixIsland_RuinValley_DarylRematchIntro	{'body': 'A rematch with you, so high up!$'}
text:SixIsland_RuinValley_HectorRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm pretty familiar with the land\\naround these parts.$"}
text:SevenIsland_TrainerTower_DarioRematchIntro	{'body': 'I sensed your approach.$'}
text:SevenIsland_TrainerTower_RodetteRematchIntro	{'body': 'Somewhere on this island, peculiar\\nPOKéMON are sleeping.$'}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Entrance_MiahRematchIntro	{'body': "Kyahaha!\\pComing back won't change a thing.\\nI'll flick you away effortlessly!$"}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Entrance_MasonRematchIntro	{'body': "Howdy! You're a member of my\\nfan club, isn't that right?$"}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Entrance_NicolasRematchIntro	{'body': 'This island is too spread out…\\nPatrolling the place is a drag…$'}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Entrance_MadelineRematchIntro	{'body': "I don't forgive people who abuse\\nPOKéMON!$"}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Entrance_EveRematchIntro	{'body': "EVE: I'll team up with JON and\\nbattle together again.$"}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Entrance_JonRematchIntro	{'body': "JON: When I'm with EVE, it feels\\nlike we could never lose, not ever.$"}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_CyndyRematchIntro	{'body': "Let's have another battle.\\nMy conditioning's in top form!$"}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_EvanRematchIntro	{'body': "It doesn't matter if you happen to\\nhave the strongest POKéMON…\\pIt doesn't mean a thing if you don't\\nknow how to use them properly!$"}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_JacksonRematchIntro	{'body': 'I work to protect the environment.\\nIn turn, nature protects me!$'}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_KatelynRematchIntro	{'body': 'Every time we meet, you have those\\nsnazzy shoes on.$'}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_LeroyRematchIntro	{'body': 'You must have gotten tougher.\\nLet me battle you, please!$'}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_MichelleRematchIntro	{'body': "I was given the best possible\\neducation to become this strong.\\pI won't lose this time.\\nAbsolutely not!$"}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_LexRematchIntro	{'body': 'LEX: My darling NYA, together\\nwe will win for certain!$'}
text:SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_NyaRematchIntro	{'body': "NYA: I won't drag down my mentor\\nLEX! We're going to win!$"}
text:SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_BrandonRematchIntro	{'body': 'Have you discovered anything about\\nthis stone chamber?$'}
text:SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_BenjaminRematchIntro	{'body': 'A mystic POKéMON is said to sleep\\ninside here.$'}
text:SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_EdnaRematchIntro	{'body': 'My teacher is showing me how to\\npaint some more.$'}
text:SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_CliffordRematchIntro	{'body': 'Today, in addition to our lesson,\\nwe came to see the chamber again.$'}
text:Trade_LookingForMonWannaTradeForMon	{'body': "I'm looking for the POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pWanna trade one for my\\n{STR_VAR_2}?$"}
text:Trade_AwwOhWell	{'body': 'Awww!\\nOh, well…$'}
text:Trade_WhatThatsNoMon	{'body': "What?\\nThat's no {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:Trade_HeyThanks	{'body': 'Hey, thanks!$'}
text:Trade_IsntMyOldMonGreat	{'body': "Isn't my old {STR_VAR_2} great?$"}
text:Trade_DoYouHaveMonWouldYouTradeForMon	{'body': 'Hello, there! Do you happen to\\nhave a {STR_VAR_1}?\\pWould you agree to a trade for\\nmy {STR_VAR_2}?$'}
text:Trade_WellIfYouDontWantTo	{'body': "Well, if you don't want to…$"}
text:Trade_ThisIsntMon	{'body': "Hmmm?\\nThis isn't a {STR_VAR_1}.\\pThink of me if you get one.$"}
text:Trade_Thanks	{'body': 'Thanks!$'}
text:Trade_HasTradedMonGrownStronger	{'body': 'The {STR_VAR_2} that I traded you,\\nhas it grown stronger?$'}
text:Trade_DoYouHaveMonWantToTradeForMon	{'body': 'Hi!\\nDo you have a {STR_VAR_1}?\\pWant to trade it for my\\n{STR_VAR_2}?$'}
text:Trade_ThatsTooBad	{'body': "That's too bad.$"}
text:Trade_ThisIsNoMon	{'body': '…This is no {STR_VAR_1}.\\pIf you get one, trade it with me.$'}
text:Trade_ThanksYoureAPal	{'body': "Thanks, you're a pal!$"}
text:Trade_HowIsMyOldMon	{'body': 'How is my old {STR_VAR_2}?\\nMy {STR_VAR_1} is doing great!$'}
text:WouldYouLikeToMixRecords	{'body': 'Would you like to mix records with\\nother TRAINERS?$'}
text:WeHopeToSeeYouAgain	{'body': 'We hope to see you again!$'}
text:BootUpPC	{'body': '{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$'}
text:gWhichPCShouldBeAccessed	{'body': 'Which PC should be accessed?$'}
text:gAccessedSomeonesPC	{'body': "Accessed SOMEONE'S PC.$"}
text:gStorageSystemOpened	{'body': 'POKéMON Storage System opened.$'}
text:gAccessedPlayersPC	{'body': "Accessed {PLAYER}'s PC.$"}
text:gAccessedLanettesPC	{'body': "Accessed LANETTE's PC.$"}
text:gAccessedBillsPC	{'body': "Accessed BILL's PC.$"}
text:gEmeraldChampionsFirstCenterVisit	{'body': "This is your first visit, isn't it?\\pWe give every new Trainer four\\ntools for building teams quickly.\\pFirst, take this Poké Vial!$"}
text:gEmeraldChampionsGiveLeveler	{'body': 'And here is your Leveler!$'}
text:gEmeraldChampionsGiveRepelSpray	{'body': 'Next, the Repel Spray!$'}
text:gEmeraldChampionsGiveFlightBeacon	{'body': 'And last, the Flight Beacon!$'}
text:gEmeraldChampionsExplainTools	{'body': 'The Poké Vial fully restores your\\nparty outside battle.\\pIt holds one dose. Every Pokémon\\nCenter refills it for free.\\pThe Leveler raises your whole\\nparty to the current level cap. It\\lnever runs out.\\pThe Repel Spray keeps wild Pokémon\\naway for 500 steps per use.\\lFishing, Rock Smash and Sweet\\lScent still work.\\pSweet Scent makes rarer local\\nspecies easier to find. Route signs\\lexplain its legendary chance.\\pThe Tutor by the PC helps with\\nmoves, Nature, EVs and Battle\\lSets.\\pThe Vendor supplies battle held\\nitems for free. Every Center has\\lboth services.\\pThe Flight Beacon calls a flier\\nonce you have the badge for Fly.$'}
text:gEmeraldChampionsGiveMissingFlightBeacon	{'body': 'One more tool for you:\\nthe Flight Beacon!$'}
text:gEmeraldChampionsHealAfterTools	{'body': "Well, now that you're here, would\\nyou also like to heal your Pokémon?$"}
text:gEmeraldChampionsExplainFlightBeacon	{'body': "Use it to call a flier once you\\nhave the badge for Fly.\\pFor skills such as Cut and Surf,\\nyou need the HM, its badge, and\\la compatible party member.\\pThey don't take a battle move\\nslot. Flash is automatic: with\\lits HM and badge, caves light up!$"}
text:gEmeraldChampionsGiveMissingRepelSpray	{'body': 'One more tool for you:\\nthe Repel Spray!$'}
text:gEmeraldChampionsExplainRepelSpray	{'body': 'Use it and wild Pokémon leave you\\nalone for 500 steps. When it wears\\loff, you can mist the air again.\\pFishing, Rock Smash and Sweet Scent\\nare never blocked.\\pSWEET SCENT reverses ordinary\\nrarity: rare species become common.\\pSWEET SCENT gives a 25% chance of\\nan available local legendary.\\pSeveral legends in one area share\\nthat chance. Their requirements apply.$'}
text:gEmeraldChampionsGiveMissingLeveler	{'body': 'We have one more tool for you:\\nthe Leveler!$'}
text:gEmeraldChampionsExplainLeveler	{'body': 'The Leveler raises your whole party\\nto the current level cap.\\pIt never runs out.$'}
text:gWouldYouLikeToRestYourPkmn	{'body': 'Hello, and welcome to\\nthe POKéMON CENTER.\\pWe restore your tired POKéMON\\nto full health.\\pWould you like to rest your POKéMON?$'}
text:gIllTakeYourPkmn	{'body': "Okay, I'll take your POKéMON\\nfor a few seconds.$"}
text:gRestoredPkmnToFullHealth	{'body': "Thank you for waiting.\\pWe've restored your POKéMON\\nto full health.$"}
text:gWeHopeToSeeYouAgain	{'body': 'We hope to see you again!$'}
text:gWelcomeCutShort	{'body': 'Hello, and welcome to\\nthe POKéMON CENTER.\\pWe restore your tired POKéMON\\nto full health.\\pWould you like to…$'}
text:gNoticesGoldCard	{'body': "Th-that card…\\nCould it be… The GOLD CARD?!\\pOh, the gold color is brilliant!\\nThe four stars seem to sparkle!\\pI've seen several TRAINERS with\\na SILVER CARD before, but, {PLAYER},\\lyou're the first TRAINER I've ever\\lseen with a GOLD CARD!\\pOkay, {PLAYER}, please allow me\\nthe honor of resting your POKéMON!$"}
text:gYouWantTheUsual	{'body': "I'm delighted to see you, {PLAYER}!\\nYou want the usual, am I right?$"}
text:gIllTakeYourPkmn2	{'body': "Okay, I'll take your POKéMON\\nfor a few seconds.$"}
text:gThankYouForWaiting	{'body': 'Thank you for waiting.$'}
text:gWeHopeToSeeYouAgain2	{'body': 'We hope to see you again!$'}
text:gObtainedTheItem	{'body': 'Obtained the {STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:gTheBagIsFull	{'body': 'The BAG is full…$'}
text:gPutItemInPocket	{'body': '{PLAYER} put away the {STR_VAR_2}\\nin the {STR_VAR_3} POCKET.$'}
text:gPlayerFoundOneItem	{'body': '{PLAYER} found one {STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:gTooBadBagIsFull	{'body': 'Too bad!\\nThe BAG is full…$'}
text:gPlayerPutItemInBag	{'body': '{PLAYER} put away the {STR_VAR_2}\\nin the BAG.$'}
text:gObtainedTheDecor	{'body': 'Obtained the {STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:gNoRoomLeftForAnother	{'body': "Too bad! There's no room left for\\nanother {STR_VAR_2}…$"}
text:gTheDecorWasTransferredToThePC	{'body': 'The {STR_VAR_2} was transferred\\nto the PC.$'}
text:gObtainedTheItems	{'body': 'Obtained {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:gPlayerFoundItems	{'body': '{PLAYER} found {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:gPutCoinsAwayInCoinCase	{'body': '{PLAYER} put the COINS away in\\nthe COIN CASE.$'}
text:gFoundXCoins	{'body': '{PLAYER} found\\n{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:gFoundXItems	{'body': '{PLAYER} found\\n{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}(s)!$'}
text:gCoinCaseIsFull	{'body': 'Too bad!\\nThe COIN CASE is full…$'}
text:gNothingToPutThemIn	{'body': "Too bad!\\nThere's nothing to put them in…$"}
text:MoveRelearner_WouldLearnNewMoves	{'body': "Hi, I'm the Move Relearner.\\nWould you like to learn new moves?$"}
text:MoveRelearner_LevelUpMoves	{'body': 'Level Up Moves$'}
text:MoveRelearner_EggMoves	{'body': 'Egg Moves$'}
text:MoveRelearner_TMMoves	{'body': 'TM Moves$'}
text:MoveRelearner_TutormoveMoves	{'body': 'Tutor Moves$'}
text:MoveRelearner_SeeYa	{'body': 'See ya!$'}
text:MoveRelearner_AnythingElse	{'body': 'Is there anything else I may do\\nfor you?$'}
text:MoveRelearner_ChoosePkmn	{'body': 'Please choose your Pokémon.$'}
text:MoveRelearner_HaveNoPkmn	{'body': 'You have no Pokémon.$'}
text:MoveRelearner_CantTeachMoveToEgg	{'body': "Sorry…\\nBut an Egg can't learn moves.$"}
text:MoveRelearner_CantTeachMoveToPkmn	{'body': "Sorry…\\pIt doesn't appear as if I have any move\\nI can teach that Pokémon.$"}
text:MoveRelearner_LevelUpMoveLWR	{'body': 'level up move$'}
text:MoveRelearner_EggMoveLWR	{'body': 'egg move$'}
text:MoveRelearner_TMMoveLWR	{'body': 'TM move$'}
text:MoveRelearner_TutorMoveLWR	{'body': 'tutor move$'}
text:MoveRelearner_MoveLWR	{'body': 'move$'}
text:MoveRelearner_WhichXmoveShouldTeach	{'body': 'Which {STR_VAR_3} should I teach?$'}
text:MoveRelearner_ThankYouComeAgain	{'body': 'Thank you for using our services.\\nPlease come again!$'}
text:gWantToUseSurf	{'body': 'The water is dyed a deep blue…\\nWould you like to SURF?$'}
text:gPlayerUsedSurf	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1} used SURF!$'}
text:CurrentTooFast	{'body': "The current is much too fast!\\nSURF can't be used here…$"}
text:gPkmnTransferredSomeonesPC	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\\nSOMEONE'S PC.\\pIt was placed in \\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$"}
text:gPkmnTransferredLanettesPC	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\\nBILL'S PC.\\pLANETTE'S PC.\\pIt was placed in \\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$"}
text:gPkmnTransferredSomeonesPCBoxFull	{'body': "BOX “{STR_VAR_3}” on\\nSOMEONE'S PC was full.\\p{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$"}
text:gPkmnTransferredLanettesPCBoxFull	{'body': "BOX “{STR_VAR_3}” on\\nBILL'S PC was full.\\pLANETTE'S PC was full.\\p{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$"}
text:gPkmnSentToPCAfterCatch	{'body': '{STR_VAR_2} was sent to\\n{B_PC_CREATOR_NAME} PC.\\pIt was placed in \\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}”.$'}
text:gPlayerObtainedTheMon	{'body': '{PLAYER} obtained\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}!$'}
text:gNoMoreRoomForPokemon	{'body': "There's no more room for POKéMON!\\pThe POKéMON BOXES are full and\\ncan't accept any more!$"}
text:gNicknameThisPokemon	{'body': 'Do you want to give a nickname to\\nthis {STR_VAR_1}?$'}
text:Questionnaire_FillOut	{'body': 'There is a questionnaire.\\nWould you like to fill it out?$'}
text:Questionnaire_ThankYou	{'body': 'Thank you for taking the time to\\nfill out our questionnaire.\\pYour feedback will be used for\\nfuture reference.$'}
text:Questionnaire_YouKnowThoseWordsGift	{'body': 'Oh, hello!\\nYou know those words?\\pThat means you must know about\\nthe MYSTERY GIFT.\\pFrom now on, you should be\\nreceiving MYSTERY GIFTS!$'}
text:Questionnaire_YouCanAccessMysteryGift	{'body': 'Once you save your game, you can\\naccess the MYSTERY GIFT.$'}
text:Questionnaire_YouKnowThoseWordsEvent	{'body': 'Oh, hello!\\nYou know those words?\\pThat means you must know about\\nthe MYSTERY EVENT.$'}
text:Questionnaire_YouCanAccessMysteryEvent	{'body': 'Once you save your game, you can\\naccess the MYSTERY EVENT.$'}
text:MysteryGift_TheresATicketForYou	{'body': 'Thank you for using the MYSTERY\\nEVENT System.\\pYou must be {PLAYER}.\\nThere is a ticket here for you.$'}
text:MysteryGift_TryUsingItAtLilycovePort	{'body': 'It appears to be for use at\\nthe LILYCOVE CITY port.\\pWhy not give it a try and see what\\nit is about?$'}
text:gAbnormalWeatherEnded_Rain	{'body': 'The massive downpour appears to\\nhave stopped…$'}
text:gAbnormalWeatherEnded_Sun	{'body': 'The intense sunshine appears to\\nhave subsided…$'}
text:CableClub_WelcomeWhichCableClubService	{'body': 'Welcome to the POKéMON CABLE\\nCLUB.\\pWhich of our services do you wish\\nto use?$'}
text:CableClub_WhichService	{'body': 'Which of our services do you wish\\nto use?$'}
text:CableClub_TradeUsingLinkCable	{'body': 'Trade POKéMON with another player\\nusing a GBA Game Link cable.$'}
text:CableClub_BattleUsingLinkCable	{'body': 'You may battle another TRAINER\\nusing a GBA Game Link cable.$'}
text:CableClub_RecordCornerUsingLinkCable	{'body': 'You can use the RECORD CORNER with\\nothers using a GBA Game Link cable.$'}
text:CableClub_CloseThisMenu	{'body': 'Close this menu.$'}
text:CableClub_NeedTwoMonsForDoubleBattle	{'body': 'For a DOUBLE BATTLE, bring at\\nleast four healthy POKéMON.$'}
text:CableClub_NeedTwoMonsToTrade	{'body': 'For trading, you must have at\\nleast two POKéMON with you.$'}
text:CableClub_CantTradeEnigmaBerry	{'body': "A POKéMON holding the {STR_VAR_1}\\nBERRY can't be traded.$"}
text:gPleaseWaitForLink	{'body': 'Please wait.\\n… … B Button: Cancel$'}
text:gConfirmLinkWhenPlayersReady	{'body': 'When all players are ready…\\nA Button: Confirm\\lB Button: Cancel$'}
text:gConfirmStartLinkWithXPlayers	{'body': 'Start link with {STR_VAR_1} players.\\nA Button: Confirm\\lB Button: Cancel$'}
text:gAwaitingLinkup	{'body': 'Awaiting linkup…\\n… … B Button: Cancel$'}
text:CableClub_OkayToSaveProgress	{'body': 'Your progress must be saved before\\nlinking. Is it okay to save?$'}
text:CableClub_PleaseEnter	{'body': 'Please enter.$'}
text:CableClub_DirectYouToYourRoom	{'body': "I'll direct you to your room now.$"}
text:SomeoneIsNotReadyToLink	{'body': 'Someone is not ready to link.\\pPlease come back after everyone\\nhas made preparations.$'}
text:LinkErrorPleaseReset	{'body': 'Sorry, we have a link error…\\nPlease reset and try again.$'}
text:PlayersMadeDifferentSelections	{'body': 'The link partners appear to have\\nmade different selections.$'}
text:CableClub_PleaseVisitAgain	{'body': 'Please do visit again.$'}
text:CableClub_IncorrectNumberOfParticipants	{'body': 'The number of participants is\\nincorrect.$'}
text:CableClub_CantSingleBattleWithXPlayers	{'body': "The SINGLE BATTLE Mode can't be\\nplayed by {STR_VAR_1} players.$"}
text:CableClub_CantDoubleBattleWithXPlayers	{'body': "The DOUBLE BATTLE Mode can't be\\nplayed by {STR_VAR_1} players.$"}
text:CableClub_NeedFourPlayers	{'body': 'There must be four players to play\\nthis Battle Mode.$'}
text:CableClub_PleaseConfirmNumberAndRestart	{'body': 'Please confirm the number of\\nplayers and start again.$'}
text:TerminateLinkConfirmation	{'body': 'The link will be terminated if you\\nleave the room. Is that okay?$'}
text:TerminateLinkPleaseWait	{'body': 'Terminating link…\\nYou will be escorted out of\\lthe room. Please wait.$'}
text:CableClub_TooBusyToNotice	{'body': 'This TRAINER is too busy to\\nnotice…$'}
text:CableClub_GotToLookAtTrainerCard	{'body': "Score! Got to look at {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nTRAINER CARD!$"}
text:CableClub_GotToLookAtColoredTrainerCard	{'body': "Score! Got to look at {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nTRAINER CARD!\\pIt's a {STR_VAR_2} card!$"}
text:BattleColosseum_2P_TakePlaceStartBattle	{'body': 'Please take your place and start\\nyour battle.$'}
text:TradeCenter_TakeSeatStartTrade	{'body': 'Please take your seat and start\\nyour trade.$'}
text:RecordCorner_ThanksForComing	{'body': 'Thanks for coming.$'}
text:CableClub_TrainerCardDataOverwritten	{'body': 'The TRAINER CARD data will\\nbe overwritten.$'}
text:CableClub_HopeToSeeYouAgain	{'body': 'I hope to see you again!$'}
text:CableClub_NotSetUpForFarAwayRegion	{'body': "I'm awfully sorry.\\pWe're not set up to conduct trades\\nwith TRAINERS far away in another\\lregion yet…$"}
text:CableClub_OtherTrainerNotReady	{'body': 'The other TRAINER is not ready.$'}
text:CableClub_YouHaveAMonThatCantBeTaken	{'body': "You have at least one POKéMON\\nthat can't be taken.$"}
text:RecordCorner_TakeSeatAndWait	{'body': 'Please take your seat and wait.$'}
text:RecordCorner_PlayerSentOverOneX	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1} sent over one\\n{STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:CableClub_CantMixWithJapaneseGame	{'body': "Sorry, there is a transmission error.\\pYou may not mix records with  \\nJapanese Ruby or Sapphire games.\\pAlso, you can't mix records with\\nJapanese Emerald and overseas Ruby\\lor Sapphire games at the same time.$"}
text:CableClub_AdapterNotConnected	{'body': 'The Wireless Adapter is not\\nconnected properly.$'}
text:CableClub_ParticipantsStepUpToCounter	{'body': 'Participants are asked to step up\\nto the reception counter.$'}
text:CableClub_Hello	{'body': 'Hello!$'}
text:CableClub_PleaseWait	{'body': 'Please wait.$'}
text:CableClub_YouMayTradeHere	{'body': 'You may trade your POKéMON here\\nwith another TRAINER.$'}
text:CableClub_YouMayBattleHere	{'body': 'You may battle with your friends\\nhere.$'}
text:CableClub_CanMakeBerryPowder	{'body': 'Two to five TRAINERS can make\\nBERRY POWDER together.$'}
text:CableClub_CanMixRecords	{'body': 'The records of two to four players\\ncan be mixed together.$'}
text:CableClub_GuideToVariousServices	{'body': "A guide to the WIRELESS CLUB's\\nvarious services.$"}
text:CableClub_CancelSelectedItem	{'body': 'Cancels the selected MENU item.$'}
text:CableClub_WhichBattleMode	{'body': 'Which battle mode would you like?$'}
text:CableClub_ReturnsToPreviousStep	{'body': 'Returns to the previous step.$'}
text:CableClub_NeedBerryForBerryCrush	{'body': 'To use the BERRY CRUSH service,\\nyou must have at least one BERRY.$'}
text:CableClub_NeedTwoMonsForUnionRoom	{'body': 'To enter the UNION ROOM, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON.$'}
text:CableClub_NoEnigmaBerryInUnionRoom	{'body': 'No POKéMON holding the {STR_VAR_1}\\nBERRY may enter the UNION ROOM.$'}
text:CableClub_UnionRoomAdapterNotConnected	{'body': 'This is the POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB\\nUNION ROOM.\\pUnfortunately, your Wireless\\nAdapter is not connected properly.\\pPlease do come again.$'}
text:CableClub_OhExcuseMe	{'body': 'Oh…\\nExcuse me!$'}
text:CableClub_PlayerIsWaiting	{'body': 'It appears as if {STR_VAR_1} is playing\\nright now.\\lGo for it!$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_DescribeWhichGame	{'body': "I can explain game rules to you,\\nif you'd like.\\pWhich game should I describe?$"}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_PokemonJumpInfo	{'body': '“POKéMON JUMP”\\pMake your POKéMON skip the VINE WHIP\\nrope with the A Button.\\pOnly mini POKéMON around 28 inches\\nor less may participate.\\pPOKéMON that only swim, burrow,\\nor fly are not good at jumping.\\pAs a result, those POKéMON may not\\nparticipate.\\pGood things happen if everyone\\njumps in time.$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_DodrioBerryPickingInfo	{'body': "“DODRIO BERRY-PICKING”\\pCommand DODRIO's three heads to\\ncatch falling BERRIES.\\pPress right, up, or left on the\\n{PLUS} Control Pad to move the heads.\\pTo play this game, you must have\\na DODRIO.$"}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_TalkToOldManToPlay	{'body': 'If you want to play a game,\\nplease tell the old man beside me.$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_WelcomeCanYouWait	{'body': 'Hi, welcome!\\nAre you here to play games using\\lWireless Communication?\\pCan you wait just a little bit?$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_ComeAgain	{'body': 'All right, come again!$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_AdapterNotConnected	{'body': "The Wireless Adapter isn't connected.\\nCome back when it's hooked up!$"}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_PlayWhichGame	{'body': 'All right, which game did you want\\nto play?$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_EnterWhichPokemon	{'body': 'Which POKéMON would you like to\\nenter?$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_AllGoodToGo	{'body': "Okay, you're all good to go.\\nDon't let the others beat you!$"}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_LeavingDoComeAgain	{'body': 'Are you leaving now?\\nDo come again!$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_ExplainRequiredMon	{'body': "It doesn't look like you have any\\nPOKéMON that you can enter…\\pWould you like me to explain what\\nkinds of POKéMON can enter?$"}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_ShortJumpingPokemonAllowed	{'body': "“POKéMON JUMP” is open to POKéMON\\naround 28 inches or less.\\pWhat you can't enter are those\\nPOKéMON that can't jump.\\pYou know, like POKéMON that only\\nswim, burrow, or fly.\\pThat's all you need to know.$"}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_OnlyDodrioAllowed	{'body': 'DODRIO BERRY-PICKING is a game that \\nonly DODRIO may enter.$'}
text:MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_RetryPlease	{'body': 'Could you retry this from the start\\nagain, please?$'}
text:CableClub_WelcomeWhichDirectCornerRoom	{'body': 'Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may interact directly with\\nyour friends here.\\pWhich room would you like to\\nenter?$'}
text:CableClub_TradePokemon	{'body': 'Would you like to trade POKéMON?$'}
text:CableClub_PlayWhichBattleMode	{'body': 'Which Battle Mode would you like\\nto play?$'}
text:CableClub_AccessRecordCorner	{'body': 'Would you like to access\\nthe RECORD CORNER?$'}
text:CableClub_UseBerryCrush	{'body': 'Would you like to use the\\nBERRY CRUSH System?$'}
text:CableClub_ExplainBattleModes	{'body': 'DOUBLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS,\\neach with at least four healthy\\lPOKéMON. EGGS cannot enter.\\pMULTI BATTLE is for four TRAINERS.\\nEach selects three POKéMON; two\\lTRAINERS form a team of six.\\pUse the same game revision and\\nchoose the same battle format.$'}
text:CableClub_ChooseGroupLeaderOfTwo	{'body': 'Please decide which of you two\\nwill become the LEADER.\\pThe other player must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$'}
text:CableClub_ChooseGroupLeaderOfFour	{'body': 'Please decide which of you four\\nwill become the GROUP LEADER.\\pThe other players must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$'}
text:CableClub_ChooseGroupLeader	{'body': 'Please decide which of you will\\nbecome the GROUP LEADER.\\pThe other players must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$'}
text:CableClub_WelcomeUnionRoomEnter	{'body': 'Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB UNION ROOM.\\pYou may interact directly with\\nother TRAINERS here, some of\\lwhom you may not even know.\\pWould you like to enter the ROOM?$'}
text:CableClub_UnionRoomInfo	{'body': 'The TRAINERS in the UNION ROOM\\nwill be those players around you\\lwho have also entered the ROOM.\\pYou may do all sorts of things\\nhere, such as exchanging greetings.\\pYou may enter two POKéMON up to\\nLv. 30 for a one-on-one battle.\\pYou may take part in a chat with\\ntwo to five people.\\pOr, you may register a POKéMON for\\ntrade.\\pWould you like to enter the ROOM?$'}
text:CableClub_EnjoyUnionRoom	{'body': 'I hope you enjoy your time in\\nthe UNION ROOM.$'}
text:CableClub_FirstTimeRightThisWay	{'body': "Hello!\\nMy name is TEALA.\\pThis must be your first time\\nup here.\\pI'll show you how the Wireless\\nCommunication System works.\\pFirst, I need to show you this\\nfloor of our POKéMON CENTER.\\pRight this way, please.$"}
text:CableClub_ExplainWirelessClubFirstTime	{'body': "On the top floor, there are two\\nrooms.\\pFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\pYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\lthe UNION ROOM.\\pWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\pSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\pIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\lusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\pIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\pI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.$"}
text:CableClub_AskAboutLinking	{'body': "Hello, {PLAYER}!\\pIt's me, TEALA, the POKéMON\\nCENTER 2F attendant.\\pIs there something you needed to\\nask me about linking?$"}
text:CableClub_ExplainWirelessClub	{'body': "Let me explain how the POKéMON\\nWIRELESS CLUB works.\\pOn this, the top floor, there are\\ntwo rooms.\\pFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\pYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\lthe UNION ROOM.\\pWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\pSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\pSometimes, you may not be able to\\nfind your friends in the UNION ROOM\\lor the DIRECT CORNER.\\pIn that case, please move closer\\nto your friends.\\pIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\lusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\pIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\pI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.$"}
text:CableClub_HopeYouEnjoyWirelessSystem	{'body': 'I hope you enjoy the Wireless\\nCommunication System.$'}
text:CableClub_RetiredSingleBattle	{'body': 'This desk hosts DOUBLE BATTLES.\\nPlease choose Double or Multi.$'}
text:CableClub_LinkPartyRequirements	{'body': 'DOUBLE BATTLE needs four healthy\\nPOKéMON per TRAINER.\\pFor MULTI, each TRAINER brings\\nthree. EGGS cannot enter.$'}
text:CableClub_IncompatibleLinkBattle	{'body': "These battle teams or formats\\naren't compatible.\\pUse the same game revision. For\\nDOUBLE, bring four healthy POKéMON;\\lfor MULTI, bring three each.$"}
text:LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_InterviewRequest	{'body': "Oh, hello! You were in a POKéMON\\nCONTEST, weren't you?\\lIt's easy to tell from your POKéMON.\\pI'm a reporter. I'm working on a story\\non POKéMON CONTESTS.\\pIf I may, would you be willing to answer\\na few questions?$"}
text:LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_DescribeContest	{'body': 'Oh, you will?\\nThank you.\\pBriefly, how would you describe the\\nCONTEST you just entered?$'}
text:LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_WhatImageWhenYouHearX	{'body': "Ah, I see.\\nThat's a very edifying comment.\\pYou get a good feel for what\\nthe CONTEST was like.\\pI've got one last question.\\pWhen you hear the word “{STR_VAR_2},”\\nwhat image do you get?$"}
text:LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_ThatsAllForInterview	{'body': "I see!\\pSo that's how you imagine the concept\\nof “{STR_VAR_2}” to be.\\pThank you!\\nYou've given me some good ideas.\\pI think I can write a good story on\\nPOKéMON CONTESTS now.\\pMaybe, just maybe, this story will even\\nmake it to television.\\lI hope you'll look forward to it!$"}
text:LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_PleaseDoShareStoryWithMe	{'body': 'Oh, too bad…\\pWell, if you come across a good story,\\nplease do share it with me.$'}
text:LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_LookingForwardToNextContest	{'body': "I'll be looking forward to your next\\nPOKéMON CONTEST.$"}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText00	{'body': "Yeah!\\nIt's BRAVO TRAINER time!\\pToday, we're going to profile a POKéMON\\nbelonging to {STR_VAR_1}.\\pNow, this POKéMON boasts a {STR_VAR_3}\\nRank in the {STR_VAR_2} Category.$"}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText01	{'body': 'Introducing {STR_VAR_2} the\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pThe nickname {STR_VAR_2}…\\pEven the nickname exudes an air that\\nproclaims “{STR_VAR_3}”!$'}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText02	{'body': 'Anyway, when the TRAINER {STR_VAR_1}\\nentered the POKéMON in a CONTEST,\\lwe managed to get a few impassioned\\lquotes about the trusty partner.$'}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText03	{'body': "Asked about the CONTEST afterwards,\\n{STR_VAR_1} happily replied with a huge\\lgrin, “{STR_VAR_2}!”\\pWell, sure, {STR_VAR_1}'s POKéMON came in\\nnumber {STR_VAR_3} in the CONTEST.\\pThat line perfectly suits {STR_VAR_1}\\nright now, I'd say!$"}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText04	{'body': "Asked about the CONTEST afterwards,\\n{STR_VAR_1} replied with a tinge of\\lbitterness, “{STR_VAR_2}.”\\pWell, sure, {STR_VAR_1}'s POKéMON came in\\nnumber {STR_VAR_3} in the CONTEST.\\p{STR_VAR_1}'s disappointment comes across\\nloud and clear, I'd say!$"}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText05	{'body': "Wouldn't you also like to know what\\n{STR_VAR_1} imagines {STR_VAR_2} to be?\\pYou bet we did!\\nSo we asked, of course!\\pThe answer is all perfectly condensed:\\n“{STR_VAR_3}!”\\pThat's what the concept of {STR_VAR_2}\\nrepresents to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText06	{'body': 'The last move {STR_VAR_2} used by\\nthe {STR_VAR_1} is entirely about\\l“{STR_VAR_3}”!$'}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText07	{'body': "Bravo, {STR_VAR_1}!\\nBravo, {STR_VAR_2}!\\pI hope we can count on seeing\\n{STR_VAR_1} scale even greater heights!\\pThat's all the time we have!\\nUntil next time, see you!$"}
text:gTVBravoTrainerText08	{'body': "Introducing the TRAINER's {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_InterviewRequest	{'body': "Hello! You're the TRAINER who just had\\na battle, right?\\pI'm gathering interviews with TRAINERS\\nall over the place.\\pMay I get a few words from you about\\nyour impressions on battling?$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_HowDidBattleTowerTurnOut	{'body': 'You will? Really?\\nThank you!\\lThen, uh…\\pHow did things turn out in\\nthe BATTLE TOWER today?\\pWere you satisfied with the battle?\\nOr are you unhappy?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_SorryWeDisturbedYou	{'body': 'Oh…\\nSorry we disturbed you.\\pPlease give us an interview the next\\ntime you visit the BATTLE TOWER.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_ObviousYouHadGreatBattle	{'body': "Well, of course!\\pThat unmistakable look of satisfaction\\non your face…\\pIt's obvious that you've had a great\\nbattle.$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_DifficultToMakeBattleTurnOutAsPlanned	{'body': 'Oh, I see…\\pWell, it certainly is difficult to make a\\nbattle turn out exactly as planned.$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_DescribeYourBattle	{'body': 'Oh, oh, may I ask one more question?\\pIf you were to describe your\\nimpressions about this battle with\\lone saying, what would it be?$'}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_ThatsGreatLine	{'body': "Oh, that is stunningly cool!\\pThat's a great line!\\nI hope you'll do great next time, too.\\pI hope to see you again!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_SilentType	{'body': "Oh, I see…\\pStill, being the silent type is also\\ncool, isn't it?\\pI hope you'll give me the opportunity\\nto share your thoughts again!$"}
text:BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_LookingForwardToNextBattle	{'body': "I'll be looking forward to your\\nnext battle!$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_Intro	{'body': "Yeah!\\nIt's BRAVO TRAINER time!\\pToday, we're going to profile {STR_VAR_1},\\nwho took the BATTLE TOWER challenge!\\pFor the challenge, {STR_VAR_1} entered\\none wicked {STR_VAR_2}.$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_NewRecord	{'body': 'The pair set a new record of {STR_VAR_2} wins\\nin a row in {STR_VAR_1} competition!\\lBravo, TRAINER!$'}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_Lost	{'body': "The twosome finally succumbed to\\n{STR_VAR_1} in match number {STR_VAR_2}.\\lNice try, TRAINER!\\pBut, hey, it's just bad luck to run into\\n{STR_VAR_1} so early in the challenge.\\pWe asked the TRAINER for impressions\\non the match with {STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_Won	{'body': "The twosome won it all by defeating\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2} thoroughly.\\lBravo, TRAINER!\\pKnocking off even {STR_VAR_1}…\\nIt defies belief! Simply astounding!\\pWe asked the TRAINER for impressions\\non the moment of glory.$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_LostFinal	{'body': "After a string of wins, the pair finally\\nsuccumbed to {STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2},\\ltheir final hurdle.\\pNice try, TRAINER!\\pStill, you have to give credit.\\nYou don't see many famous combinations\\llike {STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}.\\pWe asked the TRAINER for impressions\\non battling the celebrity pair.$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_Satisfied	{'body': "This is what the TRAINER had to say:\\n“I'm satisfied!”\\pNow isn't that a refreshing reply?\\nBravo, TRAINER!\\pIsn't it out-and-out awesome to be\\nable to battle to full satisfaction?\\pI found out exactly how satisfied\\nwhen I heard the TRAINER say this:$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_Unsatisfied	{'body': "This is what the TRAINER had to say:\\n“I'm not satisfied…”\\pOur TRAINER was obviously a little down\\nwhen that was uttered.\\pStill, it's not easy to be able to battle\\nwith complete satisfaction, am I right?\\pAnyway, I found out how dissatisfied\\nour TRAINER was when I heard this:$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_None1	{'body': 'None$'}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_None2	{'body': 'None$'}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_None3	{'body': 'None$'}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_None4	{'body': 'None$'}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_Response	{'body': '“{STR_VAR_1}.”$'}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_ResponseSatisfied	{'body': "“{STR_VAR_1}.”\\nNow isn't that great?\\pIt really expresses {STR_VAR_2}'s joy,\\nI'd say.\\pThat battle with {STR_VAR_3} at the\\nend… It really was what you'd call\\l“{STR_VAR_1}”!$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_ResponseUnsatisfied	{'body': "“{STR_VAR_1}.”\\nNow isn't that fitting?\\pThat battle with {STR_VAR_3} at the\\nend… You can't describe it as anything\\lelse but “{STR_VAR_1}”!\\p{STR_VAR_2}'s disappointment comes across\\nloud and clear, I'd say!$"}
text:BravoTrainerBattleTower_Outro	{'body': "Bravo, {STR_VAR_1}!\\nBravo, {STR_VAR_2}!\\pI hope we can count on seeing\\n{STR_VAR_1} scale even greater heights!\\pThat's all the time we have!\\nUntil next time, see you!$"}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_InterviewRequestHasName	{'body': "Wow!\\pIt's plain to see that you lavish your\\nlove on your {STR_VAR_1}.\\pOkay, it's named {STR_VAR_2}.\\pCan I ask you a favor?\\pI'm a TV reporter, and I'm running\\na survey on POKéMON.\\pWould you be willing to answer a few\\nsimple questions for me?$"}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_HereGoesQuickAnswers	{'body': 'Great! Thank you!\\pOkay, here goes.\\nI just need quick answers, okay?$'}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_DescribeFeelingsFirstMetMon	{'body': 'When you first met {STR_VAR_1},\\nwhat did you feel?\\pHow would you describe your feelings\\nat the time?$'}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_LikenMonToSomethingYouLike	{'body': 'Your {STR_VAR_1} is cared for lovingly.\\pIf you were to liken it to something\\nthat you like, what would it be?$'}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_WhatAttractedYouAboutMon	{'body': 'This question also relates to your\\nbeloved {STR_VAR_1}.\\pWhat was it about {STR_VAR_1} that\\nattracted you?$'}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_WhatDoPokemonMeanToYou	{'body': 'Okay, that makes sense.\\pThe next question might be a little\\non the tough side.\\pHere goes…\\pWhat do POKéMON mean to you?$'}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_ThatsAllForInterview	{'body': "I see!\\pHmhm…\\pOkay!\\nThanks for helping me out.\\pIt was fun and enlightening\\nchatting with you.\\pIt's possible that our interview will\\nend up on TV. Tune in and check!\\pOkay, that's all.\\nBye-bye!$"}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_HereIfYouGetUrgeToTellMe	{'body': "Oh, okay…\\pWell, if you get the urge to tell me\\nabout POKéMON, I'll be here!$"}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_EnjoyDoingInterviews	{'body': 'I enjoy this job--you get to learn\\nabout POKéMON by doing interviews.$'}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_InterviewRequest	{'body': "Hi, you seem to be very close to your\\n{STR_VAR_1}.\\pDo you know what?\\nI'm a TV reporter.\\pI travel around interviewing people\\nabout POKéMON.\\pI'm wondering if you'd be willing to tell\\nme a little about your {STR_VAR_1}?$"}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_TellMeAnythingAboutYourMon	{'body': "Wow, thank you!\\pOkay, then, please tell me anything\\nyou'd like about your {STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_ThatsAllForInterview2	{'body': "Wow…\\nThat's an interesting account.\\pYou really are tight with {STR_VAR_1},\\naren't you?\\pI get the feeling that your account\\nwill make a great TV story.\\pI promise that I'll turn this into\\nan entertaining show.\\lKeep your eyes out for it.\\pOkay, that's all.\\nBye-bye!$"}
text:gTVFanClubOpinionsText00	{'body': "WE ARE THE POKéMON FAN CLUB!\\pWe're on the air!\\pOn this program, we get your opinions,\\nand I shout them out on your behalf!\\lIsn't it a fantastic program concept?\\pToday, we bring you this report from\\nour reporter, who we sent out to the\\lPOKéMON FAN CLUB.\\pSo, just who is today's featured\\nPOKéMON fan?\\p… … … … … … … …\\p{STR_VAR_1}!\\pSo, let's hear what {STR_VAR_1} has to\\nsay about {STR_VAR_3} the {STR_VAR_2}.\\pAnd, I will shout those words of love\\nout loud on TV!\\pHoo-hah!\\pLet's shout!$"}
text:gTVFanClubOpinionsText01	{'body': "We asked {STR_VAR_1}, “When you first\\nlaid eyes on your {STR_VAR_2}, what was\\lyour initial thought?”\\p“{STR_VAR_3}!”\\pYeahah! That's a mighty fine shout!\\pDoesn't it bring back memories of those\\ndays long gone by?$"}
text:gTVFanClubOpinionsText02	{'body': "We asked {STR_VAR_1}, “If you were to\\nliken your {STR_VAR_2} to something,\\lit would be…”\\p… … … … … … … …\\p“{STR_VAR_3}!”\\pWhoah-oh, now that's an original idea!\\pYou sure can sense the intensity of\\nfeeling the TRAINER has for\\l{STR_VAR_2}.$"}
text:gTVFanClubOpinionsText03	{'body': "And let's see…\\nWhat was it about that {STR_VAR_2}\\lthat so attracted {STR_VAR_1}?\\p… … … … … … … …\\p“{STR_VAR_3}!”\\pWhoa! Such a spectacular declaration!\\pThe TRAINER's love for the {STR_VAR_2}\\ncomes across loud and clear!$"}
text:gTVFanClubOpinionsText04	{'body': "Hm? Oh, there's still more.\\nLet's check it out!\\pLet me see, now…\\pWe asked {STR_VAR_1}, “What do POKéMON\\nmean to you?”\\p… … … … … …\\p“{STR_VAR_3}!”\\pBravo!\\pThat's the best shout I've had all day!\\p“{STR_VAR_3}!”\\pIt makes you want to shout it out loud\\nagain and again!\\pNow that we've had a great shout, it's\\ntime to say good-bye until next time!\\pSo, let's all have one last shout!\\nAll together now…\\p“{STR_VAR_3}!”$"}
text:gTVFanClubText00	{'body': "WE ARE THE POKéMON FAN CLUB!\\pWe're on the air!\\pToday, we'll get rolling with the\\nPOKéMON SURVEY CORNER.\\pOut of all the tales woven by POKéMON\\nand TRAINERS, what startling new drama\\lwill grab our attention today?\\pLet me see…\\pThis one!\\pWe'll start with this letter!\\pIt's a letter from {STR_VAR_1} about a\\nbeloved {STR_VAR_2}.\\pLet's see how passionately our writer\\ncan express love for the {STR_VAR_2}!\\lHmhm…$"}
text:gTVFanClubText01	{'body': 'Whoah!\\nWhat an amazing letter!$'}
text:gTVFanClubText02	{'body': 'I loved it, so here it is again!$'}
text:gTVFanClubText03	{'body': 'A great letter bears reading over\\nand over!$'}
text:gTVFanClubText04	{'body': "The bit “{STR_VAR_3},” that really\\naccentuates emotional impact!\\pIt's a great letter that has real\\nheartfelt depth!$"}
text:gTVFanClubText05	{'body': 'Especially that “{STR_VAR_3}” bit!\\pI love how “{STR_VAR_3}” is used!$'}
text:gTVFanClubText06	{'body': "By the way, and it's not important,\\nbut “{STR_VAR_3}” is a great saying.\\pI've been using “{STR_VAR_3}” a lot\\nin conversations lately.$"}
text:gTVFanClubText07	{'body': "If I had to score this letter,\\nI'd give it {STR_VAR_3} points.\\pNext time, I'll be expecting an even\\nbetter letter, {STR_VAR_1}!\\pA-whoops, will you look at the time?\\nTime to say good-bye until next time!$"}
text:SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_InterviewRequest	{'body': "Oh?\\nDo you perhaps like POKéMON?\\pI'm on assignment with the TV network.\\pI'm gathering stories on POKéMON and\\nTRAINERS that occurred recently.\\pIf you don't mind, could you tell me\\nsomething about yourself?$"}
text:SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_InterviewRequestShort	{'body': "I'm gathering stories on POKéMON and\\nTRAINERS that occurred recently.\\pIf you don't mind, could you tell me\\nsomething about yourself?$"}
text:SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_TellMeExperienceInvolvingPokemon	{'body': 'Oh, you will?\\nThank you!\\pThen, please, tell me anything of\\ninterest that you experienced recently\\linvolving POKéMON.$'}
text:SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_LetMeKnowIfYouHaveStory	{'body': 'Oh, I see…\\pWell, if you do have an interesting\\nstory to tell, please let me know.$'}
text:SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_ThatsAllForInterview	{'body': "Oh, what an uplifting story!\\pI'll be sure to get your story told\\non television.\\pIt should be aired sometime, I think,\\nso please look forward to it.$"}
text:SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_BetterWriteUpStory	{'body': "Hmmm…\\nI've got a good story for a TV program.\\pI'd better write it up in a hurry!$"}
text:gTVRecentHappeningsText00	{'body': "Hello, it's time for RECENT HAPPENINGS.\\pFor POKéMON TRAINERS, every day\\nis a storybook tale.\\pWhat we want to do is to introduce you\\nto some of these POKéMON tales.\\pToday, we bring you the story\\nof the TRAINER {STR_VAR_1}.\\pWhat did {STR_VAR_1} experience recently?\\nLet's find out.\\pLet's see…$"}
text:gTVRecentHappeningsText01	{'body': "Wasn't that enlightening?\\pThe story gives you a clear idea of what\\n{STR_VAR_1} has experienced recently.\\lIt's as if we were there as witnesses!$"}
text:gTVRecentHappeningsText02	{'body': '“{STR_VAR_3}.” That\\naccents the tale and gives it depth.$'}
text:gTVRecentHappeningsText03	{'body': "“{STR_VAR_3}.”\\nThat gives the tale a sense of place.\\lIt lets us envision the tale's setting.$"}
text:gTVRecentHappeningsText04	{'body': 'The “{STR_VAR_3}”\\nsection of the tale is very expressive.$'}
text:gTVRecentHappeningsText05	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1} has recounted a wonderful\\ntale involving POKéMON.\\pAnd now {STR_VAR_1}'s tale is indelibly\\netched into your soul, too.\\pThat's it for today.\\nPlease tune in next time.$"}
text:gTVMassOutbreakText00	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pWe've just received word of a very\\nrare occurrence.\\pThere have been reports of a mass\\noutbreak of {STR_VAR_2} in the vicinity\\lof {STR_VAR_1}.\\p{STR_VAR_2}, as you're probably aware,\\nis known as a POKéMON that's rare\\land hard to find.\\pIt sounds like a rare opportunity to\\nsee the mystifying outbreak of\\l{STR_VAR_2} in the wild.\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText00	{'body': "MC: We hope you're in good cheer,\\n“3 CHEERS FOR {POKEBLOCK}S” is here!\\pToday, we examine the {POKEBLOCK} blended\\nby {STR_VAR_1} and associates.\\pWithout any delay, let me feed it\\nto my gourmet POKéMON GULPIN.\\p… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …$"}
text:gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText01	{'body': 'GULPIN: Gubi! Gubii!\\pMC: And the verdict is very {STR_VAR_1}!\\nGULPIN says it tastes “{STR_VAR_2}!”\\pThank you so much, {STR_VAR_3}!$'}
text:gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText02	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}'s blending performance\\nleft something to be desired.\\pIf this TRAINER could blend better,\\nthe {POKEBLOCK} would be much tastier.$"}
text:gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText03	{'body': "GULPIN: Gubi! Gubii!\\pMC: Hmm… It's too {STR_VAR_1}.\\nGULPIN says it tastes “{STR_VAR_2}!”\\pIt looks like {STR_VAR_3}'s errors\\nhurt the blending quality…$"}
text:gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText04	{'body': "It's too bad that {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nleading effort went to waste.\\pLet's hope {STR_VAR_2} can turn in\\na better showing next time!$"}
text:gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText05	{'body': 'Tune in next time!\\nOur slogan is “3 CHEERS FOR {POKEBLOCK}S!”$'}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_WhatsYourOpinionOfTrainer	{'body': "Hi, there!\\pI'm a big fan of {STR_VAR_1}.\\nWhat's your opinion of {STR_VAR_1}?$"}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_ThatsWhatYouThink	{'body': "I see, I see. That's what you think\\nabout the TRAINER.$"}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_HaveYouForgottenTrainer	{'body': 'Have you completely forgotten\\nabout {STR_VAR_1}?$'}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_WhatsYourOpinionOfTrainer2	{'body': "I'm a big fan of {STR_VAR_1}.\\nWhat's your opinion of {STR_VAR_1}?$"}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_HowStrongRateTrainer	{'body': 'How strong would you rate {STR_VAR_1}\\non a scale of one hundred?$'}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_HaveYouForgottenTrainer2	{'body': 'Have you completely forgotten\\nabout {STR_VAR_1}?$'}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_YouShouldMeetTrainer	{'body': "Oh, I see!\\nYou should meet {STR_VAR_1} sometime.\\lI'm sure you'll become a fan, too!$"}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_ThankYouIllShareThisInfo	{'body': "I see, I see.\\pThank you!\\nThat's very useful to know.\\pI'll share this information with other\\n{STR_VAR_1} fans and discuss it.$"}
text:LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_HopeYouCatchTVSpecial	{'body': "There's going to be a TV special on\\n{STR_VAR_1} very soon.\\pI hope you catch it!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText00	{'body': "TRAINER FAN CLUB\\n{STR_VAR_1} SPECIAL!\\pThis is a special presentation for\\nthe fans of {STR_VAR_1} all over HOENN!\\pToday, we ask the question, “What do\\npeople think of {STR_VAR_1}?”\\pWe posed the question to {STR_VAR_2}\\nas the TRAINER representative.\\pWe asked, “In one word, how would\\nyou describe {STR_VAR_1}?”\\pThe reply: “{STR_VAR_3}.”\\pKudos to {STR_VAR_2}!\\nWhat a perceptive opinion!\\p“{STR_VAR_3} {STR_VAR_1}.”\\nIt has such a nice ring to it!\\p{STR_VAR_2} also scored {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nstrength from 0 to 100.$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText01	{'body': 'The score was {STR_VAR_3} points!\\nThat is a very high score indeed!\\p{STR_VAR_2} must obviously hold\\n{STR_VAR_1} in very high esteem.$'}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText02	{'body': 'The score was {STR_VAR_3} points!\\nThat is quite a good score.\\p{STR_VAR_2} must consider\\n{STR_VAR_1} to be a rival.$'}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText03	{'body': "The score was {STR_VAR_3} points!\\nThat's a rather weak score.\\p{STR_VAR_2} must consider\\n{STR_VAR_1} to be a mere sidekick.$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText04	{'body': "The score was {STR_VAR_3} point(s)!\\nThat's a terrible score.\\p{STR_VAR_2} must consider\\n{STR_VAR_1} to be an underling.$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText05	{'body': "There you have it, folks!\\pI think we all learned something\\nnew about {STR_VAR_1}.\\pIn closing, I'll leave you with\\n{STR_VAR_2}'s words.\\p{STR_VAR_3} {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVNameRaterText00	{'body': "And now, it's time for…\\nTHE NAME RATER SHOW.\\pI tell your POKéMON's fortune from\\nthe nickname you've bestowed.\\pAdvice is what I have to give, and it is\\nhelpful advice that I offer.\\pToday, I shall do a reading of\\nthe nickname {STR_VAR_3} of {STR_VAR_1}'s\\lPOKéMON {STR_VAR_2}.\\pHmhm…\\pHmm…\\nThis nickname is…$"}
text:gTVNameRaterText01	{'body': 'A nickname that hints at talent in many\\ndifferent ways.\\pI urge this TRAINER to take courage\\nand take on many challenges.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText02	{'body': "A nickname that perfectly complements\\n{STR_VAR_1}, the TRAINER's name.\\pIt suggests that you will forge a fine\\npartnership with precise timing.$"}
text:gTVNameRaterText03	{'body': "A nickname fit for a unique individual\\nof a POKéMON!\\pIf raised properly, this POKéMON's\\nuniqueness will bloom excessively!$"}
text:gTVNameRaterText04	{'body': 'A nickname that will nurture the caring\\nand compassionate side of POKéMON.\\pIf raised properly, this POKéMON will\\ncome to exhibit real warmth!$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText05	{'body': 'A very fine nickname that hints at\\ngreatness to come.\\pI am intrigued about what the future\\nholds in store for this POKéMON.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText06	{'body': 'A good nickname that should make the\\nPOKéMON hale and hearty!\\pThat POKéMON should remain fit and\\nrobust for a long, long time.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText07	{'body': 'A good nickname that should make the\\nPOKéMON very active!\\pI should think that this POKéMON will be\\na strong performer in battles.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText08	{'body': "An appealing nickname that should make\\nthe POKéMON very charming!\\pI don't doubt that this POKéMON will be\\nquite the charmer in POKéMON CONTESTS.$"}
text:gTVNameRaterText09	{'body': 'The nickname {STR_VAR_1} is rooted by\\nthe letter “{STR_VAR_3}.”\\pThat letter is supported by the first\\nletter “{STR_VAR_2},” which gives it a solid sense\\lof presence as a nickname.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText10	{'body': 'The nickname {STR_VAR_1} is very\\nshapely in a pleasing manner.\\pThe presence of the letters “{STR_VAR_2}” and\\n“{STR_VAR_3}”--now that is remarkably good!$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText11	{'body': 'The nickname {STR_VAR_1}--it has a\\nsublime, flowing feel to it.\\pThe flow from the initial letter “{STR_VAR_2}” to\\n“{STR_VAR_3}” is especially wonderful.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText12	{'body': "Let's examine other examples of fine\\nnicknames, shall we?$"}
text:gTVNameRaterText13	{'body': 'Try this example. Take a part of the\\nTRAINER name of {STR_VAR_1}, and end\\lup with the fine nickname {STR_VAR_2}{STR_VAR_3}.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText14	{'body': 'The nickname {STR_VAR_2}{STR_VAR_3} would also work\\nquite well.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText15	{'body': "The POKéMON's species name of\\n{STR_VAR_2} could be used as the basis\\lfor making the nickname {STR_VAR_1}{STR_VAR_3}.$"}
text:gTVNameRaterText16	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1}{STR_VAR_3} would also be an effective\\nnickname.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText17	{'body': 'What should always be avoided is using\\nanother POKéMON species name.\\pFor instance, avoid taking the name of\\n{STR_VAR_2} to make the nickname {STR_VAR_1}{STR_VAR_3}.\\lThat is unacceptable.$'}
text:gTVNameRaterText18	{'body': "I must say that {STR_VAR_1} is quite\\na good nickname.\\pI hope that the TRAINER will continue\\nto treat {STR_VAR_1} with love.\\pThat's it for today's show.\\nMay we meet again.$"}
text:gTVPokemonAnglerText00	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} ANGLER\\pANNOUNCER: Hello! Today, we'll get tips\\non fishing for {STR_VAR_2}.\\pGURU, what advice can you give for\\ncatching {STR_VAR_2}?\\pGURU: Hm? Catching {STR_VAR_2}?\\nWell, let me tell you, be patient and\\lwait. That's the bottom line.\\pDo you see {STR_VAR_1} over there?\\nThat TRAINER makes a good example.\\pThat TRAINER's already had\\n{STR_VAR_3} POKéMON get away.\\pBut there {STR_VAR_1} waits. No giving up.\\nThat's the law for catching {STR_VAR_2}.\\pANNOUNCER: I see…\\pOh! {STR_VAR_1} has finally landed an\\nelusive {STR_VAR_2}!\\pThe TRAINER appears close to tears\\nout of sheer joy!\\pSeeing that elated look, I'm getting\\nthe itch to go fishing, too!\\pViewers, why not take this as a cue to\\ntry some {STR_VAR_2} fishing?\\pUntil our next broadcast, farewell and\\ngood fishing to you all!$"}
text:gTVPokemonAnglerText01	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} ANGLER\\pANNOUNCER: Hello! Today, we'll get tips\\non fishing for {STR_VAR_2}.\\pGURU, what advice can you give for\\ncatching {STR_VAR_2}?\\pGURU: Hm? Catching {STR_VAR_2}?\\nWell, let me tell you, use your fishing\\lROD with vigor!\\pDo you see {STR_VAR_1} over there?\\nSee how the ROD is handled?\\pThat TRAINER's already caught\\n{STR_VAR_3} in a row.\\pANNOUNCER: It's incredible!\\nIt looks like a storm…\\pSeeing technique of that caliber, I'm\\ngetting the itch to go fishing, too.\\pViewers, why not take this as a cue to\\ntry some {STR_VAR_2} fishing?\\pUntil our next broadcast, farewell and\\ngood fishing to you all!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodayFailedText00	{'body': "Hello!\\pIt's time for POKéMON TODAY!\\pBIG SIS: Hi! Is everyone peachy and\\nperky today?\\pToday, we're going to look at {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nPOKéMON {STR_VAR_2}!\\pBIG BRO: Yeah! That's what we're going\\nto do!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodayFailedText01	{'body': "Oh!\\nSpeaking of {STR_VAR_1}…\\pBIG SIS, I saw the TRAINER with my very\\nown eyes!\\pBIG SIS: Oh, what did you see?\\pBIG BRO: Well, I had to go on a trip to\\n{STR_VAR_2}.\\pThat's when I happened to come across\\n{STR_VAR_1}, who was trying to catch the\\lPOKéMON {STR_VAR_3}, but…$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodayFailedText02	{'body': "The POKéMON managed to get away!\\pIt ended up wasting this many\\nPOKé BALLS: {STR_VAR_2}!\\pYou should have seen the expression\\nof frustration on {STR_VAR_1}'s face when\\lthe POKéMON took off!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodayFailedText03	{'body': "But {STR_VAR_1} goofed and made the\\nPOKéMON faint!\\pIt ended up wasting this many\\nPOKé BALLS: {STR_VAR_2}!\\pYou should have seen the expression\\nof stunned dismay on {STR_VAR_1}'s face\\lwhen the POKéMON fainted!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodayFailedText04	{'body': "BIG SIS: Hey, there!\\nThat's not nice!\\pYou shouldn't be laughing at other\\npeople's misfortune!\\pOh, poor {STR_VAR_1}.\\nWhat a shame!\\pBIG BRO: That's true!\\nSorry for laughing.$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodayFailedText05	{'body': "BIG SIS: Bufufu…\\pBIG BRO: Hey!\\nYou just laughed, too!\\pBIG SIS: Huh?!\\pI didn't laugh!\\nHonestly, I didn't!\\pOh, poor {STR_VAR_1}.\\nWhat a shame!\\pBIG BRO: …$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodayFailedText06	{'body': "BIG SIS: That's enough silliness!\\nLet's look at today's POKéMON…\\pHuh?\\nWe're out of time already?\\pAww!\\nWe couldn't profile a POKéMON today!\\pBIG BRO: See you again next time!\\pBIG SIS: Hey, don't end the show\\nwithout me!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText00	{'body': "Hello!\\pIt's time for POKéMON TODAY!\\pBIG SIS: Hi! Is everyone peachy and\\nperky today?\\pToday, we're going to look at {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nPOKéMON {STR_VAR_2}!\\pBIG BRO: Yeah! That's what we're going\\nto do!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText01	{'body': 'BIG SIS: {STR_VAR_1} gave the nickname\\n{STR_VAR_3} to the {STR_VAR_2}!\\pIt sounds like {STR_VAR_3} is getting\\ngood, loving care!$'}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText02	{'body': 'BIG BRO: The TRAINER had to throw this\\nmany POKé BALLS to catch it: {STR_VAR_3}!\\pIt finally took a single {STR_VAR_2}\\nto catch it!$'}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText03	{'body': 'BIG SIS: If it was that easy to catch,\\nit must have been destiny that brought\\l{STR_VAR_1} and the {STR_VAR_2} together!$'}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText04	{'body': "BIG SIS: Wow! That's so neat!\\pBut you know what they say, a POKéMON\\nthat takes a lot of effort to catch\\learns the love of its TRAINER!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText05	{'body': "BIG SIS: {STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2} is a\\nmemorable POKéMON because it took an\\linvaluable MASTER BALL to catch!\\pBIG BRO: Wow! That's mega-awesome!\\pBIG SIS: {STR_VAR_1} must have really\\nwanted that {STR_VAR_2}, for sure!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText06	{'body': "BIG BRO: Then to give the nickname\\n{STR_VAR_3} to that {STR_VAR_2}…\\pYou really get a good idea about\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s TRAINER sense.\\pBIG SIS: I second that notion!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText07	{'body': "If it were me, I'd give that nickname\\nto something like this {STR_VAR_3}!\\pBIG BRO: Whoa! That could be the start\\nof something new!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText08	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} the {STR_VAR_1}?\\nDoesn't that sound perfect?\\pThe letters and everything--they\\nsound just right for the POKéMON\\l{STR_VAR_1}!\\pBIG BRO: Yeah, true, that!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText09	{'body': 'As far as I know, no TRAINER has ever\\ngiven the nickname {STR_VAR_2} to their\\l{STR_VAR_1}!\\pBIG BRO: That just goes to show what\\ngreat taste the TRAINER has in picking\\lnicknames!$'}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText10	{'body': "The next time I catch a POKéMON,\\nI should give it the name {STR_VAR_2}.\\pBIG BRO: Huh? Me, too!\\nI'll use the nickname {STR_VAR_2}, too!$"}
text:gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText11	{'body': 'BIG SIS: Oh, no!\\nLook at the time!\\pWell, gang, this is it for today.\\nSee you again next time!\\pBIG BRO: Remember, it could be your\\nPOKéMON in the spotlight next time!$'}
text:SmartShopper_Intro	{'body': "Hello!\\pIt's time for TODAY'S SMART SHOPPER.\\pINTERVIEWER: How are you, viewers?\\pToday we're visiting a shop\\nin {STR_VAR_2}.\\pLet's check on what the hot sellers\\nhave been recently.$"}
text:SmartShopper_ClerkNormal	{'body': "Let's interview the clerk to get the\\nlowdown.\\pHi, how's your business?\\pCLERK: Oh, we're doing excellent.\\pRecently, {STR_VAR_2} has been\\nselling especially strongly.\\pWhy, just the other day a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_1} bought {STR_VAR_3}.$"}
text:SmartShopper_RandomComment1	{'body': "INTERVIEWER: The TRAINER bought\\n{STR_VAR_3} {STR_VAR_2}S? That's a haul!\\pIf I may say so, {STR_VAR_1} must have\\nbeen stocking up for a long journey\\lto far-off places.\\pFor traveling, {STR_VAR_2}S are so\\nimportant!$"}
text:SmartShopper_RandomComment2	{'body': "INTERVIEWER: Speaking of the item\\n{STR_VAR_2}, I just bought {STR_VAR_3} of\\lthem recently.\\pAfter all, {STR_VAR_2}'s a great item!$"}
text:SmartShopper_RandomComment3	{'body': "INTERVIEWER: {STR_VAR_2}?!\\nBut {STR_VAR_3} of them?!\\pI didn't think there would be anyone\\nbuying that many.\\pMy goodness, I can only afford one or\\ntwo at a time…$"}
text:SmartShopper_RandomComment4	{'body': "INTERVIEWER: One time, I bought\\na whole lot of the item {STR_VAR_2}.\\pBut it turned out to be too many.\\nI ended up regretting it…\\pSince then, I only buy strictly what\\nI absolutely need…\\pOops!\\pThere's no point talking about me!$"}
text:SmartShopper_SecondItem	{'body': "CLERK: {STR_VAR_1} also bought the item\\n{STR_VAR_2} in bulk, taking {STR_VAR_3}.\\pINTERVIEWER: Oh, that's smart.\\n{STR_VAR_2}'s a very good item, too.$"}
text:SmartShopper_ThirdItem	{'body': 'CLERK: And, the TRAINER also bought\\n{STR_VAR_3} of the item {STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:SmartShopper_DuringSale	{'body': "CLERK: Plus, it was during a big sale.\\nThat's smart shopping.$"}
text:SmartShopper_OutroNormal	{'body': "INTERVIEWER: Hmm… {STR_VAR_1} sounds like\\nquite the shrewd bargain hunter!\\pIn total, {STR_VAR_1}'s purchases came to…\\p¥{STR_VAR_2}?!\\nWhat an amazing sum!\\pOops! We're out of time!\\nSee you on our next broadcast!$"}
text:SmartShopper_IsVIP	{'body': 'CLERK: {STR_VAR_1} is a VIP customer,\\nno doubt about it.$'}
text:SmartShopper_ClerkMax	{'body': "Let's interview the clerk to get the\\nlowdown.\\pHi, how's your business?\\pCLERK: Oh, we're doing unbelievable\\nbusiness. It's almost overwhelming.\\pRecently, a TRAINER named {STR_VAR_1}\\nbought the item {STR_VAR_2} in bulk.\\pThe TRAINER almost cleared out our\\nentire stock of {STR_VAR_2}S.\\pI never dreamt that any customer\\nwould ever need so many {STR_VAR_2}S.\\lIt's just unheard of!\\pINTERVIEWER: So that would be like 100\\nor 200 sold?\\pCLERK: Oh, no, much more than that!\\pINTERVIEWER: Oh, my goodness!\\n{STR_VAR_1} must be a special shopper!\\pCLERK: {STR_VAR_1} is a VIP customer,\\nno doubt about it.$"}
text:SmartShopper_OutroMax	{'body': 'INTERVIEWER: Hmm…\\nThat is amazing.\\pBut why would the TRAINER need to buy\\nso many?\\p… …\\pThe mystery deepens, but this is all\\nthe time we have today.\\lSee you on our next broadcast!\\pStill, {STR_VAR_1} is certainly an enigma…$'}
text:gTVWorldOfMastersText00	{'body': "THE WORLD OF MASTERS\\pHello, viewers.\\pPerhaps you are aware of a TRAINER\\nnamed {STR_VAR_1}.\\p{STR_VAR_1} is famous as a master at\\ncatching POKéMON.\\p{STR_VAR_1}'s quest for POKéMON depends\\nentirely on a careful search on foot.\\pOn one memorable day, the TRAINER\\nwalked some {STR_VAR_2} steps.\\pThe total number of POKéMON caught\\nthat day reached an impressive {STR_VAR_3}!$"}
text:gTVWorldOfMastersText01	{'body': 'That remarkable feat must have been\\npossible because of the trust between\\lthe TRAINER and {STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:gTVWorldOfMastersText02	{'body': "The master caught the day's last\\n{STR_VAR_3} near {STR_VAR_2}.\\pThat POKéMON apparently enjoys\\na special status as a record holder.\\pSkilled TRAINERS should be encouraged\\nto challenge this fine record.\\pThat's all for today.\\nPlease tune in next time.$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText00	{'body': "TODAY'S RIVAL TRAINER!\\pHello, fellow POKéMON TRAINERS!\\nHow are we all doing today?\\pToday, like every other day,\\nwe'll examine one of our rivals!$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText07	{'body': "Today's rival TRAINER is {STR_VAR_1},\\nwho's around {STR_VAR_3} now.\\p{STR_VAR_1} has so far registered\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON in the POKéDEX.$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText08	{'body': "Today's rival TRAINER is {STR_VAR_1},\\nwho's in a SECRET BASE now.\\p{STR_VAR_1} has so far registered\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON in the POKéDEX.$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText09	{'body': "Today's rival TRAINER is {STR_VAR_1}.\\pSo far, {STR_VAR_1} has registered\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON in the POKéDEX.$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText10	{'body': "Today's rival TRAINER is {STR_VAR_1},\\nwho's on a ferry now.\\p{STR_VAR_1} has so far registered\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON in the POKéDEX.$$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText01	{'body': 'And how many BADGES does our rival\\nhave? The number is {STR_VAR_1}!$'}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText02	{'body': "But our rival hasn't obtained\\na single BADGE yet!$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText03	{'body': "Our rival hasn't obtained a single\\nBATTLE FRONTIER Symbol yet.$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText04	{'body': "Let's see how many BATTLE FRONTIER\\nSymbols our rival has.\\pGold Symbols: {STR_VAR_1}!\\nSilver Symbols: {STR_VAR_2}!$"}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText05	{'body': 'Our rival has collected {STR_VAR_1} Battle\\nPoint(s) at the BATTLE FRONTIER.$'}
text:gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText06	{'body': "So, how did you measure up in\\ncomparison to {STR_VAR_1}?\\pThe adventure rolls on!\\pFellow TRAINERS!\\pLet's all keep moving forward\\nand ahead of our rivals!$"}
text:TrendWatcher_Intro	{'body': "DEWFORD TREND-WATCHER NETWORK!\\pMC: Wassup?\\nWe'll keep it real with the latest on\\lwhat's hip and happening in DEWFORD.\\pOur guest today is this old cat whose\\nclaim to fame is being the authority\\lon all things in DEWFORD.\\pOld man: Glad to be here.\\pMC: Let's cut to the chase, right on.\\pWhat's your word on what's groovin'\\nthe good folks of DEWFORD?\\pOld man: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}.\\pMC: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2},\\nyou say?\\pOld man: No.\\p{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2} never\\ndid get popular at all.\\pWould you like to hear about it?\\pMC: Uh, no. What we want to know is\\nwhat's the in thing of the moment…$"}
text:TrendWatcher_MaleTaughtMePhrase	{'body': 'Old man: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}\\nwas what {STR_VAR_3} from LITTLEROOT\\ltaught me as being trendy…$'}
text:TrendWatcher_FemaleTaughtMePhrase	{'body': 'Old man: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}\\nwas what {STR_VAR_3} from LITTLEROOT\\ltaught me as being trendy…$'}
text:TrendWatcher_PhraseWasHopeless	{'body': "But it was utterly hopeless.\\p{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2} festival!\\p{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2} contest!\\pI tried teaching everyone the best\\nI could, but…\\pPerhaps the {STR_VAR_1} part just\\nwasn't right…\\pMC: Uh, excuse me, compadre, I need\\nto hear about what's in now…$"}
text:TrendWatcher_MaleTellMeBigger	{'body': 'Old man: {STR_VAR_3}!\\nPlease, tell me something bigger than\\lthat {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:TrendWatcher_FemaleTellMeBigger	{'body': 'Old man: {STR_VAR_3}!\\nPlease, tell me something bigger than\\lthat {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$'}
text:TrendWatcher_Outro	{'body': "MC: …Uh… So, there you have it,\\nall you trendy, hep cats out there!\\p{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}…uh…\\nDidn't get hip or happening in DEWFORD!\\pMy time is up. Catch you on the fly!\\pOld man: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$"}
text:gTVHoennTreasureInvestigatorsText00	{'body': "HOENN TREASURE INVESTIGATORS!\\pHi, gang!\\nScore any secret items lately?\\pAs always, we'll examine eyewitness\\nreports of secrets from all over!\\pLet's start with a letter.\\nIt says, “{STR_VAR_1} discovered!”$"}
text:gTVHoennTreasureInvestigatorsText01	{'body': "Wow, we'd better check this letter\\nout! Let me read it to you.\\p…Dear INVESTIGATORS,\\nI hope you are well.\\pI recently saw {STR_VAR_2} somewhere\\naround {STR_VAR_3}.\\pThe TRAINER found the item\\n{STR_VAR_1}. It made me envious.\\p…Well, good going, {STR_VAR_2}!\\pViewers, let that motivate you to\\nfire up your ITEMFINDERS and search!\\pI'll be waiting for exciting news\\nfrom all of you!$"}
text:gTVHoennTreasureInvestigatorsText02	{'body': "Wow, we'd better check this letter\\nout! Let me read it to you.\\p…Dear INVESTIGATORS,\\nI hope you are well.\\pI recently saw {STR_VAR_2} on a ferry.\\pThe TRAINER found the item\\n{STR_VAR_1}. It made me envious.\\p…Well, good going, {STR_VAR_2}!\\pViewers, let that motivate you to\\nfire up your ITEMFINDERS and search!\\pI'll be waiting for exciting news\\nfrom all of you!$"}
text:gTVFindThatGamerText00	{'body': "FIND THAT GAMER!\\pHey, all you gamers!\\nHow's your {STR_VAR_2} spinning?\\pLike always, we'll cast our spotlight\\non a rare TRAINER who's visited the\\lGAME CORNER!\\pToday, our no. 1 gamer is…\\n{STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVFindThatGamerText01	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1} played the {STR_VAR_2} game\\nand won a rare {STR_VAR_3} COINS.\\p“When {STR_VAR_1} comes, we need to\\nmake sure we have enough COINS.”\\pThat's what the GAME CORNER clerks\\nmutter when our gamer is in play!\\pViewers, it's best to watch your COINS\\nlike {STR_VAR_1} if you visit the GAME\\lCORNER and play the {STR_VAR_2} game.\\pThis is live from the GAME CORNER--\\nwhere you can feel the excitement!\\pThat's all for today!$"}
text:gTVFindThatGamerText02	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1} played the {STR_VAR_2} game\\nand lost {STR_VAR_3} COINS.\\p“When {STR_VAR_1} comes, our COIN\\nsales seem to increase.”\\pThat's what the GAME CORNER clerks\\nsay when our gamer is in play!$"}
text:gTVFindThatGamerText03	{'body': "Viewers, it's best to watch your COINS\\nlike {STR_VAR_1} if you visit the GAME\\lCORNER and play the {STR_VAR_2} game.\\pThis is live from the GAME CORNER--\\nwhere you can feel the excitement!\\pThat's all for today!$"}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText00	{'body': 'BREAKING NEWS TV!$'}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText01	{'body': "Rare {STR_VAR_2} caught by\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pWe're live from the vicinity of\\n{STR_VAR_3}!\\p{STR_VAR_1} successfully captured\\na rare {STR_VAR_2} earlier here!$"}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText02	{'body': 'When {STR_VAR_1} encountered the rare\\n{STR_VAR_2}, the TRAINER sent out\\lthe POKéMON {STR_VAR_3}.$'}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText03	{'body': 'In the battle, the number of POKé\\nBALLS thrown by the TRAINER was {STR_VAR_1}.\\pUltimately, the rare POKéMON was\\ncaught by the {STR_VAR_2} used last.$'}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText04	{'body': "In that instant, {STR_VAR_2}\\nechoed with {STR_VAR_1}'s roars of\\ltriumphant joy.\\pI must say I'm a little envious of\\n{STR_VAR_1}. I'd love to roar, too.\\p…That ends the live feed from\\nthe happy scene!$"}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText05	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1} fails to capture a rare\\n{STR_VAR_2}!\\pWe're live from the vicinity of\\n{STR_VAR_3}!\\pIt was here that {STR_VAR_1} failed\\nto capture a rare {STR_VAR_2}!$"}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText06	{'body': 'When {STR_VAR_1} encountered the rare\\n{STR_VAR_2}, the TRAINER sent out\\lthe POKéMON {STR_VAR_3}.$'}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText07	{'body': 'The TRAINER made the {STR_VAR_2}\\nuse the move {STR_VAR_1}.\\pWithout meaning to, the TRAINER\\nmade the rare POKéMON faint…$'}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText12	{'body': 'However, {STR_VAR_1} panicked at\\nthe sight of the rare {STR_VAR_2}.\\pIn confusion, the TRAINER ordered\\n{STR_VAR_3} to attack.\\pWithout meaning to, the TRAINER\\nmade the rare POKéMON faint.$'}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText08	{'body': "In that instant, {STR_VAR_2}\\nechoed with {STR_VAR_1}'s shrieks of\\lfrustration…$"}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText09	{'body': "However, {STR_VAR_1} seemed to run\\nout of POKé BALLS.\\pThe TRAINER had to break off\\nthe battle with the rare {STR_VAR_2}.\\pIn that instant, {STR_VAR_3}\\nechoed with {STR_VAR_1}'s shrieks of\\lfrustration…$"}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText10	{'body': "However, the {STR_VAR_2} fled without\\nwarning.\\pIn that instant, {STR_VAR_3}\\nechoed with {STR_VAR_1}'s shrieks of\\lfrustration…$"}
text:gTVBreakingNewsText11	{'body': 'I must say I feel for {STR_VAR_1}.\\nWhy, it makes me want to shriek, too.\\p…That ends the live feed from\\nthe melancholy scene!$'}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText00	{'body': "Hello, folks!\\nIt's time again for\\la SECRET BASE VISIT.\\pToday, we visit the SECRET BASE\\nof {STR_VAR_1}.\\pHow has {STR_VAR_1} personalized\\nthe SECRET BASE?\\pLet's find out!\\n… … … … … …$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText01	{'body': "Oh!\\nHow marvelous!\\pThis {STR_VAR_2}…\\nIt's not what one would expect to\\lfind here!$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText02	{'body': "Oh!\\nHow remarkable!\\pThere isn't a single piece\\nof furniture or interior goods!\\pMere mortals couldn't hope to\\nimitate this bold statement!\\pIt's simple, but it bursts, yes,\\nbursts with wildness!\\pMy hat's off to you, {STR_VAR_1}.\\nIt had to be you!$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText03	{'body': 'Oh! I see!\\nWith perfect clarity, I see it!\\pThis {STR_VAR_2} being here…\\nIt sends an effective message!$'}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText04	{'body': 'Oh! I see!\\nWith perfect clarity, I see it!\\pThis space is kept deliberately\\nclear of interior items!\\pIt sends an effective message!$'}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText05	{'body': "Wheeew!\\pThe pairing of the {STR_VAR_2}\\nwith the {STR_VAR_3}!\\pIt's a dream combination if there\\never was one!$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText06	{'body': 'Wheeew!\\pThe placement of this {STR_VAR_2}\\nright here…\\pIt has a presence that fills\\nthe entire SECRET BASE!$'}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText07	{'body': "Wheeew!\\pThere's nothing in place here.\\pThis empty space has an effect on\\nthe entire SECRET BASE.$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText08	{'body': "Oh!\\nHere comes {STR_VAR_1}!\\lLet's challenge the TRAINER!\\p… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText09	{'body': "Sigh… I've got to hand it to\\n{STR_VAR_1}. Those POKéMON were a\\lformidable team!\\pThat the {STR_VAR_2} knew the move\\n{STR_VAR_3}… It shows you what\\lsort of a TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} is.\\pCertainly, it was quite a lesson!$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText10	{'body': "Aiyeeh!\\nI've got to hand it to {STR_VAR_1}.\\pThe TRAINER's POKéMON were\\nmonstrously tough!\\pThey gave ample proof of {STR_VAR_1}'s\\ntenacity as a TRAINER.\\pThat the {STR_VAR_2} knew the move\\n{STR_VAR_3}…\\pIt shows you what sort of a TRAINER\\n{STR_VAR_1} is.\\pCertainly, it was quite a lesson!$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText11	{'body': "Wheeew!\\nI've got to hand it to {STR_VAR_1}.\\pThe TRAINER's POKéMON were clearly\\nraised in a well-balanced manner.\\pThey gave ample proof of {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nthoughtfulness as a TRAINER.\\pThat the {STR_VAR_2} knew the move\\n{STR_VAR_3}…\\pIt shows you what sort of a TRAINER\\n{STR_VAR_1} is.\\pCertainly, it was quite a lesson!$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText12	{'body': "Well, well!\\nI've got to hand it to {STR_VAR_1}.\\pThe TRAINER's POKéMON showed\\ngreat promise for future growth.\\pThey represented {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nhopes and dreams.\\pThat the {STR_VAR_2} knew the move\\n{STR_VAR_3}…\\pIt shows you what sort of a TRAINER\\n{STR_VAR_1} is.\\pCertainly, it was quite a lesson!$"}
text:gTVSecretBaseVisitText13	{'body': "I must say, what a superb SECRET BASE\\nit was!\\pViewers, if you have the chance,\\ndo visit {STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE.\\pUntil next time, I bid you adieu!$"}
text:gTVPokemonLotteryWinnerFlashReportText00	{'body': "It's exciting!\\nIt's dramatic!\\pIt's the POKéMON LOTTERY\\nWINNER FLASH REPORT!\\pHello! We're coming at you live from\\nthe POKéMON LOTTERY CORNER on\\lthe ground floor of the LILYCOVE\\lDEPARTMENT STORE!\\pLike it always happens, another\\nlucky TRAINER appeared today!\\pThat TRAINER's name…\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\p{STR_VAR_1} won the {STR_VAR_2} prize\\nand took home the {STR_VAR_3}!\\p{STR_VAR_1}!\\nCongratulations!\\pViewers, don't just watch,\\nget in on the action!\\pAll of us at the LILYCOVE DEPARTMENT\\nSTORE look forward to your next visit!\\pThis has been a live broadcast from\\nthe LILYCOVE DEPARTMENT STORE,\\loffering you the greatest selection\\lin all HOENN!$"}
text:gTVThePokemonBattleSeminarText00	{'body': "THE POKéMON BATTLE SEMINAR!\\pWe examine battles to see what\\nlessons we may learn from others.\\pToday's case study is on {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nbattle.\\p{STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2} was\\nbattling one {STR_VAR_3}…$"}
text:gTVThePokemonBattleSeminarText01	{'body': "And it used the move {STR_VAR_3}\\non the {STR_VAR_2}…\\pLet's look at the damage options,\\n{STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVThePokemonBattleSeminarText02	{'body': "The TRAINER's {STR_VAR_1} also\\nknew$"}
text:gTVThePokemonBattleSeminarText03	{'body': 'the moves {STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_2},\\nand {STR_VAR_3}.$'}
text:gTVThePokemonBattleSeminarText04	{'body': 'the moves {STR_VAR_1} and\\n{STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:gTVThePokemonBattleSeminarText05	{'body': 'the move {STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:gTVThePokemonBattleSeminarText06	{'body': 'Our damage comparison suggests\\n{STR_VAR_1} could hit harder than\\l{STR_VAR_2}.\\pMore damage is not always the\\ngoal! Accuracy, side effects, and\\lcatching a wild POKéMON can change\\lthe best choice.\\pConsider the whole field before\\nyou choose. Until next time!$'}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText00	{'body': "All together now!\\nTRAINER FAN CLUB!\\pMC: How's everyone groovin'?\\nToday, we've rounded up the fans of\\lthe hyper-popular TRAINER {STR_VAR_1}!\\pFANS: Wrooooooaaaaah!\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_1}!\\pMC: Everyone!\\nHow do you like {STR_VAR_1}?!\\pFANS: We love {STR_VAR_1}!\\pMC: What do you love about\\n{STR_VAR_1}?!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText01	{'body': 'FANS: Their cool way of throwing\\nPOKé BALLS!$'}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText02	{'body': 'FANS: Their adorable way of running!$'}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText03	{'body': 'FANS: How the TRAINER turns tough\\nwhen the going gets tough!$'}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText04	{'body': "FANS: The TRAINER's knowledge of\\nPOKéMON!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText05	{'body': "FANS: The TRAINER's kindness toward\\nall POKéMON!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText06	{'body': "FANS: The TRAINER's amazing\\nBIKE-riding techniques!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText07	{'body': "FANS: The TRAINER's impressive\\nitem-buying style!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText08	{'body': "FANS: The TRAINER's charming way\\nof nicknaming POKéMON!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText09	{'body': "FANS: The TRAINER's nifty style of\\ndecorating a SECRET BASE!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText10	{'body': "FANS: The TRAINER's bold ways of\\nusing TMs!$"}
text:gTVTrainerFanClubText11	{'body': "MC: As you've just seen, {STR_VAR_1}\\nis hot! Like, too hot to touch, yow!\\pAmong {STR_VAR_1}'s FANS\\nthere's a special slogan!\\pMC: When I say {STR_VAR_1},\\nyou say…\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_2}!\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_3}!\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_2}!\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_3}!\\pMC: That's right, when someone says,\\n“{STR_VAR_1}”…\\pCome back with, “{STR_VAR_2}\\n{STR_VAR_3}!”\\pThat has such a unique ring to it!\\nI can see why people become FANS\\lof {STR_VAR_1}!\\pOkay, you, in front of the TV, join us!\\nAll together now!\\pMC: When I say {STR_VAR_1},\\nyou say…\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_2}!\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_3}!\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_2}!\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_3}!\\pMC: Thanks for joining us, all you\\nwild FANS of {STR_VAR_1}!\\lThat's the show! See you again!\\pMC: When I say {STR_VAR_1},\\nyou say…\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_2}!\\pFANS: {STR_VAR_3}!$"}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_Intro	{'body': "SPOT THE CUTIES!\\nPOKéMON IN RIBBONS!\\pHello, my sweet viewers!\\pI just know you'll agree, but a POKéMON\\nwearing RIBBONS is simply divine!\\pToday, I want to share with you\\na lovely POKéMON I spotted while\\lout on a stroll in town.\\pToday's featured pretty POKéMON\\nis {STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2}.$"}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonsLow	{'body': 'The number of RIBBONS that\\n{STR_VAR_2} wears is {STR_VAR_3}.\\pIt says a lot about how much\\n{STR_VAR_1} adores the POKéMON.$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonsMid	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} wears an amazing\\n{STR_VAR_3} RIBBONS!\\pIt speaks volumes about {STR_VAR_1}'s\\ncommitment to the POKéMON!$"}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonsHigh	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} wears an incredible\\n{STR_VAR_3} RIBBONS!\\pIt shows you {STR_VAR_1}'s total\\ndedication as a collector!$"}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonIntro	{'body': 'Let us take a closer look at the many\\nRIBBONS worn by {STR_VAR_2}.$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonChampion	{'body': 'The CHAMPION RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it upon entering\\nthe HALL OF FAME.\\pIt verily draws out the bravery\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the CHAMP RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonCool	{'body': 'The COOL RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for winning\\na COOL CONTEST.\\pIt verily draws out the coolness\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the COOL RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonBeauty	{'body': 'The BEAUTY RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for winning\\na BEAUTY CONTEST.\\pIt verily draws out the beauty\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the BEAUTY RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonCute	{'body': 'The CUTE RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for winning\\na CUTE CONTEST.\\pIt verily draws out the cuteness\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the CUTE RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonSmart	{'body': 'The SMART RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for winning\\na SMART CONTEST.\\pIt verily draws out the smartness\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the SMART RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonTough	{'body': 'The TOUGH RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for winning\\na TOUGH CONTEST.\\pIt verily draws out the toughness\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the TOUGH RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonWinning	{'body': 'The WINNING RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for its feats\\nat the BATTLE TOWER.\\pIt verily draws out the mightiness\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the WINNING RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonVictory	{'body': 'The VICTORY RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for its feats\\nat the BATTLE TOWER.\\pIt verily draws out the incredible\\nmightiness of {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the VICTORY RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonArtist	{'body': 'The ARTIST RIBBON is especially\\nfetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for being\\nthe model for an artist.\\pIt verily draws out the pop-star charm\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the ARTIST RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_RibbonEffort	{'body': 'The Hard Worker RIBBON is\\nespecially fetching.\\p{STR_VAR_2} received it for being\\nan especially dedicated worker.\\pIt verily draws out the determination\\nof {STR_VAR_2}.\\p{STR_VAR_2} and the Hard Worker RIBBON!\\nThe combination is super effective!$'}
text:TVSpotTheCuties_Outro	{'body': '…Sigh…\\pRIBBONS and POKéMON…\\nThey go so wonderfully together!\\pBefore I swoon,\\nI bid you all farewell!$'}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText00	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pWe've got some uplifting news from\\nthe BATTLE FRONTIER.$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText01	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while on\\lthe BATTLE TOWER's SINGLE BATTLE\\lROOM challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText02	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while on\\lthe BATTLE TOWER's DOUBLE BATTLE\\lROOM challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText03	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while on\\lthe BATTLE TOWER's MULTI BATTLE\\lROOM challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText04	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while on\\lthe BATTLE TOWER's LINK MULTI BATTLE\\lROOM challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText05	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-championship-streak record\\lcompeting in the BATTLE DOME's\\lSINGLE BATTLE Tournaments.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText06	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-championship-streak record\\lcompeting in the BATTLE DOME's\\lDOUBLE BATTLE Tournaments.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText07	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while on\\lthe BATTLE FACTORY's Battle\\lSwap Single challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText08	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while on\\lthe BATTLE FACTORY's Battle\\lSwap Double challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText09	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\nrecord of clearing {STR_VAR_2} rooms\\lwhile on the BATTLE PIKE's Battle\\lChoice challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText10	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while\\lcompeting in the BATTLE ARENA's\\lSet KO Tournaments.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText11	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while on\\lthe BATTLE PALACE's SINGLE BATTLE\\lHALL challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText12	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\n{STR_VAR_2}-win-streak record while on\\lthe BATTLE PALACE's DOUBLE BATTLE\\lHALL challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText13	{'body': "The TRAINER {STR_VAR_1} set a new\\nrecord of clearing {STR_VAR_2} floors\\lwhile on the BATTLE PYRAMID's\\lBattle Quest challenge.\\pHere's to {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText14	{'body': 'And to the three POKéMON, {STR_VAR_1},\\n{STR_VAR_2}, and {STR_VAR_3}!\\pCongratulations for your\\nrecord-breaking performance!$'}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText15	{'body': 'And to the two POKéMON, {STR_VAR_1}\\nand {STR_VAR_2}!\\pCongratulations for your\\nrecord-breaking performance!$'}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText16	{'body': 'And to the four POKéMON: {STR_VAR_1}!\\p{STR_VAR_2}!\\p{STR_VAR_3}!$'}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText17	{'body': 'And {STR_VAR_1}!\\pCongratulations for your\\nrecord-breaking performance!$'}
text:gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText18	{'body': "Let's hope for more record-setting\\nfeats from {STR_VAR_1} and the loyal\\lPOKéMON!\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS!$"}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText00	{'body': "WHAT'S NO. 1 IN HOENN TODAY?\\nYes, it's that time again!\\pHello, viewers! Are you giving your\\nbest at whatever you do?\\pLet's have a look at the TRAINER\\nwho did the very best today!\\pToday's no. 1 TRAINER is none other\\nthan {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText01	{'body': "In one day, {STR_VAR_1} spun the SLOTS\\nat the GAME CORNER {STR_VAR_2} times.\\pWhile playing, {STR_VAR_1} was heard\\nmurmuring, “For me, the reels don't\\leven move…”\\lIsn't that interesting?$"}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText02	{'body': "In one day, {STR_VAR_1} played\\nthe ROULETTE game at the GAME\\lCORNER {STR_VAR_2} times.\\pWhile playing, {STR_VAR_1} shouted,\\n“Let the balls decide!”\\pThe TRAINER's eyes were focused and\\nthe face showed concentration.$"}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText03	{'body': "In one day, {STR_VAR_1} battled\\nwild POKéMON {STR_VAR_2} times!\\pApparently, {STR_VAR_1}'s POKéMON\\nhave grown incomparably stronger.\\pThey appear eager to battle anywhere,\\nanytime, and anyhow!$"}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText04	{'body': 'In just one day, {STR_VAR_1} spun\\nthe BERRY BLENDER {STR_VAR_2} times!\\pToward the end, even {STR_VAR_1}\\nseemed to get dizzy.\\pThe TRAINER appeared to totter\\naround like a SPINDA!$'}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText05	{'body': "In just one day, {STR_VAR_1} planted\\n{STR_VAR_2} BERRIES!\\pAs a result, {STR_VAR_1}'s clothes\\nbecame filthy with dirt.\\pWhere the TRAINER planted, countless\\nflowers have burst into bloom.\\pThe flowers are said to soothe\\nthe emotions of people.$"}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText06	{'body': "In just one day, {STR_VAR_1} picked\\n{STR_VAR_2} BERRIES!\\p{STR_VAR_1}'s BAG became so filled\\nwith BERRIES, the TRAINER had trouble\\lwalking afterward!$"}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText07	{'body': 'In just one day, {STR_VAR_1} obtained\\n{STR_VAR_2} Battle Points!\\p{STR_VAR_1} was later seen wrestling\\nwith the choice of exchanging\\lthe Battle Points for a cool item or\\la nifty interior decoration.\\pThe TRAINER reportedly was grinning\\nwhile mulling options.$'}
text:gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText08	{'body': "Well, isn't that something!\\p{STR_VAR_1}!\\nYou're today's no. 1 TRAINER!\\pViewers, take heart from {STR_VAR_1}!\\nYou, too, can be no. 1 every day!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_Intro	{'body': "SECRET BASE SECRETS!\\pWhat do TRAINERS do in the secrecy\\nof SECRET BASES?\\pToday, we investigate {STR_VAR_1}'s\\nSECRET BASE.\\pOh? It looks like {STR_VAR_2} has come\\nfor a visit.\\pLet's have a peek!\\pWhat will {STR_VAR_2} do?$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_WhatWillPlayerDoNext1	{'body': 'What will {STR_VAR_2} do next?$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_WhatWillPlayerDoNext2	{'body': 'And now, what will {STR_VAR_2} do?$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_TookXStepsBeforeLeaving	{'body': "In the end, {STR_VAR_2} took {STR_VAR_3} steps\\nin {STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE before\\lleaving.$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_BaseFailedToInterestPlayer	{'body': "Hmm…\\pIt appears as if {STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET\\nBASE failed to interest {STR_VAR_2}…$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_PlayerEnjoyedBase	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} appears to have enjoyed\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE thoroughly.$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_PlayerHugeFanOfBase	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2} appears to have become\\na huge fan of {STR_VAR_1}'s\\lSECRET BASE.$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_Outro	{'body': "Viewers may want to check out\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE, too.\\pTune in next time as we visit another\\nSECRET BASE! Thanks for joining us!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_StoppedMoving1	{'body': "The visitor has stopped!\\pThe visitor isn't moving at all!\\pWas {STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE\\nthat unimpressive?$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_StoppedMoving2	{'body': "The visitor has stopped!\\pThe visitor isn't moving at all!\\pIs it fatigue?\\nHas the visitor grown weary?$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedChair	{'body': 'The visitor sat down on a chair!\\nThe visitor is seated!\\pLook at that look of delight!\\pThat chair must be very comfortable\\nto get that response!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedBalloon	{'body': 'The visitor charged at a balloon!\\pIt burst!\\nOh, my goodness, it popped!\\pThe visitor appears startled by\\nthe sudden noise!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedTent	{'body': "The visitor entered a TENT!\\pThe visitor is running around!\\pOh, my, the visitor is frolicking!\\pThe visitor appears surprised by\\nthe TENT's size!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedPlant	{'body': 'The visitor is examining\\na potted plant!\\pThe visitor has surprisingly\\nmature taste!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedGoldShield	{'body': "The visitor is examining\\na GOLD SHIELD!\\pThe visitor's eyes appear to be\\nlit up with wonder!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedSilverShield	{'body': 'The visitor is examining\\na SILVER SHIELD!\\pThe visitor appears to be wide-eyed!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedGlassOrnament	{'body': "The visitor is examining\\na GLASS ORNAMENT!\\pOh, no!\\pThe visitor is touching it!\\pIt's getting covered with\\nfingerprints…$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedTV	{'body': 'The visitor is watching television!\\pLooks like we have a big fan of TV!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedMudBall	{'body': 'The visitor stomped on a MUD BALL!\\pThe visitor looks delighted!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedBag	{'body': "…Oh?\\pThe visitor is reaching for their own\\nBAG and rummaging about in it!\\pThe visitor pulled out\\none {STR_VAR_2}!\\pLook at the visitor smile while\\nholding up the {STR_VAR_2}!\\pIt's like a TV commercial!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedCushion	{'body': 'The visitor grabs a cushion and…$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_HitCushion	{'body': '…begins hitting it!\\pIs the visitor under a lot of stress?$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_HuggedCushion	{'body': '…hugs it tight!\\pCould the visitor be feeling happy\\nabout something?$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_BattledWon	{'body': "The visitor is chatting with\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pIt looks like they're going to\\nhave a battle!\\pAnd…\\pIt's the visitor!\\nThe visitor won an away match!\\pThe visitor is doing\\na victory dance!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_BattledLost	{'body': "The visitor is chatting with\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pIt looks like they're going to\\nhave a battle!\\pAnd…\\pIt's {STR_VAR_1}!\\nThe visitor has lost!\\pThe visitor looks dejected!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_DeclinedBattle	{'body': "The visitor is chatting with\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pIt looks like they're going to\\nhave a battle!\\pAnd…\\pNo, the visitor has refused!\\pThere won't be a battle after all!\\pDid the visitor find {STR_VAR_1}\\nunappealing?$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedPoster	{'body': "The visitor is staring intently\\nat a poster!\\pIs the poster to the visitor's\\nliking?\\p…But… There's something disturbing\\nabout the visitor's stares.$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedNoteMat	{'body': 'The visitor stepped on a NOTE MAT!\\p…Hmm…\\nThe visitor composed a funny tune!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_BattledDraw	{'body': "The visitor is chatting with\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pIt looks like they're going to\\nhave a battle!\\pAnd…\\pIt's a draw!\\nNothing's resolved!\\pBoth TRAINERS appear to be very\\ndisappointed!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedSpinMat	{'body': 'The visitor stepped on\\na SPIN MAT!\\pIt looks like the visitor is dizzy!\\pThe visitor is tottering about!\\nLook out!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedSandOrnament	{'body': "The visitor is reaching for\\na SAND ORNAMENT!\\pOh!\\pIt crumbled!\\nIt's fallen apart!\\pThe visitor looks sheepish\\nand guilty!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedDesk	{'body': 'The visitor is rubbing a desktop\\nwith their finger!\\pApparently, the visitor disapproves\\nof dust!\\pThe visitor is surprisingly concerned\\nabout neatness!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedBrick	{'body': 'The visitor is staring at a BRICK!\\pPerhaps the visitor is thinking about\\nthe object on the BRICK.$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedSolidBoard	{'body': 'The visitor is walking across\\nthe SOLID BOARD.\\pThe visitor keeps looking down.\\pThe visitor appears to be surprisingly\\ntimid and cautious!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedFence	{'body': "The visitor is looking intently\\nat a FENCE!\\pHas a new idea for a trap popped\\ninto the visitor's head?$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedGlitterMat	{'body': 'The visitor stepped on\\na GLITTER MAT!\\pThe visitor is striking a variety\\nof poses!\\pThe visitor appears to be fantasizing\\nabout being an idol!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedTire	{'body': 'The visitor is staring intently\\nat a TIRE!\\pCould the visitor be thinking about\\nthe kind of car that would use it?$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedStand	{'body': "The visitor climbed a STAND!\\pThe visitor is looking out across\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s BASE from high up!\\pAnd…\\pLets loose a roar!\\nThe visitor is roaring!$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_BrokeDoor	{'body': 'The visitor charged headlong into\\na BREAKABLE DOOR!\\pThe visitor is laughing uproariously!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedDoll	{'body': "The visitor is talking to a DOLL!\\p…It's a little creepy…$"}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedSlide	{'body': 'The visitor is climbing the ladder\\non a SLIDE!\\pAnd…\\pThe visitor slid down!\\pLooks like the visitor is having\\na grand old time!$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedSlideButDidntGoDown	{'body': 'The visitor is climbing the ladder\\non a SLIDE!\\pAnd…\\pThe visitor went back down\\nthe ladder!\\pDid the visitor suddenly chicken out?$'}
text:TVSecretBaseSecrets_UsedJumpMat	{'body': 'The visitor stepped on\\na JUMP MAT!\\pThe visitor jumped once!\\pJumped twice!\\pAnd a successful landing!\\pThe visitor is clapping!\\nWhat a solo performance!$'}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText00	{'body': "SAFARI FAN CLUB!\\pREPORTER: All right, mates!\\nTossing them SAFARI BALLS, are you?\\pYou can bet I am here in the SAFARI\\nZONE chock-full of amazing POKéMON!\\pLet's get with it and have a chat with\\nthis good fellow of a SAFARI GUIDE!\\pAll right, mate, how are the visiting\\nTRAINERS looking?$"}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText01	{'body': 'GUIDE: Everyone seems to be going\\nhard at it.\\p{STR_VAR_1} is doing especially well.\\pWhy, before, {STR_VAR_1} caught\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON.$'}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText02	{'body': 'The TRAINER is clever with {POKEBLOCK}S.\\nUsed {STR_VAR_2} that time, I think.$'}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText03	{'body': "The TRAINER didn't use a single\\n{POKEBLOCK}! Not a one!\\pThere's an expert for you.$"}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText04	{'body': 'REPORTER: Is that right, then?\\pSounds like our mate {STR_VAR_1}\\nis a stout SAFARI master!\\pGUIDE: I hope the TRAINER comes back\\nand shows us that great technique.$'}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText05	{'body': 'GUIDE: No one seems to be doing\\nvery well.\\p{STR_VAR_1} had it especially bad.\\pWhy, before, the TRAINER only\\nmanaged to catch {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON.$'}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText06	{'body': "GUIDE: No one seems to be doing\\nvery well.\\p{STR_VAR_1} had it especially bad.\\pWhy, before, the TRAINER didn't\\ncatch one POKéMON. Not a one!$"}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText07	{'body': 'The TRAINER does use {POKEBLOCK}S.\\nUsed {STR_VAR_2} that time, I think.\\pBut, boy, I wish the TRAINER would\\nget a bit better at this.$'}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText08	{'body': "I think the TRAINER would have better\\nluck using {POKEBLOCK}S, which weren't\\lused at all that time.$"}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText09	{'body': 'REPORTER: Is that right, then?\\pSounds like our mate {STR_VAR_1}\\nneeds more SAFARI seasoning.\\pGUIDE: I hope the TRAINER visits\\nover and over to get the hang of it.$'}
text:gTVSafariFanClubText10	{'body': 'REPORTER: Quite right, it is!\\nFacing up to challenges is important!\\pViewers, come on down to the SAFARI\\nand make the challenge yourself!\\pUntil next time, cheerio!$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_Intro	{'body': "“POKéMON CONTEST LIVE UPDATES!”\\pMC: Thanks for joining us!\\pWe're live from the just-ended\\n{STR_VAR_1} site.\\pThe hall is still filled with\\nan audience unwilling to leave.\\pSpectator: {STR_VAR_2}!\\pSpectator: {STR_VAR_3}!\\pMC: As you've just heard, the CONTEST\\nwas won by the POKéMON {STR_VAR_2}\\lof {STR_VAR_3}.\\pSpectator: {STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou're the best!\\pSpectator: {STR_VAR_3}!\\nWay to go!\\pMC: Let's hear what the fans have\\nto say about this CONTEST.$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_WonBothRounds	{'body': 'Spectator: The {STR_VAR_2} was tops in\\nboth primary and secondary judging!\\pThat {STR_VAR_2} will keep winning!$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_BetterRound2	{'body': "Spectator: The {STR_VAR_2} didn't do\\nwell in the primary judging, but it\\lcleaned up in the secondary judging!\\pIt was a miraculous comeback\\nfor that {STR_VAR_2}. Yippee!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_EqualRounds	{'body': "Spectator: The {STR_VAR_2} remained\\nconsistent throughout both primary\\land secondary judging.\\p{STR_VAR_3} and the {STR_VAR_2},\\nthey're no ordinary combo!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_BetterRound1	{'body': 'Spectator: In terms of being {STR_VAR_1},\\nthat {STR_VAR_2} was outstanding.\\pI hope it makes better appeals\\nnext time, though.$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_GotNervous	{'body': "Spectator: When the {STR_VAR_2} got\\nnervous, I couldn't stop myself from\\lshouting encouragement.\\pI'd like to say this to that\\n{STR_VAR_2}, “Congratulations!”$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_StartledFoes	{'body': "Spectator: That {STR_VAR_2}'s appeal\\nstartled even me!\\p{STR_VAR_2}, you were awesome!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_UsedCombo	{'body': "Spectator: That {STR_VAR_2}'s combo\\nappeal was stunning!\\pIt's shaken me to the core!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_ExcitingAppeal	{'body': "Spectator: The winning {STR_VAR_2}'s\\nappeal got my heart pounding!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_WasCool	{'body': '{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou were cool!$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_WasBeautiful	{'body': '{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou were beautiful!$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_WasCute	{'body': '{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou were cute!$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_WasSmart	{'body': '{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou were smart!$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_WasTough	{'body': '{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou were tough!$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_VeryExcitingAppeal	{'body': "Spectator: The winning {STR_VAR_2}'s\\nappeal still has my heart pounding!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_VeryCool	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou're the last word in cool!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_VeryBeautiful	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou're the most beautiful!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_VeryCute	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou're simply the cutest!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_VerySmart	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou're the smartest among the smart!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_VeryTough	{'body': "{STR_VAR_2}!\\nYou're the toughest of the tough!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_TookBreak	{'body': "Spectator: Even when the {STR_VAR_2}\\ntook a break from making appeals,\\lI couldn't take my eyes off it.\\pI'm captivated by that {STR_VAR_2}.$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_GotStartled	{'body': "Spectator: When the {STR_VAR_2} was\\nstartled by another POKéMON's appeal,\\lI was close to tears.\\p{STR_VAR_2}, you were resilient!\\nWay to go!$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_MoveWonderful	{'body': "Spectator: Oh…\\nThat {STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}!\\l{STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}!\\l{STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}!\\lHow could it be so wonderful?$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_TalkAboutAnotherMon	{'body': "MC: Well, there you have it. This place\\nis full of the {STR_VAR_1}'s fans!\\pI should also mention that another\\nPOKéMON, {STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}, \\lcaught my eye.\\p{STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}…$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_FailedToAppeal	{'body': 'It failed to make a single appeal during\\nsecondary judging out of nervousness.\\pNext time, I would like to see this\\n{STR_VAR_1} make even one appeal.$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_LastInBothRounds	{'body': 'It finished last in both rounds of\\njudging.\\p{STR_VAR_1} and the {STR_VAR_2}\\nhave a fresh challenge: a routine\\lthat lets their best qualities\\lshine.$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_NotExcitingEnough	{'body': "It failed to take advantage of\\nthe audience's excitement and make\\lan appropriate appeal.\\pWe hope {STR_VAR_1} will learn how to get\\na feel for the audience and whip their\\lexcitement to a fever pitch next time.$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_LostAfterWinningRound1	{'body': "While finishing first in the primary\\njudging, its appeals in the secondary\\ljudging failed to click.\\pIt suffered a humiliating come-from-\\nbehind loss.\\pI'm sure {STR_VAR_1} is studying how to\\nmake more effective appeals now.$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_NeverExciting	{'body': 'The audience never got excited by its\\nappeals during the secondary judging.\\pWe hope it will stop worrying about\\nother POKéMON and learn to pitch\\lits appeals to the audience more.$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_LostBySmallMargin	{'body': "It lost to {STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2}\\nby only a small margin.\\pIt must be heartbreaking to come\\nso close to victory only to fail.\\pI wouldn't be surprised if {STR_VAR_3}\\nwere weeping over this outcome.$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_RepeatedAppeals	{'body': "Repeating the same appeals cost it\\nthe JUDGE's attention.\\p{STR_VAR_1} could try varying the\\nroutine next time to keep the\\laudience guessing.$"}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_ValiantEffortButLost	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1} finished last, but\\nkept giving the performance\\leverything.\\pThere is plenty to learn from that\\neffort. We hope to see a comeback!$'}
text:ContestLiveUpdates_Outro	{'body': "I'd like to end this program with our\\nusual farewell to the winners.\\pThis time, it's {STR_VAR_1} and\\nthe {STR_VAR_2}!\\pMC: Is everyone ready?\\nAll together now!\\pAudience: {STR_VAR_1}! {STR_VAR_2}!\\nCongratulations!\\lYou're the CONTEST winner!$"}
text:gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText00	{'body': '“POKéMON BATTLE UPDATE!”\\pBringing you the results of POKéMON\\nbattles as they come in!$'}
text:gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText01	{'body': 'The TRAINERS {STR_VAR_1} and\\n{STR_VAR_2} faced each other in\\la {STR_VAR_3} BATTLE.\\pThis match ended in victory for\\n{STR_VAR_1}!$'}
text:gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText02	{'body': "In the battle, {STR_VAR_1}'s\\n{STR_VAR_2} was a formidable force\\lusing {STR_VAR_3}!$"}
text:gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText03	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2} had a weak\\nshowing that really hurt.$"}
text:gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText04	{'body': 'Congratulations on your victory,\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pAnd for the defeated {STR_VAR_2},\\nwe hope for a better result next time!\\pThis concludes this episode of\\n“POKéMON BATTLE UPDATE!”$'}
text:gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText05	{'body': "The teams of TRAINERS {STR_VAR_1} and\\n{STR_VAR_2} met in a MULTI BATTLE.\\pThis match ended in victory for\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s team.$"}
text:gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText06	{'body': "In the battle, the {STR_VAR_2} on\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s team was a formidable\\lforce using {STR_VAR_3}.$"}
text:gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText07	{'body': "The weak showing by the {STR_VAR_3}\\non {STR_VAR_2}'s team really hurt.\\pCongratulations on your team's\\nvictory, {STR_VAR_1}!\\pAs for the defeated {STR_VAR_2}'s team,\\nwe hope for a better result next time!\\pThis concludes this episode of\\n“POKéMON BATTLE UPDATE!”$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_GabbyPreFirstBattle	{'body': "GABBY: Oh! We've just spotted a tough-\\nlooking TRAINER here of all places!\\pOkay, roll camera!\\nLet's get this interview.$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_GabbyIntro	{'body': "GABBY: Oh! You're {PLAYER}! Hi!\\nDo you remember us from last time?\\pCan you show us how much stronger\\nyou've become? Okay, cue interview!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_GabbyDefeatFirstTime	{'body': "GABBY: My eyes didn't lie!\\nI did discover an astonishing TRAINER!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_WhoAreYouInterview	{'body': 'GABBY: Awesome! Awesome!\\nWho are you?!\\pI knew we were onto something wild\\nwhen we spotted you!\\pOh, please let me explain. We travel\\naround everywhere interviewing all\\lsorts of TRAINERS.\\pSo, would you give us a bit of your time\\nfor an interview?$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_QuoteFromLastInterview	{'body': "GABBY: “{STR_VAR_1}!”\\pRemember? That's the quote you gave\\nus as the battle clincher last time.\\pI never, ever forget stuff like that!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_YouStompedUsInterviewAgain	{'body': 'The last time we battled, you stomped\\nus before we could brace ourselves…\\pAnyway, what do you think?\\nDo you want to be interviewed again?$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_YouThrewABallAtUsInterviewAgain	{'body': "The last time we battled, didn't you\\nthrow a POKé BALL at us?\\pWe were shocked! So we told everyone,\\njust everyone, about it!\\pAnyway, what do you think?\\nDo you want to be interviewed again?$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_CleverItemSkillsInterviewAgain	{'body': 'The last time we battled, your item\\nskills cleverly did us in.\\pAnyway, what do you think?\\nDo you want to be interviewed again?$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_WeLookedRespectableInterviewAgain	{'body': 'The last time we battled, we managed\\nto look respectable.\\pAnyway, what do you think?\\nDo you want to be interviewed again?$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_InterviewAgain	{'body': 'Anyway, what do you think?\\nDo you want to be interviewed again?$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_DescribeYourFeelings	{'body': 'You will?\\nThank you!\\pOkay, I need you to describe your\\nfeelings about our battle, but it\\lhas to be short and sweet. Go!$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_PerfectWellBeSeeingYou	{'body': "GABBY: Mmm, yeah!\\nThat's the perfect clincher!\\pI get the feeling that this will make\\na great TV show.\\pThere's a chance that they'll air this\\non TV, so make sure to look for us!\\pOkay!\\nWe'll be seeing you!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_DontGiveUpKeepingEyeOut	{'body': "GABBY: Oh…\\pOkay, but don't give up!\\nWe'll be keeping an eye out for you!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_KeepingAnEyeOutForYou	{'body': "GABBY: We'll be keeping an eye out\\nfor you!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_GabbyNotEnoughMons	{'body': 'GABBY: Is there a strong TRAINER\\nanywhere with a lot of POKéMON?$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_GiveUsAnInterviewThisTime	{'body': "GABBY: Wow, you are something!\\pYou've gotten a lot stronger--a lot--\\nsince we last battled.\\pWe were right about you when we\\nspotted you as a hot TRAINER.\\pSo, anyway, what do you think?\\nAre you willing to give us an interview\\lthis time?$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_GabbyDefeat	{'body': 'GABBY: That was an intense battle!\\nDid you get all that on camera?$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_TyPreFirstBattle	{'body': "TY: Hey, lookie here! A tough-looking\\nTRAINER here, of all places!\\lCamera's rolling!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_TyIntro	{'body': "TY: Hey, lookie here!\\nI remember you!\\pI'll get this battle all on this\\nhere camera!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_TyPostBattle	{'body': "TY: You're a natural!\\nGot me some prime footage right here!$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_TyNotEnoughMons	{'body': "TY: Do you only have the one POKéMON\\nand that's it?\\pIf you had more POKéMON, it'd make for\\nbetter footage, but…$"}
text:GabbyAndTy_TyDefeatFirstTime	{'body': 'TY: Yep, we sure spotted a hot TRAINER.\\nThis is a huge scoop for us!$'}
text:GabbyAndTy_TyDefeat	{'body': "TY: Yep, I got it all.\\nThat whole battle's on camera.$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText00	{'body': "IN SEARCH OF TRAINERS…\\pGABBY: Hi! Today I'm visiting an area\\nnear {STR_VAR_1}.\\pWe're trying to spot some up-and-\\ncoming new talent in the field.\\pToday, we turned our lens on the\\nTRAINER {PLAYER}.\\pThere's something about this TRAINER\\nthat piqued our interest.$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText01	{'body': "We've battled {PLAYER} before, but we\\ncan attest that the TRAINER has most\\ldefinitely improved from before.\\pI knew we were onto someone special\\nwhen we spotted this TRAINER!$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText02	{'body': "The best way to determine how strong\\na TRAINER is…\\pWell, the fastest way is to battle.\\nAnd so we began our investigation!\\p… …\\pThat's how we ended up in battle\\nwith {PLAYER}.\\pIn a dominating performance, we were\\nflattened, rolled up, and tossed aside!\\p{PLAYER} is ruthlessly strong…\\pHere's our impressions after having\\nbattled our featured TRAINER.$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText03	{'body': "The combination of {STR_VAR_1} and\\n{STR_VAR_3} was divine!\\pThe sight of them--{STR_VAR_1} and\\n{STR_VAR_3}--selflessly supporting\\leach other in the thick of battle…\\pIt was a marvelous sight to behold!\\p{STR_VAR_2} was the move the TRAINER\\nused last in our battle.\\pThe move {STR_VAR_2} is {STR_VAR_1}\\nand {STR_VAR_3}'s sign of friendship!$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText04	{'body': "…I lost confidence in myself as\\na result of our encounter.\\pWe were beaten before we could launch\\na single attack.\\lOhhh… Snivel…\\pIn spite of that, {PLAYER}'s battles\\nare worth seeing.\\pI recommend confident TRAINERS to\\nchallenge {PLAYER}.$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText05	{'body': "There's only one thing to be said.\\nDon't you dare throw a POKé BALL during\\la TRAINER battle!\\p{PLAYER} is certainly strong, but has\\nno clue about the basic rules.\\pTo our TV audience, I have a request.\\pIf you see {PLAYER}, please caution\\nthe TRAINER!$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText06	{'body': "{PLAYER} is adept at reading the\\nopponent's actions.\\pThe timing of item usage was remarkably\\neffective!$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText07	{'body': "Honestly speaking, I thought that\\nI might even be pretty good.\\pWhile we did end up losing, we did have\\na hotly contested battle.\\pBut if you're struggling against me,\\nyou have a ways to go, {PLAYER}!$"}
text:gTVInSearchOfTrainersText08	{'body': "After our battle, we asked {PLAYER} for\\na succinct summary.\\pThe TRAINER replied, “{STR_VAR_1}.”\\p{PLAYER}'s POKéMON {STR_VAR_2} and\\n{STR_VAR_3}…\\lAnd “{STR_VAR_1}”…\\pMmm! That's deep! There's deep\\nsignificance behind that quote!\\pIt's no surprise--a good TRAINER has\\ngood things to say.\\pThat's all for today!\\nSee you again on our next broadcast!$"}
text:ContestLadyShow_Intro	{'body': "“POKéMON CONTEST LIVE UPDATES!”\\pMC: Sorry to interrupt the regular\\nprogramming, and thanks for joining us!\\pWe bring you this live from\\nthe scene of a just-completed\\l{STR_VAR_1}!\\pSpectators: ?!!!!\\pMC: Oh! It looks like the CONTEST\\nparticipants are headed this way!\\pI'll try to get an impromptu interview\\nfor you folks at home!\\pSpectators: ?!!!!\\n?!!!!$"}
text:ContestLadyShow_Won	{'body': "MC: Excuse me!\\nThanks for joining us on live TV!\\pMay I congratulate you on your win?\\pWhat was the key factor in today's\\nstunning victory?\\pBEAUTY: We gave it our best effort\\ntoday, my {STR_VAR_2} and I!\\pBut I'm sure we wouldn't have made it\\nif it weren't for all the help we\\lreceived leading up to the CONTEST!\\pMC: Do you have a special someone\\nwith whom you'd like to share your joy?\\lLet's hear it live!\\pBEAUTY: Hey, out there!\\p{STR_VAR_3}! Are you watching?\\nWe did it!\\lThank you!$"}
text:ContestLadyShow_Lost	{'body': "MC: Excuse me!\\nThanks for joining us on live TV!\\pYou must be disappointed by that turn\\nof events. Do you have any comments?\\pBEAUTY: It's heartbreaking…\\nMy {STR_VAR_2} and I, we did our best…\\pBut I feel like I've let down everyone\\nwho has supported us through this.\\pMC: I hate to say it, but the POKéMON's\\ncoloration is a little wanting.\\pBEAUTY: {STR_VAR_3}, I'm so sorry…\\nI'll do better next time, I swear…\\l…Sniff… Waaaaah!\\pSpectators: See that?\\nThe poor girl!\\pMC: Uh… Uh-oh…\\pUh… That's all the time we have today!\\nThanks for tuning in!$"}
text:ContestLadyShow_LostBadly	{'body': "MC: Excuse me!\\nThanks for joining us on live TV!\\pHow did your CONTEST appearance go?\\pBEAUTY: Nothing went right…\\nFor some reason, my {STR_VAR_2}\\lcouldn't attract any popularity.\\pMC: I hate to say it, but the POKéMON's\\ncoloration is a little wanting.\\pBEAUTY: … … … … … …\\n…Sniff… Waaaaah!\\pSpectators: See that?\\nThe poor girl!\\pMC: Uh… Uh-oh…\\pUh… That's all the time we have today!\\nThanks for tuning in!$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextSlateport_Upcoming	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pSLATEPORT's most popular kind of guy,\\nthe CATCHING GURU, is in the news!\\pHe promises to, “Stupendously go for\\nit in just this many days: {STR_VAR_1}!”\\pWhile he refused to elaborate on what\\nhe will stupendously go for, the\\lCATCHING GURU advised, “Save up your\\lmoney. That'll be good…”\\pIt sounds like a trip to SLATEPORT\\nwould be well worth your while that day.\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextSlateport_Ongoing	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pThis is the news you've all been\\nwaiting for!\\pSLATEPORT'S CATCHING GURU is going\\nfor it stupendously in the MARKET!\\pHe promises unbeatable bargain\\nprices on NET BALLS and DIVE BALLS!\\pA trip to SLATEPORT CITY sounds\\nworthwhile. Why not visit and shop\\lto your heart's content?\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextSlateport_Ending	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pThis is the news you've all been\\nwaiting for!\\pSLATEPORT'S CATCHING GURU is going\\nfor it stupendously in the MARKET!\\pHe promises unbeatable bargain\\nprices on NET BALLS and DIVE BALLS!\\pAccording to the CATCHING GURU, he\\nstill has ample merchandise left.\\pWhy not visit SLATEPORT CITY for\\na most enjoyable shopping trip?\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextGameCorner_Upcoming	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pIt's approaching!\\nIt's finally coming!\\pThe GAME CORNER's service day will be\\nhere in just this many days: {STR_VAR_1}!\\pEven those who are usually unlucky\\nmay be lucky on this particular day!\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextGameCorner_Ongoing	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pIt's here!\\nIt's finally arrived!\\pGAME CORNER's service day has finally\\narrived!\\pCould you be lucky at the SLOTS \\nand ROULETTE?\\pThe location is MAUVILLE CITY.\\nThis is the place!\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextGameCorner_Ending	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pIt's here!\\nIt's finally arrived!\\pGAME CORNER's service day has finally\\narrived!\\pCould you be lucky at the SLOTS\\nand ROULETTE?\\pTime is limited and has almost run out.\\nThe location is MAUVILLE CITY.\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextLilycove_Upcoming	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pWe've just received wonderful news\\nfrom LILYCOVE DEPARTMENT STORE.\\pThe DEPARTMENT STORE's clear-out sale\\nwill be in just this many days: {STR_VAR_1}!\\pThat thingamajig or that doodad that\\nyou've always wanted could be yours!\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextLilycove_Ongoing	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pThis is the news you've all been\\nwaiting for!\\pLILYCOVE DEPARTMENT STORE's clear-out\\nsale has finally arrived!\\pAll the thingamajigs and doodads that\\nyou've always dreamt about…\\pYou may be in for fateful encounters\\nwith them all!\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextLilycove_Ending	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pThis is the news you've all been\\nwaiting for!\\pLILYCOVE DEPARTMENT STORE's clear-out\\nsale has finally arrived!\\pAll the thingamajigs and doodads that\\nyou've always dreamt about…\\pYou may be in for fateful encounters\\nwith them all!\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextBlendMaster_Upcoming	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pWe have big news for everyone\\ninvolved in the making of {POKEBLOCK}S.\\pThe legendary BLEND MASTER will be\\nappearing in LILYCOVE CITY with just\\la mere {STR_VAR_1}-day wait to go!\\pThe BLEND MASTER is said to be\\nthe best in all HOENN when it comes to\\lspinning a BERRY BLENDER.\\pThose people who want to make great\\n{POKEBLOCK}S or see the MASTER in action\\lare urged to save their BERRIES.\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextBlendMaster_Ongoing	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pWe have big news for everyone\\ninvolved in the making of {POKEBLOCK}S.\\pThe legendary BLEND MASTER has\\nfinally appeared!\\pThe BLEND MASTER is spinning\\nthe BERRY BLENDER at the LILYCOVE\\lCONTEST HALL.\\pThose people who want to make great\\n{POKEBLOCK}S or see the MASTER in action\\lshould hurry to LILYCOVE.\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:gPokeNewsTextBlendMaster_Ending	{'body': "Greetings!\\nIt's time for POKéMON NEWS.\\pIt's incredible!\\nToo incredible, even!\\pThe BERRY BLENDER is spinning at\\na dizzying pace!\\pThe BLEND MASTER has lived up to\\nhis reputation!\\pThe BLEND MASTER will soon be\\nleaving LILYCOVE.\\pIf you haven't seen the MASTER in\\naction, don't waste this chance!\\lHead to LILYCOVE right now!\\pThat's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"}
text:GiddySoPretty	{'body': ' so pretty!$'}
text:GiddySoDarling	{'body': ' so darling!$'}
text:GiddySoRelaxed	{'body': ' so relaxed!$'}
text:GiddySoSunny	{'body': ' so sunny!$'}
text:GiddySoDesirable	{'body': ' so desirable!$'}
text:GiddySoExciting	{'body': ' so exciting!$'}
text:GiddySoAmusing	{'body': ' so amusing!$'}
text:GiddySoMagical	{'body': ' so magical!$'}
text:GiddyIs	{'body': ' is$'}
text:GiddyDontYouAgree	{'body': "\\nDon't you agree?$"}
text:GiddyISoWantToGoOnAVacation	{'body': 'I so want to go on a vacation.\\nWould you happen to know a nice place?$'}
text:GiddyIBoughtCrayonsWith120Colors	{'body': "I bought crayons with 120 colors!\\nDon't you think that's nice?$"}
text:GiddyWouldntItBeNiceIfWeCouldFloat	{'body': "Wouldn't it be nice if we could float\\naway on a cloud of bubbles?$"}
text:GiddyWhenYouWriteOnASandyBeach	{'body': 'When you write on a sandy beach,\\nthey wash away. It makes me sad.$'}
text:GiddyWhatsTheBottomOfTheSeaLike	{'body': "What's the bottom of the sea like?\\nJust once I would so love to go!$"}
text:GiddyWhenYouSeeTheSettingSunDoesIt	{'body': 'When you see the setting sun, does it\\nmake you want to go home?$'}
text:GiddyLyingBackInTheGreenGrass	{'body': "Lying back in the green grass…\\nOh, it's so, so nice!$"}
text:GiddySecretBasesAreSoWonderful	{'body': "SECRET BASES are so wonderful!\\nCan't you feel the excitement?$"}
text:Route102_CalvinIntro	{'body': "If you have POKéMON with you, then\\nyou're an official POKéMON TRAINER!\\lYou can't say no to my challenge!$"}
text:Route102_CalvinDefeated	{'body': 'Arrgh, I lost…\\nI should have trained mine more…$'}
text:Route102_CalvinPostBattle	{'body': "Listen, you. If you're strong,\\nyou should have told me before!$"}
text:Route102_CalvinRegister	{'body': "I've been working hard at this since\\nI saw you before.\\pI want to keep comparing training\\nnotes. Register me in your POKéNAV!$"}
text:Route102_CalvinRegisterShort	{'body': "Let's compare training notes.\\nRegister me in your POKéNAV!$"}
text:Route102_CalvinRematchIntro	{'body': "Ever since I lost to you, I desperately\\ntrained my POKéMON.\\lYou can't say no to my challenge!$"}
text:Route102_CalvinRematchDefeated	{'body': 'Arrgh, I lost…\\nIs my training method not right?$'}
text:Route102_CalvinRematchPostBattle	{'body': "If you're going to get stronger,\\nI'll get stronger, too.$"}
text:Route102_AllenIntro	{'body': "Did you just become a TRAINER?\\nWe're both beginners!$"}
text:Route102_AllenDefeated	{'body': 'I called you because I thought\\nI could beat you…$'}
text:Route102_AllenPostBattle	{'body': "I haven't won once yet…\\nI wish I would win soon…$"}
text:Route102_RickIntro	{'body': "Hahah! Our eyes met!\\nI'll take you on with my BUG POKéMON!$"}
text:Route102_RickDefeated	{'body': 'Ow! Down and out!$'}
text:Route102_RickPostBattle	{'body': "If you lock eyes with a TRAINER,\\nyou have to challenge! It's a rule!$"}
text:Route102_TianaIntro	{'body': "I'm going to keep winning and aim\\nto be the best TRAINER.\\pHelp me further my career!$"}
text:Route102_TianaDefeated	{'body': 'I ended up furthering your career…$'}
text:Route102_TianaPostBattle	{'body': 'To keep winning my way up, I see that\\nI have to catch more POKéMON.$'}
text:Route103_DaisyIntro	{'body': 'Did you feel the tug of our\\nsoul-soothing fragrance?$'}
text:Route103_DaisyDefeated	{'body': "You weren't led astray by our aroma…$"}
text:Route103_DaisyPostBattle	{'body': 'Aromatherapy is a form of mental\\nhealing that works with fragrances.$'}
text:Route103_AmyIntro	{'body': "AMY: I'm AMY.\\nAnd this is my little sister LIV.\\lWe battle together!$"}
text:Route103_AmyDefeated	{'body': 'AMY: Uh-oh, we lost.$'}
text:Route103_AmyPostBattle	{'body': "AMY: You have to think about all\\nkinds of things when you're battling\\lagainst two TRAINERS.$"}
text:Route103_AmyNotEnoughPokemon	{'body': "AMY: Uh-oh, you have only one\\nPOKéMON with you.\\lYou can't battle us like that.$"}
text:Route103_LivIntro	{'body': 'LIV: We battle together as one\\nteam.$'}
text:Route103_LivDefeated	{'body': 'LIV: Oh, we lost, big sister…$'}
text:Route103_LivPostBattle	{'body': 'LIV: We work perfectly together,\\nme and my big sister…\\pBut we still lost…$'}
text:Route103_AmyLivRegister	{'body': "LIV: Really, we're getting better…\\nYour teamwork gave us new ideas!$"}
text:Route103_LivNotEnoughPokemon	{'body': "LIV: If you want to battle us,\\nyou have to have two POKéMON!\\lIt's not fair if you don't!$"}
text:Route103_AmyRematchIntro	{'body': "AMY: I'm AMY.\\nAnd this is my little sister LIV.\\lWe battle together!$"}
text:Route103_AmyRematchDefeated	{'body': "AMY: Aww, boo!\\nWe couldn't win again…$"}
text:Route103_AmyRematchPostBattle	{'body': "AMY: You have to think about all\\nkinds of things when you're battling\\lagainst two TRAINERS.$"}
text:Route103_AmyRematchNotEnoughPokemon	{'body': "AMY: Uh-oh, you have only one\\nPOKéMON with you.\\lYou can't battle us like that.$"}
text:Route103_LivRematchIntro	{'body': 'LIV: We battle together as one\\nteam.$'}
text:Route103_LivRematchDefeated	{'body': 'LIV: Awww, we lost again…\\nBig sister…$'}
text:Route103_LivRematchPostBattle	{'body': 'LIV: We work perfectly together,\\nme and my big sister…\\pBut why did we lose again?$'}
text:Route103_LivRematchNotEnoughPokemon	{'body': "LIV: If you want to battle us, you\\nhave to have two POKéMON!\\lIt's not fair if you don't!$"}
text:Route103_AndrewIntro	{'body': "Gah! My fishing line's all snarled up!\\nI'm getting frustrated and mean!\\lThat's it! Battle me!$"}
text:Route103_AndrewDefeated	{'body': "Gah! Lost it!\\nI'm even more annoyed now!$"}
text:Route103_AndrewPostBattle	{'body': "Gah, I'm still boiling mad…\\nGrrrrr…$"}
text:Route103_MiguelIntro	{'body': "My POKéMON is delightfully adorable!\\nDon't be shy--I'll show you!$"}
text:Route103_MiguelDefeated	{'body': 'Oh, my gosh!\\nMy darling POKéMON!$'}
text:Route103_MiguelPostBattle	{'body': "My delightful POKéMON looks darling\\neven when it's fainted!$"}
text:Route103_MiguelRegister	{'body': "I'll get you to come out and look in\\non my delightful POKéMON again!$"}
text:Route103_MiguelRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hi, you! My delightfully adorable\\nPOKéMON has become more darling!$'}
text:Route103_MiguelRematchDefeated	{'body': 'Oh!\\nMy darling POKéMON!$'}
text:Route103_MiguelRematchPostBattle	{'body': 'The more I spend time with it,\\nthe more adorable my POKéMON becomes.$'}
text:Route103_PeteIntro	{'body': 'This sort of distance…\\nYou should just swim it!$'}
text:Route103_PeteDefeated	{'body': "Oh, that's good going!$"}
text:Route103_PetePostBattle	{'body': "Oh, I understand where you're coming\\nfrom now.\\pIf I had a POKéMON that trusty,\\nI'd want to SURF on it, too!$"}
text:Route103_IsabelleIntro	{'body': "Watch where you're going!\\nWe're going to crash!$"}
text:Route103_IsabelleDefeated	{'body': 'Groan…$'}
text:Route103_IsabellePostBattle	{'body': "I'm a poor swimmer so I was practicing…\\nSorry for almost crashing into you.$"}
text:Route103_RhettIntro	{'body': "Whoa!\\nHow'd you get into a space this small?$"}
text:Route103_RhettDefeated	{'body': 'Whoa!\\nThe kid can rock!$'}
text:Route103_RhettPostBattle	{'body': 'Do you like cramped quarters\\nlike this?$'}
text:Route103_MarcosIntro	{'body': "Did my guitar's wailing draw you in?$"}
text:Route103_MarcosDefeated	{'body': 'My one-man show is ruined…$'}
text:Route103_MarcosPostBattle	{'body': 'I was playing my guitar where few\\npeople were around, but a lot of fans\\lhave gathered.\\pHeh, maybe I should turn pro.$'}
text:Route104_GinaIntro	{'body': "GINA: Okay, let's battle with our\\nPOKéMON!$"}
text:Route104_GinaDefeat	{'body': 'GINA: Losing upsets me!$'}
text:Route104_GinaPostBattle	{'body': 'GINA: You are strong!\\nWe have to train lots more!$'}
text:Route104_GinaNotEnoughMons	{'body': "GINA: Oh? Only one POKéMON?\\nThen, we don't battle with you.\\pIf there's only one POKéMON, it will\\nbe lonesome. That's not nice.$"}
text:Route104_MiaIntro	{'body': 'MIA: We are twins, so we battle\\nPOKéMON together.$'}
text:Route104_MiaDefeat	{'body': 'MIA: We battled together, but we\\nboth lost…$'}
text:Route104_MiaPostBattle	{'body': 'MIA: We will train our POKéMON more\\nand be strong like you.$'}
text:Route104_MiaNotEnoughMons	{'body': "MIA: You want to battle with us?\\pIt's a big no-no if you don't have two\\nPOKéMON with you.\\lWe're too strong for you!$"}
text:Route104_IvanIntro	{'body': "Why keep it a secret?\\nI'm the WATER POKéMON expert!\\pHuh?\\nYou don't know me?$"}
text:Route104_IvanDefeat	{'body': "I thought I wasn't too bad, if I may\\nsay so, but I guess not… Bleah…$"}
text:Route104_IvanPostBattle	{'body': 'I got too into fishing.\\nI forgot I had to raise my POKéMON…$'}
text:Route104_BillyIntro	{'body': 'Leaving footprints in the sand is\\nso fun!$'}
text:Route104_BillyDefeat	{'body': "Waah! I got sand in my runners!\\nThey're all gritty!$"}
text:Route104_BillyPostBattle	{'body': 'I want to leave my footprints in\\nthe sand everywhere, but they\\ldisappear quickly…$'}
text:Route104_HaleyIntro	{'body': "Should I…\\nOr shouldn't I?\\pOkay, sure, I will battle!$"}
text:Route104_HaleyDefeat	{'body': "I shouldn't have battled…$"}
text:Route104_HaleyPostBattle	{'body': "If you're faced with a decision and\\nyou let someone else choose for you,\\lyou will regret it, however things\\lturn out.$"}
text:Route104_HaleyRegister1	{'body': "You're strong, but should I register\\nyou in my POKéNAV?\\lMaybe I shouldn't…\\pOkay, sure, I will register you!$"}
text:Route104_HaleyRegister2	{'body': "You're strong, but should I register\\nyou in my POKéNAV?\\lMaybe I shouldn't…\\pOkay, sure, I will register you!$"}
text:Route104_HaleyRematchIntro	{'body': 'Come on, battle with me!$'}
text:Route104_HaleyRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Ohh…\\nI thought I could win…$'}
text:Route104_HaleyPostRematch	{'body': 'I made the decision to battle, so\\nI can accept this loss with grace.\\pI am still upset about losing!$'}
text:Route104_WinstonIntro	{'body': "Oh, sure, I'll accept your challenge.\\nI have a lot of money.$"}
text:Route104_WinstonDefeat	{'body': "Why couldn't I win?$"}
text:Route104_WinstonPostBattle	{'body': "There are some things money can't buy.\\nThat's POKéMON…$"}
text:Route104_WinstonRegister1	{'body': "Hm?\\nAh, you've obtained a POKéNAV.\\pI will gladly register you.\\nAfter all, I have plenty of money.$"}
text:Route104_WinstonRegister2	{'body': "Hm?\\nAh, you've obtained a POKéNAV.\\pI will gladly register you.\\nAfter all, I have plenty of money.$"}
text:Route104_WinstonRematchIntro	{'body': 'After I lost to you, I learned a bunch\\nof things about POKéMON.$'}
text:Route104_WinstonRematchDefeat	{'body': "I lost again?\\nWhy couldn't I win?$"}
text:Route104_WinstonPostRematch	{'body': "I'm fabulously wealthy, but I can't\\nseem to win at POKéMON…\\pIt's so deep, the world of POKéMON…$"}
text:Route104_CindyIntro	{'body': 'We must have been fated to meet.\\nMay I ask you for a battle?$'}
text:Route104_CindyDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, my!$'}
text:Route104_CindyPostBattle	{'body': '“Hello” is the beginning of “good-bye.”\\nI hope we meet again.$'}
text:Route104_CindyRegister1	{'body': "Hello, we meet again.\\pWe seem to be drawn together. Let's\\nregister each other in our POKéNAVS.$"}
text:Route104_CindyRegister2	{'body': "We should commemorate how we seem\\nto be drawn to each other.\\pLet's register each other in our\\nPOKéNAVS.$"}
text:Route104_CindyRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hello, we meet again.\\nMay I ask you for a battle?$'}
text:Route104_CindyRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, my…\\nI did the best that I could…$'}
text:Route104_CindyPostRematch	{'body': '“Hello” is the beginning of “good-bye.”\\nI hope we meet again.$'}
text:Route104_DarianIntro	{'body': 'I fished up a tough-looking POKéMON!\\pIt has this magical quality to it!\\nIt surely looks tough, yes it does!$'}
text:Route104_DarianDefeat	{'body': 'What the…$'}
text:Route104_DarianPostBattle	{'body': 'Every catch has a different trick.\\nI still have plenty to learn.$'}
text:Route105_FosterIntro	{'body': "There's supposed to be a mystical\\nrock around here.\\lDo you know anything about it?$"}
text:Route105_FosterDefeated	{'body': 'I was thinking too much about that\\nrock, while my POKéMON remained weak…$'}
text:Route105_FosterPostBattle	{'body': 'I can spend hours and hours staring\\nat a nice rock without growing bored.$'}
text:Route105_LuisIntro	{'body': 'Whew! I was worried that a kid was\\ndrowning when I saw you.\\pYou seem to be okay, so what do you\\nsay to a battle?$'}
text:Route105_LuisDefeated	{'body': 'Glub… Glub…$'}
text:Route105_LuisPostBattle	{'body': 'If you are drowning, the signal is to\\nwave one arm toward the beach.$'}
text:Route105_DominikIntro	{'body': 'Swimming the deep blue sea…\\nIt feels the greatest!$'}
text:Route105_DominikDefeated	{'body': "I lost…\\nNow I'm feeling blue…$"}
text:Route105_DominikPostBattle	{'body': 'Why is the sea blue?\\pI learned about that at the MUSEUM in\\nSLATEPORT, but I forgot.$'}
text:Route105_BeverlyIntro	{'body': "My body feels lighter in the water.\\nIt's as if I've gotten slimmer!$"}
text:Route105_BeverlyDefeated	{'body': "I'm floating…$"}
text:Route105_PostBattle	{'body': "Your body weight is reduced to just\\none tenth in the water.\\pThat would make me…\\nWhoops! I'm not telling you my weight!$"}
text:Route105_ImaniIntro	{'body': "The blue, blue sky…\\nThe vast sea…\\lIt's so peaceful…$"}
text:Route105_ImaniDefeated	{'body': 'I lost while I was lounging!$'}
text:Route105_ImaniPostBattle	{'body': "I want to be told I'm relaxing to be\\nwith. Giggle.$"}
text:Route105_AndresIntro	{'body': "I'm convinced that the sea keeps\\nsecrets from us.$"}
text:Route105_AndresDefeated	{'body': 'Yes…\\nI am no good at battling…$'}
text:Route105_AndresPostBattle	{'body': "I'm sure there are many secrets to be\\ndiscovered in the world's seas.\\pI mean to find them all!$"}
text:Route105_AndresRegister	{'body': "Huh? I'm so weak, but you're willing\\nto register me in your POKéNAV?$"}
text:Route105_AndresRematchIntro	{'body': "I've told you that I'm weak…\\nAre you sure you want to do this?$"}
text:Route105_AndresRematchDefeated	{'body': "Yes…\\nI didn't think I could win.$"}
text:Route105_AndresRematchPostBattle	{'body': "I may be weak at battling, but my\\ndrive to explore can't be bested.\\pI will travel the seas all around\\nthe world!$"}
text:Route105_JosueIntro	{'body': "I'm exhausted from swimming.\\nI'm just not used to it.\\pI need a battle for a change of pace!$"}
text:Route105_JosueDefeated	{'body': 'I lost because I battled at sea.$'}
text:Route105_JosuePostBattle	{'body': 'Yeah, for me, the sky is a much better\\nmatch than the sea.$'}
text:Route106_ElliotIntro	{'body': 'Which do you prefer, fishing in the\\nsea or a stream?$'}
text:Route106_ElliotDefeated	{'body': 'Like in deep-sea fishing, I lost\\nspectacularly!$'}
text:Route106_ElliotPostBattle	{'body': "Fishing is the greatest whether it's\\nin the sea or a stream.\\lYou agree with me, right?$"}
text:Route106_ElliotRegister	{'body': "Fishing's great, but so is battling.\\nIf you don't mind, can we meet again?$"}
text:Route106_ElliotRematchIntro	{'body': "I caught a bunch of POKéMON fishing.\\nI'll show you an impressive battle!$"}
text:Route106_ElliotRematchDefeated	{'body': 'I lost again spectacularly!$'}
text:Route106_ElliotRematchPostBattle	{'body': 'Win or lose, POKéMON are the greatest!\\nYou agree with me, right?$'}
text:Route106_NedIntro	{'body': "What do people do if they need to go\\nto a washroom?\\pWhat if my ROD hooks a big one while\\nI'm in the washroom? I just can't go…$"}
text:Route106_NedDefeated	{'body': "I lost because I'm trying to not go\\nto the washroom…$"}
text:Route106_NedPostBattle	{'body': "Oh, no! I've got this feeling I'll hook\\na big one!$"}
text:Route106_DouglasIntro	{'body': "Hahahah! I'm a lousy runner, but in\\nthe water you can't catch me!$"}
text:Route106_DouglasDefeated	{'body': 'I give up!$'}
text:Route106_DouglasPostBattle	{'body': "I wouldn't lose in a swim race…$"}
text:Route106_KylaIntro	{'body': "The sea is my backyard. I'm not going\\nto take it easy because you're a kid!$"}
text:Route106_KylaDefeated	{'body': 'Did you take it easy on me by any\\nchance?$'}
text:Route106_KylaPostBattle	{'body': "Drifting along with the waves…\\nI love it! Why don't you give it a try?$"}
text:Route107_DarrinIntro	{'body': 'Yawn…\\pI must have drifted off to sleep while\\nI was drifting in the waves.$'}
text:Route107_DarrinDefeated	{'body': "Ahaha, I lost…\\nI'll take a snooze, I think…$"}
text:Route107_DarrinPostBattle	{'body': "Floating and being rocked by\\nthe waves--it's like sleeping in\\la plush, comfy bed.$"}
text:Route107_TonyIntro	{'body': "The sea is like my backyard.\\nLet's battle!$"}
text:Route107_TonyDefeated	{'body': "I lost on my home field…\\nI'm in shock!$"}
text:Route107_TonyPostBattle	{'body': "I swim the seas with a heart full of\\ndreams…\\pIt's a song!\\nAnyways, I'm swimming some more.$"}
text:Route107_TonyRegister	{'body': "You've shocked me to the bone!\\nWell, so you won't forget me…$"}
text:Route107_TonyRematchIntro	{'body': 'Swimming in the big, wide sea,\\nmy POKéMON has grown stronger!$'}
text:Route107_TonyRematchDefeated	{'body': 'What a shock!\\pMy POKéMON has gotten stronger, but\\nI stayed weak as a TRAINER!$'}
text:Route107_TonyRematchPostBattle	{'body': 'What you learn in battle makes you\\na stronger TRAINER.\\lThe waves taught me that.$'}
text:Route107_DeniseIntro	{'body': 'Do you know a little town called\\nDEWFORD?$'}
text:Route107_DeniseDefeated	{'body': 'I hate this!$'}
text:Route107_DenisePostBattle	{'body': 'A weird saying is getting really\\ntrendy at DEWFORD HALL.$'}
text:Route107_BethIntro	{'body': "Did you want to battle me?\\nSure, I'll go with you!$"}
text:Route107_BethDefeated	{'body': "I wasn't good enough for you.$"}
text:Route107_BethPostBattle	{'body': "I think you're going to keep getting\\nbetter. I'll go for it, too!$"}
text:Route107_LisaIntro	{'body': 'LISA: We challenge you as a sister\\nand brother!$'}
text:Route107_LisaDefeated	{'body': "LISA: Awesome.\\nYou're in a different class of tough.$"}
text:Route107_LisaPostBattle	{'body': 'LISA: Do you have any friends who\\nwould go to the beach with you?$'}
text:Route107_LisaNotEnoughPokemon	{'body': 'LISA: If you want to battle with us,\\nbring more POKéMON.$'}
text:Route107_RayIntro	{'body': 'RAY: We always battle POKéMON,\\nme and my sister.\\pI always lose, but we can beat you\\n2-on-2!$'}
text:Route107_RayDefeated	{'body': "RAY: Wowee, you're at a higher level\\nthan us!$"}
text:Route107_RayPostBattle	{'body': "RAY: My sister gave me my POKéMON.\\nI raised it, and now it's my important\\lpartner!$"}
text:Route107_RayNotEnoughPokemon	{'body': 'RAY: If you want to battle us,\\ngo bring some more POKéMON!$'}
text:Route107_CamronIntro	{'body': "I'm in the middle of a triathlon,\\nbut I'm nowhere near tired!$"}
text:Route107_CamronDefeated	{'body': 'That exhausted me…$'}
text:Route107_CamronPostBattle	{'body': 'I still have swimming and running left\\nto do after this.\\pAm I going to be okay?$'}
text:Route108_JeromeIntro	{'body': "My dream is to swim the world's seven\\nseas!$"}
text:Route108_JeromeDefeated	{'body': "I won't be able to swim the seven seas\\nlike this…$"}
text:Route108_JeromePostBattle	{'body': 'Playing with marine POKéMON is one of\\nthe pleasures of swimming!$'}
text:Route108_MatthewIntro	{'body': 'Ahoy, there! Are you going out to\\nthe ABANDONED SHIP, too?$'}
text:Route108_MatthewDefeated	{'body': "I'm sinking!\\nGlub… Glub…$"}
text:Route108_MatthewPostBattle	{'body': 'Some people even go inside that\\nABANDONED SHIP.$'}
text:Route108_TaraIntro	{'body': 'My liar of a boyfriend told me that\\nI look great in a bikini…$'}
text:Route108_TaraDefeated	{'body': 'Oh, boo!$'}
text:Route108_TaraPostBattle	{'body': "Even if it's a lie, I love being told\\nI look great…\\lWe girls are so complex…$"}
text:Route108_MissyIntro	{'body': 'I love the sea!\\nI forget all my worries when I swim!$'}
text:Route108_MissyDefeated	{'body': 'When I lose a battle, I get all\\nstressed out!$'}
text:Route108_MissyPostBattle	{'body': "Work off your stress by swimming!\\nIt's so healthy!$"}
text:Route108_CoryIntro	{'body': 'I love WATER-type POKéMON.\\nI love other POKéMON, too!$'}
text:Route108_CoryDefeated	{'body': 'Waaah! I lost!\\nWaaah! Waaah!$'}
text:Route108_CoryPostBattle	{'body': 'Shouting is good for me!\\nIt uplifts me!$'}
text:Route108_CoryRegister	{'body': 'I love tough TRAINERS, too!\\nRegister me in your POKéNAV!$'}
text:Route108_CoryRematchIntro	{'body': 'Win or lose, I love battling at sea!$'}
text:Route108_CoryRematchDefeated	{'body': 'Waaah! I lost again!\\nWaaah! Waaah!$'}
text:Route108_CoryRematchPostBattle	{'body': "If you're faced with a challenge,\\ntry shouting at the sea!$"}
text:Route108_CarolinaIntro	{'body': 'LUXRAY and HAWLUCHA, one speedy\\nbattle. I take pride in this team.$'}
text:Route108_CarolinaDefeated	{'body': "That wasn't cute at all.$"}
text:Route108_CarolinaPostBattle	{'body': 'Out here on the water, I could wear\\nsomething pink and frilly and nobody\\lwould blink. Focus, Carolina.$'}
text:Route109_DavidIntro	{'body': 'Hiyah! Look at my chiseled abs!\\nThis is what you call “cut”!$'}
text:Route109_DavidDefeated	{'body': 'Aiyah!\\nFlubbed out!$'}
text:Route109_DavidPostBattle	{'body': 'Hiyah!\\pMy sculpted abs have nothing to do\\nwith POKéMON battles!$'}
text:Route109_AliceIntro	{'body': 'Are you properly protected against\\nthe sun?$'}
text:Route109_AliceDefeated	{'body': 'Ouch, ouch, ouch!$'}
text:Route109_AlicePostBattle	{'body': 'Cheeks are the most prone to burning!$'}
text:Route109_HueyIntro	{'body': "I've laid anchor in ports around\\nthe world, but SLATEPORT's the best.$"}
text:Route109_HueyDefeated	{'body': "You're the best!$"}
text:Route109_HueyPostBattle	{'body': 'In the best port was the best\\nTRAINER…$'}
text:Route109_EdmondIntro	{'body': 'Urrrrppp…\\nBattle? With me?$'}
text:Route109_EdmondDefeated	{'body': 'Urp… Ooooooohhhhhh…\\nUrrrrpppp…$'}
text:Route109_EdmondPostBattle	{'body': "I'm usually stronger than this!\\nI'm just seasick as a dog!\\pI'm a SAILOR, but…$"}
text:Route109_RickyIntro	{'body': "I'm thirsty… I could go for a SODA POP\\nat the SEASHORE HOUSE…$"}
text:Route109_RickyDefeated	{'body': 'Groan…$'}
text:Route109_RickyPostBattle	{'body': "I'm getting famished… My inner tube\\nlooks like a giant doughnut…$"}
text:Route109_RickyRegister	{'body': "Call me sometime when I'm not\\nall thirsty, okay?$"}
text:Route109_RickyRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm hungry, but I've got enough pep in\\nme for a battle!$"}
text:Route109_RickyRematchDefeated	{'body': "I lost…\\nIt's because I'm hungry…$"}
text:Route109_RickyRematchPostBattle	{'body': 'When you eat on a beach, everything\\nseems to taste a little better.$'}
text:Route109_LolaIntro	{'body': "Doesn't a beach umbrella look like\\na giant flower?$"}
text:Route109_LolaDefeated	{'body': 'Mommy!$'}
text:Route109_LolaPostBattle	{'body': 'If you look at the beach from the sky,\\nit looks like a big flower garden!$'}
text:Route109_LolaRegister	{'body': "Me?\\nI'm here every day!$"}
text:Route109_LolaRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm not losing to you again!\\nThat's why I have my inner tube!$"}
text:Route109_LolaRematchDefeated	{'body': 'Mommy!$'}
text:Route109_LolaRematchPostBattle	{'body': "If I have an inner tube, me and my\\nPOKéMON's cuteness goes way up!$"}
text:Route109_AustinaIntro	{'body': "I can't swim without my inner tube,\\nbut I won't lose at POKéMON!$"}
text:Route109_AustinaDefeated	{'body': 'Did I lose because I have an inner\\ntube?$'}
text:Route109_AustinaPostBattle	{'body': "My inner tube is a fashion item.\\nI can't be seen without it.$"}
text:Route109_GwenIntro	{'body': 'Hi, big TRAINER.\\nWill you battle with me?$'}
text:Route109_GwenDefeated	{'body': "Oh, you're strong.$"}
text:Route109_GwenPostBattle	{'body': 'How did you get to be so strong?$'}
text:Route109_CarterIntro	{'body': "Wahahah! This dude's going to catch\\nhimself a big one!$"}
text:Route109_CarterDefeated	{'body': 'This dude just lost one…$'}
text:Route109_CarterPostBattle	{'body': "This dude thinks you're a big one.\\nNo, you're a big-one-to-be!$"}
text:Route109_PaulIntro	{'body': "PAUL: Well, this is a mood-breaker.\\pI wish you wouldn't disturb our\\nprecious time together.$"}
text:Route109_PaulDefeated	{'body': 'PAUL: Well, I give up.$'}
text:Route109_PaulPostBattle	{'body': "PAUL: Well, don't tell anyone that\\nwe're here.\\lThis is just our private world of two!$"}
text:Route109_PaulNotEnoughPokemon	{'body': "PAUL: We're totally, deeply in love.\\nThat's why we make our POKéMON battle\\ltogether.$"}
text:Route109_MelIntro	{'body': "MEL: We're, like, totally in love.\\nOur romance is heating up all of HOENN!$"}
text:Route109_MelDefeated	{'body': "MEL: We lost, and it's my fault!\\nPAUL will hate me!$"}
text:Route109_MelPostBattle	{'body': "MEL: Um, PAUL, are you angry with me?\\nPlease don't be angry.$"}
text:Route109_MelNotEnoughPokemon	{'body': "MEL: We're, like, deeply and truly in love.\\nThat's why we make our POKéMON\\lbattle together.$"}
text:Route109_ChandlerIntro	{'body': "Tadaah! See?\\nMy inner tube's round!$"}
text:Route109_ChandlerDefeated	{'body': 'Oh, oh!\\nToo bad!$'}
text:Route109_ChandlerPostBattle	{'body': 'After I showed you my round inner\\ntube, too…$'}
text:Route109_HaileyIntro	{'body': "I can't swim, so I'm pretending\\nto swim.$"}
text:Route109_HaileyDefeated	{'body': "I thought so!\\nI didn't think we could win.$"}
text:Route109_HaileyPostBattle	{'body': 'When I learn how to swim, I think\\nmy POKéMON will become tougher.$'}
text:Route109_ElijahIntro	{'body': 'For a guy as macho as me, this kind\\nof POKéMON is the perfect match!$'}
text:Route109_ElijahDefeated	{'body': "I'm cool even in defeat, hey?$"}
text:Route109_ElijahPostBattle	{'body': "For a guy as macho as me, a port\\nis the perfect setting!\\pI guess I'll head for SLATEPORT.$"}
text:Route110_JacobIntro	{'body': "Whoa! Watch it!\\nI guess you're not used to BIKE racing.$"}
text:Route110_JacobDefeated	{'body': 'Whoa!\\nMy brakes failed!$'}
text:Route110_JacobPostBattle	{'body': 'Flat tires and brake problems can\\ncause serious injury!\\lInspect your BIKE for problems!$'}
text:Route110_AnthonyIntro	{'body': 'Yo, you!\\nCan you keep up with my speed?$'}
text:Route110_AnthonyDefeated	{'body': 'Crash and burn!$'}
text:Route110_AnthonyPostBattle	{'body': "Speed alone won't let me win at POKéMON.\\nI need to reconsider this…$"}
text:Route110_BenjaminIntro	{'body': "Don't panic if your BIKE's going fast!$"}
text:Route110_BenjaminDefeated	{'body': "I shouldn't panic during POKéMON\\nbattles…$"}
text:Route110_BenjaminPostBattle	{'body': "There's no need to panic or stress.\\nTake it easy. There's plenty of time.$"}
text:Route110_BenjaminRegister	{'body': "I'll keep chugging on without stressing.\\nGive me a shout if you're up to it.$"}
text:Route110_BenjaminRematchIntro	{'body': "Aren't you going a little too fast?\\nTake it easy and let's battle.$"}
text:Route110_BenjaminRematchDefeated	{'body': "I didn't panic, but I still lost…$"}
text:Route110_BenjaminRematchPostBattle	{'body': "There's no need to panic or stress.\\nTake it easy. There's plenty of time.$"}
text:Route110_AbigailIntro	{'body': 'The triathlon is hard in the extreme.\\pYou have to complete the three events\\nof swimming, cycling, and running.$'}
text:Route110_AbigailDefeated	{'body': 'POKéMON battles are hard, too!$'}
text:Route110_AbigailPostBattle	{'body': "I'm exhausted, so I need a break.\\nIt's important to get proper rest.$"}
text:Route110_AbigailRegister	{'body': "You know, I like you!\\nLet's swap tips about CYCLING ROAD.$"}
text:Route110_AbigailRematchIntro	{'body': "Isn't it neat to hold a battle while\\ncycling?$"}
text:Route110_AbigailRematchDefeated	{'body': 'Wow…\\nHow could you be so strong?$'}
text:Route110_AbigailRematchPostBattle	{'body': "Were you going after a record?\\pI'm sorry if I held you up!$"}
text:Route110_JasmineIntro	{'body': "I've been riding without stopping.\\nMy thighs are like rocks!$"}
text:Route110_JasmineDefeated	{'body': "I'm worried about muscle cramps…$"}
text:Route110_JasminePostBattle	{'body': "Oh, you have some GYM BADGES?\\nNo wonder you're so strong!$"}
text:Route110_EdwardIntro	{'body': 'I have foreseen your intentions!\\nI cannot possibly lose!$'}
text:Route110_EdwardDefeated	{'body': 'I failed to prophesize my own demise!$'}
text:Route110_EdwardPostBattle	{'body': 'I see your future…\\pHmm…\\nI see a shining light…$'}
text:Route110_JaclynIntro	{'body': "Ahahahaha!\\nI'll dazzle you with my wonders!$"}
text:Route110_JaclynDefeated	{'body': 'I wondrously lost!$'}
text:Route110_JaclynPostBattle	{'body': "You managed to win only because it was\\na wonder! Yes, a wonder!\\lDon't think you can win all the time!$"}
text:Route110_EdwinIntro	{'body': 'Could I see your POKéMON?\\nJust one look, please?$'}
text:Route110_EdwinDefeated	{'body': 'I wanted to complete\\nmy collection…$'}
text:Route110_EdwinPostBattle	{'body': "When I see a POKéMON that I don't know,\\nmy passion as a collector is ignited!$"}
text:Route110_EdwinRegister	{'body': 'I like collecting MATCH CALL\\nregistrations, too…$'}
text:Route110_EdwinRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hi, have you caught any new POKéMON?\\pCould I see your POKéMON?\\nJust one look, please?$'}
text:Route110_EdwinRematchDefeated	{'body': 'Your POKéMON…\\nI envy you.$'}
text:Route110_EdwinRematchPostBattle	{'body': 'Oh, I long to make all rare POKéMON\\nmine!$'}
text:Route110_DaleIntro	{'body': "Hey!\\nDon't sneak up behind me like that!$"}
text:Route110_DaleDefeated	{'body': 'I lost!\\nDrat!$'}
text:Route110_DalePostBattle	{'body': 'Fishing is all about concentration.\\nYou have to focus on the floater.$'}
text:Route110_IsabelIntro	{'body': 'Ahahaha! I would go anywhere to show\\noff my delightful POKéMON.$'}
text:Route110_IsabelDefeated	{'body': "Oh, dear, this won't do.$"}
text:Route110_IsabelPostBattle	{'body': 'Rather than battling, perhaps I should\\nshow off my POKéMON at the FAN CLUB.$'}
text:Route110_IsabelRegister	{'body': "That wasn't close to what I could\\ndo to show off my POKéMON.\\pI'll have you as my captive audience\\nas often as possible!$"}
text:Route110_IsabelRematchIntro	{'body': 'Ahahahaha! I would be happy to show\\noff my POKéMON as often as you like!$'}
text:Route110_IsabelRematchDefeated	{'body': "Oh, dear, this won't do.$"}
text:Route110_IsabelRematchPostBattle	{'body': "I don't think that I could ever stop\\nfrom showing off my POKéMON.\\pBut I like to battle, too!$"}
text:Route110_TimmyIntro	{'body': 'I found some cool POKéMON in the grass\\naround here!$'}
text:Route110_TimmyDefeated	{'body': "Being cool isn't enough to win…$"}
text:Route110_TimmyPostBattle	{'body': "It's hard to battle with POKéMON you\\njust caught.$"}
text:Route110_AlyssaIntro	{'body': "I fell off CYCLING ROAD…\\pI'll get over my embarrassment by\\nbattling with you!$"}
text:Route110_AlyssaDefeated	{'body': 'Oops!\\nI ended up losing!$'}
text:Route110_AlyssaPostBattle	{'body': 'Falling… Losing…\\nThis is so humiliating for me!$'}
text:Route110_JosephIntro	{'body': "Okay! Full-throttle time! If you can't\\ngroove, you get left behind!$"}
text:Route110_JosephDefeated	{'body': 'You got into the groove all right…$'}
text:Route110_JosephPostBattle	{'body': "This isn't going to bring me down!\\nLosing has made me a better man!$"}
text:Route110_KalebIntro	{'body': "When cute POKéMON help each other…\\nYou won't see a more adorable sight!$"}
text:Route110_KalebDefeated	{'body': 'Have you no compassion or pity?$'}
text:Route110_KalebPostBattle	{'body': "Okay, okay, you've done the best you\\ncould, my pretties.$"}
text:Route111_DrewIntro	{'body': "Oh, hey! Those GO-GOGGLES suit you.\\nBut I think they look better on me.\\pLet's decide who they look better on\\nwith a battle!$"}
text:Route111_DrewDefeat	{'body': "I couldn't see what was happening at\\nmy sides because of the GO-GOGGLES.$"}
text:Route111_DrewPostBattle	{'body': 'The GO-GOGGLES make it possible to\\nget through sandstorms.\\lThat makes me happy!$'}
text:Route111_HeidiIntro	{'body': "I'm having a picnic in the desert.\\pYou can always find a TRAINER,\\nso I can enjoy a battle here, too!$"}
text:Route111_HeidiDefeat	{'body': "Ohhh! You're mean!$"}
text:Route111_HeidiPostBattle	{'body': "When you're battling in a sandstorm,\\nwatch out for your POKéMON's HP.\\pIt can faint if you don't keep\\nan eye on it!$"}
text:Route111_BeauIntro	{'body': 'Wearing these GO-GOGGLES makes me\\nfeel like a superhero.\\lRight now, nobody can beat me!$'}
text:Route111_BeauDefeat	{'body': "I can't win on spirit alone…$"}
text:Route111_BeauPostBattle	{'body': "I'm going to be a real hero one day.\\nI'm going to work harder to make me\\land my POKéMON stronger.$"}
text:Route111_BeckyIntro	{'body': 'I heard there are fossils to be found\\nin the desert. Where could they be?$'}
text:Route111_BeckyDefeat	{'body': 'I came up short…$'}
text:Route111_BeckyPostBattle	{'body': 'If they can find fossils in the desert,\\nit must have been a sea before.$'}
text:Route111_DustyIntro	{'body': 'For thirty years I have searched for\\nancient ruins!\\lI am to be challenged?$'}
text:Route111_DustyDefeat	{'body': "While I have searched for ruins,\\nI've not searched for strong POKéMON.$"}
text:Route111_DustyPostBattle	{'body': 'For thirty years I have searched for\\nancient ruins!\\pNo, wait, was that forty years?\\nWhich was it now?$'}
text:Route111_DustyRegister	{'body': "I haven't been searching for any\\ntough POKéMON.\\pBut, for some reason, I sure do like\\nPOKéNAVS.$"}
text:Route111_DustyRematchIntro	{'body': 'For thirty years I have searched for\\nancient ruins!\\pNo, wait, was that forty years?\\nAnyway, am I to be challenged?$'}
text:Route111_DustyRematchDefeat	{'body': "I've found no ruins, nor have I found\\nany strong POKéMON…$"}
text:Route111_DustyPostRematch	{'body': "For thirty years I have searched for\\nancient ruins!\\pNo, wait, was that forty years\\nI've searched?\\pHmm… It could even be fifty…\\nHow long have I been at this?$"}
text:Route111_TravisIntro	{'body': "I'm full of pep!\\nAnd my POKéMON is peppy, too!$"}
text:Route111_TravisDefeat	{'body': 'My POKéMON lost its pep…$'}
text:Route111_TravisPostBattle	{'body': "When I see a TRAINER with a lot of pep,\\nI can't help looking.$"}
text:Route111_IreneIntro	{'body': "I don't know where you're going,\\nbut would you like to battle?$"}
text:Route111_IreneDefeat	{'body': "Oh, you're disgustingly good!$"}
text:Route111_IrenePostBattle	{'body': "I'm thinking that I should go to\\nMT. CHIMNEY, but the view around\\lhere is very nice, too.$"}
text:Route111_DaisukeIntro	{'body': 'To train myself, I challenge all\\nwhom I meet!$'}
text:Route111_DaisukeDefeat	{'body': 'Uncle! I give up!$'}
text:Route111_DaisukePostBattle	{'body': 'All I can do is keep training until\\nI can defeat strong TRAINERS such\\las yourself.$'}
text:Route111_WiltonIntro	{'body': "COFAGRIGUS gives your attacker MUMMY,\\nthen STEELIX cleans what's left.\\pShow me a team that doesn't need to\\ntouch it.$"}
text:Route111_WiltonDefeat	{'body': "My defenses weren't enough…$"}
text:Route111_WiltonPostBattle	{'body': 'Contact moves are a habit. Break the\\nhabit before a Ghost breaks your team.$'}
text:Route111_WiltonRegister	{'body': 'There is much to be learned from\\nyour training style.\\pI request permission to record your\\ncontact, if it behooves you.$'}
text:Route111_WiltonRematchIntro	{'body': "We're training here to elevate our\\ngame to the next level.\\lStay and train with us!$"}
text:Route111_WiltonRematchDefeat	{'body': "Ooh, you're decent!$"}
text:Route111_WiltonPostRematch	{'body': "Since you're that strong, you should\\naim for the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"}
text:Route111_BrookeIntro	{'body': 'Every partner has a job. Some make\\nan opening; others charge through\\lit.\\pWhich one will you answer first?$'}
text:Route111_BrookeDefeat	{'body': 'You picked the right one.$'}
text:Route111_BrookePostBattle	{'body': 'Every role has a counter. The trick is\\nnot spending it on the wrong role.$'}
text:Route111_BrookeRegister	{'body': 'I wish I could become friends with\\nmore strong people like you!$'}
text:Route111_BrookeRematchIntro	{'body': 'You can make POKéMON stronger or\\nweaker depending on the moves you\\lteach them.\\pWhat kinds of moves do your POKéMON\\nknow?$'}
text:Route111_BrookeRematchDefeat	{'body': "You've taught them good moves!$"}
text:Route111_BrookePostRematch	{'body': 'I should ask a CENTER TUTOR about\\nmoves that give my partners more\\lways to help each other.$'}
text:Route111_CeliaIntro	{'body': "I shouldn't have come to a place like\\nthis for a picnic!$"}
text:Route111_CeliaDefeat	{'body': "Aww!\\nI really shouldn't have come!$"}
text:Route111_CeliaPostBattle	{'body': "In a sandstorm like this, I can't set\\nthe places for a picnic even with my\\lGO-GOGGLES on…$"}
text:Route111_BryanIntro	{'body': 'How tough are you?\\nWe shall expose that secret!$'}
text:Route111_BryanDefeat	{'body': 'Oh! Your strength!\\nIt is shrouded in mystery!$'}
text:Route111_BryanPostBattle	{'body': 'This desert hoards mysteries in\\nits shifting sands!$'}
text:Route111_BrandenIntro	{'body': "I'll give you some of my sandwich\\nif you'll lose.$"}
text:Route111_BrandenDefeat	{'body': 'Tch! I thought a sandwich would be\\nenough of a bribe…$'}
text:Route111_BrandenPostBattle	{'body': 'My whole crew loves sharing\\nmy sandwiches.$'}
text:Route111_TyronIntro	{'body': 'This is my favorite kind of POKéMON!$'}
text:Route111_TyronDefeat	{'body': 'Wait!\\nDid you get a good look at my POKéMON?$'}
text:Route111_TyronPostBattle	{'body': 'When having a battle, I get a kick out\\nof showing off my POKéMON.\\pI bet everyone feels that way when\\nthey enter a battle!$'}
text:Route111_CelinaIntro	{'body': 'Show me how to put a little excitement\\ninto my life.$'}
text:Route111_CelinaDefeat	{'body': 'Oh… My…\\nThat was too much excitement.$'}
text:Route111_CelinaPostBattle	{'body': "My pulse is still racing.\\nYou're one fabulous TRAINER.$"}
text:Route111_HaydenIntro	{'body': "When you're as famished as I am,\\nthere is no room for pity!$"}
text:Route111_HaydenDefeat	{'body': 'Groan…$'}
text:Route111_HaydenPostBattle	{'body': 'My stomach is grumbling!\\nMaybe I can grill some BERRIES…$'}
text:Route111_BiancaIntro	{'body': 'Did you come from MAUVILLE?\\nThen you should be full of energy!$'}
text:Route111_BiancaDefeat	{'body': "Ooh lala!\\nThat's a lot to take!$"}
text:Route111_BiancaPostBattle	{'body': 'This road here…\\nYou have quite a ways to travel.$'}
text:Route112_BriceIntro	{'body': 'Hahahaha!\\nHow about we have a battle?\\lYou and me!\\lHahahaha!$'}
text:Route112_BriceDefeat	{'body': 'I lost!\\nHahahaha!$'}
text:Route112_BricePostBattle	{'body': 'Hahahahaha! Something flew up my nose!\\nHahahaha-hatchoo!$'}
text:Route112_TrentIntro	{'body': "My legs are solid from pounding up\\nand down the mountains.\\pThey're not going to buckle easily,\\nfriend!$"}
text:Route112_TrentDefeat	{'body': 'Ouch! My legs cramped up!$'}
text:Route112_TrentPostBattle	{'body': 'Try hiking, and I mean really\\npounding, on these mountain trails\\lwith a heavy pack weighing dozens of\\lpounds.\\pThat, my friend, will get your body\\ninto serious shape.$'}
text:Route112_TrentRegister	{'body': "Ow, my legs have cramped up.\\nCan you grab me some bandages from\\lmy backpack?\\pNo, that's my POKéNAV!\\nOh, fine, I'll register you.$"}
text:Route112_TrentRematchIntro	{'body': "I've been keeping fit by hiking.\\nPower, I have in spades!$"}
text:Route112_TrentRematchDefeat	{'body': 'I got trumped in power?$'}
text:Route112_TrentRematchPostBattle	{'body': 'I hear there are some seriously tough\\nTRAINERS on top of MT. CHIMNEY.\\pI intend to get up there and give them\\na challenge!$'}
text:Route112_LarryIntro	{'body': "I'm strong.\\nI won't cry if I lose.$"}
text:Route112_LarryDefeat	{'body': 'Waaaah!$'}
text:Route112_LarryPostBattle	{'body': "I'm not crying because I miss my mommy!\\nSnivel…$"}
text:Route112_CarolIntro	{'body': "When you're out on a picnic, why,\\nyou simply have to sing!\\lCome on, sing with me!$"}
text:Route112_CarolDefeat	{'body': "Oh, you're so strong!$"}
text:Route112_CarolPostBattle	{'body': "It doesn't matter if you're good or bad\\nat singing or POKéMON.\\pIf you have the most fun, you win!$"}
text:Route112_BryantIntro	{'body': 'I caught hot POKéMON in FIERY PATH!\\nTake a look!$'}
text:Route112_BryantDefeat	{'body': 'What a bumpy ride that was!$'}
text:Route112_BryantPostBattle	{'body': 'I like the way you battle.\\nIt has a certain flair to it.$'}
text:Route112_ShaylaIntro	{'body': "Oh, aren't you an adorable TRAINER!\\nPlease, I need a romantic battle!\\lI'm somewhat decent!$"}
text:Route112_ShaylaDefeat	{'body': "Oh, how strong you are!\\nYou've given me quite a shock!$"}
text:Route112_ShaylaPostBattle	{'body': 'That was wonderfully dramatic!\\nI need time to think about every\\lturn. What a romantic battle!$'}
text:Route113_JaylenIntro	{'body': "Can you guess why it's so cool\\naround here?$"}
text:Route113_JaylenDefeat	{'body': 'Peeuuw!\\nThat stinks!$'}
text:Route113_JaylenPostBattle	{'body': "The volcanic ash blocks the sun,\\nso it doesn't get very warm.\\pThat's good for me--I can't stand heat!$"}
text:Route113_DillonIntro	{'body': "The volcano's eruption is proof that\\nthe earth is alive.$"}
text:Route113_DillonDefeat	{'body': "You're some kind of strong!$"}
text:Route113_DillonPostBattle	{'body': "Ouch! Owww! I can't see!\\nI got ashes in my eyelashes!\\pGet it? Ashes and eyelashes?\\pOkay, that was bad, sorry…$"}
text:Route113_MadelineIntro	{'body': 'I use this parasol to ward off this\\nfilthy, yucky volcanic ash from\\lmy dear VANILLISH.$'}
text:Route113_MadelineDefeat	{'body': 'Huff, huff…\\nI am exhausted…$'}
text:Route113_MadelinePostBattle	{'body': "You're very good at this.\\nI must say I'm impressed!$"}
text:Route113_MadelineRegister	{'body': 'Here, slide under my parasol.\\nLet me register you in my POKéNAV.$'}
text:Route113_MadelineRematchIntro	{'body': "Oh, hello, hasn't it been a while?\\nMay I invite you to battle?$"}
text:Route113_MadelineRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, how super!$'}
text:Route113_MadelinePostRematch	{'body': "You've remained very good at this.\\nI must say I'm impressed!$"}
text:Route113_LaoIntro	{'body': 'From out of the ashes I leap! Hiyah!\\nI challenge thee!$'}
text:Route113_LaoDefeat	{'body': 'With honor I admit defeat!$'}
text:Route113_LaoPostBattle	{'body': 'I must refine the art of concealment.\\nI bid thee farewell.$'}
text:Route113_LaoRegister	{'body': 'Yiiyaah! Witness the ancient ninja\\ntechnique of POKéNAV registration!$'}
text:Route113_LaoRematchIntro	{'body': 'From out of the ashes I leap! Hiyah!\\nI challenge thee!$'}
text:Route113_LaoRematchDefeat	{'body': 'With honor I admit defeat!$'}
text:Route113_LaoPostRematch	{'body': 'My flawless concealment was let down\\nby my immature battle skills…\\pI bid thee farewell.$'}
text:Route113_LungIntro	{'body': 'Thanks for finding me!\\nBut we still have to battle!$'}
text:Route113_LungDefeat	{'body': "I'll use my ninjutsu on you…\\n“VOLCANIC ASH SWIRL CLOAK”!\\p…What?\\nIt's already over?$"}
text:Route113_LungPostBattle	{'body': "You know what's crummy about hiding?\\nIt's lonely if no one comes along.$"}
text:Route113_ToriIntro	{'body': 'TORI: Both of us, we collect ashes.\\nWe battle POKéMON, too.$'}
text:Route113_ToriDefeat	{'body': "TORI: We lost… It's boring, so I'm going\\nto get some more ashes.$"}
text:Route113_ToriPostBattle	{'body': 'TORI: How much ash do we have?\\nEnough for a WHITE FLUTE, I hope.$'}
text:Route113_ToriNotEnoughMons	{'body': "TORI: We want to battle 2-on-2.\\nIf we didn't, we would lose!$"}
text:Route113_TiaIntro	{'body': 'TIA: Both of us, we collect ashes.\\nWe battle POKéMON, too.$'}
text:Route113_TiaDefeat	{'body': "TIA: We couldn't win… It's boring,\\nso I'm getting some more ashes.$"}
text:Route113_TiaPostBattle	{'body': 'TIA: We have a lot of ashes!\\nI think enough for a WHITE FLUTE!$'}
text:Route113_TiaNotEnoughMons	{'body': "TIA: We want to battle 2-on-2.\\nIf we don't, we won't win!$"}
text:Route113_CobyIntro	{'body': 'Pfft, with these wings I can\\nflick you away!$'}
text:Route113_CobyDefeat	{'body': 'A… What?$'}
text:Route113_CobyPostBattle	{'body': "I don't know what to say when I get\\nbeaten so easily…$"}
text:Route113_SophieIntro	{'body': 'The warmth here is making me drowsy.\\nBattle with me so I can stay awake.$'}
text:Route113_SophieDefeat	{'body': "This is a dream.\\nI'm sure of it…$"}
text:Route113_SophiePostBattle	{'body': "Losing burns me up…\\nI'm just going to sleep right here!\\lZzz!$"}
text:Route113_LawrenceIntro	{'body': 'Were you maybe in the middle\\nof gathering volcanic ashes?$'}
text:Route113_LawrenceDefeat	{'body': 'Ehehe.\\nWe got beaten cleanly.$'}
text:Route113_LawrencePostBattle	{'body': 'I ought to hide under the ashes, too.$'}
text:Route113_WyattIntro	{'body': 'Y-you want to battle with me?\\nEven though I just caught my POKéMON?$'}
text:Route113_WyattDefeat	{'body': "Y-you're all happy to win?\\nEven though it's only me?$"}
text:Route113_WyattPostBattle	{'body': "Oh, so now you want to say a word to\\nthe loser?\\pAren't you just the coolest?\\nHumph!$"}
text:Route114_LennyIntro	{'body': "Yodelayhihoo!\\p… …\\pYou're supposed to shout\\n“yodelayhihoo” since it doesn't\\lecho here!$"}
text:Route114_LennyDefeat	{'body': 'Yodelayhihoo!$'}
text:Route114_LennyPostBattle	{'body': 'When I was a wee tyke, I believed there\\nwas someone copying me and shouting\\lback, “Yodelayhihoo.”$'}
text:Route114_LucasIntro	{'body': "If you're not prepared, you shouldn't\\nbe up in the mountains!$"}
text:Route114_LucasDefeat	{'body': 'The mountains are unforgiving…$'}
text:Route114_LucasPostBattle	{'body': 'In the winter, mountains turn deadly\\nwith blizzards and avalanches.$'}
text:Route114_ShaneIntro	{'body': "Camping's fun! You can fish, roast\\nmarshmallows, and tell spooky stories!\\pBut the best of all are the POKéMON\\nbattles!$"}
text:Route114_ShaneDefeat	{'body': 'Way too strong!$'}
text:Route114_ShanePostBattle	{'body': "I think it's great that I can go\\ncamping with my POKéMON.$"}
text:Route114_NancyIntro	{'body': "I need to exercise after a meal.\\nLet's have a match!$"}
text:Route114_NancyDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, no!$'}
text:Route114_NancyPostBattle	{'body': "I just had a tasty meal.\\nI'm getting drowsy…$"}
text:Route114_SteveIntro	{'body': 'Ufufufufufu…\\nWant to battle against my POKéMON?$'}
text:Route114_SteveDefeat	{'body': 'M-My POKéMON…$'}
text:Route114_StevePostBattle	{'body': "A big body that's all lumpy and hard,\\nenormous horns, and vicious fangs…\\pUfufufufu…\\nI wish I had a POKéMON like that…$"}
text:Route114_SteveRegister	{'body': "Don't forget what you've done to me!\\nI'll make it so you can't forget!$"}
text:Route114_SteveRematchIntro	{'body': 'Ufufufufufu…\\nCome on, battle my POKéMON…$'}
text:Route114_SteveRematchDefeat	{'body': 'I feel so lucky getting to see your\\nPOKéMON…$'}
text:Route114_StevePostRematch	{'body': 'Ufufufufufu…\\pWhen I see POKéMON battling, I get all\\nshivery and shaky…$'}
text:Route114_BernieIntro	{'body': "If you're lighting a campfire,\\nmake sure you have water handy.$"}
text:Route114_BernieDefeat	{'body': 'Thanks for dousing my fire!$'}
text:Route114_BerniePostBattle	{'body': "You really do have to be careful with\\nany sort of fire in a forest.\\pDon't ever underestimate the power\\nof fire.$"}
text:Route114_BernieRegister	{'body': "You set my spirit on fire.\\nLet's register each other!$"}
text:Route114_BernieRematchIntro	{'body': 'Have you learned to keep water handy\\nfor campfires?$'}
text:Route114_BernieRematchDefeat	{'body': 'I got hosed down before I could\\nflare up, I guess.$'}
text:Route114_BerniePostRematch	{'body': "You really do have to be careful with\\nany sort of fire in a forest.\\pDon't ever underestimate the power\\nof fire.$"}
text:Route114_ClaudeIntro	{'body': "If we were fishing, you wouldn't stand\\na chance against me.\\lSo, bring on your POKéMON!$"}
text:Route114_ClaudeDefeat	{'body': "If we were fishing, I would've won…$"}
text:Route114_ClaudePostBattle	{'body': "I think I'll try my luck at landing\\na big one at METEOR FALLS.\\pThere has to be something in there.\\nI just know it.$"}
text:Route114_NolanIntro	{'body': "I like to fish. But I also like to\\nbattle!\\pIf anyone challenges me, I'm there,\\neven if I'm fishing.$"}
text:Route114_NolanDefeat	{'body': "I like to battle, but that doesn't\\nmean I'm good at it…$"}
text:Route114_NolanPostBattle	{'body': "This time I'll do it!\\pI always think that, so I can't walk\\naway from fishing or POKéMON.$"}
text:Route114_TyraIntro	{'body': "TYRA: Well, sure.\\nI'm in the mood for it.\\lI'll teach you a little about POKéMON.$"}
text:Route114_TyraDefeat	{'body': 'TYRA: What an amazing battle style!$'}
text:Route114_TyraPostBattle	{'body': 'TYRA: I was teaching my junior IVY\\nabout POKéMON.$'}
text:Route114_TyraNotEnoughMons	{'body': "TYRA: Giggle…\\nIf you want to battle with us, just one\\lPOKéMON isn't enough!$"}
text:Route114_IvyIntro	{'body': 'IVY: Who taught you about POKéMON?$'}
text:Route114_IvyDefeat	{'body': 'IVY: What an amazing battle style!$'}
text:Route114_IvyPostBattle	{'body': 'IVY: I started training POKéMON\\nbecause TYRA, my student mentor,\\ltaught me!$'}
text:Route114_IvyNotEnoughMons	{'body': 'IVY: Do you only have one POKéMON?\\nI think it must feel lonesome.$'}
text:Route114_KaiIntro	{'body': 'I landed a big one!\\nA huge one, I tell you!$'}
text:Route114_KaiDefeat	{'body': 'What was that about?\\nDid mine lose in size?$'}
text:Route114_KaiPostBattle	{'body': "Okay!\\nI'll just fish me a bigger one!$"}
text:Route114_CharlotteIntro	{'body': "Me!\\nI'm not just a pretty face!$"}
text:Route114_CharlotteDefeat	{'body': "That wasn't cute in the least!$"}
text:Route114_CharlottePostBattle	{'body': "I don't want a POKéMON that's\\njust cute.\\pI adore cute ones that have a quirk\\nor two!$"}
text:Route114_AngelinaIntro	{'body': 'Have you made your POKéMON evolve\\nvery much?$'}
text:Route114_AngelinaDefeat	{'body': "Oh, I see.\\nThat's good to know.$"}
text:Route114_AngelinaPostBattle	{'body': "Some POKéMON change so much when\\nthey evolve, it's startling!$"}
text:Route115_TimothyIntro	{'body': 'HARIYAMA opens with FAKE OUT.\\nThen DUSCLOPS slows the clock for\\lCONKELDURR.\\pRead the tempo. Then keep me\\ncompany.$'}
text:Route115_TimothyDefeat	{'body': 'You set the pace of that match!$'}
text:Route115_TimothyPostBattle	{'body': 'Effort beats talent, but knowing which\\nturn matters beats effort.$'}
text:Route115_TimothyRegister	{'body': 'Hmm… A loss this thorough has been\\na distant memory.\\pIf you would allow it, I wish to\\nexchange training observations.$'}
text:Route115_TimothyRematchIntro	{'body': 'Hm… As always, your agility speaks\\nfor itself.\\lCome, keep me company!$'}
text:Route115_TimothyRematchDefeat	{'body': 'As strong as ever!$'}
text:Route115_TimothyPostRematch	{'body': "All it takes is effort!\\pI lost because I haven't put in enough\\neffort!$"}
text:Route115_KoichiIntro	{'body': 'You!\\pMy fighting crew!\\pWe demand a battle!$'}
text:Route115_KoichiDefeat	{'body': 'Ouch, ouch, ouch!$'}
text:Route115_KoichiPostBattle	{'body': 'My fighting crew!\\pSo long as they seek power, I will\\ngrow strong with them!$'}
text:Route115_NobIntro	{'body': 'My strongest skill is busting bricks\\nwith my forehead!$'}
text:Route115_NobDefeat	{'body': 'Ugwaaaah!\\nMy head is busted!$'}
text:Route115_NobPostBattle	{'body': "I've been teaching my POKéMON karate.\\pIt looks like they'll get a lot better\\nthan me. I'm excited about that.$"}
text:Route115_NobRegister	{'body': 'You impress me! Let me share how\\nour training develops!$'}
text:Route115_NobRematchIntro	{'body': 'After you beat me, we trained hard to\\nimprove our skills.\\lCome on, give us a rematch!$'}
text:Route115_NobRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Ugwaaah!\\nWe lost again!$'}
text:Route115_NobPostRematch	{'body': "My POKéMON will grow stronger!\\nI'll redouble my training!$"}
text:Route115_CyndyIntro	{'body': "This beach is my secret training spot!\\nDon't come butting in!$"}
text:Route115_CyndyDefeat	{'body': "I haven't trained enough!$"}
text:Route115_CyndyPostBattle	{'body': 'The sand acts as a cushion to reduce\\nimpact and prevent injury.\\lThis is the perfect place to train.$'}
text:Route115_CyndyRegister	{'body': "Okay, fine, you're free to come here.\\nIn return, share your training tips.$"}
text:Route115_CyndyRematchIntro	{'body': "Okay, let's get this battle on!$"}
text:Route115_CyndyRematchDefeat	{'body': 'I can battle but my POKéMON…$'}
text:Route115_CyndyPostRematch	{'body': 'Even when I lose, I still get some\\nenjoyment out of it.\\lIt must be that I love POKéMON.$'}
text:Route115_HectorIntro	{'body': 'I have a rare POKéMON!\\nWould you like me to show you?$'}
text:Route115_HectorDefeat	{'body': "You…\\nYou want my POKéMON, don't you?$"}
text:Route115_HectorPostBattle	{'body': "I have this rare POKéMON.\\nIt's enough to keep me satisfied.$"}
text:Route115_KyraIntro	{'body': "I'll battle while I'm running!\\nTry to keep up with me!$"}
text:Route115_KyraDefeat	{'body': 'Gasp, gasp…$'}
text:Route115_KyraPostBattle	{'body': 'I made the mistake of trying to battle\\nwhile running!\\pI should take a run to calm down…$'}
text:Route115_JaidenIntro	{'body': 'Take that!\\nUltra POKéMON ninja attack!$'}
text:Route115_JaidenDefeat	{'body': 'Waaah!\\nOur strategy failed!$'}
text:Route115_JaidenPostBattle	{'body': "But my POKéMON were ultra,\\nweren't they?$"}
text:Route115_HeleneIntro	{'body': 'My POKéMON have black belt-level\\nstrength!$'}
text:Route115_HeleneDefeat	{'body': 'This is too humiliating!$'}
text:Route115_HelenePostBattle	{'body': "I rarely meet anyone who's better\\nthan me…\\pI get it now!\\nYou're a GYM LEADER, aren't you?$"}
text:Route115_AlixIntro	{'body': "Our eyes met!\\nThere's no getting away now!$"}
text:Route115_AlixDefeat	{'body': 'Gah!\\nNot bad!$'}
text:Route115_AlixPostBattle	{'body': 'Oh, well.\\nI think I will TELEPORT home.$'}
text:Route115_MarleneIntro	{'body': "You've disturbed my meditation…\\nYou'll be punished for it.$"}
text:Route115_MarleneDefeat	{'body': "You've broken my concentration!$"}
text:Route115_MarlenePostBattle	{'body': "I was meditating with my POKéMON.\\nBut this place isn't very peaceful…$"}
text:Route116_ClarkIntro	{'body': "If the tunnel doesn't go through, then\\nI'll just go over the top.$"}
text:Route116_ClarkDefeat	{'body': 'Gasp… Gasp…\\nLosing made me tired…$'}
text:Route116_ClarkPostBattle	{'body': "It's no big deal if there's no tunnel.\\nTo a HIKER, mountains are roads!$"}
text:Route116_JoeyIntro	{'body': 'My POKéMON rule!\\nCheck them out!$'}
text:Route116_JoeyDefeat	{'body': 'Ouch! A scrape!\\nI have to put on a bandage!$'}
text:Route116_JoeyPostBattle	{'body': "Bandages are signs of toughness!\\nI've got another one!$"}
text:Route116_JoseIntro	{'body': "My BUG POKéMON are tough!\\nLet's battle!$"}
text:Route116_JoseDefeat	{'body': 'I lost!\\nI thought I had you!$'}
text:Route116_JosePostBattle	{'body': 'BUG POKéMON evolve quickly.\\nSo they get strong quickly, too.$'}
text:Route116_JaniceIntro	{'body': 'Let me teach you how strong my\\nadorable POKéMON is!$'}
text:Route116_JaniceDefeat	{'body': "You're a notch above me…$"}
text:Route116_JanicePostBattle	{'body': "POKéMON that possess cuteness and\\npower, that's ideal, I think.$"}
text:Route116_JerryIntro	{'body': "We learn all sorts of things at the\\nTRAINER'S SCHOOL.\\pI want to test things out for real!$"}
text:Route116_JerryDefeat	{'body': "I slacked off in school…\\nThat's why I lost.$"}
text:Route116_JerryPostBattle	{'body': "I'll have to redo some courses at\\nthe TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\\lIf I don't, ROXANNE will be steamed.$"}
text:Route116_JerryRegister1	{'body': "I learned at the TRAINER'S SCHOOL\\nthat a POKéNAV can register TRAINERS.\\pI don't really get what that means,\\nso can I just try it?$"}
text:Route116_JerryRegister2	{'body': "I learned at the TRAINER'S SCHOOL\\nthat a POKéNAV can register TRAINERS.\\pI don't really get what that means,\\nso can I just try it?$"}
text:Route116_JerryRematchIntro	{'body': "I've been studying seriously at the\\nTRAINER'S SCHOOL.\\lI won't lose like I did last time.$"}
text:Route116_JerryRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Hunh?\\nI studied diligently.$'}
text:Route116_JerryPostRematch	{'body': "I'll have to redo some courses at\\nthe TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\\lIf I don't, ROXANNE will be steamed.$"}
text:Route116_KarenIntro	{'body': 'I study at school, and I study on\\nthe way home, too!$'}
text:Route116_KarenDefeat	{'body': "I'm in shock--I lost?$"}
text:Route116_KarenPostBattle	{'body': "Awww, I'll never become an elegant\\nTRAINER like ROXANNE this way!$"}
text:Route116_KarenRegister1	{'body': "Oh, wow! Isn't that a POKéNAV?\\nI have one, too! Please register me!$"}
text:Route116_KarenRegister2	{'body': "Oh, wow! Isn't that a POKéNAV?\\nI have one, too! Please register me!$"}
text:Route116_KarenRematchIntro	{'body': 'I studied a whole lot since I saw you.\\nYou must see my achievements!$'}
text:Route116_KarenRematchDefeat	{'body': "I'm in shock.\\nI lost again?$"}
text:Route116_KarenPostRematch	{'body': "You've beaten ROXANNE?\\nI can't beat you, then. Not yet.$"}
text:Route116_SarahIntro	{'body': "Just so you know, I've never once been\\nbested by anyone at anything.$"}
text:Route116_SarahDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, my goodness.\\nThis is a new experience for me.$'}
text:Route116_SarahPostBattle	{'body': 'My life of luxury affords me all that\\nI could possibly desire.\\pHowever, when it comes to POKéMON,\\nmy wealth has no meaning.$'}
text:Route116_DawsonIntro	{'body': "When you lay your eyes on my POKéMON's\\ngorgeous fur, their beauty will render\\lyou helpless!$"}
text:Route116_DawsonDefeat	{'body': "Oh, baby, say it isn't so!$"}
text:Route116_DawsonPostBattle	{'body': "Oh, no, no, no!\\nYou've mussed up my POKéMON's fur!\\lYou've ruined my hairdo, too!\\lI'll have to call my stylist now!$"}
text:Route116_DevanIntro	{'body': "We'll rock you hard!$"}
text:Route116_DevanDefeat	{'body': 'Aiyiyi!\\nNo contest at all!$'}
text:Route116_DevanPostBattle	{'body': "I should try different POKéMON\\ntypes, that's what I ought to do.$"}
text:Route116_JohnsonIntro	{'body': "It's a dead end up here.\\nI'm bored, so can we battle?$"}
text:Route116_JohnsonDefeat	{'body': 'That was fun even though I lost.$'}
text:Route116_JohnsonPostBattle	{'body': 'Want to stay here and keep\\nme company?$'}
text:Route117_IsaacIntro	{'body': "Listen, could I get you to battle\\nthe POKéMON I'm raising?$"}
text:Route117_IsaacDefeat	{'body': "You've raised yours superbly…$"}
text:Route117_IsaacPostBattle	{'body': "POKéMON isn't all about power.\\pPolishing a unique aspect of one's\\ncharacter is another way of enjoying\\lPOKéMON.$"}
text:Route117_IsaacRegister	{'body': "I'm going to redouble my training.\\nWould you come look in on us?$"}
text:Route117_IsaacRematchIntro	{'body': "The POKéMON I've been raising are\\nlooking good, just like before.$"}
text:Route117_IsaacRematchDefeat	{'body': 'You know how to raise them properly.\\nYou might have DAY CARE skills…$'}
text:Route117_IsaacPostRematch	{'body': 'Your POKéMON are growing good!\\nYou should enter them in CONTESTS.$'}
text:Route117_LydiaIntro	{'body': 'Please, allow me to evaluate if you\\nhave raised your POKéMON properly.$'}
text:Route117_LydiaDefeat	{'body': 'Yes, they are growing properly.$'}
text:Route117_LydiaPostBattle	{'body': 'Try raising POKéMON with more\\nattention to their character traits.$'}
text:Route117_LydiaRegister	{'body': "I'm glad I met a superb TRAINER in you.\\nI hope to see you again.$"}
text:Route117_LydiaRematchIntro	{'body': 'Allow me to reevaluate if you have\\nraised your POKéMON properly.$'}
text:Route117_LydiaRematchDefeat	{'body': 'They are growing admirably.$'}
text:Route117_LydiaPostRematch	{'body': 'POKéMON seem to like different kinds\\nof {POKEBLOCK}S, depending on their nature.$'}
text:Route117_DylanIntro	{'body': "I'm in the middle of a triathlon, but,\\nwhatever, let's have a battle!$"}
text:Route117_DylanDefeat	{'body': 'I ran out of energy!$'}
text:Route117_DylanPostBattle	{'body': 'I may have blown it…\\pI might have dropped to last during\\nthat battle…$'}
text:Route117_DylanRegister	{'body': "POKéMON have to be strong, too?\\nI'd like you to train me!$"}
text:Route117_DylanRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm smack in the middle of a triathlon,\\nbut I'm comfortably ahead.\\lLet's make this a quick battle!$"}
text:Route117_DylanRematchDefeat	{'body': 'I ran out of energy again!$'}
text:Route117_DylanPostRematch	{'body': "I was tops in swimming and cycling,\\nbut I'm not quite that confident with\\lPOKéMON yet.$"}
text:Route117_MariaIntro	{'body': "I do my triathlon training with POKéMON,\\nso I'm pretty confident about my speed.$"}
text:Route117_MariaDefeat	{'body': 'I need to get more practices in,\\nI guess.$'}
text:Route117_MariaPostBattle	{'body': "Training is meaningful only if you\\nkeep it up regularly.\\pOkay! I'll resume my training!\\nTomorrow!$"}
text:Route117_MariaRegister	{'body': "You appear to be training properly…\\nI'd like to compare our routines!$"}
text:Route117_MariaRematchIntro	{'body': 'Are you keeping up with your training?\\nI sure am!\\lLet me show you the evidence!$'}
text:Route117_MariaRematchDefeat	{'body': 'I need to get more practices in,\\nI guess.$'}
text:Route117_MariaPostRematch	{'body': "I'll resume training tomorrow.\\nLet's battle again sometime!$"}
text:Route117_DerekIntro	{'body': 'Once a BUG CATCHER!\\nAnd now a BUG MANIAC!\\pBut my love for POKéMON remains\\nunchanged!$'}
text:Route117_DerekDefeat	{'body': 'My ineptitude also remains\\nunchanged…$'}
text:Route117_DerekPostBattle	{'body': "All I did was follow my heart, and now\\nthey call me a BUG MANIAC…\\pStill, I am an expert on BUG POKéMON,\\nso it's only natural that they call me\\la BUG MANIAC.$"}
text:Route117_AnnaIntro	{'body': "ANNA: I'm with my pretty junior student\\npartner. I have to do good!$"}
text:Route117_AnnaDefeat	{'body': "ANNA: I'm with my pretty junior student\\npartner! Let me win!$"}
text:Route117_AnnaPostBattle	{'body': "ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\\ncombinations.\\pI'd say you're second only to us!$"}
text:Route117_AnnaAndMegRegister	{'body': 'ANNA: We learned from that loss!\\nLet us share what we discover.$'}
text:Route117_AnnaNotEnoughMons	{'body': 'ANNA: If you want to battle us,\\nbring two POKéMON with you.$'}
text:Route117_MegIntro	{'body': "MEG: I'm going to tag up with my super\\nsenior student partner and beat you!$"}
text:Route117_MegDefeat	{'body': "MEG: Oh, no!\\nI'm sorry, ANNA! I let you down…$"}
text:Route117_MegPostBattle	{'body': "MEG: I dragged ANNA down…\\nIf I didn't, she would have won!$"}
text:Route117_MegNotEnoughMons	{'body': "MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\\nWe can't battle with you, then.\\pWe want to have a 2-on-2 battle.$"}
text:Route117_AnnaRematchIntro	{'body': "ANNA: I can't keep losing in front of\\nmy junior partner, right?$"}
text:Route117_AnnaRematchDefeat	{'body': "ANNA: I couldn't get into the groove.$"}
text:Route117_AnnaPostRematch	{'body': "ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\\ncombinations.\\pI'd say you're second only to us!$"}
text:Route117_AnnaRematchNotEnoughMons	{'body': 'ANNA: If you want to battle us,\\nbring two POKéMON with you.$'}
text:Route117_MegRematchIntro	{'body': "MEG: I'm going to tag up with my\\nsenior partner and win this time!$"}
text:Route117_MegRematchDefeat	{'body': 'MEG: Too strong!$'}
text:Route117_MegPostRematch	{'body': "MEG: I battled together with my\\nsenior partner, but we lost…\\pThat's so discouraging…$"}
text:Route117_MegRematchNotEnoughMons	{'body': "MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\\nWe can't battle with you, then.\\pWe want to have a 2-on-2 battle.$"}
text:Route117_MelinaIntro	{'body': "Isn't it nice? To battle while looking\\nat pretty flowers?$"}
text:Route117_MelinaDefeat	{'body': "Oh, that's quite impressive!$"}
text:Route117_MelinaPostBattle	{'body': 'It feels wonderful to go for a jog\\nwhile looking at flowers.$'}
text:Route117_BrandiIntro	{'body': 'Let me demonstrate the power\\nhidden within a PSYCHIC POKéMON!$'}
text:Route117_BrandiDefeat	{'body': 'Astonishing!$'}
text:Route117_BrandiPostBattle	{'body': 'PSYCHIC POKéMON are complex.\\nYou should try catching some.$'}
text:Route117_AishaIntro	{'body': "Concentrate on getting the win.\\nThat's how I battle!$"}
text:Route117_AishaDefeat	{'body': "I don't waste any time being angry\\nover a loss--I would rather train.$"}
text:Route117_AishaPostBattle	{'body': "I think that if you worry about losing,\\nyou're more likely to lose.$"}
text:Route118_RoseIntro	{'body': 'The aroma of flowers has a magical\\npower. It cleanses us body and soul.$'}
text:Route118_RoseDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, dear me.\\nI seem to have lost.$'}
text:Route118_RosePostBattle	{'body': "Flowers, POKéMON…\\nI love whatever smells nice.\\pStinky things…\\nI'll pass.$"}
text:Route118_RoseRegister	{'body': "Sniff… That odor--it's a POKéNAV!\\nWe must register each other!$"}
text:Route118_RoseRematchIntro	{'body': 'Were you drawn here by the sweet\\naroma?$'}
text:Route118_RoseRematchDefeat	{'body': "The power of aroma…\\nIt didn't seem to do much.$"}
text:Route118_RosePostRematch	{'body': 'If you use a sweet aroma properly,\\nPOKéMON will be attracted by it.$'}
text:Route118_PerryIntro	{'body': "BIRD POKéMON that FLY elegantly in\\nthe sky… They're the best!$"}
text:Route118_PerryDefeat	{'body': 'Urgh…\\nI crashed…$'}
text:Route118_PerryPostBattle	{'body': "You've got great POKéMON.\\nI'll have to train mine better.$"}
text:Route118_ChesterIntro	{'body': 'Take your marks!\\nMy whole team!$'}
text:Route118_ChesterDefeat	{'body': 'They did take flight…$'}
text:Route118_ChesterPostBattle	{'body': "If my birds get stronger, they'll be\\nable to fly more freely…$"}
text:Route118_BarnyIntro	{'body': "I'm a FISHERMAN, but also a TRAINER.\\nI'm raising the POKéMON I caught.$"}
text:Route118_BarnyDefeat	{'body': 'I thought I was doing okay in my\\ntraining…$'}
text:Route118_BarnyPostBattle	{'body': "I couldn't win by training POKéMON\\nwhile I fished…\\pWas I doing things in half measures?$"}
text:Route118_WadeIntro	{'body': 'For FISHERMEN, equipment is the key.\\pBut for TRAINERS, the key ingredients\\nare POKéMON and heart, of course!$'}
text:Route118_WadeDefeat	{'body': 'I was beaten in heart?$'}
text:Route118_WadePostBattle	{'body': 'Come to think of it, fishing is a battle\\nbetween a FISHERMAN and a POKéMON.$'}
text:Route118_DaltonIntro	{'body': 'Let my melody rock your soul!$'}
text:Route118_DaltonDefeat	{'body': 'La-lalala…$'}
text:Route118_DaltonPostBattle	{'body': "An electric guitar doesn't always\\nhave to be noisy…\\pIt can be strummed to squeeze out\\nthis heart-stirring melody…$"}
text:Route118_DaltonRegister	{'body': 'When I compose better melodies,\\nyou have to come listen, okay?$'}
text:Route118_DaltonRematchIntro	{'body': 'A melody from my POKéMON and me…\\nLet us deliver it to your soul.$'}
text:Route118_DaltonRematchDefeat	{'body': 'La-lalala…$'}
text:Route118_DaltonPostRematch	{'body': 'When I play, my emotions should reach\\nyou through my electric guitar…$'}
text:Route118_DeandreIntro	{'body': 'Go, go, go! Every partner, ready\\nfor action!$'}
text:Route118_DeandreDefeat	{'body': 'Come in, POKéMON! Is everybody\\nokay?!$'}
text:Route118_DeandrePostBattle	{'body': "Isn't it cool that I have a POKéMON\\nbattle team?\\pYou can copy me--I don't mind!$"}
text:Route119_BrentIntro	{'body': "We're the MIMIC CIRCLE!\\nWe MIMIC what you do!$"}
text:Route119_BrentDefeat	{'body': 'Whoopsie!\\nI lost!$'}
text:Route119_BrentPostBattle	{'body': "What's so good about mimicry?\\pFufufu…\\nYou'll never understand…$"}
text:Route119_DonaldIntro	{'body': "A swarm doesn't have to stand\\nstill! Mine can slow you down\\lwhile keeping the pressure on.\\pTry to keep up!$"}
text:Route119_DonaldDefeat	{'body': "My swarm couldn't hold you back!$"}
text:Route119_DonaldPostBattle	{'body': 'ELECTROWEB slows the opposing\\npair. I need to make better use of\\lthe time that buys.$'}
text:Route119_TaylorIntro	{'body': 'If you step forward, we step forward.\\pIf you turn right, we turn, too…$'}
text:Route119_TaylorDefeat	{'body': 'But if you win, I lose…$'}
text:Route119_TaylorPostBattle	{'body': "I can't MIMIC you winning the match.\\nThat's just impossible…\\lIt's burning me up…$"}
text:Route119_DougIntro	{'body': "Yep, you've finally caught me!\\nOr were you trying to avoid me?$"}
text:Route119_DougDefeat	{'body': 'Whoop, that was a great match!$'}
text:Route119_DougPostBattle	{'body': "We're the MIMIC CIRCLE!\\nI hope you enjoyed our performance.$"}
text:Route119_GregIntro	{'body': "We're the MIMIC CIRCLE! I've\\ncopied a few tricks from the wind\\land the light.\\pLet's see if they hold up in\\nbattle!$"}
text:Route119_GregDefeat	{'body': "My reflections weren't enough…$"}
text:Route119_GregPostBattle	{'body': 'REFLECT and LIGHT SCREEN soften\\nattacks. TAILWIND helps us act\\lsooner.\\pPutting those tricks together\\ntakes practice!$'}
text:Route119_KentIntro	{'body': "See that darting shape between the\\ntrees? That's my partner warming\\lup!\\pThe forest never stands still.\\nNeither do we!$"}
text:Route119_KentDefeat	{'body': 'You caught up with us!$'}
text:Route119_KentPostBattle	{'body': 'NINJASK gathers Speed, then BATON\\nPASS can hand it to a teammate.\\pThe tricky part is choosing when\\nto make the handoff.$'}
text:Route119_JacksonIntro	{'body': "A RANGER reads the ground. Here the\\nground is TAPU KOKO's own terrain.$"}
text:Route119_JacksonDefeat	{'body': 'You handled our charged-up team!$'}
text:Route119_JacksonPostBattle	{'body': 'ELECTRIC TERRAIN changes the\\nground under our feet. The rain\\lchanges the weather above it.\\pA RANGER watches both.$'}
text:Route119_JacksonRegister	{'body': "I hope you'll share advice without\\nmocking my lack of knowledge.$"}
text:Route119_JacksonRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm going to regain my wild spirit by\\nbeing together with POKéMON.$"}
text:Route119_JacksonRematchDefeat	{'body': "You've remained strong!$"}
text:Route119_JacksonPostRematch	{'body': 'Believe in your POKéMON.\\nBelieve in yourself.\\pThe road will reveal itself to you.$'}
text:Route119_CatherineIntro	{'body': "Traveling light? CASTFORM changes with\\nevery storm. GOODRA drinks it.\\pLet's see how light you really are.$"}
text:Route119_CatherineDefeat	{'body': 'Prepared for everything, then.$'}
text:Route119_CatherinePostBattle	{'body': 'Being prepared means having more\\nthan one plan. The weather can\\lchange before you finish packing!$'}
text:Route119_CatherineRegister	{'body': "Do you have a POKéNAV?\\nIt's a must-have tool for any TRAINER.\\pOh, you do have one!\\nLet's register each other, then!$"}
text:Route119_CatherineRematchIntro	{'body': "How's your journey with POKéMON\\ngoing?$"}
text:Route119_CatherineRematchDefeat	{'body': "I'm still missing something…$"}
text:Route119_CatherinePostRematch	{'body': 'In the same way that you, as a TRAINER,\\nrely on your POKéMON, your POKéMON\\lrely on you.$'}
text:Route119_HughIntro	{'body': 'The vast sky holds untold promise!\\pNothing can compare to the sheer\\nexhilaration of flight!$'}
text:Route119_HughDefeat	{'body': 'Down and out!$'}
text:Route119_HughPostBattle	{'body': 'My BIRD POKéMON made my dreams of\\nflying come true!$'}
text:Route119_PhilIntro	{'body': "I'll show you the true potential of me\\nand my whole team!$"}
text:Route119_PhilDefeat	{'body': 'We lacked potential…$'}
text:Route119_PhilPostBattle	{'body': 'Ever since I was a little kid, I always\\nadmired BIRD POKéMON…$'}
text:Route119_YasuIntro	{'body': 'A ninja watches for an opening. My\\npartners can make one with speed,\\lstrength, or a well-timed trick.\\pWill you leave us a gap?$'}
text:Route119_YasuDefeat	{'body': 'My techniques fell short…$'}
text:Route119_YasuPostBattle	{'body': 'A ninja must learn when to strike\\nand when to retreat. My partners\\land I still have work to do.$'}
text:Route119_TakashiIntro	{'body': "I trained in this rain until you\\ncouldn't hear my footsteps.\\pNow let's see how quietly my\\npartners can take you by surprise!$"}
text:Route119_TakashiDefeat	{'body': 'So much for my surprise attack!$'}
text:Route119_TakashiPostBattle	{'body': 'Concealment only lasts until the\\nbattle starts. After that, I have\\lto rely on my partners.$'}
text:Route119_HideoIntro	{'body': 'To hide a tree, use a forest!$'}
text:Route119_HideoDefeat	{'body': 'I bow to your superiority.$'}
text:Route119_HideoPostBattle	{'body': 'To hide a tree, use a forest!\\nTo hide a POKéMON, use a POKéMON!\\pThere is no deep, hidden meaning\\nto that.$'}
text:Route119_ChrisIntro	{'body': "You spoke to me…\\nSo you want to challenge me!\\pSure! I'll try out the POKéMON I caught\\nwhile SURFING!$"}
text:Route119_ChrisDefeat	{'body': "I don't have a clue about what it\\ntakes to win.$"}
text:Route119_ChrisPostBattle	{'body': "Go for a SURF on my POKéMON…\\pThen fish off its back…\\pIt's an indescribably luxuriant moment!$"}
text:Route119_FabianIntro	{'body': 'My rhythm is thunder, voice, and\\nwind. Every partner adds something\\lto the band.\\pTry to break the chorus!$'}
text:Route119_FabianDefeat	{'body': 'That brought the house down!$'}
text:Route119_FabianPostBattle	{'body': 'A doubles team is a band: each part can\\nsolo, but the arrangement wins.$'}
text:Route119_DaytonIntro	{'body': "Hohoho!\\nI like kid TRAINERS!\\lLet's have a good one!$"}
text:Route119_DaytonDefeat	{'body': "You're pretty amazing!\\nHohoho!$"}
text:Route119_DaytonPostBattle	{'body': "Hohoho!\\nI'll try emulating the pep of kid\\lTRAINERS like you!$"}
text:Route119_RachelIntro	{'body': 'My parasol is for more than show.\\nMy partners know how to make the\\lmost of a rainy day.\\pShall we?$'}
text:Route119_RachelDefeat	{'body': 'Oh! My forecast was wrong…$'}
text:Route119_RachelPostBattle	{'body': "A good rain team needs a plan for\\nclear skies, too. I'll remember\\lthat on my next walk.$"}
text:Route120_ColinIntro	{'body': 'Do you have any moves that can strike\\na flying POKéMON?$'}
text:Route120_ColinDefeat	{'body': 'You soared above me!$'}
text:Route120_ColinPostBattle	{'body': "The move FLY is convenient,\\ndon't you think?\\pWhile the POKéMON is flying,\\nalmost no moves can strike it.$"}
text:Route120_RobertIntro	{'body': 'My POKéMON is strong!\\nHow about yours?$'}
text:Route120_RobertDefeat	{'body': 'Your POKéMON were stronger…$'}
text:Route120_RobertPostBattle	{'body': 'A POKéMON that grows steadily is one\\nyou can count on.$'}
text:Route120_RobertRegister	{'body': "You can be counted on to get better.\\nI'd like to register you in my POKéNAV!$"}
text:Route120_RobertRematchIntro	{'body': 'A POKéMON that grows steadily is one\\nyou can count on.$'}
text:Route120_RobertRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Your POKéMON are seriously strong.$'}
text:Route120_RobertPostRematch	{'body': 'My POKéMON are growing stronger.\\nI have to grow stronger, too.$'}
text:Route120_LorenzoIntro	{'body': 'Fitness check! OGERPON sets the pace,\\nSTARMIE keeps it. Can you keep up?$'}
text:Route120_LorenzoDefeat	{'body': 'You outpaced my whole team!$'}
text:Route120_LorenzoPostBattle	{'body': "A RANGER's partners have to move all\\nday. Yours can. Good.$"}
text:Route120_JennaIntro	{'body': "SHIFTRY and SEVIPER don't wait for\\nyou to get ready. Neither do I.$"}
text:Route120_JennaDefeat	{'body': "I'm fit. You're fitter.$"}
text:Route120_JennaPostBattle	{'body': 'I run with my POKéMON every morning.\\nTry it. Speed is a habit.$'}
text:Route120_JeffreyIntro	{'body': '… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\lWant to battle?$'}
text:Route120_JeffreyDefeat	{'body': 'Lost it…$'}
text:Route120_JeffreyPostBattle	{'body': "… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\lI'll try harder…$"}
text:Route120_JeffreyRegister	{'body': '… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\lDo you have a POKéNAV…?$'}
text:Route120_JeffreyRematchIntro	{'body': '… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\lWant to battle again?$'}
text:Route120_JeffreyRematchDefeat	{'body': '… … … … … …\\nI lost again…$'}
text:Route120_JeffreyPostRematch	{'body': "… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\lI'll try harder…\\lFor my precious BUG POKéMON…$"}
text:Route120_JenniferIntro	{'body': 'An ABILITY can change a whole\\nbattle. Mine have a few surprises\\lfor you.\\pReady to discover them?$'}
text:Route120_JenniferDefeat	{'body': 'Your team surprised me!$'}
text:Route120_JenniferPostBattle	{'body': 'PRANKSTER gives many status moves\\npriority. Think about what a\\lpartner can do with that opening.$'}
text:Route120_ChipIntro	{'body': 'Who might you be?\\pAre you perhaps searching for ancient\\nruins that are rumored to possibly\\lexist according to legend?$'}
text:Route120_ChipDefeat	{'body': 'What a disgraceful setback…$'}
text:Route120_ChipPostBattle	{'body': 'That giant rock… I would like to\\nbelieve it may indeed contain ancient\\lruins. But I see no entrance.$'}
text:Route120_ClarissaIntro	{'body': 'My parasol follows the forecast.\\pCan your team do the same?$'}
text:Route120_ClarissaDefeat	{'body': 'You weathered that battle well!$'}
text:Route120_ClarissaPostBattle	{'body': "I love the rain, but I can't count\\non it forever. Even a parasol\\lneeds folding sometimes.$"}
text:Route120_AngelicaIntro	{'body': 'Me, POKéMON, and my parasol…\\pIf any one of them is missing,\\nthe picture of beauty will be ruined.$'}
text:Route120_AngelicaDefeat	{'body': "You've completely ruined my beauty…$"}
text:Route120_AngelicaPostBattle	{'body': "A parasol wouldn't suit you at all.\\pWhy, something like this would only\\nget in your way.$"}
text:Route120_KeigoIntro	{'body': 'I will adopt the movements of POKéMON\\nand create new ninja techniques.$'}
text:Route120_KeigoDefeat	{'body': 'The creation of new ninja techniques\\nis but a distant dream…$'}
text:Route120_KeigoPostBattle	{'body': 'Perhaps I ought to apprentice under\\na ninja sensei.$'}
text:Route120_RileyIntro	{'body': "We ninja conceal ourselves under our\\ncamouflage cloaks.\\lI bet you didn't know where I was!$"}
text:Route120_RileyDefeat	{'body': 'I lost!\\nI should camouflage my shame!$'}
text:Route120_RileyPostBattle	{'body': 'Our camouflage cloaks are all\\nhandmade.$'}
text:Route120_CallieIntro	{'body': "If you don't pay attention,\\nyou could get hurt!$"}
text:Route120_CallieDefeat	{'body': 'Ouch!\\nI was the one to get hurt.$'}
text:Route120_CalliePostBattle	{'body': "I wonder… Should I evolve my POKéMON?\\nThey're cute the way they are, though.$"}
text:Route120_LeonelIntro	{'body': 'The rain wakes old stories here.\\nHave you seen the masked POKéMON?$'}
text:Route120_LeonelDefeat	{'body': 'You read every change in the field!$'}
text:Route120_LeonelPostBattle	{'body': "OGERPON lives in this route's\\ngrass, with a 3% encounter chance.\\pSWEET SCENT can help draw out\\nthe local legendaries.$"}
text:Route121_VanessaIntro	{'body': 'Will you play with my delightfully\\npretty POKéMON?$'}
text:Route121_VanessaDefeat	{'body': "This isn't what I meant!$"}
text:Route121_VanessaPostBattle	{'body': "I'm going to a CONTEST in LILYCOVE.\\pMy POKéMON should have no problem\\nsweeping the MASTER CLASS.$"}
text:Route121_WalterIntro	{'body': "With my POKéMON, I have traveled\\nto the world's four corners.\\pYou might say I have some confidence\\nin my abilities.$"}
text:Route121_WalterDefeat	{'body': 'Ah, well played.$'}
text:Route121_WalterPostBattle	{'body': 'I would like to circle the globe once\\nagain with my POKéMON.$'}
text:Route121_WalterRegister	{'body': 'Your POKéMON prowess is remarkable.\\nAllow me to register you as a memento.$'}
text:Route121_WalterRematchIntro	{'body': "With my POKéMON, I have traveled\\nto the world's four corners.\\pYou might say I have some confidence\\nin my abilities.$"}
text:Route121_WalterRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Ah, well played.$'}
text:Route121_WalterPostRematch	{'body': 'Your POKéMON and you…\\pYour prowess together will be\\nconsidered strong, even overseas.$'}
text:Route121_TammyIntro	{'body': 'There are powers beyond our\\nunderstanding in the world…$'}
text:Route121_TammyDefeat	{'body': 'I have lost…$'}
text:Route121_TammyPostBattle	{'body': 'MT. PYRE…\\nThere is a mysterious power\\lat work there…$'}
text:Route121_KateIntro	{'body': "KATE: Together, we're fearless!\\nWe'll demonstrate how tough we are!$"}
text:Route121_KateDefeat	{'body': 'KATE: I blew it in front of my junior\\nstudent partner…$'}
text:Route121_KatePostBattle	{'body': "KATE: When someone's relying on me,\\nI get this urge to look cool in front\\lof them…$"}
text:Route121_KateNotEnoughMons	{'body': "KATE: If you've only got one POKéMON,\\nwe can't battle with you.\\pThat would be bullying.$"}
text:Route121_JoyIntro	{'body': "JOY: Together, we're fearless!\\nWe'll demonstrate how tough we are!$"}
text:Route121_JoyDefeat	{'body': 'JOY: Please forgive me, KATE!$'}
text:Route121_JoyPostBattle	{'body': "JOY: Ehehe, I'll have to train with KATE,\\nmy senior student partner, again.$"}
text:Route121_JoyNotEnoughMons	{'body': "JOY: You need at least two POKéMON\\nif you're going to challenge us!$"}
text:Route121_JessicaIntro	{'body': 'Stop! Have a good look at my precious\\nPOKéMON!$'}
text:Route121_JessicaDefeat	{'body': "Oh, how dare you!\\nDon't take it so seriously!$"}
text:Route121_JessicaPostBattle	{'body': "Maybe I'll go catch more POKéMON at\\nthe SAFARI.$"}
text:Route121_JessicaRegister	{'body': 'I took it easy on you!\\nStill, I learned plenty from that.$'}
text:Route121_JessicaRematchIntro	{'body': 'My precious POKéMON grew!\\nHave a good look!$'}
text:Route121_JessicaRematchDefeat	{'body': "Oh, how dare you!\\nYou still won't take it easy!$"}
text:Route121_JessicaPostRematch	{'body': "Maybe I'll go catch more POKéMON at\\nthe SAFARI.$"}
text:Route121_CristinIntro	{'body': "Five TRAINERS a day, that's my routine.\\nNINETALES sets the sun. You're five.$"}
text:Route121_CristinDefeat	{'body': "No! You're horrid!$"}
text:Route121_CristinPostBattle	{'body': "I didn't expect the fifth one to be\\nthe hard one. Next time.$"}
text:Route121_CristinRegister	{'body': "That was total humiliation!\\nI won't forget you…\\lHand over your POKéNAV!$"}
text:Route121_CristinRematchIntro	{'body': "I have this new routine.\\nDefeat ten TRAINERS a day.\\lGuess what? You're number ten!$"}
text:Route121_CristinRematchDefeat	{'body': "Wait! That's nasty!\\nI demand a rematch!$"}
text:Route121_CristinPostRematch	{'body': "An opponent I just can't beat…\\nSnivel…\\lI can't believe this is happening…$"}
text:Route121_CaleIntro	{'body': "Can't you see that I have all this\\nstuff with me?\\pDespite that, you still insist that\\nwe battle?$"}
text:Route121_CaleDefeat	{'body': "Of course I lost!\\nI'm holding stuff in both hands!$"}
text:Route121_CalePostBattle	{'body': "I bought too much stuff at\\nthe LILYCOVE DEPT. STORE.\\pIt's up the road from here.\\nI wish I had a BAG like yours.$"}
text:Route121_MylesIntro	{'body': "There's nothing I love more than\\nchecking out other people's POKéMON!$"}
text:Route121_MylesDefeat	{'body': 'Super awesome!$'}
text:Route121_MylesPostBattle	{'body': "They're great, your POKéMON!\\nHow do you raise them?$"}
text:Route121_PatIntro	{'body': "I want everybody to see the POKéMON\\nI've raised!$"}
text:Route121_PatDefeat	{'body': 'Wow!\\nSpectacular!$'}
text:Route121_PatPostBattle	{'body': "I raise every POKéMON with the same\\nlove and care--I don't pick favorites.$"}
text:Route121_MarcelIntro	{'body': 'My gang has never tasted defeat.\\nZERAORA, show them why!$'}
text:Route121_MarcelDefeat	{'body': 'Oh. Now what happened here?$'}
text:Route121_MarcelPostBattle	{'body': 'Undefeated is a nice word until the\\nfirst loss. Time to earn it again.$'}
text:Route123_WendyIntro	{'body': "SCIZOR pulls, HYDREIGON pushes.\\nWant to find out how strong you\\lare? I'm the test.$"}
text:Route123_WendyDefeat	{'body': 'Passed. With room to spare.$'}
text:Route123_WendyPostBattle	{'body': "A good test gives both TRAINERS\\nsomething to think about. You've\\lcertainly given me plenty!$"}
text:Route123_BraxtonIntro	{'body': "That's a lot of BADGES. Let's see if\\nthey survive BRAVIARY and GARCHOMP.$"}
text:Route123_BraxtonDefeat	{'body': 'Worthy. Every one of them.$'}
text:Route123_BraxtonPostBattle	{'body': 'You did those BADGES proud.\\nWherever you go next, keep that\\ldetermination.$'}
text:Route123_VioletIntro	{'body': 'They say that good times are filled\\nwith good aromas.$'}
text:Route123_VioletDefeat	{'body': 'Oh…\\nI smell the bitter scent of misery…$'}
text:Route123_VioletPostBattle	{'body': "The BERRY MASTER's garden is filled\\nwith uplifting fragrances.$"}
text:Route123_CameronIntro	{'body': "Being a psychic is about willpower.\\pI've willed myself not to lose to\\nanyone. That makes me strong!$"}
text:Route123_CameronDefeat	{'body': 'I feel sad…$'}
text:Route123_CameronPostBattle	{'body': "Being a psychic is about willpower.\\nI thought I wouldn't lose to you…$"}
text:Route123_CameronRegister	{'body': "I sense it!\\nYou and I shall stay connected!\\lI can't tell what I'll sense, though…\\pLet's see your POKéNAV.$"}
text:Route123_CameronRematchIntro	{'body': "I've convinced myself that I won't\\nlose anymore. That makes me strong!$"}
text:Route123_CameronRematchDefeat	{'body': 'I feel sad…$'}
text:Route123_CameronPostRematch	{'body': "I should train at MT. PYRE…\\nI'll never beat you this way…$"}
text:Route123_JackiIntro	{'body': "Don't be too happy if your POKéMON\\ndevelop psychic powers.\\pYou need to refine those powers to\\nmake them really useful.$"}
text:Route123_JackiDefeat	{'body': 'Overwhelmed!$'}
text:Route123_JackiPostBattle	{'body': "We all have psychic powers.\\nWe've just forgotten how to use them.$"}
text:Route123_JackiRegister	{'body': 'I would like to study your technique.\\nMay I register your contact?$'}
text:Route123_JackiRematchIntro	{'body': 'Have you awoken the psychic powers\\nwithin you?$'}
text:Route123_JackiRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Astounding!$'}
text:Route123_JackiPostRematch	{'body': 'Your power with POKéMON…\\nThat could be a psychic power, too.$'}
text:Route123_MiuIntro	{'body': "MIU: Hello, TRAINER. I hope your\\nPOKéMON won't cry when they lose.$"}
text:Route123_MiuDefeat	{'body': 'MIU: Uh-oh, we lost.$'}
text:Route123_MiuPostBattle	{'body': 'MIU: TRAINER, your POKéMON are\\nstrong because you are friends.$'}
text:Route123_MiuNotEnoughMons	{'body': "MIU: It's no fun to battle if you\\ndon't have two POKéMON.$"}
text:Route123_YukiIntro	{'body': "YUKI: Okay!\\nWe're beating the TRAINER's POKéMON!$"}
text:Route123_YukiDefeat	{'body': 'YUKI: Uh-oh, we lost.$'}
text:Route123_YukiPostBattle	{'body': "YUKI: Why are you so strong?\\nWe've never lost before.$"}
text:Route123_YukiNotEnoughMons	{'body': "YUKI: It's no fun to battle if you\\ndon't have two POKéMON.$"}
text:Route123_KindraIntro	{'body': 'MT. PYRE…\\nWhere the spirits of POKéMON sleep…\\lWill your POKéMON sleep?$'}
text:Route123_KindraDefeat	{'body': 'Overflowing with vitality…$'}
text:Route123_KindraPostBattle	{'body': 'MT. PYRE…\\nWhere the spirits of POKéMON sleep…\\pIt must overflow with a power that\\nsoothes spirits…$'}
text:Route123_FernandoIntro	{'body': "I'll turn your lights out while\\nI rip through this tune!$"}
text:Route123_FernandoDefeat	{'body': 'Hey, hold it!\\nI was still playing the intro!$'}
text:Route123_FernandoPostBattle	{'body': "You're rock steady.\\nI'd like to write a tune about you.$"}
text:Route123_FernandoRegister	{'body': 'The next time, lend your ears to\\nthe full tune, will you?$'}
text:Route123_FernandoRematchIntro	{'body': "Today's the day I'm going to do it!\\nI'll turn out your lights before\\lI finish singing my song!$"}
text:Route123_FernandoRematchDefeat	{'body': "Hey, hold it!\\nI haven't even hit the chorus!$"}
text:Route123_FernandoPostRematch	{'body': "I thought you'd be so enthralled\\nby my tune, you'd lose.$"}
text:Route123_DavisIntro	{'body': 'This is my awesome BUG POKéMON!\\nMy big brother got it for me.$'}
text:Route123_DavisDefeat	{'body': 'Waaaah!\\nYou meanie!$'}
text:Route123_DavisPostBattle	{'body': "Don't tell my brother I lost.\\nYou have to keep it a secret!$"}
text:Route123_JazmynIntro	{'body': 'ABSOL sees it coming, LUCARIO punishes\\nit. Beating someone strong is how I\\lkeep my confidence up.$'}
text:Route123_JazmynDefeat	{'body': 'There goes my confidence…$'}
text:Route123_JazmynPostBattle	{'body': "You didn't look like much. Looks lie.\\nI should know better by now.$"}
text:Route123_FrederickIntro	{'body': 'Hello, child!\\nCan you spare some time?$'}
text:Route123_FrederickDefeat	{'body': 'Ah, a mighty capable child!\\nLet me contribute to your allowance.$'}
text:Route123_FrederickPostBattle	{'body': "Contribute to your allowance?\\nWasn't the prize money enough?$"}
text:Route123_AlbertoIntro	{'body': "I have to tell you, BIRD POKéMON\\nare my obsession!\\pBirds are cool!\\nThey're the best!$"}
text:Route123_AlbertoDefeat	{'body': 'Even in defeat, BIRD POKéMON are cool!$'}
text:Route123_AlbertoPostBattle	{'body': "I gather BIRD POKéMON feathers that\\nscatter during battles.\\pI'm going to make a hat with\\nBIRD POKéMON feathers.$"}
text:Route123_EdIntro	{'body': 'When there are no TRAINERS around,\\nI let my POKéMON battle each other.\\lI watch them.$'}
text:Route123_EdDefeat	{'body': 'I kind of like your POKéMON.$'}
text:Route123_EdPostBattle	{'body': "Hehe, I'm swiping your battling ideas!\\nI think they'll make me better.$"}
text:Route123_JonasIntro	{'body': 'I lay in ambush, and a TRAINER has\\nlanded in my trap!$'}
text:Route123_JonasDefeat	{'body': "If you don't lose, how am I supposed\\nto have fun playing ninja?$"}
text:Route123_JonasPostBattle	{'body': "I'm going to ambush a weaker-looking\\nTRAINER next time.$"}
text:Route123_KayleyIntro	{'body': 'I just bought this parasol.\\nMy cuteness should be up by a third!$'}
text:Route123_KayleyDefeat	{'body': "You're better than me by about\\nfive times!$"}
text:Route123_KayleyPostBattle	{'body': 'Using accessories effectively is\\nthe secret behind fashion appeal.$'}
text:Route124_SpencerIntro	{'body': 'Hey, are you lost at sea?\\pIf you can beat my POKéMON,\\nI can serve as your pilot.$'}
text:Route124_SpencerDefeat	{'body': 'I lost my bearings in battle!$'}
text:Route124_SpencerPostBattle	{'body': "Many people lose their bearings at sea.\\pIf you're that sort, you should refer\\nto the POKéNAV's MAP.$"}
text:Route124_RolandIntro	{'body': "Hm! You're riding a POKéMON instead\\nof swimming yourself…\\pI am envious!$"}
text:Route124_RolandDefeat	{'body': "Oh!\\nI can't…$"}
text:Route124_RolandPostBattle	{'body': "I'm getting chilled…\\nI've been in the water too long…\\pI wish I could ride a POKéMON like you…$"}
text:Route124_JennyIntro	{'body': 'If you just float in the sea like\\nthis, POKéMON come around to play.$'}
text:Route124_JennyDefeat	{'body': "Oh, darn.\\nI've gone and lost.$"}
text:Route124_JennyPostBattle	{'body': 'While swimming, I noticed that some\\nPOKéMON attack, and some just watch.\\pI guess POKéMON have personalities\\nof their own.$'}
text:Route124_JennyRegister	{'body': "It's only on a whim, but maybe I'll get\\nyou to register me in your POKéNAV.$"}
text:Route124_JennyRematchIntro	{'body': 'If you just float in the sea like this,\\nTRAINERS challenge you!$'}
text:Route124_JennyRematchDefeat	{'body': "That's strange…\\nI lost again…$"}
text:Route124_JennyPostRematch	{'body': "This has nothing to do with anything,\\nbut maybe I'll visit the TRICK HOUSE.$"}
text:Route124_GraceIntro	{'body': "I'm growing bored of swimming…\\nHow about a battle?$"}
text:Route124_GraceDefeat	{'body': 'I had no idea that you were\\nthis strong!$'}
text:Route124_GracePostBattle	{'body': 'All the effort you put in must have\\nmade you this strong.$'}
text:Route124_ChadIntro	{'body': 'Fufufufu… I dive deep underwater\\nto go deep under cover.\\lPlumbing the depths is where I excel!$'}
text:Route124_ChadDefeat	{'body': "Glub, glub, glub…\\nI'm sinking…$"}
text:Route124_ChadPostBattle	{'body': "I have it on good authority that\\nthere's a DIVE spot around here.\\pIt gives me the urge to go deep\\nagain…$"}
text:Route124_LilaIntro	{'body': "LILA: Sigh…\\pHere I am in the sea, but who's with me?\\nMy little brother!\\pLet's battle so I won't have to dwell\\non that!$"}
text:Route124_LilaDefeat	{'body': "LILA: ROY! It's your fault we lost!\\nYou're in for it later!$"}
text:Route124_LilaPostBattle	{'body': "LILA: Sigh…\\pIf only it wasn't my little brother\\nnext to me, but a nice boyfriend…$"}
text:Route124_LilaNotEnoughMons	{'body': "LILA: You're planning to battle us?\\nNot unless you have two POKéMON.$"}
text:Route124_RoyIntro	{'body': "ROY: My big sister is tough at POKéMON!\\pDon't cry when you lose!$"}
text:Route124_RoyDefeat	{'body': 'ROY: Uh-oh…\\nMy big sister will chew me out…$'}
text:Route124_RoyPostBattle	{'body': "ROY: My big sister is really scary\\nwhen she gets angry.\\pThat's why she doesn't have a\\nboyfriend.$"}
text:Route124_LilaRoyRegister	{'body': 'ROY: Can we trade training tips?\\nLILA keeps working me too hard!$'}
text:Route124_RoyNotEnoughMons	{'body': 'ROY: Did you want to battle us?\\nBring two POKéMON, then.$'}
text:Route124_LilaRematchIntro	{'body': "LILA: Sigh…\\pHere I am in the sea, but who's with me?\\nMy little brother!\\pOh, hi, it's been a while. Let's battle\\nso I won't have to dwell on things!$"}
text:Route124_LilaRematchDefeat	{'body': "LILA: ROY!\\nIt's your fault we lost again!\\pWe're having a training session later!$"}
text:Route124_LilaPostRematch	{'body': "LILA: Sigh…\\pIf I had a nice boyfriend, we'd beat\\nanyone with lovely combinations…$"}
text:Route124_LilaRematchNotEnoughMons	{'body': "LILA: You're planning to battle us?\\nNot unless you have two POKéMON.$"}
text:Route124_RoyRematchIntro	{'body': "ROY: If we lose, I'll catch heck.\\nI'm going to go totally all out!$"}
text:Route124_RoyRematchDefeat	{'body': 'ROY: Uh-oh…\\nMy big sister will chew me out again.$'}
text:Route124_RoyPostRematch	{'body': "ROY: My big sister is really scary\\nwhen she gets angry.\\pShe's going to make me train really\\nhard with POKéMON later…$"}
text:Route124_RoyRematchNotEnoughMons	{'body': 'ROY: Did you want to battle us?\\nBring two POKéMON, then.$'}
text:Route124_DeclanIntro	{'body': "Here I am swimming by my lonesome\\non this wide, beautiful sea.\\pThere's no other word for it.\\nThis is pathetic!$"}
text:Route124_DeclanDefeat	{'body': "I'm feeling blue.\\nBlue as the sky…$"}
text:Route124_DeclanPostBattle	{'body': 'I should chat up lady SWIMMERS\\nand invite them on a long swim.$'}
text:Route124_IsabellaIntro	{'body': "I'm not going to lose to some\\nsurfer TRAINER.$"}
text:Route124_IsabellaDefeat	{'body': "I've only got sweat in my eyes!\\nI am not crying!$"}
text:Route124_IsabellaPostBattle	{'body': 'You can find pretty colored shards\\nof things around here.$'}
text:Route125_NolenIntro	{'body': 'I heard you approaching, so I hung\\naround for you!$'}
text:Route125_NolenDefeat	{'body': 'I surrender!$'}
text:Route125_NolenPostBattle	{'body': 'Sound travels faster in water than\\nit does through air.$'}
text:Route125_StanIntro	{'body': 'Hey, there!\\nCheck out my sweet POKéMON!$'}
text:Route125_StanDefeat	{'body': 'I floundered…$'}
text:Route125_StanPostBattle	{'body': "I was blown away by HORSEA's charm,\\nso I started swimming, too.$"}
text:Route125_TanyaIntro	{'body': "I'm tired of swimming.\\nAre you up for a battle with me?$"}
text:Route125_TanyaDefeat	{'body': "You're too much!$"}
text:Route125_TanyaPostBattle	{'body': 'Whew…\\nWhich way is it to MOSSDEEP CITY?$'}
text:Route125_SharonIntro	{'body': 'How would you like to take on the\\nWATER-type POKéMON I raised?$'}
text:Route125_SharonDefeat	{'body': 'Lost it…$'}
text:Route125_SharonPostBattle	{'body': "Your power… You're the real deal.\\nI'm amazed!$"}
text:Route125_ErnestIntro	{'body': "Ahoy! I'm a buff, tough SAILOR!\\nI've braved the world's seas!$"}
text:Route125_ErnestDefeat	{'body': "Gwrroooar!\\nI couldn't win!$"}
text:Route125_ErnestPostBattle	{'body': "The tide ebbs and flows inside the\\nSHOAL CAVE.\\pBy the way, it's about six hours from\\nhigh tide to low tide. Did you know?$"}
text:Route125_ErnestRegister	{'body': "Register me in your POKéNAV,\\nand I'll tell you something good.$"}
text:Route125_ErnestRematchIntro	{'body': "It's high time I get my payback\\nfrom you! Come on, we're battling!$"}
text:Route125_ErnestRematchDefeat	{'body': "I couldn't win!\\nI flat out couldn't win!$"}
text:Route125_ErnestRematchPostBattle	{'body': "The SHOAL CAVE…\\pThere are places you can and can't\\nget to depending on the rise and fall\\lof the tide.\\pBy the way, it's about six hours from\\nhigh tide to low tide. Don't forget!$"}
text:Route125_KimIntro	{'body': 'KIM: A funny old man lives in the\\nSHOAL CAVE. Someone told me.\\lAre you going to see him, too?$'}
text:Route125_KimDefeat	{'body': 'KIM: I thought we would win.$'}
text:Route125_KimPostBattle	{'body': "KIM: A funny old man lives in the\\nSHOAL CAVE, doesn't he?\\pLet's go see him, IRIS!$"}
text:Route125_KimNotEnoughMons	{'body': "KIM: No, no, no! You need two POKéMON,\\nor it's just no good!$"}
text:Route125_IrisIntro	{'body': "IRIS: KIM, can you tell me what we're\\nlooking for out here?$"}
text:Route125_IrisDefeat	{'body': 'IRIS: Oh, we came sort of close.$'}
text:Route125_IrisPostBattle	{'body': "IRIS: KIM, are we really going into\\nthe SHOAL CAVE?\\lWe'll get all wet.$"}
text:Route125_IrisNotEnoughMons	{'body': 'IRIS: Oh, we could never, ever do\\nanything like a 2-on-1 battle.$'}
text:Route125_PresleyIntro	{'body': 'Why would a BIRDKEEPER like me\\ncome out to the sea?$'}
text:Route125_PresleyDefeat	{'body': "Okay.\\nI'll tell you why I'm here.$"}
text:Route125_PresleyPostBattle	{'body': "I put a message in a bottle and put\\nit out to sea.\\pI'm sure that a girl SWIMMER will\\nfind it!$"}
text:Route125_AuronIntro	{'body': "Hey! Was it you dumping trash in the\\nsea? Doesn't matter. LUCARIO wants a\\lfight either way.$"}
text:Route125_AuronDefeat	{'body': 'Oh. Not you, then. Sorry.$'}
text:Route125_AuronPostBattle	{'body': "Someone's been polluting these waves.\\nIf I find them, they meet VAPOREON.$"}
text:Route126_BarryIntro	{'body': 'Swimming is a full-body workout!\\nYou will get fit!$'}
text:Route126_BarryDefeat	{'body': 'I admit it!\\nYou win!$'}
text:Route126_BarryPostBattle	{'body': 'Thanks to my daily swimming routine…\\nLook! Feast your eyes on this physique!$'}
text:Route126_DeanIntro	{'body': 'This towering white mountain of rock\\nis SOOTOPOLIS CITY.$'}
text:Route126_DeanDefeat	{'body': 'I was done in?$'}
text:Route126_DeanPostBattle	{'body': "I can't find the entrance to\\nSOOTOPOLIS. Where could it be?$"}
text:Route126_NikkiIntro	{'body': "Ufufufufu!\\nI'm a mermaid!$"}
text:Route126_NikkiDefeat	{'body': 'My fantasy burst as if it were a bubble!\\nBlub, blub, blub…$'}
text:Route126_NikkiPostBattle	{'body': 'You thrashed me… I want to\\ndisappear in a wave of despair…$'}
text:Route126_BrendaIntro	{'body': 'Hello, kiddo!\\nWant a battle with me?$'}
text:Route126_BrendaDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, noooooh!$'}
text:Route126_BrendaPostBattle	{'body': 'I love frolicking with POKéMON in\\nthe sea like this!$'}
text:Route126_PabloIntro	{'body': "Check out this sculpted body!\\nI'm more cut than a BLACK BELT!$"}
text:Route126_PabloDefeat	{'body': 'Whoops! Too strong!\\nNot bad! Not bad at all!$'}
text:Route126_PabloPostBattle	{'body': "Losing to you stimulated my senses!\\nI'll train myself and POKéMON harder!$"}
text:Route126_PabloRegister	{'body': "Yep, you're not bad at all!\\nI'd like to get to know you more!$"}
text:Route126_PabloRematchIntro	{'body': "Check out this beautiful body!\\nI'm more shapely than a SWIMMER!$"}
text:Route126_PabloRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Whoops! Really too strong!\\nNot bad! Not bad at all!$'}
text:Route126_PabloPostRematch	{'body': "I'm going to train even harder!\\nYou're a great motivator!\\lYou have to come back again!$"}
text:Route126_LeonardoIntro	{'body': "I couldn't even swim last year,\\nbut now I'm a decent SWIMMER.\\pI think I'm capable of anything now.$"}
text:Route126_LeonardoDefeat	{'body': "Sheesh, getting greedy didn't do\\na thing for me.$"}
text:Route126_LeonardoPostBattle	{'body': "If you practice at something,\\nyou will get better at it.\\pYou're young--don't be afraid to\\ntry all sorts of things!$"}
text:Route126_IsobelIntro	{'body': "If seawater gets up your nose,\\ndoesn't it feel terrible?$"}
text:Route126_IsobelDefeat	{'body': 'Ack! Why, you…\\nGlub!$'}
text:Route126_IsobelPostBattle	{'body': "Ooh, I choked on some water!\\nIt's bitter! It's salty!!$"}
text:Route126_SiennaIntro	{'body': "I'm throwing my whole heart\\ninto this!$"}
text:Route126_SiennaDefeat	{'body': 'You had more heart!$'}
text:Route126_SiennaPostBattle	{'body': "I need to cool down now…\\nI think I'll go for a dive.$"}
text:Route127_CamdenIntro	{'body': 'I can see it in your face.\\nYou want to challenge me.$'}
text:Route127_CamdenDefeat	{'body': 'Awawawawawa…$'}
text:Route127_CamdenPostBattle	{'body': 'A well-played match leaves me feeling\\nrefreshed and serene.$'}
text:Route127_DonnyIntro	{'body': 'Do you have a rival whom you just\\nhate to lose against?$'}
text:Route127_DonnyDefeat	{'body': 'Arrrgh!\\nI hate losing!$'}
text:Route127_DonnyPostBattle	{'body': "If you have a rival, don't you get the\\nfeeling that you have to keep getting\\lbetter?$"}
text:Route127_JonahIntro	{'body': 'Through fishing, I have attained a\\nstate of becalmed serenity…\\pPlease, allow me to demonstrate…$'}
text:Route127_JonahDefeat	{'body': 'Though I have lost, my heart remains\\ncalm…$'}
text:Route127_JonahPostBattle	{'body': 'It matters not that I catch nothing.\\nThe line remains in the water…$'}
text:Route127_HenryIntro	{'body': "Whoops! Don't tell me I snagged\\na SURFING POKéMON?$"}
text:Route127_HenryDefeat	{'body': "I can't keep up!$"}
text:Route127_HenryPostBattle	{'body': "It'd be a handful if I hooked\\nyour tough POKéMON!$"}
text:Route127_RogerIntro	{'body': 'Well, hey! This is a match between\\na POKéMON fan and a fishing buff!$'}
text:Route127_RogerDefeat	{'body': "No! My line's all tangled!\\nThe party's over!$"}
text:Route127_RogerPostBattle	{'body': "My fishing line's doing a dance!\\nThe tangle tango! Hahaha, snarl!$"}
text:Route127_AidanIntro	{'body': 'BIRD POKéMON have excellent vision.\\nThey spot prey from great heights.$'}
text:Route127_AidanDefeat	{'body': 'Whew… I give up.$'}
text:Route127_AidanPostBattle	{'body': "There're lots of diving spots in\\nthe sea around here.\\pYou can spot them easily from the sky\\nbecause of their darker color.$"}
text:Route127_KojiIntro	{'body': 'Run in your bare feet.\\nThat will toughen up your soles!$'}
text:Route127_KojiDefeat	{'body': 'Yowch!\\nI got a pebble under a toenail!$'}
text:Route127_KojiPostBattle	{'body': 'Going barefoot feels great.\\nBut your RUNNING SHOES are cool, too.$'}
text:Route127_KojiRegister	{'body': "This is what I do to people who beat me!\\nI'll send you my barefoot training tips.$"}
text:Route127_KojiRematchIntro	{'body': 'I still run in my bare feet daily.\\nMy soles are tough!$'}
text:Route127_KojiRematchDefeat	{'body': 'Yowch!\\nPebbles dug into my arches!$'}
text:Route127_KojiPostRematch	{'body': 'Want to go barefoot for a while?\\nSo I can try your RUNNING SHOES?$'}
text:Route127_AthenaIntro	{'body': 'Slow and methodical. Then PHEROMOSA\\nmakes it fast. Shall we?$'}
text:Route127_AthenaDefeat	{'body': 'You got the better of me!$'}
text:Route127_AthenaPostBattle	{'body': "Out here, time slows down. Battles\\ndon't. I keep forgetting that.$"}
text:Route128_IsaiahIntro	{'body': 'EVER GRANDE CITY is still a long ways\\naway…$'}
text:Route128_IsaiahDefeat	{'body': 'My first victory seems to be far\\naway, too…$'}
text:Route128_IsaiahPostBattle	{'body': 'My whole life has been about losing,\\nbut I will never give up!$'}
text:Route128_IsaiahRegister	{'body': "I know I'm not good now, but I\\nthink I can win eventually.\\pPlease register me and track my\\nprogress.$"}
text:Route128_IsaiahRematchIntro	{'body': "I'm still feeling good. I'll keep on\\nswimming to EVER GRANDE CITY.$"}
text:Route128_IsaiahRematchDefeat	{'body': "I've yet to taste my first victory…$"}
text:Route128_IsaiahPostRematch	{'body': "I'll eventually reach EVER GRANDE CITY\\nwhere I can eventually win…$"}
text:Route128_KatelynIntro	{'body': "You have to swim, cycle, and then run\\na marathon in a triathlon.\\pIt's a grueling race that consists\\nof three events.$"}
text:Route128_KatelynDefeat	{'body': 'A POKéMON battle is grueling, too…$'}
text:Route128_KatelynPostBattle	{'body': "I have to ride a BIKE next, but…\\nI'm about to throw in the towel…$"}
text:Route128_KatelynRegister	{'body': "Well, I may as well make the best\\nof this. Let's exchange training notes.$"}
text:Route128_KatelynRematchIntro	{'body': 'A triathlon is long. But I guess the\\nroad to become the POKéMON CHAMPION\\lis also a long and grueling one.$'}
text:Route128_KatelynRematchDefeat	{'body': 'A POKéMON battle really is harsh\\nand unforgiving…$'}
text:Route128_KatelynPostRematch	{'body': 'You should give serious thought to\\nchallenges on VICTORY ROAD.$'}
text:Route128_AlexaIntro	{'body': "We've trained for the LEAGUE for a year.\\nFERALIGATR, SCIZOR… we can't lose now!$"}
text:Route128_AlexaDefeat	{'body': 'Oh! How could this happen?!$'}
text:Route128_AlexaPostBattle	{'body': "One setback. I've had a hundred. The\\nLEAGUE is still where I'm going.$"}
text:Route128_RubenIntro	{'body': 'There is no stronger TRAINER than me.\\nDRAGONITE agrees. So does HEATMOR.$'}
text:Route128_RubenDefeat	{'body': "This can't be!$"}
text:Route128_RubenPostBattle	{'body': 'Correction. There is probably no\\nstronger TRAINER than you. Probably.$'}
text:Route128_WayneIntro	{'body': 'I want to visit EVER GRANDE, so I\\nbrought a partner that can use\\lWATERFALL to crest the falls.$'}
text:Route128_WayneDefeat	{'body': "I'm crestfallen!$"}
text:Route128_WaynePostBattle	{'body': 'Awww, phooey! My partner can use\\nWATERFALL, but I still need the\\lSOOTOPOLIS GYM BADGE!$'}
text:Route128_HarrisonIntro	{'body': "You're looking awfully tough.\\nI wonder if I can win?$"}
text:Route128_HarrisonDefeat	{'body': 'Ouch!\\nI guess it was impossible to win.$'}
text:Route128_HarrisonPostBattle	{'body': 'There are tough TRAINERS galore\\naround EVER GRANDE.\\pDo you think I may be out\\nof my league?$'}
text:Route128_CarleeIntro	{'body': 'Open water, no shelter…\\nI hope you came prepared!$'}
text:Route128_CarleeDefeat	{'body': 'I should have prepared for you!$'}
text:Route128_CarleePostBattle	{'body': 'Sun or rain, I watch the weather.\\nIt can change quickly out here.$'}
text:Route129_ChaseIntro	{'body': "This is my first triathlon.\\nI'm all tense and nervous!$"}
text:Route129_ChaseDefeat	{'body': 'Wroooaaar!\\nI failed to win!$'}
text:Route129_ChasePostBattle	{'body': "If I'm all tensed up, I won't be able to\\ngive it my all.$"}
text:Route129_AllisonIntro	{'body': "I'm in the middle of a triathlon,\\nbut, sure, why don't we battle?$"}
text:Route129_AllisonDefeat	{'body': "I was sure I'd win!$"}
text:Route129_AllisonPostBattle	{'body': "Do you know what's the greatest thing\\nabout triathlons?\\pTesting the limits of your own\\nstrength and endurance against\\lMother Nature!$"}
text:Route129_ReedIntro	{'body': "Say hey, hey!\\nLet's get on with it!$"}
text:Route129_ReedDefeat	{'body': "Beat, I'm beaten.\\nThat's it, done!$"}
text:Route129_ReedPostBattle	{'body': "There's nothing for a loser.\\nTime for me to beat it home.$"}
text:Route129_TishaIntro	{'body': "What's the hurry?\\nLet's take it slow and easy.$"}
text:Route129_TishaDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, my.\\nI wanted to relax a little more…$'}
text:Route129_TishaPostBattle	{'body': "Don't you hate making mistakes when\\nyou're in a rush?\\pThat's why I try to take things\\nslowly.$"}
text:Route129_ClarenceIntro	{'body': "Surfing isn't as easy as it seems,\\nisn't that right?$"}
text:Route129_ClarenceDefeat	{'body': "Winning sure isn't easy.$"}
text:Route129_ClarencePostBattle	{'body': 'You have your sights on the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE? Keep at it!$'}
text:Route130_RodneyIntro	{'body': "What a surprise! I didn't expect to\\nsee a TRAINER out in the sea.\\pI think we should battle!$"}
text:Route130_RodneyDefeat	{'body': "This kid's awfully tough…$"}
text:Route130_RodneyPostBattle	{'body': "Your eyes have that look of someone\\nwho's experienced harsh challenges\\land won. It suits you well!$"}
text:Route130_KatieIntro	{'body': 'In the deep blue sea,\\nmy shattered blue heart finds\\lcomfort among waves.$'}
text:Route130_KatieDefeat	{'body': 'Like the vast blue sea,\\nthe world of POKéMON spans\\ldepths beyond belief.$'}
text:Route130_KatiePostBattle	{'body': "The world's children dream\\nof one day becoming\\lthe POKéMON CHAMPION.$"}
text:Route130_SantiagoIntro	{'body': "Floating on the open sea like this…\\nIt's peaceful.$"}
text:Route130_SantiagoDefeat	{'body': 'I needed to be a little less peaceful!$'}
text:Route130_SantiagoPostBattle	{'body': "Swimming and battling like this…\\nI'm one happy guy…$"}
text:Route131_RichardIntro	{'body': "The sea is teeming with POKéMON.\\nIt's not easy swimming, I tell you.$"}
text:Route131_RichardDefeat	{'body': 'POKéMON raised by TRAINERS are\\nseriously tough…$'}
text:Route131_RichardPostBattle	{'body': "Gasp… Gasp…\\nI'm wiped out…\\pThe going's easy. It's the leaving\\nthat's the hard part.\\pWill I have any energy left to make\\nthe return trip?$"}
text:Route131_HermanIntro	{'body': "The sea… The sea… The sea…\\nThe sea as far as these eyes can see!\\lI'm sick and tired of the sea!$"}
text:Route131_HermanDefeat	{'body': 'Bleah!$'}
text:Route131_HermanPostBattle	{'body': "Bored I am by the sea, but swim I must.\\pI'm a born swimmer!\\nThat's what I am.$"}
text:Route131_SusieIntro	{'body': 'Hi, sweetie, wait!\\nWe should battle, you and I!$'}
text:Route131_SusieDefeat	{'body': "You're tough in spite of the way\\nyou look!$"}
text:Route131_SusiePostBattle	{'body': "Did you see a guy over there who whines\\nthat he's bored of the sea?\\pThat's all talk.\\nHe's hopelessly in love with the sea!$"}
text:Route131_KaraIntro	{'body': 'Why do men love bathing suits so much?\\pThey all ogle me!$'}
text:Route131_KaraDefeat	{'body': "I'm out of my depth!$"}
text:Route131_KaraPostBattle	{'body': "Maybe it's not my bathing suit that\\nmakes men look. It must be my beauty!$"}
text:Route131_ReliIntro	{'body': "RELI: We'll work together as siblings\\nto take you on!$"}
text:Route131_ReliDefeat	{'body': "RELI: We couldn't win even though we\\nworked together…$"}
text:Route131_ReliPostBattle	{'body': 'RELI: The people of PACIFIDLOG are\\ntogether with the sea and POKéMON from\\lthe time they are born.$'}
text:Route131_ReliNotEnoughMons	{'body': "RELI: You don't have two POKéMON?\\nWe can't enjoy a battle, then.$"}
text:Route131_IanIntro	{'body': "IAN: I'm doing my best together with\\nmy sis!$"}
text:Route131_IanDefeat	{'body': "IAN: I did my best with my sis,\\nbut we still couldn't win…$"}
text:Route131_IanPostBattle	{'body': "IAN: You know how PACIFIDLOG is\\na floating town?\\pSo, wherever there is the sea,\\nthat's a part of PACIFIDLOG!$"}
text:Route131_IanNotEnoughMons	{'body': "IAN: If you have two POKéMON,\\nwe'll take you on!$"}
text:Route131_TaliaIntro	{'body': "If you can beat me, I'll give you some\\ngreat information!$"}
text:Route131_TaliaDefeat	{'body': 'Oh?\\nDid I lose?$'}
text:Route131_TaliaPostBattle	{'body': "There is an odd place nearby.\\nThere's a huge tower there.\\lWhy don't you go take a look?$"}
text:Route131_KevinIntro	{'body': 'The people of PACIFIDLOG are\\na peaceful bunch.\\pThey never get angry.\\nThat goes for me, too.$'}
text:Route131_KevinDefeat	{'body': 'Oops!$'}
text:Route131_KevinPostBattle	{'body': "Tch! …Oh, wait.\\nI'm not angry. Honestly!\\pBut, boy, you're strong!\\nHahaha!$"}
text:Route132_GilbertIntro	{'body': 'I used to catch colds all the time as\\na kid, but I became totally fit after\\lI started swimming.$'}
text:Route132_GilbertDefeat	{'body': 'I crave more power…$'}
text:Route132_GilbertPostBattle	{'body': 'TRAINERS travel the fields and\\nmountains, so they must be fit, too.$'}
text:Route132_DanaIntro	{'body': 'I try not to swim where the currents\\nare too strong.$'}
text:Route132_DanaDefeat	{'body': 'Oh, please, no!$'}
text:Route132_DanaPostBattle	{'body': "If I get swept away, I'll lose all my\\nsense of place…$"}
text:Route132_RonaldIntro	{'body': "Win or lose, you'll never know until\\nyou try!$"}
text:Route132_RonaldDefeat	{'body': 'Waah!\\nI sank in defeat!$'}
text:Route132_RonaldPostBattle	{'body': "I never battle when I know I'll win.\\nI like to battle at the razor's edge of\\lvictory and defeat!$"}
text:Route132_KiyoIntro	{'body': 'I contemplate POKéMON 24 hours a day.\\nHow could you possibly beat me?$'}
text:Route132_KiyoDefeat	{'body': 'I lose.\\nI will concede defeat.$'}
text:Route132_KiyoPostBattle	{'body': "Urggh…\\nYou're a POKéMON fanatic, aren't you?\\pYou must contemplate POKéMON 24 hours\\na day, don't you?$"}
text:Route132_MakaylaIntro	{'body': "I'm usually with my husband, but my\\nAMOONGUSS and I win fine without him.$"}
text:Route132_MakaylaDefeat	{'body': 'Oh. I guess not this time.$'}
text:Route132_MakaylaPostBattle	{'body': "That young man looks just like my\\nhusband did. Don't tell him I said so.$"}
text:Route132_JonathanIntro	{'body': "Someone's been watching me. Was it you?\\nRAMPARDOS doesn't like being watched.$"}
text:Route132_JonathanDefeat	{'body': "Wow! You're strong, all right!$"}
text:Route132_JonathanPostBattle	{'body': "I still feel eyes on me. It's\\nprobably the SABLEYE. I keep\\lforgetting it's mine.$"}
text:Route132_PaxtonIntro	{'body': "My wife's wandered off again. Fine.\\nBRELOOM and I can win on our own.$"}
text:Route132_PaxtonDefeat	{'body': "I see. Couldn't manage it alone.$"}
text:Route132_PaxtonPostBattle	{'body': "She'll be looking for me. Her BEARTIC\\nwould have handled you, you know.$"}
text:Route132_DarcyIntro	{'body': "I liked training here alone. Now it's\\ncrowded. PORYGON-Z, clear the beach!$"}
text:Route132_DarcyDefeat	{'body': "Okay. I'll stop complaining.$"}
text:Route132_DarcyPostBattle	{'body': "Maybe I'll team up with that old man\\nand challenge the couple. Doubles.$"}
text:Route133_FranklinIntro	{'body': "Did the currents carry you here, too?\\nThis must have been fated.\\lLet's battle!$"}
text:Route133_FranklinDefeat	{'body': 'Strong!\\nToo much so!$'}
text:Route133_FranklinPostBattle	{'body': "It's just my luck that a tough TRAINER\\nlike you would drift here…\\lI must be cursed…$"}
text:Route133_DebraIntro	{'body': "I've led a life of woe and misery…\\nI've been cast away, and this is where\\lI've drifted…$"}
text:Route133_DebraDefeat	{'body': 'Another loss…$'}
text:Route133_DebraPostBattle	{'body': "A life adrift…\\nI don't want it anymore!$"}
text:Route133_LindaIntro	{'body': "Welcome!\\nI've been expecting you!$"}
text:Route133_LindaDefeat	{'body': 'No! Please!$'}
text:Route133_LindaPostBattle	{'body': "A strong child TRAINER…\\nThat's so annoying!$"}
text:Route133_WarrenIntro	{'body': 'I like finding my own way to win.\\nMUSHARNA and TORTERRA help me do\\ljust that!$'}
text:Route133_WarrenDefeat	{'body': 'Darn it! My way is still too slack!$'}
text:Route133_WarrenPostBattle	{'body': 'Doing it my own way is more fun than\\ncopying. Even when I lose.$'}
text:Route133_BeckIntro	{'body': 'I came all the way out here with my\\nBIRD POKéMON.$'}
text:Route133_BeckDefeat	{'body': "You…\\nYou're stunningly cool!$"}
text:Route133_BeckPostBattle	{'body': "I'd like to go back to FORTREE,\\nbut I've grown to like this place, too.$"}
text:Route133_MollieIntro	{'body': "I've battled thousands of times.\\nGENGAR remembers every one of\\lthem.$"}
text:Route133_MollieDefeat	{'body': 'Thousands of losses, and this one\\nstill stings.$'}
text:Route133_MolliePostBattle	{'body': 'Keep at it, youngster. Get old doing\\nthis, like my husband and me.$'}
text:Route133_ConorIntro	{'body': "Young people drift. No direction.\\nFERROTHORN and I don't drift.$"}
text:Route133_ConorDefeat	{'body': 'You have a firm sense of purpose.$'}
text:Route133_ConorPostBattle	{'body': "Don't let anyone steer you. Not even\\nan old man who just lost to you.$"}
text:Route134_JackIntro	{'body': 'Even those POKéMON that can swim are\\ncarried along by the rapid currents.$'}
text:Route134_JackDefeat	{'body': 'Aiyeeeeh!$'}
text:Route134_JackPostBattle	{'body': 'I think POKéMON enjoy the fast-running\\ncurrents around these parts.$'}
text:Route134_LaurelIntro	{'body': 'My LUVDISC are looking for a fun\\nmatch. Will you join us?$'}
text:Route134_LaurelDefeat	{'body': 'Oopsie!$'}
text:Route134_LaurelPostBattle	{'body': "There's a collector who's after\\nthe SCALES of LUVDISC.$"}
text:Route134_AlexIntro	{'body': "Okeydokey! That's enough rest, gang!\\nIt's time for a match!$"}
text:Route134_AlexDefeat	{'body': 'Tuckered out again…$'}
text:Route134_AlexPostBattle	{'body': 'My whole team gets tired quickly after\\na long journey…$'}
text:Route134_HitoshiIntro	{'body': "You're a POKéMON TRAINER.\\nNo need for words. We battle now.$"}
text:Route134_HitoshiDefeat	{'body': '… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …$'}
text:Route134_HitoshiPostBattle	{'body': 'It was I who challenged you, and yet\\nI lost. I am deeply shamed…$'}
text:Route134_AaronIntro	{'body': "The tide here is savage. It's made my\\nDragons savage too. TYRANTRUM!$"}
text:Route134_AaronDefeat	{'body': 'I concede. Willingly, even.$'}
text:Route134_AaronPostBattle	{'body': 'We train at METEOR FALLS next. Come\\nalong if you want to be toughened.$'}
text:Route134_KelvinIntro	{'body': 'O-our boat!\\nThe tide carried it away!$'}
text:Route134_KelvinDefeat	{'body': 'Awawawawah!\\nPlease, stop! Please!$'}
text:Route134_KelvinPostBattle	{'body': "If we can't SURF, how are we supposed\\nto get home?\\pActually, I know a fainted POKéMON\\ncan still SURF, but it feels wrong.$"}
text:Route134_MarleyIntro	{'body': "Fast or slow, every partner needs\\nits moment. Mine won't let an\\lopening go to waste!$"}
text:Route134_MarleyDefeat	{'body': 'Oh! Thoroughly beaten!$'}
text:Route134_MarleyPostBattle	{'body': 'A slow partner can still hit hard.\\nThe trick is getting it safely\\linto position.$'}
text:Route134_ReynaIntro	{'body': "My POKéMON can't be taken down\\neasily!$"}
text:Route134_ReynaDefeat	{'body': "You're kidding!\\nExplain how I lost!$"}
text:Route134_ReynaPostBattle	{'body': "Haha!\\nYou won, all right!\\pI'll work my way back up by taking on\\nTRAINERS I happen to meet!$"}
text:Route134_HudsonIntro	{'body': 'Listen, have you seen another SAILOR\\naround here?$'}
text:Route134_HudsonDefeat	{'body': "Now, that's something!$"}
text:Route134_HudsonPostBattle	{'body': "Our boat drifted out to sea.\\pMy buddy's a timid fellow, so I'm\\nworried about him.$"}
text:VSSeeker_BatteryNotChargedNeedXSteps	{'body': "The battery isn't charged enough.\\pNo. of steps required to fully\\ncharge the battery: {STR_VAR_1}{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"}
text:VSSeeker_NoTrainersWithinRange	{'body': 'There are no Trainers within range\\nwho can battle…\\pThe VS Seeker was turned off.{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$'}
text:VSSeeker_TrainersNotReady	{'body': "The other Trainers don't appear\\nto be ready for battle.\\pLet's wait till later.{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingAreYouCurious	{'body': 'PROF. BIRCH: Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pAre you curious about how your\\nPOKéDEX is coming along?$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingCancel	{'body': 'Another time, then! I always enjoy\\nhearing about your discoveries.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingSoYouveSeenAndCaught	{'body': "Hmhm…\\pSo, you've seen {STR_VAR_1} POKéMON,\\nand you've caught {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON…$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan10	{'body': 'Go into grassy areas more and look\\nfor POKéMON more carefully.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan20	{'body': "I guess you're getting the hang\\nof it. But, it gets harder from here.$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan30	{'body': 'Some POKéMON only appear in\\ncertain areas.\\lYou must be persistent.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan40	{'body': 'Well, it could use more quantity,\\nbut this is looking more like\\la POKéDEX now.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan50	{'body': 'This is coming along pretty good.\\nKeep up the effort.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan60	{'body': 'Are you using any RODS?\\nThere are many POKéMON in the sea.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan70	{'body': 'Instead of just catching POKéMON,\\nhow about making them evolve, too?$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan80	{'body': "This is going to be a fantastic\\nPOKéDEX.\\lThat's the feeling I'm getting.$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan90	{'body': "You've collected this many…\\nYour talent is remarkable!$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan100	{'body': 'Have you visited the SAFARI ZONE?\\pI hear there are some POKéMON that\\ncan only be caught there.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan110	{'body': 'Your field notes are really taking\\nshape. This is an impressive\\lPOKéDEX!$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan120	{'body': 'There might be POKéMON that can be\\nfound using ROCK SMASH.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan130	{'body': 'Try returning to familiar places\\nwith a new ROD or a field skill.\\lYou may meet different POKéMON!$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan140	{'body': "I've heard of POKéMON that evolve\\nwhen they come to fully love their\\lTRAINERS.$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan150	{'body': 'I had no idea that there were so\\nmany POKéMON species in the HOENN\\lregion.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan160	{'body': "On occasion, some POKéMON appear\\nin large numbers like outbreaks.\\pDon't miss opportunities like\\nthose.$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan170	{'body': 'One can get a very good idea about\\nthe POKéMON of the HOENN region\\lby looking through your POKéDEX.$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan180	{'body': 'I would say you already qualify as\\na POKéMON PROFESSOR, and a good\\lone, too!$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan190	{'body': "With a POKéDEX this complete,\\nyou're a real professional at this!$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingLessThan200	{'body': "You're very close to completing\\nthis POKéDEX.\\lI can feel it in my bones!$"}
text:gBirchDexRatingDexCompleted	{'body': 'Congratulations! Your HOENN\\nPOKéDEX is complete!$'}
text:gBirchDexRatingOnANationwideBasis	{'body': "Hmhm…\\nOn a nationwide basis…\\pYou've seen {STR_VAR_1} POKéMON,\\nand you've caught {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON…$"}
text:PokedexRating_HowIsPokedexComingAlong	{'body': 'OAK: Good to see you!\\nHow is your POKéDEX coming along?\\pHere, let me take a look.$'}
text:PokedexRating_SeenXOwnedY	{'body': "The amount of progress you've made\\non your POKéDEX is:\\p{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.\\p{FONT_NORMAL}PROF. OAK's rating:$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan10	{'body': 'You still have lots to do.\\pGo into every patch of grass you\\nsee and look for POKéMON!$'}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan20	{'body': "It looks as if you're getting on\\nthe right track!\\pI've given one of my AIDES a FLASH\\nHM. Make sure you go get it!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan30	{'body': 'Your POKéDEX could use a bit more\\nvolume still!\\pTry to catch other species of\\nPOKéMON!$'}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan40	{'body': "Good, it's apparent that you're\\ntrying hard!\\pI've given one of my AIDES an\\nITEMFINDER. Be sure to collect it!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan50	{'body': "Your POKéDEX is coming along quite\\nwell!\\pI've given one of my AIDES an\\nAMULET COIN. Be sure to get it!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan60	{'body': "Ah, you've finally topped 50\\nspecies!\\pI've given one of my AIDES an EXP.\\nSHARE. Be sure to go get it!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan70	{'body': 'Hoho! This is turning into quite the\\nrespectable POKéDEX!$'}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan80	{'body': "Very good!\\pI think you'll collect even more\\nPOKéMON by going fishing!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan90	{'body': "Wonderful! Let me guess… You\\nlike to collect things, don't you?$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan100	{'body': "I'm impressed!\\nIt must have been difficult to do!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan110	{'body': "You've finally hit 100 species!\\nI can't believe how good you are!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan120	{'body': 'You even have the evolved forms\\nof POKéMON! Super!$'}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan130	{'body': 'Excellent! Trade with friends to\\nget some more!$'}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan140	{'body': "Outstanding!\\nYou've become a real pro at this!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LessThan150	{'body': "I have nothing left to say!\\nYou're the POKéMON PROFESSOR now!$"}
text:PokedexRating_Complete	{'body': 'Your POKéDEX is entirely complete!\\nCongratulations!!$'}
text:PokedexRating_NationalDexSeenXOwnedY	{'body': 'And your NATIONAL POKéDEX is:\\p{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.$'}
text:PokedexRating_LookForwardToFilledNationalDex	{'body': "I'll be looking forward to seeing\\nyou fill the NATIONAL POKéDEX!$"}
text:PokedexRating_YouveCompletedDex	{'body': "Finally…\\pYou've finally completed the\\nPOKéDEX!\\pIt's magnificent!\\nTruly, this is a fantastic feat!$"}
text:PokedexRating_Wroooaaarrr	{'body': 'Wroooooooaaaaaarrrr!$'}
text:PokedexRating_ThankYouMadeDreamReality	{'body': "Thank you, {PLAYER}!\\nSincerely, thank you!\\lYou've made my dream a reality!$"}
text:PokedexRating_LoveSeeingYourPokedex	{'body': "OAK: Ah, welcome!\\pTell me, how is your POKéDEX\\ncoming along?\\pWahaha!\\pActually, I know how it is, but I\\nlove seeing it anyway!\\pLet's see…$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_LotteryCornerDrawTicket	{'body': "This is the POKéMON LOTTERY CORNER.\\pAll shoppers at our DEPARTMENT STORE\\nget to draw a POKéMON LOTO TICKET.\\pIf the LOTO TICKET's number matches\\nthe ID number of any of your POKéMON,\\lyou will receive a fabulous gift.\\pWould you like to draw a POKéMON\\nLOTO TICKET?$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_ComeBackTomorrow	{'body': 'Please come back tomorrow.$'}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_PleaseVisitAgain	{'body': 'Please do visit again.$'}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_PleasePickTicket	{'body': 'Please pick a LOTO TICKET.\\n…{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}…{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}…{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}{PAUSE 15}$'}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_TicketNumberIsXPleaseWait	{'body': "The LOTO TICKET number is {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI need to run a check on this number\\nto see if it matches any of your\\lPOKéMON's ID numbers. Please wait.$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_TicketMatchesPartyMon	{'body': "Congratulations!\\pThe ID number of your team's\\n{STR_VAR_1} matches your\\lLOTO TICKET's number!$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_TicketMatchesPCMon	{'body': "Congratulations!\\pThe ID number of your PC-boxed\\n{STR_VAR_1} matches your\\lLOTO TICKET's number!$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_NoNumbersMatched	{'body': "I'm sorry.\\nNone of the numbers matched.$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_TwoDigitsMatched	{'body': "Two digits matched, so you win the\\nthird prize!\\lYou've won the {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_ThreeDigitsMatched	{'body': "Three digits matched, so you win the\\nsecond prize!\\lYou've won the {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_FourDigitsMatched	{'body': "Four digits matched, so you win the\\nfirst prize!\\lYou've won the {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_AllFiveDigitsMatched	{'body': "Oh, my goodness, all five digits\\nmatched!\\pYou've won the jackpot prize!\\nYou've won the {STR_VAR_1}!$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_NoRoomForThis	{'body': 'Oh?\\nYou seem to have no room for this.\\pPlease make room in your BAG and\\nlet me know.$'}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_PrizeWeveBeenHolding	{'body': "{PLAYER}?\\nYes, I've been expecting you.\\pThis is the prize we've been holding\\nfor you.$"}
text:LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_1F_PleaseVisitAgain2	{'body': 'Please do visit again.$'}
text:EventTicket_ShowOldSeaMap	{'body': 'The ferry to SLATEPORT is…\\pI beg your pardon?\\nCan we sail to this place on the map?\\pI know someone who will help you better.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:EventTicket_ThatPass	{'body': 'The ferry to SLATEPORT is…\\pOh?\\nThat PASS…$'}
text:EventTicket_ShowEonTicket	{'body': "Aye, mate, are you the one who brought\\nthat mighty odd PASS?\\pI'll tell you, you're trying to reach a\\ntiny spit of an island far in the south.\\pThere's no telling what we'll encounter\\nonce we reach there, aye.\\lThat shivers my timbers!\\pAll aboard!$"}
text:EventTicket_SouthernIslandSailBack	{'body': 'Aye, mate, this island has a quiet\\nall its own.\\pReady to sail back to LILYCOVE?$'}
text:EventTicket_SailHome	{'body': 'Aye, right, then!\\nSail home we will!$'}
text:EventTicket_AsYouLike	{'body': 'Aye, right, as you like, then.$'}
text:SouthernIsland_Interior_Sign	{'body': '“All dreams are but another reality.\\nNever forget…”$'}
text:SouthernIsland_Exterior_Sign	{'body': '“Those whose memories fade seek to\\ncarve them in their hearts…”$'}
text:Underwater_SealedChamber_Braille_GoUpHere	{'directives': ('brailleformat 4, 6, 26, 13, 7, 9', '.braille "GO UP HERE.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_ABC	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 6, 21, 13, 10, 9', '.braille "ABC$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_GHI	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 6, 21, 13, 10, 9', '.braille "GHI$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_MNO	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 6, 21, 13, 10, 9', '.braille "MNO$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_TUV	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 6, 21, 13, 10, 9', '.braille "TUV$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_DEF	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 6, 21, 13, 10, 9', '.braille "DEF$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_JKL	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 6, 21, 13, 10, 9', '.braille "JKL$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_PQRS	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 6, 21, 13, 10, 9', '.braille "PQRS$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_Period	{'directives': ('brailleformat 9, 6, 19, 13, 12, 9', '.braille ".$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_WXYZ	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 6, 21, 13, 10, 9', '.braille "WXYZ$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_Comma	{'directives': ('brailleformat 9, 6, 19, 13, 12, 9', '.braille ",$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_OuterRoom_Braille_DigHere	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 4, 23, 15, 10, 7', '.braille "DIG HERE.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_InnerRoom_Braille_FirstWailordLastRelicanth	{'directives': ('brailleformat 0, 0, 29, 19, 3, 3', '.braille "FIRST COMES\\n"', '.braille "WAILORD.\\n"', '.braille "LAST COMES\\n"', '.braille "RELICANTH.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_InnerRoom_Braille_InThisCaveWeHaveLived	{'directives': ('brailleformat 2, 0, 26, 19, 5, 3', '.braille "IN THIS\\n"', '.braille "CAVE WE\\n"', '.braille "HAVE\\n"', '.braille "LIVED.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_InnerRoom_Braille_WeOweAllToThePokemon	{'directives': ('brailleformat 7, 2, 23, 17, 10, 5', '.braille "WE OWE ALL\\n"', '.braille "TO THE\\n"', '.braille "POKEMON.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_InnerRoom_Braille_ButWeSealedThePokemonAway	{'directives': ('brailleformat 3, 0, 25, 19, 6, 3', '.braille "BUT, WE\\n"', '.braille "SEALED THE\\n"', '.braille "POKEMON\\n"', '.braille "AWAY.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_InnerRoom_Braille_WeFearedIt	{'directives': ('brailleformat 5, 6, 25, 13, 8, 9', '.braille "WE FEARED IT.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_InnerRoom_Braille_ThoseWithCourageHope	{'directives': ('brailleformat 6, 0, 24, 19, 9, 3', '.braille "THOSE WITH\\n"', '.braille "COURAGE,\\n"', '.braille "THOSE WITH\\n"', '.braille "HOPE.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_InnerRoom_Braille_OpenDoorEternalPokemonWaits	{'directives': ('brailleformat 3, 2, 27, 17, 6, 5', '.braille "OPEN A DOOR.\\n"', '.braille "AN ETERNAL\\n"', '.braille "POKEMON\\n"', '.braille "WAITS.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:DesertRuins_Braille_UseRockSmash	{'directives': ('brailleformat 1, 0, 27, 19, 4, 3', '.braille "LEFT, LEFT,\\n"', '.braille "DOWN, DOWN.\\n"', '.braille "PRESS A\\n"', '.braille "TO USE\\n"', '.braille "ROCK SMASH.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:IslandCave_Braille_RunLapAroundWall	{'directives': ('brailleformat 5, 0, 25, 19, 8, 3', '.braille "STAY CLOSE\\n"', '.braille "TO THE WALL.\\n"', '.braille "RUN AROUND\\n"', '.braille "ONE LAP.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:AncientTomb_Braille_ShineInTheMiddle	{'directives': ('brailleformat 3, 0, 25, 19, 6, 3', '.braille "THOSE WHO\\n"', '.braille "INHERIT OUR\\n"', '.braille "WILL, SHINE\\n"', '.braille "IN THE MIDDLE.\\n"', '.braille "PRESS A\\n"', '.braille "FOR FLASH.$"'), 'body': ''}
text:SealedChamber_InnerRoom_Braille_Regigigas	{'directives': ('brailleformat 3, 0, 25, 19, 6, 3', '.braille "BODIES OF\\n"', '.braille "ROCK, ICE,\\n"', '.braille "AND STEEL.\\n"', '.braille "BRING THREE.\\n"', '.braille "THE KING\\n"', '.braille "SHALL AWAKEN.$"'), 'body': ''}
