text:MatchCall_BattleFrontierRecordStreakText5	{'body': "Hiya, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nIt's {STR_VAR_1}.\\pYou were at the {STR_VAR_2}\\nand won {STR_VAR_3} battles in a row?\\lIsn't that something!\\pMe? I'd say I'm coming along.\\nSee you soon!$"}
