text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText1	{'body': "Hi! {PLAYER}?\\nHello, this is {STR_VAR_1}!\\lI heard the news!\\pYou became the champion at\\nthe {STR_VAR_2} {STR_VAR_3} times?\\pIt's awesome! I have to do better!\\nSee you!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText2	{'body': "Hello, it's {STR_VAR_1}!\\nI heard about you!\\pThey said you won {STR_VAR_3} titles\\nat the {STR_VAR_2}.\\pThat's super! I wonder if I can\\nbecome a champion?$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText3	{'body': "Hey there, {PLAYER}!\\nIt's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\\lHow's it going?\\pI heard you won events {STR_VAR_3} times\\nat the {STR_VAR_2}!\\pMake it one more next time!\\nCatch you soon!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText4	{'body': "Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\n{STR_VAR_1} here.\\pI heard you became the champion\\nat the {STR_VAR_2} {STR_VAR_3} times.\\pSounds like you're working hard.\\nI'll try to keep up!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText5	{'body': "Hiya, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nIt's {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI heard you won {STR_VAR_3} times\\noutright at the {STR_VAR_2}.\\pI'd better get with it, too!\\nSee you soon!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText6	{'body': "Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}?\\n{STR_VAR_1} here. How are you?\\pBy the way, I heard you became\\nthe champion {STR_VAR_3} times at\\lthe {STR_VAR_2}.\\pI'd better raise my POKéMON before\\nyou pull farther ahead.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText7	{'body': "{PLAYER}{KUN}?\\n{STR_VAR_1} here.\\pYou were at the {STR_VAR_2}\\nand became the champ {STR_VAR_3} times?\\pThat's neat. By the way, have you\\ncaught any rare POKéMON lately?\\pOh, is that right.\\nOkay, bye.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText8	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, how do you do?\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1} speaking.\\lI hope you're doing well.\\lOh, but, you are.\\pI've heard that you won {STR_VAR_3} titles\\nat the {STR_VAR_2}.\\pI must raise my POKéMON like you.\\nSee you again.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText9	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hi there!\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}!\\pI heard! You took the title\\n{STR_VAR_3} times at the {STR_VAR_2}!\\pThat is so cool!\\nI'd better try harder, too!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText10	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello.\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}.\\pYou won {STR_VAR_3} straight times at\\nthe {STR_VAR_2}?\\pThat's quite the accomplishment.\\nI need to work harder.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText11	{'body': "Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI hear you're the terror of\\nthe {STR_VAR_2}?\\pYou won, what, {STR_VAR_3} straight times\\nnow?\\pI wonder if I can ever become\\na champion?\\p…Pretty well impossible?\\nWell, see you!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText12	{'body': "Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nIt's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\\lAre you keeping well?\\pYou've won {STR_VAR_3} events at a place\\nnamed {STR_VAR_2}?\\pThat's quite the tale.\\nSee you!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText13	{'body': "Ah, hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}!\\lI hope you've been keeping well.\\pThey say you won {STR_VAR_3} events\\nat the {STR_VAR_2}?\\pI admire your energy!\\nBye now.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattleDomeText14	{'body': "Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}.\\lI heard about you!\\pDidn't you win {STR_VAR_3} titles\\nat the {STR_VAR_2}?\\pYou're an inspiration!\\nSee you again!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattlePikeText1	{'body': "Hi! {PLAYER}?\\nHello, this is {STR_VAR_1}!\\lI heard the news!\\pYou got through {STR_VAR_3} rooms\\nat the {STR_VAR_2}!\\pThat's awesome!\\nSee you!$"}
