text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText6	{'body': "Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}?\\n{STR_VAR_1} here. How are you?\\pBy the way, I heard you got through\\n{STR_VAR_3} floors in the {STR_VAR_2}.\\pI'd better raise my POKéMON before\\nyou pull further ahead.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText7	{'body': '{PLAYER}{KUN}?\\n{STR_VAR_1} here.\\pYou were at the {STR_VAR_2}\\nand won your way up {STR_VAR_3} floors?\\pNeat. Were there any rare POKéMON\\nthere?\\pNo, huh?\\nOkay, bye.$'}
text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText8	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, how do you do?\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1} speaking.\\lI hope you're doing well.\\lOh, but, you are.\\pI've heard that you got through\\n{STR_VAR_3} floors in the {STR_VAR_2}.\\pThat's quite impressive!\\nI must raise my POKéMON like you.\\lSee you again.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText9	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hi there!\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}!\\pI heard! You won your way through\\n{STR_VAR_3} floors in the {STR_VAR_2}!\\pThat is so cool!\\nI'd better try harder, too!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText10	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello.\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}.\\pYou climbed {STR_VAR_3} floors inside\\nthe {STR_VAR_2}?\\pThat's quite the accomplishment.\\nI need to work harder.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText11	{'body': "Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI hear you're the terror of\\nthe {STR_VAR_2}?\\pYou rose through, what, {STR_VAR_3} floors?\\nThat's gotta count for something.\\pI wonder if I can ever become\\na champion?\\p…Pretty well impossible?\\nWell, see you!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText12	{'body': "Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nIt's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\\lAre you keeping well?\\pYou've won through {STR_VAR_3} floors in\\na place named {STR_VAR_2}?\\pThat's quite the tale.\\nSee you!$"}
text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText13	{'body': "Ah, hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}!\\lI hope you've been keeping well.\\pThey say you climbed {STR_VAR_3} floors\\nin the {STR_VAR_2}?\\pI admire your energy!\\nBye now.$"}
text:MatchCall_BattlePyramidText14	{'body': "Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nThis is {STR_VAR_1}.\\lI heard about you!\\pDidn't you get through {STR_VAR_3} floors\\nin the {STR_VAR_2}?\\pYou're an inspiration!\\nSee you again!$"}
text:MatchCall_Mom1	{'body': 'MOM: Your father and you…\\nEveryone is captivated by POKéMON.\\pWhat is the charm of POKéMON?\\pMe?\\nI adore POKéMON that help me with\\lmy everyday chores.$'}
text:MatchCall_Mom2	{'body': "MOM: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\nYour father keeps himself locked\\laway in the PETALBURG GYM.\\pHe comes home every so often.\\nBut he goes back to the GYM when\\lhe's eaten everything he can.\\pI'm guessing that losing to you\\nwas a big blow to his pride!$"}
text:MatchCall_Mom3	{'body': "MOM: {PLAYER}…\\nDon't worry about me or the house.\\pWear those RUNNING SHOES until\\nthey fall apart, honey!$"}
text:MatchCall_Roxanne_Preparing	{'body': "ROXANNE: Oh, hello, {PLAYER}!\\pI've been hard at work retraining\\nsince we met.\\pThe GYM is quiet now that you've\\npassed through.\\pCome by and tell me about the road\\nahead sometime!$"}
text:MatchCall_Roxanne_PreparingPostGame	{'body': "ROXANNE: Is this {PLAYER}?\\nCongratulations!\\lI've been hearing about you!\\pAs for me, I've gone back to teaching\\nat the TRAINERS' SCHOOL.\\pCome by RUSTBORO and tell my class\\nhow you did it!$"}
text:MatchCall_Roxanne_RematchReady	{'body': 'ROXANNE: {PLAYER}!\\nMy GYM is ready!\\pPlease visit RUSTBORO whenever\\nyou can!$'}
text:MatchCall_Roxanne_PostRematch	{'body': 'ROXANNE: At the RUSTBORO GYM,\\nthe fact that we battled, {PLAYER},\\lis a matter of pride.$'}
text:MatchCall_Brawly_Preparing	{'body': "BRAWLY: Hey, there, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pI learned a lot from the battle we\\nhad together.\\pI intend to do my training over,\\nthen reopen the GYM.\\pIt's going to take some time before\\nI'm ready to run the GYM again.\\pBut if I can reopen the GYM,\\nI want you to challenge us again.$"}
text:MatchCall_Brawly_PreparingPostGame	{'body': "BRAWLY: Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nCongratulations!\\pWord about your exploits arrived\\non tidal winds!\\pIt appears as if I need to work on\\nmy training some more.\\pIt's going to take some time before\\nI'm ready to run the GYM again.\\pBut if I can reopen the GYM,\\nI want you to challenge us again.$"}
text:MatchCall_Brawly_RematchReady	{'body': "BRAWLY: Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nMy GYM's ready for action!\\pCome back to DEWFORD anytime\\nfor another challenge!$"}
text:MatchCall_Brawly_PostRematch	{'body': 'BRAWLY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, our battle keeps\\nteaching me new lines to ride!$'}
text:MatchCall_Wattson_Preparing	{'body': "WATTSON: Oh, it's you!\\pAfter you left, I've been redoing\\nmy training from scratch.\\pI'd say I could use a wee bit more\\ntime to reopen my GYM.\\pYou'll have to wait till then!\\nWahahahaha!$"}
text:MatchCall_Wattson_PreparingPostGame	{'body': "WATTSON: Wahahahaha!\\pYou've really done it, haven't you?\\nI've been getting word about you!\\pIt seems I need to retrain some\\nmore still.\\pI'd say I could use a wee bit more\\ntime to reopen my GYM.\\pYou'll have to wait till then!\\nWahahahaha!$"}
text:MatchCall_Wattson_RematchReady	{'body': "WATTSON: Oh, it's you!\\nMy GYM's ready!\\pVisit MAUVILLE anytime!\\nWahahahaha!$"}
text:MatchCall_Wattson_PostRematch	{'body': 'WATTSON: Wahahaha!\\pThe battle we shared was charged\\nwith shocking power!$'}
text:MatchCall_Flannery_Preparing	{'body': "FLANNERY: {PLAYER}…\\pWhen we battled, I learned exactly\\nhow immature I was.\\pBut I'm not done yet!\\pI'm going to redo my training and\\nreopen the GYM.\\pWhen the time comes, {PLAYER},\\nplease challenge us again.$"}
text:MatchCall_Flannery_PreparingPostGame	{'body': "FLANNERY: Hello, {PLAYER}?\\nCongratulations!\\pWord of your success has reached\\nus like the heat of a volcano!\\pOur training is coming along very\\nwell here.\\pWhen the GYM's ready, a mark will\\nappear beside my name in the\\lMATCH CALL list.$"}
text:MatchCall_Flannery_RematchReady	{'body': "FLANNERY: Oh, {PLAYER}?\\nOur GYM's ready!\\pCome to LAVARIDGE for a soak\\nin the hot spring and a challenge!$"}
text:MatchCall_Flannery_PostRematch	{'body': "FLANNERY: {PLAYER}…\\nI'm positive that you keep getting\\lbetter at training every time.$"}
text:MatchCall_Winona_Preparing	{'body': "WINONA: Hello, {PLAYER}!\\pThanks to our battle, I've come\\nto understand my weak points!\\pWhen I reopen the GYM, I won't go\\ndown in defeat again!$"}
text:MatchCall_Winona_PreparingPostGame	{'body': "WINONA: You've done it, {PLAYER}!\\pNews about the new CHAMPION\\nhas reached us in FORTREE!\\pBut… The next time we battle,\\nit's not going to end the same way.$"}
text:MatchCall_Winona_RematchReady	{'body': "WINONA: Is this {PLAYER}?\\nOur GYM is back in operation!\\pWe're waiting for you in FORTREE!$"}
text:MatchCall_Winona_PostRematch	{'body': 'WINONA: {PLAYER}…\\nThough I have lost, my wings will\\lnever break.\\pYes, in exactly the same way that\\nyou never lost sight of your dream.$'}
text:MatchCall_TateLiza_Preparing	{'body': "TATE: Oh! You're…\\nLIZA: {PLAYER}!\\pTATE: We're in training again…\\nLIZA: So we can reopen our GYM!\\pTATE: When our GYM is ready…\\nLIZA: When our GYM is ready…\\pTATE: A mark'll appear by our name…\\nLIZA: On the MATCH CALL list.$"}
text:MatchCall_TateLiza_PreparingPostGame	{'body': "TATE: {PLAYER}, congratulations!\\nLIZA: {PLAYER}, congratulations!\\pTATE: The two of us are…\\nLIZA: Still in training!\\pTATE: We need some more time, but…\\nLIZA: When our GYM is ready…\\pTATE: A mark'll appear by our name…\\nLIZA: On the MATCH CALL list.$"}
text:MatchCall_TateLiza_RematchReady	{'body': 'TATE: {PLAYER}!\\nLIZA: {PLAYER}!\\pTATE: Our GYM is ready!\\nLIZA: Our GYM is ready!\\pTATE: Please come visit…\\nLIZA: MOSSDEEP anytime!$'}
text:MatchCall_TateLiza_PostRematch	{'body': 'TATE: {PLAYER}, the battle we had…\\nLIZA: Is an invaluable experience.\\pTATE: We still study…\\nLIZA: Every turn that shaped it!$'}
text:MatchCall_Juan_Preparing	{'body': 'JUAN: Hmm…\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}… Was it?\\pOur battle together--it brought\\nto me memories of when I first\\lencountered WALLACE.\\pPerhaps you are a genius who may\\nyet surpass WALLACE!$'}
text:MatchCall_Juan_PreparingPostGame	{'body': "JUAN: Fufu… {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nYou've finally achieved your goal.\\pMy eye for appraising talent wasn't\\nmistaken…\\pI wish for another chance to meet\\nyou, for you have scaled the peak\\lof power and prestige.$"}
text:MatchCall_Juan_RematchReady	{'body': 'JUAN: Hoho… {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\pOur SOOTOPOLIS GYM has finally\\nreopened.\\pIf you wish to see me, you are\\nwelcome to visit anytime.$'}
text:MatchCall_Juan_PostRematch	{'body': 'JUAN: {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\pLike the finest music, the battle\\nwe shared still strikes chords\\lof inspiration in my heart…\\pWhen I close my eyes, I see visions\\nof you soaring with the melody…$'}
text:MatchCall_Sidney	{'body': "SIDNEY: Yo, {PLAYER}!\\pIf you want to battle with me\\nagain, you come on back whenever\\lyou like to the POKéMON LEAGUE.\\pI'll always be here!\\nI'll be waiting!$"}
text:MatchCall_Phoebe	{'body': "PHOEBE: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\pHow about coming back here again\\nsometime?\\pI'd like to see how much tighter\\nyour bond has grown with your\\lPOKéMON.$"}
text:MatchCall_Glacia	{'body': "GLACIA: Hello, {PLAYER}.\\pI trust you haven't become\\ncomplacent with your power?\\pIf you feel the need to cool your\\nhot emotions just a little, do come\\lto the POKéMON LEAGUE…$"}
text:MatchCall_Drake	{'body': "DRAKE: That voice… {PLAYER}, is\\nit? You sound well…\\pThe CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT tests how\\nlong a crew can keep winning.\\pHere at the LEAGUE, you face us in\\nsuccession. Two worthy challenges\\lfor a seasoned TRAINER.\\pWhen the sea brings you back,\\nwe'll be ready.$"}
text:MatchCall_Wallace	{'body': "WALLACE: Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nHave you met STEVEN?\\pHe is…\\nActually incredibly skilled.\\pHowever, he's an odd soul who\\nrarely battles.\\pInstead, he would rather look for\\nrare stones.\\pI'm sure he's digging in a cave or\\na craggy mountain somewhere.\\pBut what is a rare stone exactly?\\nAll I can think of is a METEORITE…$"}
text:MatchCall_MayRayquazaCall	{'body': "… … … … … …\\n… … … … … Beep!\\pMAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pI was just in PACIFIDLOG a little\\nwhile ago.\\pI saw a giant green POKéMON\\nflying high in the sky.\\pI…\\nI've never seen anything like it.\\pI wonder what it was.\\nIs this maybe a major discovery?\\p… … … … … …\\n… … … … … Click!$"}
text:MatchCall_BrendanRayquazaCall	{'body': "… … … … … …\\n… … … … … Beep!\\pBRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\\nI was in PACIFIDLOG just now.\\pI saw this huge green POKéMON\\nflying across the sky.\\pI've never seen anything that\\namazing before.\\pI wish you could've seen it,\\n{PLAYER}.\\p… … … … … …\\n… … … … … Click!$"}
text:MatchCall_May1	{'body': 'MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pMR. BRINEY retired as a SAILOR,\\nbut I still see him out on the sea\\lwith his pet PEEKO sometimes.\\pHe must love the sea still.$'}
text:MatchCall_May2	{'body': "MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pYou know how little towns like\\nPETALBURG and DEWFORD have GYMS?\\pFor some reason, the big port of\\nSLATEPORT doesn't have a GYM.\\pWhen they finally build a GYM there,\\nI should apply to be the LEADER.$"}
text:MatchCall_May3	{'body': 'MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pDo you remember a man named\\nthe CUTTER in RUSTBORO?\\lHe had a house there, remember?\\pWell, I found out his younger\\nbrother lives in MAUVILLE.\\pCan you guess his name?\\p… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\pThe ROCK SMASH GUY!$'}
text:MatchCall_May4	{'body': 'MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}?\\pRUSTURF TUNNEL…\\nThey named it that because it\\ljoins RUSTBORO and VERDANTURF.$'}
text:MatchCall_May5	{'body': "MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, how are you?\\pI'm out on ROUTE 111 now.\\pI'm going to get a rest at an old\\nlady's house.\\pShe lives just north of\\nthe desert.$"}
text:MatchCall_May6	{'body': 'MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pDid you know about the MIRAGE\\nTOWER in the desert?\\pThey say, like a mirage, it seems\\nto mysteriously come and go.\\pI wish I could see it.$'}
text:MatchCall_May7	{'body': "MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, yahoo!\\nI'm on ROUTE 119 now.\\pThere's a big river here, and\\nit often rains.\\pI got soaked!$"}
text:MatchCall_May8	{'body': 'MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, hi.\\pMT. PYRE is a memorial to POKéMON\\nwhose lives have ended.\\pGHOST POKéMON gather there. I\\nwonder if they feel at home among\\lthe memories.$'}
text:MatchCall_May9	{'body': 'MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pI was thinking of going to the hot\\nspring in LAVARIDGE.\\pBut on the way, around JAGGED\\nPASS, I ran into some bad-looking\\lcharacters. The mood was ugly!$'}
text:MatchCall_May10	{'body': 'MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nDid you see the news?\\pThey say CAPT. STERN discovered\\nthe SEAFLOOR CAVERN while on his\\lsubmarine expedition.$'}
text:MatchCall_May11	{'body': "MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nDon't you think it's neat?\\pEven if you don't have a boat,\\nyou can cross the sea using\\la POKéMON's move.\\pDid you know there's more?\\pThere's a POKéMON move that lets\\nyou go to the bottom of the sea.$"}
text:MatchCall_May12	{'body': 'MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nHope things are okay!\\pHave you been on the sea and\\nfound your way to the other side\\lblocked?\\pTry diving deep underwater and\\nfollowing trenches.\\pWhen you get to the other side,\\ncome up to the surface. Easy!$'}
text:MatchCall_May13	{'body': "MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pHow's it going?\\nAre you filling your POKéDEX?\\pI heard a rumor that there are\\nsuper-ancient POKéMON out there.\\lAnd there are three of them!\\pI would love to see even one…$"}
text:MatchCall_May14	{'body': "MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nI heard the rumors!\\pYou beat the SOOTOPOLIS GYM\\nLEADER?\\pThat means you don't have far\\nto go, do you?$"}
text:MatchCall_May15	{'body': "MAY: There isn't a single TRAINER\\nleft in HOENN who doesn't know who\\lyou are, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pWhen I tell people that I'm friends\\nwith you, {PLAYER}{KUN}, they're all\\lsurprised!$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan1	{'body': 'BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\\pMR. BRINEY retired as a SAILOR,\\nbut I still see him out on the sea\\lwith his pet PEEKO sometimes.\\pI guess he must love\\nthe sea still.$'}
text:MatchCall_Brendan2	{'body': "BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\\pI don't get how little towns like\\nPETALBURG and DEWFORD have GYMS.\\pI mean, not when the big port of\\nSLATEPORT doesn't have a GYM.\\pWhen they finally build a GYM there,\\nI should apply to be the LEADER.$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan3	{'body': 'BRENDAN: Yo, {PLAYER}!\\pDo you remember a guy named\\nthe CUTTER in RUSTBORO?\\lHe had a house there, right?\\pWell, it turns out his little\\nbrother lives in MAUVILLE.\\pCan you guess his name?\\p… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\pThe ROCK SMASH GUY!$'}
text:MatchCall_Brendan4	{'body': 'BRENDAN: This voice… {PLAYER}?\\pThey gave RUSTURF TUNNEL its name\\nbecause it joins RUSTBORO and\\lVERDANTURF.\\pDid you know that?$'}
text:MatchCall_Brendan5	{'body': "BRENDAN: {PLAYER}, what's up?\\pHey, I'm out on ROUTE 111 now.\\pI'm going to rest up at an old\\nlady's house north of the desert.\\pIf you're in the area, you should\\nvisit her, too.$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan6	{'body': "BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\\pDid you know about the MIRAGE\\nTOWER in the desert?\\pThey say, like a mirage, it can be\\nseen only sometimes.\\pI'd like to see that!$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan7	{'body': "BRENDAN: Who's this? Oh, {PLAYER}?\\nGuess what? I'm on ROUTE 119 now.\\pThere's a big river here, and\\nit rains all the time.\\pI got soaked to the bone!$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan8	{'body': "BRENDAN: {PLAYER}!\\pMT. PYRE is a memorial to POKéMON\\nwhose lives have ended.\\pThere are GHOST POKéMON\\neverywhere. I'm keeping my voice\\ldown while I explore.$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan9	{'body': 'BRENDAN: Hey there, {PLAYER}.\\pI was on my way back to the hot\\nspring in LAVARIDGE.\\pBut around JAGGED PASS, I ran into\\nsome nasty-looking characters.\\pThose creeps…\\nI think they were TEAM MAGMA.$'}
text:MatchCall_Brendan10	{'body': 'BRENDAN: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\nDid you catch the news?\\pThey say CAPT. STERN discovered\\nthe SEAFLOOR CAVERN while on his\\lsubmarine expedition.$'}
text:MatchCall_Brendan11	{'body': "BRENDAN: Hey there, {PLAYER}!\\nDon't you think it's awesome?\\pEven if you don't have a boat,\\nyou can cross the sea using\\la POKéMON's move.\\pAnd, there's a move that lets you\\ntravel to the bottom of the sea.\\pMan, POKéMON can do anything!$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan12	{'body': 'BRENDAN: Howdy, {PLAYER}!\\nHow are you holding up?\\pEver found your way to the other\\nside blocked while on the sea?\\pTry diving deep underwater and\\nfollowing trenches at the bottom.\\pWhen you get to the other side,\\ncome up to the surface. Simple!$'}
text:MatchCall_Brendan13	{'body': "BRENDAN: Hey there, {PLAYER}!\\pHow's it going? Filling up your\\nPOKéDEX successfully?\\pI heard a rumor that there are\\nsuper-ancient POKéMON out there.\\lAnd not just one--three!\\pI'd love to catch even one…$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan14	{'body': "BRENDAN: {PLAYER}!\\nI heard the rumors!\\pYou beat the SOOTOPOLIS GYM\\nLEADER? Awesome!\\pYou're getting awful close now!$"}
text:MatchCall_Brendan15	{'body': "BRENDAN: There isn't a TRAINER in\\nall of HOENN who doesn't know who\\lyou are, {PLAYER}!\\pWhen I tell people that I'm friends\\nwith you, {PLAYER}, they get pretty\\lenvious!$"}
text:MatchCall_Wally1	{'body': "WALLY: Oh, {PLAYER}!\\pI've been getting healthier and\\nmore physically fit.\\pI hope I can become a TRAINER like\\nyou soon, {PLAYER}!$"}
text:MatchCall_Wally2	{'body': "WALLY: {PLAYER}, hello!\\pAfter RUSTURF TUNNEL went\\nthrough, WANDA's been very happy!$"}
text:MatchCall_Wally3	{'body': "WALLY: Oh, {PLAYER}!\\pI… I left my uncle's place in\\nVERDANTURF without telling anyone.\\pI wonder if he's furious with me…\\p{PLAYER}, you understand how\\nI feel, don't you?$"}
text:MatchCall_Wally4	{'body': "WALLY: {PLAYER}?\\nIt's me, WALLY!\\pThe world of TRAINERS is amazing!\\pWhen I have my POKéMON with me,\\nall sorts of people say hi!\\pIt's as if everyone's getting\\nconnected through POKéMON!$"}
text:MatchCall_Wally5	{'body': "WALLY: {PLAYER}? It's awesome!\\nThat RALTS we caught together?\\lIt evolved, {PLAYER}!\\pMaybe I'm talented…\\pOh, but I shouldn't get a big head\\nlike that!\\pAfter all, it's the POKéMON that\\nshould be praised!$"}
text:MatchCall_Wally6	{'body': "… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\pWALLY appears to be out of\\nthe POKéNAV's service area…$"}
text:MatchCall_Wally7	{'body': "WALLY: Oh, {PLAYER}!\\pBefore I met you, I hardly ever\\nleft my house…\\pBut now, I'm on an adventure with\\nmy very own POKéMON…\\p{PLAYER}…\\nThank you…$"}
text:MatchCall_Scott1	{'body': 'SCOTT: Howdy, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pYou know how POKéMON can be found\\neverywhere?\\pLike in the mountains, in the sea,\\nin tall grass anywhere?\\pJust like POKéMON, you can find\\nTRAINERS everywhere, too.\\pAs a result, I have to hurry\\neverywhere, too. Busy, busy!$'}
text:MatchCall_Scott2	{'body': "SCOTT: I'm on ROUTE 119 right now.\\nIt's teeming with TRAINERS!\\pIt's also overgrown with tall grass\\neverywhere, it seems.\\pWalking around in shorts here\\nmakes me all ticklish!$"}
text:MatchCall_Scott3	{'body': "SCOTT: Hi, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pHave you had the chance to climb\\nMT. PYRE?\\pThe place is a memorial to POKéMON\\nthat have passed away.\\pIt's somewhere every TRAINER\\nshould climb to the top of once.$"}
text:MatchCall_Scott4	{'body': "SCOTT: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pI've been hearing about these odd\\ngangs being a nuisance.\\pTEAM MAGMA and TEAM AQUA,\\nI think they were.\\pI would think there'd be some\\nskilled TRAINERS among them.\\p…But if they're thugs…$"}
text:MatchCall_Scott5	{'body': "SCOTT: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\pMight there be tough TRAINERS\\nat the bottom of the sea?\\pI can't go check for myself.\\nI can't swim, for one.\\lAnd I don't raise POKéMON…$"}
text:MatchCall_Scott6	{'body': "SCOTT: Hi, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}! All\\neight BADGES! The LEAGUE is\\lwaiting for you.\\pIf you want another challenge,\\nvisit the CHAMPIONS CIRCUIT at the\\lBATTLE FRONTIER.\\pThe LILYCOVE ferry opens that\\nroute with six BADGES. You've\\lalready earned your passage!\\pI hope to see you over there!$"}
text:MatchCall_Scott7	{'body': "… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\pSCOTT appears to be out of\\nthe POKéNAV's service area…$"}
text:MatchCall_Norman1	{'body': "DAD: In RUSTBORO, there's a man\\nthat goes by the odd name of\\lthe CUTTER.\\pIf you're in the area, you should\\npay him a visit.$"}
text:MatchCall_Norman2	{'body': "DAD: Hm… Little by little, but also\\nvery surely, you're getting\\ltougher, {PLAYER}.\\pThe stronger you get, the farther\\nand higher you soar from Mother\\land me…\\pThis feeling is hard to explain.$"}
text:MatchCall_Norman3	{'body': "DAD: I see…\\nYou've collected four GYM BADGES…\\pThere's no avoiding it now.\\nWe will battle like I promised.\\pCome anytime.\\nWe'll all be waiting for you!$"}
text:MatchCall_Norman4	{'body': "DAD: {PLAYER}! You'd better go visit\\nMother every so often.\\pI'm going to remain here and\\nredouble my training.\\pThe way of battling is deep\\nand unforgiving!$"}
text:MatchCall_Norman5	{'body': "DAD: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}!\\pWhat's that? MAGMA EMBLEM?\\nI don't know what that's about.\\pBut with a name like that, it may\\nbe somehow linked to a volcano!$"}
text:MatchCall_Norman_Preparing	{'body': 'DAD: Hiyah! Haah! Dwah!\\p…Oh? {PLAYER}!\\pYou caught me right in the middle\\nof a POKéMON training session!$'}
text:MatchCall_Norman_PreparingPostGame	{'body': "DAD: {PLAYER}!\\pWho would've thought you'd become\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION…\\pOkay!\\nI won't be left behind!$"}
text:MatchCall_Norman_RematchReady	{'body': "DAD: Hm? {PLAYER}?\\nWhat good timing!\\pThis time, I'm going to challenge\\nyou to battle.\\pI'm waiting in the PETALBURG GYM.\\nAccept my challenge anytime!$"}
text:MatchCall_Norman_PostRematch	{'body': 'DAD: …You amaze me, {PLAYER}.\\nHow much higher will you soar?$'}
text:MatchCall_Steven1	{'body': 'STEVEN: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pHave you been to MAUVILLE\\nalready?\\pYou should visit the BIKE SHOP\\nand get a MACH BIKE.\\pThen, try exploring the GRANITE\\nCAVE thoroughly.\\pYou may make a new discovery\\nthere.$'}
text:MatchCall_Steven2	{'body': "STEVEN: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pI've met a lot of different\\nTRAINERS so far.\\pBut you're one of a kind.\\nYou're not like anyone else.$"}
text:MatchCall_Steven3	{'body': "STEVEN: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pWhen you're on an adventure with\\nyour POKéMON, what do you think?\\pDo you consider them to be strong\\npartners?\\pDo you think of them as fun\\ncompanions?\\pDepending on how you think, your\\nadventure's significance changes.$"}
text:MatchCall_Steven4	{'body': "STEVEN: Hello?\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}?\\pI'm involved in a spot of trouble\\nat the SPACE CENTER.\\pI'm sorry, but I can't talk now.\\nBye!$"}
text:MatchCall_Steven5	{'body': "STEVEN: Oh!\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pThere's no need to talk.\\nIt's past time for talking.\\pYou have to believe in yourself\\nand do what's right.$"}
text:MatchCall_Steven6	{'body': '… … … … … …\\pSTEVEN appears not to be getting\\nthe call…$'}
text:MatchCall_Steven7	{'body': 'STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}… Congratulations\\nfor entering the HALL OF FAME.\\p… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\pI hope we can meet again\\nsomewhere!$'}
text:MatchCall_BirchRegisterCall	{'body': "PROF. BIRCH: Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nI've already heard about you!\\pIt seems your POKéNAV's been\\nupgraded with MATCH CALL.\\pWell, I should register, too!\\pThat way, I'd be able to examine\\nyour POKéDEX even while you're\\lout in the field.\\p… … … … … …$"}
text:MatchCall_RegisteredBirch	{'body': 'Registered PROF. BIRCH\\nin the POKéNAV.$'}
text:MatchCall_UnusedProfBirch	{'body': 'PROF. BIRCH: When one has both\\nthe POKéDEX and POKéNAV, studying\\lPOKéMON becomes more fun, eh?$'}
text:MatchCall_MrStone1	{'body': "MR. STONE: Oh? {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pSince you called me, the POKéNAV\\nmust be working properly!\\pOther people will be registered,\\nso try calling them up, too!\\pGood! Good!\\nYou seem to be quite happy!\\pHm…\\nHow could I know that?\\pIt's because I'm looking down at\\nyou from my office window!\\pWahahaha!\\nSee you again!$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone2	{'body': "MR. STONE: Oh? {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pWhat's wrong? Have you forgotten\\nabout that little errand of mine?\\pI need you to deliver my letter\\nto STEVEN in DEWFORD.\\pAfter that, deliver our parcel to\\nCAPT. STERN in SLATEPORT.\\pYou remember, don't you?\\pNow, since I am a busy PRESIDENT,\\nI have to go! Bye-bye!$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone3	{'body': "MR. STONE: Oh! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pAh, so you've met STEVEN!\\nI'd better reward you, then!\\pWhen you visit RUSTBORO again,\\ncome see me at my office.\\pI'll be waiting for you!$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone4	{'body': "MR. STONE: Oh! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pDid you know that DEVON was\\ndigging the RUSTURF TUNNEL?\\pBut we shut down the operation to\\nprotect the POKéMON in the area.\\pIt's a no-brainer, really.\\pIt's more important to let POKéMON\\nlive in peace than worry about our\\lown convenience.$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone5	{'body': "MR. STONE: Hello, hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pI heard from someone in PETALBURG\\nthat you're NORMAN's child!\\pNo wonder you're such a capable\\nbeing!$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone6	{'body': "MR. STONE: What's that?\\pYou battled your own father and\\ndefeated him?\\pThat's astounding!\\pI had no idea that I befriended\\nsomeone so special! Wahaha!$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone7	{'body': "Hello!\\nThis is DEVON CORPORATI…\\lOh, hello, {PLAYER}!\\pOur PRESIDENT was here a little\\nwhile ago, but he's gone out.\\pOur PRESIDENT is busy, but you\\nseem to be just as busy, {PLAYER}.$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone8	{'body': "…Huh? …What's that?\\pGROU… Yes? …DON?\\pYou're breaking up…\\n…can't hear…\\pBZZZZ…$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone9	{'body': "…Huh? …What's that?\\pSeaflo… Yes? …Caver…?\\pYou're breaking up…\\n…can't hear…\\pBZZZZ…$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone10	{'body': "MR. STONE: {PLAYER}{KUN}! It's me!\\pYou were apparently involved in all\\nsorts of things, but I, being busy,\\lhaven't a clue exactly what!\\pHowever, I urge you to take\\nthe road you believe in and walk it.\\pI'll always be in your corner!\\nTake care!$"}
text:MatchCall_MrStone11	{'body': "MR. STONE: … … … … … …\\nIs this maybe {PLAYER}{KUN}?\\pYour voice is so full of confidence,\\nI didn't recognize you right off!\\pHm! You must come visit us at DEVON\\nsometime!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge0	{'body': "Um, I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\\nSnivel… This tension is getting to me…$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge1	{'body': "I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\\nHere we come!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge2	{'body': "I'm the no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice of {STR_VAR_1}!\\nAccept my challenge!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge3	{'body': "Um… I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice…\\nDo you think someone like me can win?$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge4	{'body': "I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\\nI'll let you challenge me!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge5	{'body': "I'm horribly busy, but I also happen\\nto be {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge6	{'body': "I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\\nGlad to meet you!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge7	{'body': "I serve as {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\\nMay I begin?$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge8	{'body': "Eek! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\\nI'll do my best!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge9	{'body': "Yeehaw! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\\nPut 'em up!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge10	{'body': "I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s 1,000th apprentice!\\nActually, I'm no. {STR_VAR_2}! Here goes!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge11	{'body': "Yeah, I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\\nLet's get rockin' and a-rollin'!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge12	{'body': "Yippee-yahoo! I'm what you call\\n{STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge13	{'body': "Cough! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\\nGood to meet you! Cough!$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge14	{'body': "This is nerve-racking…\\nI'm the no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice of {STR_VAR_1}.$"}
text:gApprenticeChallenge15	{'body': "I am {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice,\\nand that's no lie.$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach0	{'body': "Are you… {PLAYER}?\\nOh! Sniff…sob…\\pOh! S-sorry…\\nI'm so nervous, I can't help crying…\\pI'm {STR_VAR_1}, and I really look up\\nto you, {PLAYER}.\\pI… I had this dream of one day meeting\\nyou and asking you about POKéMON.\\pPlease, please, {PLAYER}!\\nPlease teach me about POKéMON!$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching0	{'body': "Oh… B-but…\\nSnivel… Waaaaaaah!\\pPlease!\\nI'm begging you, please!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode0	{'body': "Oh, really? You will? Awesome!\\nWicked! Awoooh!\\pOh… I'm sorry… I'm so happy, I'm\\ncrying…\\pI'm planning my own practice team.\\nShould I train for Level 50 or\\lOpen Level?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks0	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}?\\nWaaaaah!\\pOh! I'm so sorry!\\nYou've made me happy by choosing\\lthe level for me, and it's made me cry…\\pSnivel…\\nThank you so much!\\lPlease talk with me again!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach1	{'body': "Wowee! You're {PLAYER}, aren't you?\\nYou're awesomely strong, aren't you?\\pI'm {STR_VAR_1}!\\nI just became a TRAINER!\\pPlease, {PLAYER}!\\nCan you be my teacher and tell me\\llots about being a TRAINER?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching1	{'body': 'Aww, why?\\nOh, please? Pretty please?\\lPlease be my teacher, please!$'}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode1	{'body': 'Yay! Great!\\pI want to set a goal for my\\npractice team! Level 50 or Open\\lLevel?\\pWhich would be perfect for me?$'}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks1	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}, huh? That's true!\\nI'll do my best there!\\pIf we meet here again, please teach\\nme something else, teacher!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach2	{'body': "Um… Are you {PLAYER}?\\nMy name is {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI want to become a POKéMON TRAINER,\\nbut I don't know what to do…\\pSo I thought maybe I could ask you for\\nadvice because you're so famous.\\p{PLAYER}, could you give me advice?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching2	{'body': 'Oh, but…\\pI sincerely want to become a POKéMON\\nTRAINER!\\pPlease, can you answer my questions?$'}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode2	{'body': "Thank you! Here's my first\\nquestion!\\pFor my own practice team, should I\\naim for Level 50 or Open Level?\\pWhich is more suitable for me?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks2	{'body': "Oh, the {STR_VAR_1} challenge?\\nUnderstood!\\pIf I have another question, I'll come\\nback here for your advice!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach3	{'body': "Oh? Huh? You're…\\nNo, that can't be true.\\pThere isn't any way that someone\\nlike me could meet {PLAYER}.\\p…You really are {PLAYER}?\\nI can't believe I'm talking to you!\\pWhen something this good happens,\\nonly terrible things will happen to me\\lnow, I just know it…\\p…I'm sorry…\\nI'm… {STR_VAR_1}…\\pThere isn't anything special about\\nme that I can be proud of…\\pI shouldn't even say anything about\\nmyself because you'll forget…\\pI had this dream that if I ever met\\nyou, {PLAYER}, that maybe I could ask\\lyou for advice as a TRAINER.\\pBut I don't think you would agree\\nto that.\\p…Or will you be so kind as to give\\nme advice?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching3	{'body': "I knew it…\\pIt had to happen because I'm such\\na really boring nobody…\\pBut I thought just maybe…\\nYou won't reconsider, will you?\\pBut I can't give up just like that.\\nI'll ask you while I'm still lucky!\\pPlease, will you be so kind as to give\\nme advice?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode3	{'body': "Really? I can't believe you'll\\nadvise me! I… I'm so happy…\\pI need a goal for my practice\\nteam, but I can't decide…\\pLevel 50 or Open Level? Which\\ncould someone like me manage?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks3	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}? Okay!\\nBut do you really think someone like\\lme would have a chance?\\pI'll do my best, even though I don't\\nthink it will work.\\pThank you very much for spending\\ntime with someone like me.$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach4	{'body': "Oh! You're {PLAYER}{KUN}, aren't you?\\pI've heard that you're tough at\\nPOKéMON!\\pI'm {STR_VAR_1}!\\nI'll be your friend!\\pDid you know?\\pYou can't win at the BATTLE FRONTIER\\nif all you know is what they teach at\\lthe TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\\pI'm willing to listen to your advice.\\nYou'll agree, of course?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching4	{'body': "Huh? Why are you refusing me?\\nIt's me who's asking you!\\lYou have to reconsider!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode4	{'body': "Okay, I need you to decide\\nsomething for me.\\pI'm planning my own practice team.\\nShould I aim for Level 50 or Open\\lLevel?\\pWhich do you think would suit me,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks4	{'body': "Okay, {STR_VAR_1} is suitable for me?\\nThank you!\\pKnowing that you made the decision,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\\lI lose.\\pOkay, I'll look to you for advice again.\\nBye!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach5	{'body': "Oh, hi, there! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nI know you because you're famous!\\lCall me {STR_VAR_1}! Glad to meet you!\\pI'm a TRIATHLETE, so I keep myself\\nfit even while I raise POKéMON.\\pI'm also involved with other things\\nlike work, napping, ballroom dancing…\\pBeing this busy, it's not so easy for\\nme to become a decent TRAINER.\\pSo, I have a proposition!\\pThere must be a reason why we met.\\nSo, {PLAYER}{KUN}, how about sharing your\\lwisdom with me every so often?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching5	{'body': 'Oh, but, please?\\nA guy like me needs someone like\\lyou, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pHonestly, I need your advice!$'}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode5	{'body': "Thank you! That's more like it!\\nLet's start with an easy one!\\pI need a training goal for my\\nteam. Level 50 or Open Level?\\pMe being a busy guy, which should\\nI gear up for?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks5	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}, huh? Okay, gotcha.\\nI'll find time somehow and give it a go!\\p…Whoops, I'd better go to work!\\nThanks! See you around!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach6	{'body': "No way! Uh-uh!\\nAre you maybe the real {PLAYER}?\\pA-hah! Awesome! I'm {STR_VAR_1},\\nso pleased to meet you!\\p{PLAYER}, you're very strong,\\naren't you?\\pEveryone's talking about you!\\pOh! I just had this great idea!\\nI'll get advice off you, {PLAYER}!\\lI'm sure it will make me tougher!\\pIsn't it a great idea?\\nPlease, I want your advice!$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching6	{'body': "Ahahaha, you can pretend to be mean,\\nbut you can't fool me!\\lYou really mean okay, don't you?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode6	{'body': "Yay! I knew you'd have a big\\nheart, {PLAYER}!\\pDrum roll, please! My first\\nquestion is about my practice\\lteam!\\pLevel 50 or Open Level? Which\\nsuits me more?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks6	{'body': "Oh-oh-oh!\\n{STR_VAR_1}, you say!\\lThank you for a totally cool reply!\\pI guess that's about all I wanted\\nto ask you today.\\pLet's meet here again, okay?\\nThanks!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach7	{'body': "I beg your pardon, but…\\nAre you {PLAYER}?\\pI'm {STR_VAR_1}, and I am delighted to\\nmake your acquaintance.\\pI have long been an admirer\\nof yours…\\p… … … … … …\\pUm… I hope you don't find this\\nrequest too much of a burden, but…\\pMay I become your apprentice,\\n{PLAYER}?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching7	{'body': "Oh…!\\p… … … … … …\\n… … … … … …\\p…I must have fainted from shock.\\nI'm sorry, I must have misheard you.\\pPlease! Please say that you will\\naccept me as your apprentice!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode7	{'body': "Oh… I'm delighted!\\pPlease help me set a goal for my\\nown practice team.\\pWhich would be most suitable for\\nme? Level 50 or Open Level?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks7	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1} is your choice!\\nI see. I will do my best!\\pThank you, {PLAYER}.\\nI hope I can count on you again.\\lPlease take care!$'}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach8	{'body': "Eek! Eek! {PLAYER}!\\nYou spoke to me!\\lI… I'm overjoyed!\\pMe! My name is {STR_VAR_1}!\\nI just became a TRAINER!\\pI'm delighted I met you, {PLAYER},\\nthe big name in POKéMON circles!\\pOh-oh-oh, I know!\\nMay I ask a huge favor, {PLAYER}?\\pPlease take me in as your apprentice!\\nI want to learn from you!$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching8	{'body': "Waaaah!\\n{PLAYER} turned me down…\\lIt… It's an invaluable experience!\\p{PLAYER}, please! I want to hear\\nan affirmative answer this time!\\pI beg you for your guidance!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode8	{'body': "Hieeeeh! {PLAYER} said yes! I\\nwon't be able to sleep tonight…\\pThen, here's my question! For my\\npractice team, what is right for\\lme?\\pLevel 50 or Open Level?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks8	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}! Perfectly understood!\\nI understand perfectly!\\lI'm deliriously delighted!\\pI hope you'll be willing to teach me\\nsome more another time.$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach9	{'body': "Whoa! Could you be…\\nMight you be… {PLAYER}{KUN}?!\\lThat strong and famous TRAINER?\\lWell, hello, aren't I just the luckiest!\\pHello, the name's {STR_VAR_1}!\\pI've been on the lookout for\\na POKéMON teacher.\\pAnd with impeccably good timing,\\nalong came you, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pSo, there you have it, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nLet me apprentice under you!$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching9	{'body': "Gwaaaah!\\nYou're quite cool and tough…\\pDon't be that way, please.\\nI'm asking you!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode9	{'body': "Oh, yeah! That's a solid reply!\\nExcellent, I might add!\\pNow for my own practice team…\\nShould I train for Level 50 or\\lOpen Level?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks9	{'body': "Uh-huh, {STR_VAR_1} it is!\\nOK, A-OK!\\lI'll go show my mettle, like, jam!\\pAll right, I'll look to you as my mentor!\\nAdios!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach10	{'body': "Oh, hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}, right?\\nThe police were looking for you!\\p… … …\\nOf course I'm lying!\\pMe, I'm {STR_VAR_1}. Despite the way\\nI look, I'm the POKéMON CHAMPION!\\l…That's a lie, too!\\pThis is no lie, though.\\nI'm not very good at battling.\\pSo, how about you becoming my master\\nabout all things POKéMON?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching10	{'body': "If you're going to act cold like that,\\nI'll show you what I'll do!\\pWaaah! Waaah! Waaah!\\nHiccup!\\pHahaha, that was my FAKE TEARS!\\pCome on, will you please be\\nmy POKéMON master?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode10	{'body': "Yippee! I'll buy you a boat for\\nthat!\\pOf course I'm lying again! But…\\nThank you, master!\\pShould I train my own team for\\nLevel 50 or Open Level? Decide for\\lme, master!$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks10	{'body': "Okay, so {STR_VAR_1} is better!\\nI'll go to the other level, then!\\pJust kidding!\\nI'll obey your teaching, master!\\pThanks, master!\\nI hope you'll keep teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach11	{'body': "A-H-O-Y!\\nAnd that spells ahoy, and it means hi!\\pI'm {STR_VAR_1}, the rappin' SAILOR\\nam I!\\pYour turn now, tell me a little about\\nyourself, give it a try!\\pUh-huh, uh-huh!\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}'s your name,\\land POKéMON's your game!\\pAnd you're at a delicate age\\nwhen all the world's your stage!\\pAnyway, I just want to say,\\nthat you're the tenth TRAINER\\lI've spoken to today.\\pLet's make that a celebration!\\nBecome my mentor for commemoration!$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching11	{'body': "But!\\nYou have to work with me!\\pDon't be such a tease!\\nBecome my mentor, please!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode11	{'body': "That's it! {PLAYER}, you've got\\nthe spirit!\\pMy practice team needs a\\ndestination! I leave it to your\\linspiration!\\pLevel 50 or Open Level there be,\\nwhich is the one that's good for\\lme?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks11	{'body': "Okay, {STR_VAR_1} it is, you say!\\nI'll go and take it on my way!\\pIf it's advice I ever need,\\n{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach12	{'body': "Say, hey, aren't you {PLAYER}?\\nWhat should I do? Talk to you?\\lWhy not? I'm already talking to you!\\p{PLAYER}, are you surprised at me?\\nI'd better tell you who I happen to be!\\p{STR_VAR_1} is what you can call me.\\nThe brightest star in guitardom,\\lthat's me!\\pAre you receiving me?\\nYou are receiving me!\\pMy luck's at its best,\\nI'll hit you with a request!\\p{PLAYER}, let me be your underling!\\nI want you to teach me everything!$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching12	{'body': "You're turning me down, then?\\nI'll just have to ask you again!\\p{PLAYER}, I beg to be your underling!\\nI need you to teach me everything!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode12	{'body': "Lucky, yeah, woohoo! Should I pop\\na question to you?\\pMy practice team needs a goal to\\npursue. Level 50 or Open Level?\\lIt's up to you!$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks12	{'body': "If {STR_VAR_1} is what you suggest,\\nit must be the very best!\\pWell, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\\nbut don't you forget about me.\\pSee you again, my smart friend!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach13	{'body': "Oh, hi! You there! Can I get you\\nto massage my shoulder?\\p…Yes, there! Ouch, ouch! Oooh,\\nthat feels great!\\pMy name's {STR_VAR_1}. I take\\nkarate training, but my body's not\\lbuilt to take the abuse…\\pI decided I'll battle POKéMON and\\ntoughen myself up.\\pYou're {PLAYER}{KUN}, aren't you?\\nI've heard you're a tough TRAINER!\\pListen, can I get you to give me\\nadvice?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching13	{'body': "Oh, why?\\pI won't be a big bother, I promise!\\nPlease?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode13	{'body': 'Thank you. Mighty good of you!\\n…Cough! Cough!\\pOogh, I have to toughen up quick…\\nMy POKéMON need a training goal,\\ltoo.\\pLevel 50 or Open Level? Which\\nshould I aim for?$'}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks13	{'body': "Hm, all right. That's {STR_VAR_1}.\\nI'll go there right away.\\pI hope I can keep hitting you up for\\nhelp--after all, you're my mentor!$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach14	{'body': "Er… Um…\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}…?\\pPlease, don't look at me that way.\\nYou're making me all self-conscious.\\pI… I'm {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI'm really embarrassed to say this,\\nbut I explore ancient ruins and such.\\pI'm even more embarrassed to admit\\nI'm interested in the BATTLE FRONTIER.\\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, you have a reputation as\\na tough TRAINER…\\pIt's hard for me to say this,\\nbut I want to ask something.\\pCould you become my teacher and\\ngive me advice?$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching14	{'body': "Please don't brush me off like this!\\nI can't live with the humiliation.\\pPlease become my teacher!\\nI need your advice!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode14	{'body': "Th-thank you… Please don't stare.\\nI'm getting all flustered.\\pI need a goal for my practice\\nteam. Level 50 or Open Level?\\pWhich should I attempt?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks14	{'body': "Oh… Okay!\\nI'll try my hand at that.\\pI hope I can make a valiant challenge\\nwithout getting all flustered…\\pThank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nIf we meet again, I hope you will be\\las helpful.$"}
text:gApprenticePleaseTeach15	{'body': "Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nBut are you really real?\\pYou may call me {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI have been toying with the idea of\\napprenticing under a strong TRAINER.\\pSo, I must say I'm lucky you came along!\\n…You really are {PLAYER}{KUN}, yes?\\pNo, no, if you are real, it's fine.\\nI merely want you to recognize me\\las your apprentice.$"}
text:gApprenticeRejectTeaching15	{'body': 'Oh?\\nBut what would compel you to refuse?\\pI apologize for being skeptical about\\nyour identity.\\pPlease accept my apology and\\naccept me as your apprentice.$'}
text:gApprenticeWhichLevelMode15	{'body': "You really are accepting me? I\\ndon't wish to celebrate\\lprematurely.\\pIf it is true, I apologize. Now, I\\nneed your advice.\\pFor my own practice team, what\\nwould be worthy of me? Level 50 or\\lOpen Level?$"}
text:gApprenticeLevelModeThanks15	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}?\\nAre you certain?\\pI see. If that's the case, that's fine.\\nI thank you for your time.\\pI realize I can annoy, but it delights\\nme that you have accepted me.\\pLet us meet again!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem0	{'body': "Sigh… Sob…\\nOh, {PLAYER}!\\pI'm all tangled up in a dilemma\\nthat I can't decide.\\pI can't decide what I should make\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} hold.\\pPlease tell me, {PLAYER}.\\nWhat item should I make it hold?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing0	{'body': "Oh, really? I shouldn't make\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem0	{'body': "Oh, okay! I'm delighted it's settled!\\nAwesome! Wicked! Awoooh!\\pThank you so much!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem0	{'body': "Oh, I'm so glad…\\nI think I have that {STR_VAR_1}, too.\\pI'm delighted it's settled!\\nAwesome! Wicked! Awoooh!\\pThank you so much!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended0	{'body': "Waaaah! Please don't be mean!\\pThat item {STR_VAR_1} was already\\nrecommended to me before, sob…\\pOr do you mean I shouldn't make\\nmy {STR_VAR_2} hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem1	{'body': "Yay! It's {PLAYER}!\\nGreat! I wanted to ask you something!\\pDo you make your POKéMON hold items?\\nI want to make mine hold items, but…\\pWhat item would be good for\\n{STR_VAR_1} to hold?\\pWhat do you think?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing1	{'body': "Huh? You mean my {STR_VAR_1} doesn't\\nhave to hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem1	{'body': "Oh, I get it! I'll do that!\\nThanks for teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem1	{'body': "Oh, wow! One {STR_VAR_1}, huh?\\nOkay, I'll do that!\\pThanks for teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended1	{'body': "Oh, uh, no, that's not what I meant.\\nI want to know about a different item\\lthan the ones I already know.\\pOr do you mean that my POKéMON doesn't\\nhave to hold anything this time?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem2	{'body': "{PLAYER}, hello!\\nIt's about my {STR_VAR_1}…\\pI want to make it hold a good item.\\nWhat would be good for it?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing2	{'body': "Oh, then my {STR_VAR_1} doesn't have\\nto hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem2	{'body': 'Okay, I got it!\\nSee you again!$'}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem2	{'body': "Oh, the item {STR_VAR_1}?\\nUnderstood!\\pI'll do my best to find one!\\nSee you again!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended2	{'body': "Somebody taught me about\\nthe {STR_VAR_1} already.\\pI want my POKéMON to hold a different\\nkind of item.\\pOr do you think {STR_VAR_2} doesn't\\nhave to hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem3	{'body': "Hello, {PLAYER}…\\nI'm sorry to disturb you, but I have\\lsomething else I wanted to ask you.\\pI don't think I'm good enough to win\\nmatches on my own, so I'm thinking of\\lmaking my {STR_VAR_1} hold an item.\\pBut I don't know what would be good.\\p{PLAYER}, please, could you decide\\nfor me?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing3	{'body': 'A POKéMON belonging to someone like me\\nwould be better off without an item?$'}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem3	{'body': "I understand…\\nYou're saying I shouldn't rely on items.\\lI'll do my best not to!\\pThank you very much!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem3	{'body': "The item {STR_VAR_1}, okay.\\nI'm not sure if I can get one…\\lNo! I'll do my best to get it.\\pThank you very much!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended3	{'body': "Oh, but…\\nI think I've heard about that before…\\pIs it maybe because I haven't handled\\nthe item {STR_VAR_1} very well?\\pOr do you mean I shouldn't make\\nmy {STR_VAR_2} hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem4	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nThere's something I wanted to ask you.\\pYou know how you decided which\\nPOKéMON I should have for me?\\pBut I never asked you what item\\nit should be holding.\\pSince you already gave me advice,\\nhow about seeing this to the end?\\pWhat would be good? I want to make\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} hold something.$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing4	{'body': 'Oh! So my {STR_VAR_1} should do\\nthe best it can empty-handed?$'}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem4	{'body': "If you think that's best, I'll do that.\\pKnowing that you made the decision,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\\lI lose.\\pOkay, I'll look to you for advice again.\\nBye!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem4	{'body': "The item {STR_VAR_1}, huh?\\nNot bad. I'll use it!\\pKnowing that you made the decision,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\\lI lose.\\pOkay, I'll look to you for advice again.\\nBye!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended4	{'body': 'Huh? What are you saying?\\nYou told me about the {STR_VAR_1}\\lalready before.\\pOr do you mean my {STR_VAR_2} should\\ndo the best it can empty-handed?$'}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem5	{'body': "Yo, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pWe're both busy, but we seem to run\\ninto each other often anyway!\\pToday I have to do some walking,\\ncleaning, and brushing.\\pI haven't even had the time to buy\\nmy precious {STR_VAR_1} anything.\\pI don't have any time, so how about\\ngiving me advice on what I should make\\lmy {STR_VAR_1} hold?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing5	{'body': "Oh, so me being a busy guy, you say\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} doesn't need anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem5	{'body': "Okay, gotcha.\\nI won't need any time for that.\\pThanks today!\\nSee you around!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem5	{'body': "Okay, gotcha.\\nI'll find time somehow and find\\lthat {STR_VAR_1} you recommended.\\pI'm glad I met a good mentor in you.\\nThanks! See you around!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended5	{'body': "Huh? I already know about\\nthat {STR_VAR_1}.\\pOh, right, I get it.\\nSo me being a busy guy, you say\\lmy {STR_VAR_2} doesn't need anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem6	{'body': "Hiya, {PLAYER}! It's me!\\nI need to tap your mind again today.\\lPlease, I need your advice!\\pDrum roll, please!\\nThe question I have is…\\pIf I want to make my {STR_VAR_1} hold\\nan item, what should it be?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing6	{'body': "Is that right? My {STR_VAR_1} doesn't\\nneed to hold an item, you're saying.$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem6	{'body': "Okay, that's what I'll do!\\pI guess that's about all I wanted\\nto ask you today.\\pLet's meet here again, okay?\\nThanks!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem6	{'body': "Uh-huh! One {STR_VAR_1}.\\nWhat a cool choice!\\lI'll definitely try that!\\pI guess that's about all I wanted\\nto ask you today.\\pLet's meet here again, okay?\\nThanks!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended6	{'body': "Ahahah! That's silly!\\nYou already told me about that\\l{STR_VAR_1} before!\\pAre you feeling okay, {PLAYER}?\\pOh, wait! My {STR_VAR_2} doesn't\\nneed to hold an item, you're saying.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem7	{'body': "Hello, {PLAYER}. I hope you've been\\nkeeping well.\\pMay I approach you for advice?\\pIn a recent battle, my opponent\\nseemed to have given his POKéMON\\lan item to hold.\\pAs a result, I was defeated…\\pI don't wish to be left behind.\\nI would like to make my {STR_VAR_1}\\lhold an item, too.\\pIt would please me if you could decide\\nwhat would be right for my POKéMON…$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing7	{'body': 'In other words… My POKéMON has\\nno need to hold an item?$'}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem7	{'body': 'I understand clearly now!\\nI will keep trying like this.\\pThank you, {PLAYER}.\\nI hope I can count on you again.\\lPlease take care!$'}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem7	{'body': 'One {STR_VAR_1} it is!\\nI will order it right away.\\pThank you, {PLAYER}.\\nI hope I can count on you again.\\lPlease take care!$'}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended7	{'body': "You've already told me about that,\\nand I already have it.\\pOr are you saying… My POKéMON has\\nno need to hold an item?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem8	{'body': "Eek! {PLAYER}!\\nI… I'm overjoyed to see you again!\\pOh-oh-oh! There's something I just\\nhad to ask you, {PLAYER}!\\pPlease decide what my {STR_VAR_1}\\nshould be holding!$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing8	{'body': "Oh, wow! I didn't expect that answer!\\nSo, a hold item isn't necessary?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem8	{'body': "Perfectly understood!\\nI'll keep at this without an item!\\pI hope you'll be willing to teach me\\nsome more another time.$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem8	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}! I'll use that!\\pUm… Could it be, {PLAYER}, you also\\nmake your POKéMON hold that item?\\pI'll be sure to get it!\\nI hope you'll be willing to teach me\\lsome more another time.$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended8	{'body': "Oh? You recommended that\\n{STR_VAR_1} before, too.\\pOr is it the best thing to hold?\\nOr do you mean that my {STR_VAR_2}\\ldoesn't need anything to hold?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem9	{'body': "Hola!\\nMy maestro, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pI want to hit you up for advice on\\nPOKéMON tools.\\pWhat do you think would be good for\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} to hold?\\pDon't be shy now.\\nLet's blurt it out!$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing9	{'body': "Oh? So, you're saying my {STR_VAR_1}\\ncan win without holding any item?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem9	{'body': "Si, bueno!\\nI'll give it my best shot, like, slam!\\pAll right, thanks, as always!\\nAdios!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem9	{'body': "Uh-huh, that's one {STR_VAR_1}?\\nSi, bueno!\\lI'll go find me one, like, bam!\\pAll right, thanks, as always!\\nAdios!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended9	{'body': "No, no! You already told me about\\nthat {STR_VAR_1} thing before.\\pOh, now wait just one minute here…\\nSo, you're saying my {STR_VAR_2}\\lcan win without holding any item?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem10	{'body': "{PLAYER}{KUN}, something unbelievable\\nhas happened!\\pI woke up this morning, and my POKéMON\\nhad 10 NUGGETS!\\pOf course I'm lying!\\nWahahaha!\\pThis is no lie, though.\\nI'm not very good at thinking about\\lwhat items POKéMON should hold.\\pSo, how about deciding for me what\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} should hold, master?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing10	{'body': "What's that mean?\\nDon't make it hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem10	{'body': "Okay, so it shouldn't hold anything.\\nThen, I'd better get something for it!\\pJust kidding!\\nI'll obey your teaching, master!\\pThanks, master!\\nI hope you'll keep teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem10	{'body': "Okay, so it's one {STR_VAR_1}!\\nI'll make it hold anything but that!\\pJust kidding!\\nI'll obey your teaching, master!\\pThanks, master!\\nI hope you'll keep teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended10	{'body': "Um, you told me about that before,\\ndidn't you?\\pIsn't there something else?\\pOr do you mean, don't make\\nmy {STR_VAR_2} hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem11	{'body': "A-H-O-Y!\\nAnd that spells ahoy!\\pThe rappin' SAILOR am I!\\nI present to you a question\\lthat's pretty fly!\\pIt's an item question\\nthat begs your suggestion!\\pMy {STR_VAR_1} needs an item to hold,\\nWhat should it be, if I may be bold?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing11	{'body': "Is that right?\\nMy {STR_VAR_1} doesn't need to be\\lholding anything tight?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem11	{'body': "Okay, I hear you, sure I do!\\nMy POKéMON will go empty-handed, too!\\pIf it's advice I ever need,\\n{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem11	{'body': "Okay, one {STR_VAR_1},\\nthat's what I'll use.\\lI was right to make you choose!\\pIf it's advice I ever need,\\n{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended11	{'body': "Okay, one {STR_VAR_1}, you say?\\nYou told me that the other day.\\lI need a new idea, a brand new way.\\pOr, what, is that right?\\nMy POKéMON doesn't need to hold\\lanything tight?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem12	{'body': "Say, hey, {PLAYER}!\\nI found you again today!\\pWhat should I do? Get your advice?\\nWhy not? I'm already talking to you!\\p{PLAYER}, are you getting sick of me?\\nNah, no way, that can't be.\\pWill you hear me out?\\nI'm looking for advice--that's what\\lI'm talking about.\\pIt's about a hold item for\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} that'd be good.\\lMy indecision is making me brood.$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing12	{'body': "My {STR_VAR_1} needs nothing?\\nDoesn't need to hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem12	{'body': "If holding nothing is the best,\\nI'll do as you suggest!\\pWell, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\\nbut don't you forget about me.\\pSee you again, my smart friend!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem12	{'body': "If holding that {STR_VAR_1} is\\nthe best, I'll do as you suggest!\\pWell, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\\nbut don't you forget about me.\\pSee you again, my smart friend!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended12	{'body': "Haven't I heard about that\\n{STR_VAR_1} before?\\lI'm certain I have, that's for sure!\\pI need a new something!\\nOr, my {STR_VAR_2} needs nothing?\\lDoesn't need to hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem13	{'body': "Gwah! Ouch! {PLAYER}{KUN}, my arm's broken!\\nDon't touch it, please!\\pI must've broken it while I was trying\\nout different hold items with my posse\\lof POKéMON.\\pSo, things being this way,\\nI need you to decide for me.\\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, what do you think would be\\ngood for my {STR_VAR_1} to hold?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing13	{'body': "Ouch…\\pSo your suggestion is my {STR_VAR_1}\\ndoesn't have to hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem13	{'body': 'Hm, all right. That would be easier\\nfor me, the way things are now.\\pI hope I can keep hitting you up\\nfor help like this.$'}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem13	{'body': "Hm, all right. That's one {STR_VAR_1}.\\nMy POKéMON's arm is fine, so I'll make\\lit hold that item right away.\\pI hope I can keep hitting you up\\nfor help like this.$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended13	{'body': "No, no, you told me about that\\n{STR_VAR_1} before, remember?\\pHow about telling me something\\neven better?\\pOh, wait a second.\\nSo your suggestion is my {STR_VAR_2}\\ldoesn't have to hold anything?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem14	{'body': "Er… Um…\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}…\\pPlease, don't look at me that way.\\nMy POKéMON don't have anything.\\pI… I'm really embarrassed about this,\\nbut I really need your advice.\\pI can't decide what hold item would\\nmake my {STR_VAR_1} strong.\\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, what do you think would\\nbe good?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing14	{'body': "Oh… Then, you think it would be better\\nif my {STR_VAR_1} didn't have an item?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem14	{'body': "Oh… Okay!\\nI'll go without an item.\\pThis is nerve-racking, though.\\nWouldn't it be too cool?\\pThank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nIf we meet again, I hope you will be\\las helpful.$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem14	{'body': "Oh… Okay!\\nI'll go with that {STR_VAR_1}.\\pThis is nerve-racking, though.\\nWouldn't it be too cool?\\pThank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nIf we meet again, I hope you will be\\las helpful.$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended14	{'body': "B-but I already heard about that.\\pPlease don't brush me off like this!\\nI can't live with the humiliation.\\pOh… Am I jumping to conclusions?\\nDo you think it would be better if\\lmy {STR_VAR_2} didn't have an item?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhatHeldItem15	{'body': "Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nBut are you really?\\lPerhaps you're a twin?\\pOh, no, no, no, don't worry!\\nIf you really are {PLAYER}, please\\lforget about my rudeness.\\pWhat I would like is some more of\\nyour fine advice.\\pI have here my {STR_VAR_1} that I wish\\nto make hold a convenient item.\\pWhat would be worthy of it?$"}
text:gApprenticeHoldNothing15	{'body': "It's better if it held nothing?\\nAre you certain?$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem15	{'body': "I see. If that's the case, that's fine.\\nI thank you for your time.\\pLet us meet again!$"}
text:gApprenticeThanksHeldItem15	{'body': "One {STR_VAR_1}?\\nAre you certain?\\pI see. If that's the case, that's fine.\\nI thank you for your time.\\pI do hope my POKéMON will be able to\\nput it to good use.\\pLet us meet again!$"}
text:gApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended15	{'body': "No, no, wait a minute.\\nI believe you taught me that before.\\pI would like you to recommend\\nsomething different this time.\\pPerhaps you're suggesting that\\nmy {STR_VAR_2} should hold nothing?\\lAre you certain?$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst0	{'body': "Waah, {PLAYER}!\\nI have a dilemma, sob…\\pI want to begin battling other people,\\nbut I don't know what to do.\\pHow should I line up my POKéMON\\nso they'll be at their strongest?\\pPlease tell me, {PLAYER}.\\nIf you were me, which of these POKéMON\\lwould you send out first?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks0	{'body': "My {STR_VAR_1} should go first?\\nWaaaaah!\\pOh! I'm so sorry!\\nYou've made me happy by choosing\\lmy first POKéMON, and it's made me cry…\\pThank you so much!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst1	{'body': "Yay! It's {PLAYER}!\\nGreat! I wanted to ask you something!\\pUm, of my POKéMON, which do you\\nthink should go out first?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks1	{'body': "My {STR_VAR_1}? That's true.\\nOkay, I'll do that!\\pThanks for teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst2	{'body': "{PLAYER}, hello!\\pI think, in a battle, it's very important\\nwhich POKéMON comes out first.\\pOut of the POKéMON that I have,\\nwhich would be good to send out first?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks2	{'body': 'My {STR_VAR_1} goes first?\\nOkay, I got it!\\pSee you again!$'}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst3	{'body': "Hello, {PLAYER}…\\nI'm sorry to disturb you again with\\lanother question.\\pI have so little confidence, I don't\\nknow what I'd do without you, {PLAYER}.\\pIt may be a waste of time for me to\\neven worry about it, but I just can't\\ldecide something…\\pWhich of my POKéMON should I send\\nout first in a battle?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks3	{'body': "My {STR_VAR_1}?\\nUnderstood!\\pI can't believe that you would bother\\nto answer my questions so often!\\pI'm so grateful that you would even\\nspeak with me… Thank you!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst4	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}! It's me!\\nI'm so glad to see you because I have\\lthis little problem.\\pI can't decide how my POKéMON should\\nbe lined up. Could you decide for me?\\pOh, you don't need to decide the whole\\nparty right now.\\pHow about deciding just the first\\nPOKéMON for me?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks4	{'body': "My {STR_VAR_1}? That's great!\\pKnowing that you made the decision,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\\lI lose.\\pOkay, I'll look to you for advice again.\\nBye!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst5	{'body': "Hi, my teacher {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nI'm busy again today!\\pI have to do some cycling, shopping,\\nand humming.\\pI haven't even had the time to decide\\nhow to line up my POKéMON team.\\pSo, how about checking out my team?\\nWhich one should go first?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks5	{'body': "Okay, gotcha.\\nI have enough time at least to put\\lmy {STR_VAR_1} at the head of the line!\\pWhoops, my girlfriend's waiting!\\nThanks! See you around!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst6	{'body': "Yoohoo! Hiya, {PLAYER}!\\nYou always walk around looking tough!\\pListen, I need something from you\\nagain! It's the usual thing!\\pDrum roll, please!\\nThe question I have is about my team.\\pWhich POKéMON of mine should be first\\nto go out in a battle?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks6	{'body': "Hmhm!\\nMy {STR_VAR_1}, you say!\\lThanks for a most cool answer!\\pI guess that's about all I wanted\\nto ask you today.\\pLet's meet here again, okay?\\nThanks!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst7	{'body': "Thank you so much for stopping to\\nchat with me, {PLAYER}.\\pI know I'm taking advantage of your\\nkindness, but may I ask for advice?\\pI would like you to decide on the order\\nof my POKéMON team.\\pIt would please me if you could decide\\nwhich POKéMON should come first.$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks7	{'body': 'My {STR_VAR_1} it is!\\nI will put it first right away!\\pThank you, {PLAYER}.\\nI hope I can count on you again.\\lPlease take care!$'}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst8	{'body': "Eek! {PLAYER}!\\nI… I'm overjoyed to see you again!\\pMy POKéMON have become much\\nstronger!\\pBut I don't always win. It seems to\\ndepend on which POKéMON goes first.\\p{PLAYER}, please, I need your help!\\pPlease decide which of my POKéMON\\nshould go out first!$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks8	{'body': "Sigh… I'm overwhelmed with happiness…\\pIt's like a dream having you decide\\nfor me, {PLAYER}.\\pBut perfectly understood!\\nI will go with my {STR_VAR_1} first!\\pI hope you'll be willing to teach me\\nsome more another time.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst9	{'body': "Hello, hello!\\nMy mentor, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\lHit me with your sage advice today!\\pYou see, I pulled together a team of\\nthree POKéMON. So far so good.\\pBut the team's battling order's not\\nsettled yet.\\pThis is where you come in, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nYou decide which POKéMON leads off!\\pDon't be shy now.\\nLet's blurt it out!$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks9	{'body': "Uh-huh, my {STR_VAR_1} leads off!\\nOK, A-OK!\\lI'll reorder the lineup, like, wham!\\pAll right, thanks, as always!\\nAdios!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst10	{'body': "{PLAYER}{KUN}, listen!\\nIt's a crisis!\\pMy POKéMON, all three of them, go into\\nbattle at once!\\pOf course that's impossible!\\nWahahaha!\\pThis is no lie, though.\\nI'm not very good at thinking about\\lhow I should line up my POKéMON.\\pSo, how about deciding for me which\\nPOKéMON should go first, master?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks10	{'body': "Okay, so it's my {STR_VAR_1} you chose?\\nI'll let any but that one go first!\\pJust kidding!\\nI'll obey your teaching, master!\\pThanks, master!\\nI hope you'll keep teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst11	{'body': "A-H-O-Y!\\nAnd that spells ahoy!\\pThe rappin' SAILOR am I!\\nI present to you a question\\lthat's pretty fly!\\pIt's a team lineup question\\nthat begs your suggestion!\\pOut of this lot, which should go first\\nas the first on the spot?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks11	{'body': "Okay, I hear you, sure I do!\\nI'll switch them up, that I'll do!\\pIf it's advice I ever need,\\n{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst12	{'body': 'Yahoo, {PLAYER}!\\nHow do you do?\\pWhat should I do? Go ahead and ask?\\nUh-huh, I have something to ask!\\lAre you receiving me?\\lYou are receiving me!\\pYou have to decide, which of my\\nPOKéMON is the first to ride!\\lInto battle, I mean to say.$'}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks12	{'body': "My {STR_VAR_1}? Yes!\\nThat'll do, there's no distress!\\pWell, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\\nbut don't you forget about me.\\pSee you again, my smart friend!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst13	{'body': "…Oof…ooch… {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nMy stomach's hurting all of a sudden…\\p…It's getting better now…\\pI must've worried myself sick racking\\nmy brains on how I should line up\\lmy posse of POKéMON.\\pSo, things being this way,\\nI need you to decide for me.\\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, which of my POKéMON should\\ngo first? So I'd win, I mean.$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks13	{'body': "Hm, all right.\\nMy {STR_VAR_1} goes first.\\pI'll fix the lineup like that after\\nI have my supper.\\pI hope I can keep hitting you up\\nfor help like this.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst14	{'body': "Er… Um…\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}?\\pPlease, don't look at me that way.\\nYou're making me feel all flustered.\\pUm…\\nI really need your advice.\\pIt makes me bashful to say this,\\nbut I chose my 3-POKéMON team.\\lI can't decide on the order, though.\\pWhich POKéMON should I send out first\\nso I at least look capable?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks14	{'body': "Oh… Okay!\\nI'll lead with my {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI hope I can do my best without\\ngetting all flustered.\\pThank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nIf we meet again, I hope you will be\\las helpful.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMonFirst15	{'body': "Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nBut are you really?\\lPerhaps you're a clever look-alike?\\pOh, no, no, no, don't worry!\\nIf you really are {PLAYER}, please\\lforget about my rudeness.\\pWhat I would like is your fine advice.\\pI have here my POKéMON team.\\nI would like you to tell me which one\\lshould go first in a battle.$"}
text:gApprenticeMonFirstThanks15	{'body': "My {STR_VAR_1}…\\nYou aren't pulling my leg?\\pI see. If that's the case, that's fine.\\nI thank you for your time.\\pI am as you see, but I shall do\\nmy best.\\pLet us meet again!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon0	{'body': "Snivel…\\nOh, {PLAYER}!\\pWhat perfect timing!\\nThere's something I just can't decide…\\pI can't decide which POKéMON I should\\nbe using.\\pI can't decide between the POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}…\\p{PLAYER}, which do you think will give\\neven me a chance at winning?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks0	{'body': "Snivel… I… I understand!\\nOh! I'm so sorry!\\lYou've made me so happy, I'm crying…\\pI'll do my best to catch one\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pThank you so much!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon1	{'body': "Yay! It's {PLAYER}!\\nYay, you came at the right time, too!\\lI need your advice again!\\pUm, I'm all mixed up--should I use\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}…\\pWhich do you think I should raise,\\n{PLAYER}?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks1	{'body': "Oh, so my {STR_VAR_1} is better!\\nOkay, I'll do that!\\pThanks for teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon2	{'body': "{PLAYER}, hello!\\nI have a question I wanted to ask.\\pI'm in a dilemma over whether I should\\nraise one {STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}.\\pWhich POKéMON do you think will\\nbe stronger?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks2	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1} is your choice?\\nOkay, I got it!\\pI'll go catch a strong {STR_VAR_1}\\nright away!\\pSee you again!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon3	{'body': "Hello, {PLAYER}…\\pUm, you've probably already forgotten\\nabout someone like me…\\p…But that doesn't matter if you\\ncould give me advice…\\pI can't decide on the one kind of\\nPOKéMON I should raise…\\pI've narrowed the field to the POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}, but that's\\lwhere I became stuck…\\p{PLAYER}, you probably don't want to\\nbother, but please decide for me.$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks3	{'body': "But will a wild {STR_VAR_1} even pay\\nattention to me?\\pI will try!\\pBut will I even be able to catch one…\\nNo! I'll do my best!\\pThank you!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon4	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}! I'm so glad to see you!\\nI was about to go looking for you!\\pCan you decide what kind of POKéMON\\nI should use?\\pFor instance…\\nHow about the POKéMON {STR_VAR_1}\\land {STR_VAR_2}?\\pWhich one do you think would be\\nbetter?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks4	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}? That's great!\\pKnowing that you made the decision,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\\lI lose.\\pOkay, I'll look to you for advice again.\\nBye!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon5	{'body': "If it isn't {PLAYER}{KUN}! How's it going?\\nI'm busy again as always!\\pI want to do good with POKéMON, too,\\nbut I haven't been able to decide\\lwhich POKéMON I should use.\\pYou know how {STR_VAR_1} look strong?\\nBut {STR_VAR_2} are tough to ignore.\\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, give me some of your good\\nadvice! Which one'd be good for me?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks5	{'body': "Okay, gotcha.\\nI'll find time somehow and catch me\\lthat {STR_VAR_1} you recommended.\\pI'm glad I met a good mentor in you.\\nThanks! See you around!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon6	{'body': "Oh!\\nYay, it's {PLAYER}!\\pI didn't waste any time boasting to\\nmy friends about meeting you!\\pI need to tap your mind again today.\\nIt's an easy one for you!\\pDrum roll, please!\\nThe question I have is…\\pIf I were to raise a POKéMON,\\nand the choices were one {STR_VAR_1}\\lor {STR_VAR_2}, which should it be?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks6	{'body': "Ahhh!\\n{STR_VAR_1}, you say!\\lThanks for a most cool answer!\\pI guess that's about all I wanted\\nto ask you today.\\pLet's meet here again, okay?\\nThanks!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon7	{'body': "Oh, is it you, {PLAYER}?\\nI'm delighted to see you again!\\pEver since I became your apprentice,\\nmy confidence has been blooming.\\pI think I'm ready to raise a POKéMON\\nof my own!\\p{PLAYER}, may I impose on you to choose\\nwhich POKéMON I should raise?\\pThe choices are the POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}…\\lWhich POKéMON is right for me?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks7	{'body': 'One {STR_VAR_1} it is!\\nI will find one right away!\\pThank you, {PLAYER}.\\nI hope I can count on you again.\\lPlease take care!$'}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon8	{'body': "Eek! {PLAYER}! I met you again!\\nI… I'm overjoyed!\\pOh-oh-oh, I know!\\nI shouldn't pass up this opportunity!\\pMay I ask a huge favor, {PLAYER}?\\nPlease choose a POKéMON for me!\\pPlease decide which would be better,\\n{STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}!$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks8	{'body': "Wow! You decided for me!\\nOne {STR_VAR_1} is what I'll raise to\\lthe best of my ability.\\pI hope you'll be willing to teach me\\nsome more another time.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon9	{'body': "Hey, hey!\\nMy mentor, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pHello, I've been looking for you\\nfor some more of your sage advice!\\pWhich kind of POKéMON would be right\\nfor me, one {STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}?\\pDon't be shy now.\\nLet's blurt it out!$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks9	{'body': "Uh-huh, one {STR_VAR_1} it is!\\nOK, A-OK!\\lI'll get one in a BALL, like, cram!\\pAll right, thanks, as always!\\nAdios!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon10	{'body': "{PLAYER}{KUN}, listen! Big news!\\nI caught a mirage POKéMON!\\pOf course I'm lying!\\nWahahaha!\\pThis is no lie, though.\\nI'm not very good at catching\\lPOKéMON.\\pSo, how about deciding for me which\\nkind of POKéMON I should catch,\\lmaster?\\pWhich would be better?\\n{STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks10	{'body': "Okay, so it's {STR_VAR_1} you chose?\\nI'll grab the other kind, then!\\pJust kidding!\\nI'll obey your teaching, master!\\pThanks, master!\\nI hope you'll keep teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon11	{'body': "A-H-O-Y!\\nAnd that spells ahoy!\\pThe rappin' SAILOR am I!\\nSurely you remember who am I?\\pToday, I have a POKéMON question\\nthat begs your suggestion!\\pI have the choice between this\\n{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}, you see.\\lWhich is the one to catch for me?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks11	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}, you say, hey, hey!\\nI'll go get me one right away!\\pIf it's advice I ever need,\\n{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon12	{'body': "Oh, wow, if it isn't {PLAYER}!\\pWhat should I do? Get your advice?\\nWhy not? I'm already talking to you!\\pIt's been a long time. Let me break\\nthe ice. I'm also looking for advice!\\lAre you receiving me?\\lYou are receiving me!\\pMy POKéMON--which should I use?\\nIt's either {STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}.\\lWhich do you choose?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks12	{'body': "If that {STR_VAR_1} is the best,\\nI'll do as you suggest!\\pWell, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\\nbut don't you forget about me.\\pSee you again, my smart friend!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon13	{'body': "Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nI have this horrible headache…\\pI must've worried too much about\\nthe kind of POKéMON I should raise.\\pSo, things being this way,\\nI need you to decide for me.\\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, if I had to choose between\\nthe POKéMON {STR_VAR_1} and\\l{STR_VAR_2}, which should it be?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks13	{'body': "Hm, one {STR_VAR_1}, all right.\\nI'll go look for one when I get better.\\pI hope I can keep hitting you up\\nfor help like this.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon14	{'body': "Er… Um…\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}…?\\pPlease, don't look at me that way.\\nI'm getting all flustered…\\lI… I need your advice.\\pI… I'm really embarrassed, but I can't\\ndecide which POKéMON to use.\\pIf the choices were {STR_VAR_1} or\\n{STR_VAR_2}, which would be better?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks14	{'body': "Oh… Okay!\\nI'll do my best with one {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI hope I can do my best without\\ngetting all flustered.\\pThank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nIf we meet again, I hope you will be\\las helpful.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMon15	{'body': "Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nBut are you really real?\\pNo, no, if you are real, it's fine.\\nIncidentally, I would like to obtain\\lyour advice.\\pIt's about the POKéMON I am to use.\\pIf the choices are the POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}, which is\\lmore worthy of me?$"}
text:gApprenticeMonThanks15	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}?\\nAre you certain?\\pI see. If that's the case, that's fine.\\nI thank you for your time.\\pI do hope it is something even I can\\nhandle with aplomb.\\pLet us meet again!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove0	{'body': "Waaah! Oh, {PLAYER}!\\nSnivel… Hiccup…\\pI have a dilemma!\\nI can't decide on a move for\\lmy {STR_VAR_1}…\\pPlease, please, {PLAYER}.\\nCan you decide for me?\\pFor my {STR_VAR_1}, which move would\\nbe the better choice: {STR_VAR_2}\\lor {STR_VAR_3}?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks0	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}?\\nWaaaaah!\\pOh! I'm so sorry, {PLAYER}!\\nYou've made me so happy by deciding\\lthe move, I'm crying…\\pSnivel…\\nThank you so much!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove1	{'body': "Yay! Hi, {PLAYER}!\\nI need your advice again!\\pI want to teach my {STR_VAR_1}\\na cool move.\\pI like either of the moves\\n{STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}.\\lWhat's your recommendation?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks1	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1} is better? I guess so!\\nOkay, I'll go with that!\\pIf we meet here again, please teach\\nme something else, teacher!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove2	{'body': "{PLAYER}, hello!\\nIt's about my {STR_VAR_1}, but I'm\\lworried about its moves.\\pYou see, it's the moves {STR_VAR_2}\\nand {STR_VAR_3}.\\pWhich is stronger and better for\\nmy {STR_VAR_1}?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks2	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1} is your choice?\\nOkay, I got it!\\pI'll go teach {STR_VAR_1} to\\nmy POKéMON right away!\\pSee you again!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove3	{'body': "Ohhh, {PLAYER}…\\nI'm hopeless, no, really!\\pI've decided to raise a POKéMON,\\nbut now I can't even decide what\\lmove I should let it learn…\\pI know that it doesn't mean anything\\nto you, {PLAYER}.\\pBut it means a lot to me…\\pPlease, {PLAYER}, could you choose\\na move for my {STR_VAR_1}?\\pIf you could even choose between\\n{STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_3}…$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks3	{'body': "I understand!\\pBut will it even be willing to learn\\n{STR_VAR_1} for me…\\lNo! I'll do my best!\\pThank you!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove4	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nI was just hoping to see you, too!\\pI was wondering what move would\\nbe suitable for my {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI can't decide, so can you decide\\nfor me instead?\\pFor instance… How about the moves\\n{STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_3}?\\lWhich one would be better?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks4	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}? That's great!\\pKnowing that you made the decision,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\\lI lose.\\pOkay, I'll look to you for advice again.\\nBye!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove5	{'body': "How could things be this busy?\\nHey, if it isn't {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\lHow's it going?\\pSince I got up this morning, I've done\\nmy jogging, swimming, and cooking!\\pYou wouldn't believe how busy I am!\\pI can't even decide what move\\nmy {STR_VAR_1} should learn!\\p{STR_VAR_2} looks good, huh?\\nBut {STR_VAR_3}'s also decent.\\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, give me some of your good\\nadvice! Which move'd be good for me?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks5	{'body': "Okay, gotcha.\\nI'll make room in my schedule and\\lteach that move.\\pI'm glad I met a good mentor in you.\\nThanks! See you around!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove6	{'body': 'Oh! Lucky!\\nI met you again, {PLAYER}!\\lI need to tap your mind again today.\\pDrum roll, please!\\nThe question I have is…\\pFor my {STR_VAR_1}, which is the move\\nbest suited, {STR_VAR_2} or\\l{STR_VAR_3}?$'}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks6	{'body': "Ahhh!\\n{STR_VAR_1}, you say!\\lThanks for a most cool answer!\\pI guess that's about all I wanted\\nto ask you today.\\pLet's meet here again, okay?\\nThanks!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove7	{'body': "Oh, hello, {PLAYER}.\\nI trust you've been well?\\pI have to seek your advice again.\\nIt's about my dearest {STR_VAR_1}.\\pWhat would be the ideal move for\\nmy lovable {STR_VAR_1}?\\l{STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks7	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1} it is!\\nI will teach that right away!\\pThank you, {PLAYER}.\\nI hope I can count on you again.\\lPlease take care!$'}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove8	{'body': "Eek! {PLAYER}! I met you again!\\nI… I'm overjoyed!\\pWhenever I'm in need, you're always\\nthere for me, {PLAYER}!\\pToday, I want you to recommend\\na move for me!\\pPlease choose a move for\\nmy {STR_VAR_1}!\\pWhich move would be better,\\n{STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks8	{'body': "Oh-oh-oh! Thank you!\\n{STR_VAR_1} is it!\\lPerfectly understood!\\pI hope you'll be willing to teach me\\nsome more another time.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove9	{'body': "Hola, {PLAYER}{KUN}, bueno!\\nI'm hoping for some more of\\lyour sage advice today!\\pWhat would be the best move for\\nmy {STR_VAR_1}?\\pIt should be something that'll\\nlet me win just like that!\\pWould it be {STR_VAR_2}?\\nOr {STR_VAR_3}?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks9	{'body': "Uh-huh, {STR_VAR_1} it is!\\nSi, bueno!\\lI'll get it taught, like, ka-blam!\\pAll right, thanks, as always!\\nAdios!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove10	{'body': "{PLAYER}{KUN}, it's completely wild!\\pMy POKéMON!\\nIt learned six moves!\\pOf course I'm lying!\\nWahahaha!\\pThis is no lie, though.\\nI'm not very good at choosing moves\\lfor my POKéMON.\\pSo, how about deciding for me which\\nkind of move I should teach?\\p{STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}--which\\nwould go with my {STR_VAR_1} best?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks10	{'body': "Okay, so it's {STR_VAR_1} you chose?\\nI'll choose another move, then!\\pJust kidding!\\nI'll obey your teaching, master!\\pThanks, master!\\nI hope you'll keep teaching me!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove11	{'body': "A-H-O-Y!\\nAnd that spells ahoy!\\pThe rappin' SAILOR am I!\\nI'm always with it, don't ask me why.\\pToday, I have a move question\\nthat begs your suggestion!\\p{STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_3} are\\nthe moves. What would be the best\\lfor my {STR_VAR_1} so it grooves?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks11	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}, you say, hey, hey!\\nI'll go teach that right away!\\pIf it's advice I ever need,\\n{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove12	{'body': "Oh, yeahah, if it isn't {PLAYER}!\\pWhat should I do? Get your advice?\\nWhy not? I'm already talking to you!\\p{PLAYER}, are you surprised by me?\\nI want your advice, can't you see?\\pAre you receiving me?\\nYou are receiving me!\\pMy {STR_VAR_1}--what should it use?\\nIt's {STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3},\\lwhat do you choose?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks12	{'body': "If that {STR_VAR_1} is the best,\\nI'll do as you suggest!\\pWell, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\\nbut don't you forget about me.\\pSee you again, my smart friend!$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove13	{'body': "Gahack! Gaah! Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nI have this lousy cold, I do…\\pI want to pick a move for my POKéMON,\\nbut I'm not up to it…\\pSo, things being this way,\\nI need you to decide for me.\\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, if I had to choose between\\n{STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_3} for\\lmy {STR_VAR_1}, which would it be?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks13	{'body': "Hm, {STR_VAR_1}, all right. Cough!\\nI'll go teach it when I get better.\\pI hope I can keep hitting you up\\nfor help like this.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove14	{'body': "Er… Um…\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}…?\\pPlease, don't look at me that way.\\nI'm getting all flustered…\\lI… I need your advice.\\pI… I'm really embarrassed, but I can't\\ndecide what move I should teach\\lmy POKéMON.\\pIt's for my {STR_VAR_1}.\\nIf the choices were {STR_VAR_2} or\\l{STR_VAR_3}, which would be better?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks14	{'body': "Oh… Okay!\\nI'll try that {STR_VAR_1}.\\pI hope I can teach that move…\\nThis is so nerve-racking…\\pThank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nIf we meet again, I hope you will be\\las helpful.$"}
text:gApprenticeWhichMove15	{'body': "Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nBut are you really real?\\pPerhaps you're one of those popular\\nmimics?\\pNo, no, if you are real, it's fine.\\nNo need to be upset, I assure you!\\pIncidentally, I would like to obtain\\nyour advice.\\pIt's about my {STR_VAR_1}.\\pWhich move would be better for it to\\nuse, {STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}?$"}
text:gApprenticeMoveThanks15	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}?\\nThere's no question about that?\\pI see. If that's the case, that's fine.\\nI thank you for your time.\\pI do hope it is something even\\nmy POKéMON can learn.\\pLet us meet again!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech0	{'body': "Oh… {PLAYER}?\\nIt is {PLAYER}!\\lOh! Sniff…sob… Please, listen!\\pI… When I battle, I get so nervous,\\nI can't help crying even if I win…\\pI wish I could say something cool\\nwhen I win…\\pPlease, please, {PLAYER}!\\nCould you maybe teach me something\\lcool to say when I win so I don't cry?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks0	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pAwesome! Wicked! Awoooh!\\nIt's really cool!\\pOh… I'm sorry…\\nI'm so happy, I'm crying…\\pSnivel… {PLAYER}!\\nThank you so much for everything!\\pI will battle the best I can for\\nyour sake, {PLAYER}!\\p{PLAYER}…\\nNext time… We should battle!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech1	{'body': "Yay! It's {PLAYER}! Hello!\\nI wanted to ask you something!\\pI want to say something cool when\\nI win a match.\\pDo you have a cool saying that\\nyou could recommend?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks1	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pOh, wow! That is so cool!\\nOkay, I'll say that!\\pThanks for teaching me all this time!\\nI'm going to do the best I can\\lwherever I go from now on!\\pWhen we meet again, it'll be for\\na battle!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech2	{'body': '{PLAYER}, hello!\\pMy POKéMON and I are ready for\\nanything, except for one thing.\\pI think it would be good if I had\\nsomething to shout when I win.\\pCould you think up something good\\nto say?$'}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks2	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\p…Cool!\\nI will use that!\\pI'm going out to battle all over\\nthe place.\\pWho knows, I may even get to battle\\nyou one day, {PLAYER}.\\pNext time, let's meet at a place\\nof battle!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech3	{'body': "Hello, {PLAYER}…\\nI'm sorry to bug you, but I'm hopeless…\\pEven when…\\nEven when I win, I don't have anything\\lspecial to say…\\pI know that it doesn't mean anything\\nto you, {PLAYER}.\\pBut it means a lot to me…\\pPlease, {PLAYER}, what should I say\\nif I win a battle?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks3	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pThat's inspired…\\pUh… Is it okay for someone like me\\nto even say that?\\pNo! I'll do my best!\\p{PLAYER}, thank you so much for\\nputting up with me for so long…\\pI promise to do my best from now on.\\pI'm sure you'll quickly forget about\\nsomeone like me, but let's meet\\lsomewhere again!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech4	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nThere's something I want you to hear.\\pI know that I don't always sound\\nnice or polite…\\pWhen I win a battle, I think I come\\nacross as being arrogant.\\pI don't want people to dislike me,\\nso I want to say something nice to\\lsomeone I beat.\\pBut I can't think of anything good!\\nCould you think something up for me?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks4	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pNot bad!\\nYup, that's what I'll go with!\\pI'm going to hit the road and do what\\nI can with what you taught me in\\lmy head and heart.\\pI'm sorry that I've been so pushy\\nwith you!\\pNext time, we battle, okay?\\nSee you!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech5	{'body': "Oh, I can't get over how busy I am!\\nOh, hey, I was looking for you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\pAre you well as usual?\\nThings haven't changed for me at all.\\pI've got running, fighting, and mapping\\nto do. Why am I so busy?\\pBut even though I'm busy, it'd be rude\\nto just turn on my heels and walk away\\lfrom a win without saying a word.\\pSo, what would be a cool saying to\\nunderline my coolness when I'm done\\land walking away? {PLAYER}{KUN}, help me!$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks5	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pOkay, gotcha.\\nI can find time to say that!\\pHonestly, I'm glad I met a good mentor\\nlike you.\\pI'm going to make time somehow so\\nI can get into battling.\\pThanks for everything, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\\nWe have to battle, you and me, one day!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech6	{'body': 'I lucked out again!\\n{PLAYER}! Am I glad to see you!\\lLike usual, I need your advice!\\pDrum roll, please!\\nThe last question I have is…\\pIf I win a battle and want to end\\nit with a cool flourish, what\\lshould I say?$'}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks6	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pThat… That's fabulous!\\nIt's dignified and cool! I claim it!\\p…Listen, I think I'm getting decent\\nat this, huh?\\pSo, I'm thinking of challenging other\\nTRAINERS from now on.\\p{PLAYER}, your advice really helped me.\\pMaybe one day, there'll be a time when\\nwe battle!\\pThank you for everything!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech7	{'body': "Oh, {PLAYER}.\\nI'm so glad I met you!\\pI no longer have any concerns with\\nregard to my POKéMON.\\pIt's myself that worries me…\\pDo you know how a TRAINER says\\na few things upon winning a battle?\\pDefinitely, I wish I could do that,\\ntoo!\\pPlease, what should I say when\\nI win a battle?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks7	{'body': '{STR_VAR_1}\\pAh! That saying! It refreshes me\\nand makes me feel reborn!\\pI must use that right away!\\pAnd now, I must take my leave,\\n{PLAYER}…\\pI will go out to battle many others,\\nbut never will I forget your teachings.\\pPerhaps one day…\\nFarewell!$'}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech8	{'body': "Eek! I spotted {PLAYER}!\\nI… I'm overjoyed to see you!\\pOh-oh-oh! There's something I just\\nhad to ask you!\\pA little while ago, I won a battle.\\nThat part was giddying!\\pBut it made me so overjoyed that\\nI choked up and couldn't say a thing!\\pSo now, {PLAYER}, please, I want you to\\nthink up an exit line for when I win!$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks8	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pWaaaaah!\\nI'm going to say that?!\\lI… I'm delirious with joy!\\pTh-th-thank you!\\nI have nothing left to regret now!\\pI'm going to travel now and battle\\nall sorts of people.\\pEverything, I owe it to you, {PLAYER}.\\nReally, really, thank you!\\pI've got to go now, but let's meet\\nin battle one day!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech9	{'body': "Hola, bueno!\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}!\\pYou know, I'm getting the itch to roam\\nand battle where I may.\\pBut before I do, I want your advice\\nonce again, please!\\pIf I were to win a battle, what would\\nbe a good boast I could say to my\\lfallen TRAINER opponent?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks9	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pUh-huh, that's sweet!\\nSi, bueno!\\lI'll try saying that, like, ham!\\pAnd now, it's time to say good-bye!\\nThanks for all sorts of things!\\pGive me a battle one day, OK?\\nAdios!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech10	{'body': "{PLAYER}{KUN}, there's big trouble!\\pWhen I win a battle, I brag about it\\nfor an hour at least!\\pOf course I'm lying!\\nWahahaha!\\pThis is no lie, though.\\nI'm not very good at chatting.\\pSo, how about deciding for me what\\nI should say after winning a battle,\\lmaster?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks10	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pThat's what I should say, huh?\\nThen, I'll stay away from that!\\pJust kidding!\\nI'll obey your teaching, master!\\pThanks for teaching me all this time,\\nmaster!\\pI'm finally understanding what being\\na TRAINER is about.\\pI'm going to go out and win battles\\nagainst any TRAINER.\\pMaybe it'll be you one day, master!\\pThat's all!\\nFarewell, my master!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech11	{'body': "A-H-O-Y!\\nAnd that spells ahoy!\\pThe rappin' SAILOR am I!\\nThis will be my last question,\\ldon't you cry!\\pIt's a saying question\\nthat begs your suggestion!\\pIf I win a match, what can I say\\nin a real cool way?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks11	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pPerfect! That's what I'll use.\\nI was right to make you choose!\\pAnd now, I think it'd be best,\\nif I were to fly the nest!\\pThanks for all you taught me.\\nI'll be off on a battle spree!\\pB-O-N-V-O-Y-A-G-E!\\nAnd that spells bon voyage,\\lto you this is my homage!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech12	{'body': "Oh, yeah, {PLAYER}!\\nI found you again today!\\pWhat should I do? Ask you again?\\nWhy not? I'm already asking you!\\pAnyways, {PLAYER}…\\nAre you receiving me?\\lYou are receiving me!\\lI need some more advice for me!\\pIt's about what I should yell.\\nSomething cool to holler when\\la battle ends well.\\pCome on, I wanna hear you say it!$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks12	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pAll right, all right!\\nI'll use that because it's so tight!\\pI'm out of things to ask you.\\nWaving bye is all that's left to do.\\pBut maybe one day we'll meet, with one\\ndestined to go down in defeat.\\pBut, it really is time to say farewell.\\pWell, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\\nbut don't you forget about me!\\pTake care, {PLAYER}!\\nLove ya!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech13	{'body': "{PLAYER}{KUN}, I'm finished…\\nMy nose won't stop dripping…\\pI was trying to think up something\\ncool to say when I win a battle.\\pIt inspired me so much, it made me cry,\\nand now my nose won't stop running…\\pSo, things being this way,\\nI need you to decide for me, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\pWhen I win a battle,\\nwhat should I say?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks13	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\p… … …That's good.\\nNo, it's awe inspiring!\\lIt's bringing fresh tears to my eyes!\\pBut in spite of my tears and runny\\nnose, I will use that saying!\\pI'm plumb out of things to ask you,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}.\\pFrom now on, we're rivals!\\nThanks for everything!$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech14	{'body': "Er… Um…\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}…\\pPlease, don't look at me that way.\\nYou're making me all nervous.\\pI… I need your advice again.\\nI'll make it my last, though…\\pIt's really embarrassing to ask,\\nbut what if I win a battle?\\lWhat should I say?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks14	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\pOh… Okay!\\nI'll try to say that!\\lI might be too nervous to say it…\\pThank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\\nI have to say good-bye now.\\pI'll obey all that you've taught me,\\n{PLAYER}{KUN}, and do the best I can.$"}
text:gApprenticePickWinSpeech15	{'body': "Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\\nBut are you really?\\lPerhaps a clever {PLAYER} DOLL?\\pOh, no, no, no, don't worry!\\nIf you really are real, please\\lforget about my rudeness.\\pNo need to be so angry. All I wish for\\nis more of your fine advice.\\pIt concerns a saying.\\pMore precisely, what should I say\\nif I win a battle?$"}
text:gApprenticeWinSpeechThanks15	{'body': "{STR_VAR_1}\\p… … … … … …\\nWhen I win a match…\\p{STR_VAR_1}\\p…Are you serious?\\pI see. If you are serious, that's fine.\\nI thank you for your time.\\pI do hope even I will be able to\\nput that saying to good use.\\pI seem to have run dry on what advice\\nI need.\\pI do believe it's high time I bid you\\nfarewell and strike out on my own.\\pThank you, my mentor!\\nI apologize for my skepticism!$"}
text:BerryBlender_BlendWithTheBlendMaster	{'body': 'BLEND MASTER: Indeed I am!\\nThe BLEND MASTER am I!\\pBlend with me, and you shall witness\\nthe mastery I bring to blending!$'}
text:BerryBlender_SeeMyMasteryInAction	{'body': 'BLEND MASTER: Hmmm! So, you wish to\\nsee my mastery in action?$'}
text:BerryBlender_TooBusyNowIsee	{'body': 'Hmmm!\\pSo, you are too busy now, I see!\\pBut fear not!\\nI shall be here all day!\\lHurry back from your errand!$'}
text:BerryBlender_BlendMasterNoBerries	{'body': "Hmmm!\\pYou haven't got a single BERRY!\\pI shall be here all day!\\nHurry back with some BERRIES!$"}
text:BerryBlender_BlendMasterKnowHowToMakePokeblocks	{'body': 'Of course!\\nOf course!\\pIncidentally…\\nYou do know how to blend {POKEBLOCK}S\\lfrom BERRIES?$'}
text:BerryBlender_BlendMasterExplainBerryBlending	{'body': "Hmmm!\\pAh, but it is a simple process!\\pWhen the BLENDER's arrow comes to\\nyour marker, just press the A Button.\\pThat's all you have to do.\\pWhen you see how precisely I press\\nthe A Button, you will understand.$"}
text:BerryBlender_BlendMasterLetsBerryBlender	{'body': "Fine!\\pLet's get started, then!\\pAll together with the BLEND MASTER,\\nlet's BERRY BLENDER!$"}
text:BerryBlender_BlendMasterNoPokeblockCase	{'body': "Hmmm!\\pYou don't appear to have gotten\\nthe {POKEBLOCK} CASE!\\pI shall be here all day!\\nObtain the {POKEBLOCK} CASE and hurry back!$"}
text:BerryBlender_BlendMasterPokeblockCaseFull	{'body': 'Hmmm!\\pYour {POKEBLOCK} CASE appears to be full!\\pI shall be here all day!\\nUse some {POKEBLOCK}S and hurry back!$'}
text:BerryBlender_WhoaAwesome	{'body': 'Whoa!\\nAwesome!$'}
text:BerryBlender_WickedlyFast	{'body': 'Wickedly fast!$'}
text:BerryBlender_WhatAnExpert	{'body': 'What an expert!$'}
text:BerryBlender_MadeAmazingPokeblocksWithMaster	{'body': 'When I blended with the MASTER,\\nwe made amazing {POKEBLOCK}S!$'}
text:BerryBlender_QualitiesOfBlendMaster	{'body': 'Eyes that track the arrow with\\nmachinelike intensity…\\pA hand that taps the A Button\\nwith clockwork-like precision…\\pPossessing these qualities makes\\nthe BLEND MASTER truly great.$'}
text:BerryBlender_MasterWorksOnSkillsInMountains	{'body': "The BLEND MASTER's supposed to work\\non his skills deep in the mountains.\\pSometimes, he comes to LILYCOVE\\nto blend BERRIES all day long.$"}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_WelcomeToBattleTent	{'body': "Welcome to the FALLARBOR BATTLE TENT!\\pI run the Set KO Tourney, HOENN's only\\nSINGLE BATTLE laboratory.$"}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_TakeChallenge	{'body': 'Now, do you wish to take the challenge\\nof a Set KO Tourney?$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_AwaitAnotherChallenge	{'body': 'We await your challenge on\\nanother occasion!$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_ExplainFallarborTent	{'body': 'The FALLARBOR BATTLE TENT is the one\\nplace in HOENN built for SINGLES.\\pBring three POKéMON, in order. Each\\nfights alone until it faints or wins.\\pIf a bout lasts three turns it goes to\\njudging: mind, skill, and body.\\pDoubles teaches cooperation. This\\nteaches a single set to stand alone.\\pThree wins in a row earn a PP MAX or a\\nrare capture Ball.\\pTo interrupt a challenge, save the\\ngame. Quitting without saving forfeits.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_SaveBeforeChallenge	{'body': 'Before showing you to the BATTLE\\nTENT, I must save. Is that okay?$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_WhichLevelMode	{'body': 'We offer two levels of challenge,\\nLevel 50 and Open Level.\\lWhich is your choice?$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_SelectThreeMons	{'body': 'Very well, now select your\\nthree POKéMON, please.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50	{'body': 'My dear challenger!\\pYou do not have the three POKéMON\\nrequired for entry.\\pThey also must not hold the same\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\\pWhen you have made your preparations,\\nplease do return.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen	{'body': 'My dear challenger!\\pYou do not have the three POKéMON\\nrequired for entry.\\pTo qualify, you must bring three\\ndifferent kinds of POKéMON.\\pThey also must not hold the same\\nkinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\\pWhen you have made your preparations,\\nplease do return.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_GuideYouToBattleTent	{'body': 'I shall now guide you to\\nthe BATTLE TENT.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_DidntSaveBeforeQuitting	{'body': 'My dear challenger!\\pYou did not save the game before\\nshutting down, did you?\\pIt is unfortunate, but that has\\nresulted in your disqualification\\lfrom your challenge.\\pYou may, of course, start with a fresh\\nchallenge.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_BeatThreeTrainers	{'body': 'How splendid! You have beaten\\nthree TRAINERS in succession!$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_WaitWhileSaveGame	{'body': 'Please wait while I save the game.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_PresentYouWithPrize	{'body': 'In commemoration of your 3-win streak,\\nwe present you with this prize.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_ReceivedPrize	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the prize\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_BagFullReturnForPrize	{'body': 'Oh?\\nYour BAG seems to be full.\\pI urge you to clear space and\\nreturn for your prize.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_ThankYouWaitWhileSaving	{'body': 'Thank you so much for participating!\\pPlease wait while I save the game.$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_AwaitAnotherChallenge2	{'body': 'We await your challenge on\\nanother occasion!$'}
text:FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_LookingForwardToArrival	{'body': 'We have been looking forward to\\nyour arrival.\\pBefore I show you to the BATTLE TENT,\\nI must save the game. Please wait.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_WelcomeToBattleTent	{'body': 'Welcome to the VERDANTURF BATTLE\\nTENT!\\pHere, four POKéMON battle in\\npairs, and their TRAINER only\\lwatches.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_TakeChallenge	{'body': 'Do you wish to take the VERDANTURF\\nBATTLE TENT challenge?$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ExplainVerdanturfTent	{'body': 'In the VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT every\\nmatch is a DOUBLE BATTLE.\\pYou bring four POKéMON. Once a pair is\\nout, you may only switch them.\\pYou give no commands. Each POKéMON\\nchooses moves by its own Nature.\\pIt is the purest test of a build: does\\nthe set work without you?\\pWin three matches in a row and you\\nearn an Evolution Stone.\\pTo interrupt a challenge, save the\\ngame. Quitting without saving forfeits.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ReturnFortified	{'body': 'When you have fortified your heart\\nand POKéMON, you must return.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_WhichLevelMode	{'body': 'There are two levels of difficulty,\\nLevel 50 and Open Level.\\lWhich is your choice of a challenge?$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50	{'body': 'Sigh…\\pYou do not have the three POKéMON\\nrequired for the challenge.\\pTo enter, you must provide three\\ndifferent kinds of POKéMON.\\pThey also must not be holding\\nthe same kinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\\pCome back when you have made\\nyour preparations.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen	{'body': 'Sigh…\\pYou do not have the three POKéMON\\nrequired for the challenge.\\pTo enter, you must provide three\\ndifferent kinds of POKéMON.\\pThey also must not be holding\\nthe same kinds of items.\\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\\pCome back when you have made\\nyour preparations.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_SelectThreeMons	{'body': 'Good. Now, you must select your\\nfour POKéMON for Double Battles.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_SaveBeforeChallenge	{'body': 'I must save before I show you to\\nthe BATTLE TENT. Is that okay?$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_NowFollowMe	{'body': 'Good.\\nNow, follow me.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ResultsWillBeRecorded	{'body': "I feel privileged for having seen\\nyour POKéMON's exploits.\\pThe results will be recorded.\\nI must ask you to briefly wait.$"}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_AchievedThreeWinStreak	{'body': 'To achieve a 3-win streak…\\pThe bonds that bind your heart with\\nyour POKéMON seem firm and true.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_FeatWillBeRecorded	{'body': 'Your feat will be recorded.\\nI must ask you to briefly wait.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_PresentYouWithPrize	{'body': 'For the feat of your 3-win streak,\\nwe present you with this prize.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_WelcomeToBattleTent	{'body': 'Welcome to the SLATEPORT BATTLE TENT!\\pI run the Doubles Swap Tournament.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_TakeChallenge	{'body': 'Would you like to take the Battle\\nSwap challenge?$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ExplainSlateportTent	{'body': "At the SLATEPORT BATTLE TENT you fight\\nwith rental POKéMON, in DOUBLE BATTLES.\\pFirst, choose a rental team from sets\\nbuilt exactly like the CENTER builds.\\pAfter each win you may swap one rental\\nfor one of the opponent's.\\pIt teaches the game's hardest skill:\\nwinning with pieces you didn't pick.\\pThree wins in a row earn a held\\nEvolution item.\\pTo interrupt a challenge, save the\\ngame. Quitting without saving forfeits.$"}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_LookForwardToNextVisit	{'body': 'We look forward to your next visit.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_WhichLevelMode	{'body': 'Which level do you wish to challenge?\\nLevel 50 or Level 100?$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_SaveBeforeChallenge	{'body': 'Before you begin your challenge,\\nI need to save data. Is that okay?$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_HoldMonsForSafekeeping	{'body': 'Okay, I will hold your POKéMON for\\nsafekeeping while you compete.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_StepThisWay	{'body': 'Please step this way.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ReturnRentalMonsSaveResults	{'body': 'Thank you for participating!\\pI will return your POKéMON in exchange\\nfor our rental POKéMON.\\pI must also save your event results.\\nPlease wait.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ReturnMonsExchangeRentals	{'body': 'I will return your POKéMON in exchange\\nfor our rental POKéMON.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_WonThreeMatchesReturnMons	{'body': "Congratulations!\\nYou've won three straight matches!\\pI will return your POKéMON in exchange\\nfor our rental POKéMON.\\pI must also save your event results.\\nPlease wait.$"}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_AwardYouThisPrize	{'body': 'In recognition of your 3-win streak,\\nwe award you this prize.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_NoRoomInBagMakeRoom	{'body': 'Oh?\\nYou seem to have no room for this.\\pPlease make room in your BAG and\\nlet me know.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_BeenWaitingForYou	{'body': "We've been waiting for you!\\pBefore we resume your challenge,\\nI must save the game.$"}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_DidntSaveBeforeQuitting	{'body': "I'm sorry to say this, but you didn't\\nsave before you quit playing last time.\\pAs a result, you have been disqualified\\nfrom your challenge.$"}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ReturnPersonalMons	{'body': "We'll return your personal POKéMON.$"}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ReceivedPrize	{'body': '{PLAYER} received the prize\\n{STR_VAR_1}.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_RulesAreListed	{'body': 'The Battle Swap rules are listed.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ExplainBasicRules	{'body': 'In a Battle Swap event, you may use\\nonly three POKéMON.\\pWhether you are renting or swapping,\\nyour team may not have two or more\\lof the same POKéMON.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ExplainSwapPartnerRules	{'body': 'You may swap POKéMON only with\\nthe TRAINER you have just defeated.\\pYou may swap for only those POKéMON\\nused by the beaten TRAINER.$'}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ExplainSwapNumberRules	{'body': "After every battle you win, you may\\nswap for one of your defeated\\lopponent's POKéMON.\\pYou will not be able to swap POKéMON\\nwith the third TRAINER in the event.$"}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ExplainSwapNotes	{'body': "There are two key points to be aware\\nof when swapping POKéMON.\\pFirst, when swapping, you can't check\\nthe stats of the POKéMON you are\\labout to receive.\\pSecond, the POKéMON on your team\\nare lined up in sequence, depending on\\lthe order in which you rented them.\\pThis sequence remains unchanged\\neven when swaps are made.$"}
text:SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_ExplainMonRules	{'body': 'The POKéMON of the SLATEPORT\\nBATTLE TENT are all rentals.\\pAll rental POKéMON are kept at\\nLevel 30.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_RulesAreListed2	{'body': 'The VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT\\nrules are listed.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ReadWhichHeading	{'body': 'Which heading do you want to read?$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ExplainBasicRules	{'body': 'Here at the VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT,\\nPOKéMON are required to think and\\lbattle by themselves.\\pUnlike in the wild, POKéMON that live\\nwith people behave differently\\ldepending on their nature.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ExplainNatureRules	{'body': 'Depending on its nature, a POKéMON\\nmay prefer to attack no matter what.\\pAnother POKéMON may prefer to protect\\nitself from any harm.\\pYet another may enjoy vexing or\\nconfounding its foes.\\pDepending on its nature, a POKéMON\\nwill have favorite moves that it is good\\lat using.\\pIt may also dislike certain moves that\\nit has trouble using.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ExplainMoveRules	{'body': 'There are offensive moves that inflict\\ndirect damage on the foe.\\pThere are defensive moves that are\\nused to prepare for enemy attacks or\\lused to heal HP and so on.\\pThere are also other somewhat-odd\\nmoves that may enfeeble the foes with\\lstat problems including poison and \\lparalysis.\\pPOKéMON will consider using moves in\\nthese three categories.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ExplainUnderpoweredRules	{'body': 'When not under command by its TRAINER,\\na POKéMON may be unable to effectively\\luse certain moves.\\pA POKéMON is not good at using any\\nmove that it dislikes.\\pIf a POKéMON only knows moves that\\ndo not match its nature, it will often\\lbe unable to live up to its potential.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_ExplainWhenInDangerRules	{'body': "Depending on its nature, a POKéMON may\\nstart using moves that don't match its\\lnature when it is in trouble.\\pIf a POKéMON begins behaving oddly\\nin a pinch, watch it carefully.$"}
text:BattleTentLobby_ExplainLevelRules	{'body': 'At this BATTLE TENT, the levels of\\nyour opponents will be adjusted to\\lmatch the levels of your POKéMON.\\pHowever, no TRAINER you face will\\nhave any POKéMON below Level 30.$'}
text:VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_RulesAreListed	{'body': 'The VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT\\nrules are listed.$'}
text:EventTicket_OldSeaMapTooFar	{'body': "What's up, youngster?\\pWhat, it's you who's supposed to have\\na tattered old map?\\pLet's have a look.\\n… … … … … …\\pBoy, this is quite a ways away.\\nI'm afraid I can't help you…$"}
text:EventTicket_BrineyHoldOnASecond	{'body': "BRINEY: Hold on a second!\\pWhat's the idea of turning down\\nsomeone that I owe so much to?$"}
text:EventTicket_BrineyLetsSail	{'body': "{PLAYER}{KUN}, I'm terribly sorry.\\pYou came to me seeking my help,\\nand we almost turned you away.\\pWell, let me make things right.\\pWe'll sail right away, of course!\\pLet's find this island on\\nthis OLD SEA MAP!$"}
text:EventTicket_OddTicketGetOnBoard	{'body': "Is it you who brought that odd\\nticket?\\pWhere you're trying to go is an island\\nthat's far, far away.\\pNo one knows what awaits there…\\pThe very thought excites my blood\\nas a sailing man!\\pGet on board, youngster!$"}
text:FarawayIsland_Entrance_SailorReturn	{'body': 'CAPT. BRINEY can be so maddeningly\\nfickle…\\pDo you want to return to LILYCOVE?$'}
text:BirthIsland_Harbor_SailorReturn	{'body': 'What an oddly shaped island, eh?\\nDo you want to return to LILYCOVE?$'}
text:EventTicket_OddTicketsWhereTo	{'body': 'Is it you who brought those\\nodd tickets?\\p… … …Hm.\\pThese tickets will get you to islands\\nthat are far, far away.\\pNo one knows what awaits there,\\nor what may happen there.\\pThe very thought excites my blood\\nas a sailing man!\\pGet on board, youngster!\\nWhere shall we sail first?$'}
text:NavelRock_Harbor_SailorReturn	{'body': "Did… Did you hear that?\\nThat low growling from deep in there.\\pAre you sure it's safe?\\nDo you think we should leave?$"}
text:FarawayIsland_Entrance_Sign	{'body': 'The writing is fading as if it was\\nwritten a long time ago…\\p“…ber, 6th day\\nIf any human…sets foot here…\\lagain…et it be a kindhearted pers…\\l…ith that hope, I depar…”$'}
text:FarawayIsland_Interior_Mew	{'body': 'Myuu…$'}
text:MoveTutor_ThisMoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnce	{'body': 'I can give this lesson only once.\\nShall we begin?$'}
text:MoveTutor_SwaggerTeach	{'body': "Heh! My POKéMON totally rules!\\nIt's cooler than any POKéMON!\\pI was lipping off with a swagger in\\nmy step like that when the CHAIRMAN\\lchewed me out.\\pThat took the swagger out of my step.\\pIf you'd like, I'll teach the move\\nSWAGGER to a POKéMON of yours.$"}
text:MoveTutor_SwaggerDeclined	{'body': "What, no? Can't you get into\\nthe spirit of things?$"}
text:MoveTutor_SwaggerWhichMon	{'body': 'All right, which POKéMON wants to\\nlearn how to SWAGGER?$'}
text:MoveTutor_SwaggerTaught	{'body': "I'll just praise my POKéMON from now\\non without the swagger.$"}
text:MoveTutor_RolloutTeach	{'body': "Did you know that you can go from\\nhere a long way in that direction\\lwithout changing direction?\\pI might even be able to roll\\nthat way.\\pDo you think your POKéMON will\\nwant to roll, too?\\pI can teach one the move ROLLOUT\\nif you'd like.$"}
text:MoveTutor_RolloutDeclined	{'body': "You don't need to be shy about it.\\nLet's roll!$"}
text:MoveTutor_RolloutWhichMon	{'body': "Ehehe, sure thing! It'd be great if\\nthe POKéMON looked like me.$"}
text:MoveTutor_RolloutTaught	{'body': "Rolling around in the grass makes me\\nhappy. Come on, let's roll!$"}
text:MoveTutor_FuryCutterTeach	{'body': "There's a move that gets stronger\\nwhen you keep using it in a row.\\pIt's a BUG-type move, and it is\\nwickedly cool.\\pIt's called FURY CUTTER.\\nWant me to teach it to a POKéMON?$"}
text:MoveTutor_FuryCutterDeclined	{'body': "We're not on the same wavelength.$"}
text:MoveTutor_FuryCutterWhichMon	{'body': 'Yay!\\nShow me which POKéMON I should teach.$'}
text:MoveTutor_FuryCutterTaught	{'body': 'I get a thrill watching to see if\\nthe move keeps hitting in succession!$'}
text:MoveTutor_MimicTeach	{'body': 'Ah, young one!\\pI am also a young one, but I mimic\\nthe styles and speech of the elderly\\lfolks of this town.\\pWhat do you say, young one?\\nWould you agree to it if I were to\\loffer to teach the move MIMIC?$'}
text:MoveTutor_MimicDeclined	{'body': 'Oh, boo! I wanted to teach MIMIC\\nto your POKéMON!$'}
text:MoveTutor_MimicWhichMon	{'body': 'Fwofwo! And so I shall!\\nLet me see the POKéMON\\lyou wish me to teach.$'}
text:MoveTutor_MimicTaught	{'body': 'MIMIC is a move of great depth.\\pCould you execute it to perfection\\nas well as me…?$'}
text:MoveTutor_MetronomeTeach	{'body': "I want all sorts of things!\\nBut I used up my allowance…\\pWouldn't it be nice if there were\\na spell that made money appear when\\lyou waggle a finger?\\pIf you want, I can teach your POKéMON\\nthe move METRONOME.\\pMoney won't appear, but your POKéMON\\nwill waggle a finger. Yes?$"}
text:MoveTutor_MetronomeDeclined	{'body': "Okay. I'll be here if you change\\nyour mind.$"}
text:MoveTutor_MetronomeWhichMon	{'body': "Okay! I'll teach it!\\nWhich POKéMON should I teach?$"}
text:MoveTutor_MetronomeTaught	{'body': "When a POKéMON waggles its finger\\nlike a METRONOME, all sorts of nice\\lthings happen.\\pWouldn't it be nice if we could\\nuse it, too?$"}
text:MoveTutor_SleepTalkTeach	{'body': 'Humph! My wife relies on HIDDEN\\nPOWER to stay awake.\\pShe should just take a nap like I do,\\nand SLEEP TALK.\\pI can teach your POKéMON how to\\nSLEEP TALK instead. Interested?$'}
text:MoveTutor_SleepTalkDeclined	{'body': 'Oh, fine, fine. You want to stay awake\\nwith HIDDEN POWER, too…$'}
text:MoveTutor_SleepTalkWhichMon	{'body': 'Ah, an appreciative child!\\nWhich POKéMON should I teach?$'}
text:MoveTutor_SleepTalkTaught	{'body': "I've never once gotten my wife's\\ncoin trick right.\\pI would be happy if I got it right\\neven as I SLEEP TALK…$"}
text:MoveTutor_SubstituteTeach	{'body': "When I see the wide world from up\\nhere on the roof…\\pI think about how nice it would be\\nif there were more than just one me\\lso I could enjoy all sorts of lives.\\pOf course it's not possible.\\nGiggle…\\pI know! Would you be interested in\\nhaving a POKéMON learn SUBSTITUTE?$"}
text:MoveTutor_SubstituteDeclined	{'body': 'Oh, no?\\pA POKéMON can make a copy of\\nitself using it, you know.$'}
text:MoveTutor_SubstituteWhichMon	{'body': 'Giggle…\\nWhich POKéMON do you want me to\\lteach SUBSTITUTE?$'}
text:MoveTutor_SubstituteTaught	{'body': "We human beings should enjoy our\\nown lives to the utmost!\\pI hope you'll get that way, too!$"}
text:MoveTutor_DynamicPunchTeach	{'body': "I can't do this anymore!\\pIt's utterly hopeless!\\pI'm a FIGHTING-type TRAINER,\\nso I can't win at the MOSSDEEP GYM\\lno matter how hard I try!\\pArgh! Punch! Punch! Punch!\\nPunch! Punch! Punch!\\pWhat, don't look at me that way!\\nI'm only hitting the ground!\\pOr do you want me to teach your\\nPOKéMON DYNAMICPUNCH?$"}
text:MoveTutor_DynamicPunchDeclined	{'body': "Darn! You're even making fun of me?\\nPunch! Punch! Punch!$"}
text:MoveTutor_DynamicPunchWhichMon	{'body': "What? You do? You're a good person!\\nWhich POKéMON should I teach?$"}
text:MoveTutor_DynamicPunchTaught	{'body': 'I want you to win at the MOSSDEEP GYM\\nusing that DYNAMICPUNCH!$'}
text:MoveTutor_DoubleEdgeTeach	{'body': "Sigh…\\pSOOTOPOLIS's GYM LEADER is really\\nlovably admirable.\\pBut that also means I have many\\nrivals for his attention.\\pHe's got appeal with a DOUBLE-EDGE.\\nI couldn't even catch his eye.\\pPlease, let me teach your POKéMON\\nthe move DOUBLE-EDGE!$"}
text:MoveTutor_DoubleEdgeDeclined	{'body': 'Oh…\\nEven you rejected me…$'}
text:MoveTutor_DoubleEdgeWhichMon	{'body': 'Okay, which POKéMON should I teach\\nDOUBLE-EDGE?$'}
text:MoveTutor_DoubleEdgeTaught	{'body': "I won't live for love anymore!\\nI'll become tough!$"}
text:MoveTutor_ExplosionTeach	{'body': "I don't intend to be going nowhere\\nfast in the sticks like this forever.\\pYou watch me, I'll get out to the city\\nand become a huge hit.\\pSeriously, I'm going to cause\\na huge EXPLOSION of popularity!\\pIf you overheard that, I'll happily\\nteach EXPLOSION to your POKéMON!$"}
text:MoveTutor_ExplosionDeclined	{'body': "Gaah! You're turning me down because\\nI live in the country?$"}
text:MoveTutor_ExplosionWhichMon	{'body': 'Fine! An EXPLOSION it is!\\nWhich POKéMON wants to blow up?$'}
text:MoveTutor_ExplosionTaught	{'body': "For a long time, I've taught POKéMON\\nhow to use EXPLOSION, but I've yet\\lto ignite my own EXPLOSION…\\pMaybe it's because deep down,\\nI would rather stay here…$"}
text:gConfirmSave	{'body': 'Would you like to save the game?$'}
text:gAlreadySavedFile	{'body': 'There is already a saved file.\\nIs it okay to overwrite it?$'}
text:gSavingDontTurnOff	{'body': "SAVING…\\nDON'T TURN OFF THE POWER.$"}
text:gPlayerSavedGame	{'body': '{PLAYER} saved the game.$'}
text:gDifferentSaveFile	{'body': "WARNING!\\pThere is a different game file that\\nis already saved.\\pIf you save now, the other file's\\nadventure, including items and\\lPOKéMON, will be entirely lost.\\pAre you sure you want to save now\\nand overwrite the other save file?$"}
text:gSaveError	{'body': 'Save error.\\pPlease exchange the\\nbackup memory.$'}
text:gSavingDontTurnOffPower	{'body': "SAVING…\\nDON'T TURN OFF THE POWER.$"}
text:gBirch_Welcome	{'body': 'Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting!\\pWelcome to the world of POKéMON!\\pMy name is BIRCH.\\pBut everyone calls me the POKéMON\\nPROFESSOR.\\p$'}
text:gBirch_Pokemon	{'body': 'This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\\p\\n$'}
text:gBirch_MainSpeech	{'body': "This world is full of POKéMON.\\nThey share our forests, our seas,\\land our everyday lives.\\pI study them here in HOENN.\\nLately, the weather has changed,\\land so have their habitats.\\pEven a familiar path can lead\\nto a new discovery!\\pYour journey will begin with two\\npartners. TRAINERS here battle\\lin pairs, so teamwork matters.\\pOur POKéMON CENTERS will help you\\nprepare your team for free.\\pHOENN's TRAINERS are a challenge.\\nExplore, try new partners, and\\llearn from the battles you lose.\\pThere is more to HOENN than its\\nGYMS. Listen to its people.\\lWatch its POKéMON.\\pI wonder what you will discover\\ntogether!$"}
text:gBirch_AndYouAre	{'body': 'And you are?$'}
text:gBirch_BoyOrGirl	{'body': 'Are you a boy?\\nOr are you a girl?$'}
text:gBirch_WhatsYourName	{'body': "All right.\\nWhat's your name?$"}
text:gBirch_SoItsPlayer	{'body': "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"}
text:gBirch_YourePlayer	{'body': "Ah, okay!\\pYou're {PLAYER}{KUN} who's moving to my\\nhometown of LITTLEROOT.\\lI get it now!\\p$"}
text:gBirch_AreYouReady	{'body': "All right, are you ready?\\pYour own adventure is about\\nto begin. New friends and\\ldiscoveries are waiting!\\pCome find me in LITTLEROOT.\\nI'd love to show you around.$"}
