OS', 'family': 'family:Zapdos', 'stats': (90, 90, 85, 125, 90, 100), 'yield': (0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0), 'name': 'Zapdos', 'category': 'Electric', 'pool': 'learn:pool.ZAPDOS'}
